window.AKK_AH_THE_VILLAINS_I_FORCED_TO_TURN_EVIL_CAN_READ_MY_MIND_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AH_THE_VILLAINS_I_FORCED_TO_TURN_EVIL_CAN_READ_MY_MIND_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201: Qiao Chuchu: I Am About to Move Out of My Favorite Work to Suppress Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu cupped Qi Xiaojia’s face and said firmly, “You need to understand what would have happened to you if I hadn’t come.”","“Xia Xuechun didn’t hurt you this time, but she will definitely try again, and it will be even worse!”","“Being merciful to your enemy is being cruel to yourself. You need to think about this clearly!”","Qi Xiaojia listened intently. “Actually, I know why Xia Xuechun sent people to humiliate me.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Qi Xiaojia continued, “That chair today was thrown at you by Xia Xuechun. She wanted to kill you, and I saw it. That’s why she tried to silence me with a private video.”","Qiao Chuchu: “??”","A hint of murderous intent flickered in Qi Xiaojia’s eyes, though she seemed utterly drained. “I really don’t care about money, but by locking that door, she essentially killed me. If you hadn’t come to rescue me, I would still be suffering humiliation and torment. Those videos could have spread everywhere, being ogled and enjoyed by all sorts of disgusting people...”","“I’m not a weak person, and I won’t let those who betray me get away with it.”","“So...”","A single tear rolled down Qi Xiaojia’s cheek, landing in Qiao Chuchu’s palm.","“I agree to your terms.”","Qiao Chuchu’s anxiety eased, and she gripped Qi Xiaojia’s hand. “I’ll arrange for your parents’ ICU fees to be covered for the next ten days, so you can rest assured.”","Because Qi Xiaojia’s parents would be out of the ICU in ten days, fully recovered and ready to leave the hospital.","Confident, Qiao Chuchu said, “Let’s work well together.”","The Pei Family was in an uproar because Qiao Chuchu had left without them.","Pei Buxian vented his frustration at Pei Youchuan, “Pei Youchuan, I gave you an hour, but you didn’t even bother to tell me you were leaving! You could’ve at least let me take over!”","Pei Youchuan turned to Lin Shen, “Lin Shen, you invited yourself over, and because of you, I left for ten minutes, and Qiao Chuchu disappeared!”","Pei Fengnong sipped Lin Shen’s porridge, “It’s really good. Lin Shen, how do you make it? Do you have a recipe?”","Lin Shen, lounging on the sofa, sneered, “I can’t believe I’ve been fooled by all of you for so many years. I thought we were all normal people, but you’re all liars! Hypocrites!”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci spoke in unison, “How did our gifts lose to Pei Youchuan’s bag? Our gifts were expensive!”","Pei Yuan frowned, “Why did Qiao Chuchu leave without us, and why didn’t she tell any of us?”","Pei Che looked at Pei Yuan, “I still can’t figure out how she knew your gift was special. Do you two have some secret code?”","Little Xie, standing in front of the eight men, thought to herself, “Help, they’re all talking over each other, and nothing they’re saying connects!”","Pei Yuan suddenly turned to Little Xie, “Did Qiao Chuchu tell you why she left without us?”","The living room fell silent.","All eyes turned sharply to Little Xie.","Little Xie: “...”","She was done for.","She felt like she was under a microscope!","On pins and needles!","With a lump in her throat!","She stammered, “N-no, she didn’t.”","Pei Yuan raised an eyebrow, seeing right through her, “Little Xie, I’m the one who pays your salary. Hiding things from your employer is grounds for dismissal. Do you want to be fired?”","Little Xie gasped, “Miss Qiao just said you all are a bit... clingy.”","The Pei brothers: “?”","Lin Shen suddenly perked up, “Oh?”","Little Xie felt increasingly guilty, “She thinks you all have too much pent-up energy and are too... affectionate, so she doesn’t like taking you with her.”","Lin Shen: “Pfft!”","The Pei Family: “...”","Little Xie lowered her head, trembling, “But please rest assured, she took three bodyguards with her. She said they’re tough and don’t talk much.”","The Pei Family: “...”","So they’re the ones who talk too much?!","Lin Shen was holding back laughter, his face turning red!","A car horn sounded outside.","Little Xie sighed in relief, “Miss Qiao is back!”","The Pei Family strode toward the entrance!","Qiao Chuchu stepped out of the car with Qi Xiaojia.","The seven men marched out in unison, “Qiao Chuchu!”","Qiao Chuchu was startled, “What?”","They opened their mouths to question her but then, remembering something, raised their heads proudly, “Nothing.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","[They called my name but didn’t say anything. Are they getting worse?]","The Pei Family: “?”","Getting worse?","What’s wrong with them?","Qiao Chuchu handed Qi Xiaojia over to Little Xie, “Take care of her. She’s just been through something traumatic.”","She then turned and walked toward her art studio.","The seven men, along with Lin Shen, followed her with long strides!","Qiao Chuchu felt a chill, “Why are you all following me?”","Pei Yuan’s face darkened, “We have nothing better to do.”","Pei Che adjusted his glasses and said cryptically, “Hmm.”","Pei Youchuan licked his canine tooth, “I’m usually very aloof. I’m tough and don’t talk much.”","Pei Fengnong just stared at her expressionlessly.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci slung their arms over each other’s shoulders, grinning at her, “Chuchu, we brothers usually don’t talk much. We just like talking to you.”","Pei Buxian, holding his dog, followed her quietly and gloomily.","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","[So they still didn’t answer why they’re following me, and they’re just spouting nonsense. They really are clingy and talk too much.]","The Pei Family: “......???”","Lin Shen’s cheeks were aching from holding back his laughter!","Qiao Chuchu entered the studio and went straight to a painting.","The painting was covered with a white cloth, hiding its true appearance.","Pei Youchuan asked curiously, “What are you doing?”","Qiao Chuchu placed her hands on the frame, her voice filled with excitement, “There’s a charity auction tonight. I’ve already called to add one of my works to the lineup. I’ll be bringing this piece with me!”","[I originally wanted to bring a different painting, but after thinking it over, this one is the best to put Xia Xuechun in her place. Her paintings are done by a ghost artist, and as someone in the industry, I need to showcase my best work.]","They perked up their ears.","Put Xia Xuechun in her place?","Qiao Chuchu stroked the frame, pleased, “This painting is my masterpiece. I’ve poured my heart and soul into it.”","Their expressions changed as they looked at the painting on the wall.","Qiao Chuchu pulled off the white cloth!","Before them stood a magnificent black dragon!","It loomed from above, surrounded by mountains of jewels and crowns, its head piercing through dark clouds, exuding an overwhelming presence as it glared at a young girl in the center!","The girl held a sword that gleamed with a cold, sharp light, her back resolute and proud!","They were speechless, completely awestruck.","This... was her work?!","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes sparkled, “I’ve named it ‘The Dragon Slayer.’ It also hints that after slaying the dragon, the girl will gain power and wealth, becoming a dragon herself.”","She touched the protective glass over the painting, “This is the last piece I completed a few years ago, infused with all my love and effort. I’ve always been reluctant to show it to anyone, but today, it will meet its new owner.”","She turned to them, her lips curving into a confident smile.","“It will definitely be bought by someone who truly loves it. I’m sure of it.”","They were stunned, a shared thought rising in their minds, their eyes gleaming with determination."]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202: Xia Xuechun, Get Ready for Overnight Fame","paragraphs":["Evening.","Half an hour before the charity auction gala began.","Qiao Chuchu stepped out of the car, dressed in an elegant gown.","A few familiar faces gasped softly, \"Oh my, it's Qiao Chuchu!\"","\"It's been years since I last saw her. Why does she seem so much more commanding now?\"","\"She really is the Qiao Chuchu who went viral online! She's even more stunning in person than in the videos!\"","\"Did she come alone? Shouldn't her seven brothers be with her?!\"","The Pei Brothers and Lin Shen sat in the car behind, their expressions tinged with resentment.","They weren't absent.","It was just that Qiao Chuchu didn't bring them along.","Back at home, Qiao Chuchu had been straightforward with them: \"I’ll need to borrow your bodyguards for the charity auction tonight.\"","She smiled confidently, \"I’m going alone. You don’t need to come, because I have my own matters to attend to.\"","She didn’t elaborate on what those matters were.","Her thoughts didn’t reveal anything either.","The only clue she dropped was: 「I need to deal with Xia Xuechun.」","So, no matter how reluctant they were, they had no choice but to let Qiao Chuchu go alone.","They would just secretly follow her.","Of course, there was one advantage: Qiao Chuchu didn’t know they would be there in person, so they could bid on that painting!","This was strictly confidential—even Lin Qing didn’t know.","They had to keep it from the Weisheng family too.","So, it was just the eight of them competing.","Lin Shen got out of the car and scanned the surroundings. \"By the way, where are Pei Mu and Pei Ci? They’ve been missing since earlier.\"","Pei Youchuan glanced around and his expression changed. \"Did they disguise themselves as bodyguards to protect Qiao Chuchu?!\"","Pei Buxian looked around but couldn’t find them. He was on the verge of losing his temper again. \"Damn it! They’re pulling that role-playing stunt again!\"","Pei Che, however, remained calm. \"Relax. Let them livestream the situation. They can be tools—no chance for them to be alone with her.\"","Pei Buxian’s eyes lit up. \"Second Brother, you’re a genius!\"","He picked up his phone and sent a message to Pei Mu and Pei Ci: 「Are you two pretending to be bodyguards near Qiao Chuchu?! If you are, livestream it, or I’ll tell her!」","Pei Mu: 「...」","Pei Ci: 「...」","The two exchanged glances and looked at Qiao Chuchu, who had her back to them.","Yes, they were indeed disguised as bodyguards, staying close to Qiao Chuchu.","They were dressed in tailored bodyguard suits, wearing sunglasses and Bluetooth earpieces, their hair styled with gel to match the standard bodyguard look.","Though the sunglasses didn’t hide much, the good thing was that Qiao Chuchu never paid close attention to her bodyguards.","So, she had no idea they were right beside her.","What’s professionalism?","This! This is professionalism!","Pei Ci leaned closer to Pei Mu. \"Brothers like us are one of a kind.\"","Pei Mu raised an eyebrow. \"Do you mean our uniqueness is one of a kind, or our level of obsession is one of a kind?\"","Pei Ci: 「?」","The hotel’s heating was intense, making it feel like summer. Qiao Chuchu casually took off her fur coat and handed it to them.","Both reached out to take it, and their eyes inadvertently caught a glimpse of Qiao Chuchu’s bare back!","?","This dress not only showed off her legs but also her back?!","Did she spend tens of thousands on a dress like this?!","Where’s the fabric?! Where’s the coverage?! And where’s the designer’s contact information?!","Qiao Chuchu lightly brushed her hair aside, revealing her pale, delicate back to the crowd!","Her shoulder blades were faintly visible!","Without a second thought, Pei Mu and Pei Ci immediately draped the fur coat back over her shoulders!","They nearly covered her head with it!","Qiao Chuchu: 「?」","Pei Mu: 「?」","Pei Ci: 「?」","They exchanged glances, realizing something was off.","Would normal bodyguards immediately try to cover her up after seeing her bare back?","Qiao Chuchu also found it strange and turned to look at them.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci quickly pulled the coat back and lowered their heads!","Qiao Chuchu frowned as she scrutinized them. \"Why did you two try to cover me up?\"","【The bodyguards I’ve had before always did exactly as I told them without needing a second word.】","Pei Mu lowered his voice and explained gruffly, \"Apologies, Miss. We’re new. We made a mistake. Please feel free to command us as you wish!\"","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes. \"Tonight is very important to me. I specifically chose you two because of your professionalism. If this happens again, I’ll replace you with other bodyguards. Understand?\"","There was a waiting area for bodyguards.","She had brought seven.","But only two could accompany her into the venue and move around freely.","【I picked these two because they had the best posture and seemed fit, like they worked out regularly. Why do they suddenly seem so unprofessional?】","【Maybe I should switch them out now? The ones who accompanied me to find Qi Xiaojia earlier seemed much better—quiet but efficient.】","Pei Mu and Pei Ci’s hearts tightened. They both bowed and said in unison, \"We’re sorry, Miss Qiao. Please give us another chance!\"","Qiao Chuchu gave them a critical look. \"Just one more chance.\"","A flicker of relief, unnoticed even by themselves, passed through Pei Mu and Pei Ci’s eyes as they replied firmly, \"Yes, just one more chance. We won’t disobey you again.\"","Qiao Chuchu: 「...No need to be so dramatic. I’m not an emperor. Just do as you’re told.」","Pei Mu and Pei Ci nodded vigorously, their heads bobbing like chickens pecking at rice!","Pei Buxian, hiding nearby, snickered. \"Ha! Those two idiots got scolded!\"","Qiao Chuchu suddenly glanced in his direction!","Pei Buxian quickly turned his back!","Qiao Chuchu: 「...Was I imagining things? I thought I saw one of my brothers.」","Just then, a commotion broke out in the venue. \"Ha, are old men these days not even trying to hide their mistresses anymore? Bringing a mistress to an event like this?\"","Qiao Chuchu perked up and followed the guests’ mocking gazes toward the entrance.","【Xia Xuechun is here!!】","Those who could hear Qiao Chuchu’s thoughts all turned to look at the door.","Xia Xuechun walked in arm-in-arm with Long Yuntian, calmly accepting the scrutinizing looks from the crowd.","Today was her day of triumph!","Because tonight, she would be introduced as a painter at the charity auction gala, officially stepping into high society with the backing of the Long family!","Most importantly, she was personally recommended by Long Yuntian’s elder brother—the most capable member of the Long family.","As Long Yuntian’s companion, she made a dazzling entrance at the gala!","Xia Xuechun held her head high, like a proud peacock, and whispered to Long Yuntian, \"Has the video from Qi Xiaojia’s side come out yet?\"","Qi Xiaojia had been with those men for hours now.","But there was still no news.","Long Yuntian smiled and shook his head. \"It’s fine. Maybe they’re not done yet.\"","Xia Xuechun looked surprised. \"They’ve been at it for hours? Can Qi Xiaojia handle that?\"","Long Yuntian affectionately pinched her cheek. \"Are you worried about her?\"","Xia Xuechun pursed her lips and said with concern, \"I personally picked those men. They’re all good-looking. I just hope Qi Xiaojia has a good experience. After all, I only wanted to silence her, not torment her. So, let’s have them stop and get the video to me as soon as possible.\"","With that, she cheerfully approached Madam Wang. \"Grandma Wang!~\"","Madam Wang smiled at her. \"Today’s a big day for you. Are you nervous?\"","Xia Xuechun blushed and nodded. \"A little, but not too much. I’m just worried my painting won’t sell for 1.5 million.\"","\"Everything’s been arranged. You’ll definitely succeed today,\" Madam Wang reassured her, patting her shoulder. \"After tonight, you’ll be the new rising star in the art world. Many will flock to you. Everything is under control—both mine and Long Yuntian’s.\"","Xia Xuechun affectionately linked arms with Madam Wang. \"Grandma, you’re so good to me. You’re even better than my own grandmother!\"","Madam Wang patted her arm soothingly.","Qiao Chuchu stood in a corner, holding a champagne glass handed to her by a server, her eyes dark as she watched them.","She remembered the last scene from when she was trapped in the mental institution.","Old Lady Wang Ru Tang had sent her there.","Long Yuntian and Long Yunxiao, those two brothers, had tried to assault her.","Hmph.","Her facial muscles twitched slightly. \"Did you get Long Yuntian’s medical report?\"","Pei Ci quickly stepped forward. \"Yes, I glanced through it earlier. He has high blood pressure, high cholesterol, and coronary heart disease. Although it’s under control, he’s definitely not in a condition to handle stress.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded. \"Good job.\"","Pei Ci's eyes lit up, and he nodded, \"Thank you for the compliment, Miss.\"","Qiao Chuchu downed her champagne in one go. \"Let's go, the auction is about to start.\"","Long Yuntian took Xia Xuechun's hand. \"Let's go, the auction is about to begin. Your piece will be the only painting showcased tonight. Get ready to become famous overnight.\""]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203: How Could Qiao Chuchu Be Here","paragraphs":["Soon, the auction began.","When it was Xia Xuechun's turn, the auctioneer announced, \"The artwork titled 'Dream of Beauty,' created by the recently emerging artist Xia Xuechun, who is also the donor. The Wonderful Fund Association thanks Miss Xia for her generous donation.\"","Xia Xuechun stood up and nodded to the audience.","A few people frowned and whispered among themselves, \"Is she Long Yuntian's new mistress?\"","\"No, I heard she's his goddaughter.\"","\"I thought she was his sister.\"","\"She's quite good-looking, though.\"","Xia Xuechun sat back down, her eyes shining with excitement as she gazed at the painting hanging on the wall.","The guests, however, reacted indifferently.","After all, it was just a landscape painting.","A depiction of flowers and plants, nothing particularly special.","But Xia Xuechun was confident.","Though she hadn't painted it herself.","She had instructed the artist to paint according to her vision!","She believed in her own taste!","Of course, the expected price was set at 1.5 million. She wondered if anyone would appreciate her work enough to bid higher.","Soon, the gavel fell.","The artwork sold for 1.5 million.","A smattering of applause followed, and Xia Xuechun's smile stiffened slightly, her disappointment evident.","All the bidders were people arranged by Long Yuntian, artificially driving up the price. No outsiders had participated.","These people simply didn't understand her inspiration.","Long Yuntian, however, smiled and said, \"Everything is going according to plan.\"","Xia Xuechun nodded, unable to hide her disappointment. \"I thought someone might actually like my painting.\"","Long Yuntian reassured her, \"You've just made your debut today. It's normal for some people not to appreciate your work yet. But you're the only artist here, and your painting is the only one on display. Don't worry, people will remember you. Once we create some buzz, everyone will follow the trend and admire you.\"","Xia Xuechun nodded, her mood lifting.","That's right.","Today was her big day.","Today, Qiao Chuchu would never expect that she had dealt with her traitor and was about to become unstoppably famous!","The auctioneer announced, \"Due to unforeseen circumstances, we have added another artwork to the auction. Next, we present the painting 'Dragon Slayer' by the artist Qiao Chu.\"","The artwork was wheeled onto the stage, and as the cover was removed, a black dragon was revealed, stunning everyone present!","Wang Ru Tang: \"?!\"","Long Yuntian: \"??\"","Xia Xuechun shot up from her seat!","The room erupted in murmurs.","\"Qiao Chu is selling her work today? Didn't she retire years ago?!\"","\"This is why she's Qiao Chu. Her work always gives me chills!\"","\"This is what it means to be born with talent! Look at her painting compared to the one before—it's like comparing a god to dirt!\"","\"Ha, I can't believe that last painting sold for 1.5 million. My child could paint something like that. Someone must have been propping her up, artificially inflating the price.\"","Xia Xuechun's mind was reeling as she looked toward the figure approaching from the side of the stage.","All eyes turned in that direction.","Qiao Chuchu walked in from the side.","She wore a form-fitting, high-slit gown that accentuated her long legs. Her fiery red hair contrasted sharply with her ivory-white dress. Her makeup was subtle, but her gaze was piercing, exuding an air of dominance.","She looked like a dark princess who had just stepped out of a fairy tale, captivating everyone the moment she appeared.","The Pei family, hiding in the shadows, stole glances at her.","They didn't dare to be too obvious.","But they couldn't look away.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci walked proudly beside her, like two strutting roosters.","Xia Xuechun's fingers trembled.","Why was Qiao Chuchu here?!","How could she be here?!!!","Qiao Chuchu smirked, thoroughly enjoying Xia Xuechun's reaction.","[Didn't expect this, did you? I'm here to put you in your place!]","She glanced at the stunned Long Yuntian, then slowly turned her gaze to Wang Ru Tang, whose expression was grim.","Wang Ru Tang's face turned ashen.","Long Yuntian's expression twisted with anger.","Qiao Chuchu ignored them, calmly meeting the stares of the crowd as she took a seat beside Xia Xuechun.","Xia Xuechun's face flushed with anger.","She had noticed the empty seat next to her earlier, but she thought the person wasn't coming.","She never expected it to be Qiao Chuchu!","Wasn't this auction supposed to feature only her painting?!","Why was Qiao Chuchu here to steal her spotlight?!","She turned to Long Yuntian, her lips trembling, on the verge of tears.","Long Yuntian, heartbroken, took Xia Xuechun's hand and demanded of Qiao Chuchu, \"Miss Qiao, what strings did you pull to get your painting added to this charity auction? We weren't informed.\"","\"The organizer is the mother of my high school classmate,\" Qiao Chuchu replied, her eyes fixed ahead. \"I do have some connections, after all.\"","Long Yuntian narrowed his eyes, his tone mocking. \"I bet you used your brother's connections, didn't you?\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow, finally looking at him. \"What's the difference between my brother's connections and mine?\"","\"The difference between relying on yourself and relying on a man,\" Long Yuntian sneered. \"I don't think you're capable of this on your own. You're just a spoiled young lady from the Pei family.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci's faces darkened as they glared at him.","Qiao Chuchu chuckled. \"Age really does make a difference. You can't even understand plain speech anymore.\"","Long Yuntian: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu casually tucked a strand of hair behind her ear. \"I already told you, the organizer is my high school classmate's mother, yet you insist I'm relying on my brother.\"","Her smile was sweet but laced with venom. \"Are you going senile? Or have you reached an age where you no longer consider yourself a man? If Xia Xuechun relies on you, does that mean she's relying on a eunuch?\"","Long Yuntian: \"!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"Qiao Chuchu—\"","\"This isn't a marketplace, Xia Xuechun,\" Qiao Chuchu interrupted, her tone calm but firm. \"Shouting here only makes you look uncultured.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"...\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci quickly started a video call to broadcast the scene live!","Such an exciting moment couldn't be enjoyed by just the two of them!","Our sister is amazing!","Little Eight is a legend!","The auctioneer continued, introducing the painting and its price.","\"The artist is Qiao Chu, and the artwork is titled 'Dragon Slayer.' The starting bid is two million...\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?\"","Two million?","Qiao Chuchu's painting starts at two million?!","Qiao Chuchu noticed Xia Xuechun's shock and smiled even more smugly. \"What do you have to compete with me? Your final bid didn't even reach my starting price.\"","Xia Xuechun clenched her teeth, wanting to retort.","But her hand was held by Long Yunxiao's wrinkled one.","Long Yunxiao said reassuringly, \"Let's wait and see how the bidding goes. No need to rush. She's a well-known artist, after all. If her painting doesn't sell for at least five million, she has no right to boast in front of you. You're just starting out.\"","Xia Xuechun felt somewhat comforted and let out a long sigh.","But within minutes, the auctioneer cheerfully asked, \"Nine hundred and sixty thousand. Can anyone bid higher? Nine hundred and ninety thousand?\"","\"Good, we have a phone bid at nine hundred and ninety thousand. Can anyone go higher? One point two million?\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?\"","Long Yunxiao: \"??\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"???\""]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204: Xia Xuechun Will Suffer, Long Yuntian Will Suffer Even More","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was overjoyed.","[\"I can't believe it exceeded the budget by so much! I thought it would cap at eight million at most!\"]","[\"It seems someone with good taste has bought my painting!~\"]","She provocatively glanced at Long Yuntian: \"Thank you for your blessings, Uncle Long Yuntian. My painting has already surpassed ten million. Do you have any more blessings to offer? I feel like your words have a certain... luck to them.\"","Long Yuntian's eyelid twitched, his already foul mood worsening: \"You call me Uncle? I recall you addressing Weisheng Wenzhan as 'brother.'\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"Weisheng Wenzhan is five years younger than you. He's forty-four, while you're already forty-nine. Plus, he takes care of himself like a celebrity and doesn't look old. You, on the other hand...\"","She shamelessly covered her nose: \"You look dirty and smelly.\"","Long Yuntian's eyes widened: \"You—\"","\"You were just telling Xia Xuechun to calm down. You should calm down too,\" Qiao Chuchu pointed to the two bodyguards behind her. \"Otherwise, my bodyguards won't care if you're from the Dragon Family or the Horse Family. They'll just toss you out.\"","Long Yuntian froze, pinching his thigh to calm himself: \"It seems Miss Qiao doesn't like me very much.\"","\"Oh, I do,\" Qiao Chuchu said with a flat expression. \"I like targeting you. I like watching you get so angry you might have a stroke. I like seeing you meet a miserable end.\"","Long Yuntian: \"!!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him mockingly: \"What can you do to me?\"","Long Yuntian opened his mouth, furious, but clutched his chest, glaring at her with restraint.","[\"Oh, looks like he's about to have a heart attack~\"]","Qiao Chuchu grew even more delighted, taunting him fearlessly: \"What. Can. You. Do. To. Me?\"","Long Yuntian collapsed to the ground!!","Xia Xuechun screamed: \"Brother Long!!\"","The auctioneer, startled, looked toward the VIP section and paused the auction: \"Security, please check on the guest!\"","Qiao Chuchu stood up, looking down at Long Yuntian, who was clutching his chest in pain, and smirked: \"Bodyguards.\"","Pei Ci and Pei Mu responded: \"Yes, Miss.\"","Qiao Chuchu leaned in and whispered: \"While it's chaotic, crush that thing between his legs.\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","The Pei family watching the video: \"?\"","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked down at Long Yuntian with disdain.","[\"In the previous timeline, Long Yuntian and Long Yunxiao tried to assault me, leering at me with disgusting smiles.\"]","[\"Xia Xuechun is no good, and these two brothers are even worse.\"]","[\"Xia Xuechun's fate will be tragic.\"]","[\"But I want these two brothers to suffer even more!\"]","Pei Ci's killing intent surged, and he rushed toward Long Yuntian: \"Are you okay, Mr. Long?!\"","He \"accidentally\" tripped and stomped hard on Long Yuntian's crotch!","Long Yuntian: \"AHHHHHHHHH!!!\"","Pei Mu quickly pushed Pei Ci aside: \"Mr. Long, are you alright?!\"","He took advantage of the chaos to stomp several more times!!","Long Yuntian's face turned beet red, unsure whether to clutch his heart or his injured area!","More and more people crowded around!","Even several men joined in.","One of them, wearing a cap with platinum blond hair, cried out: \"Mr. Long!!\"","And then kicked him right between the legs!!","Qiao Chuchu was even pushed aside by the crowd, feeling like Long Yuntian was being swarmed!","[\"What’s with all these people?! How am I supposed to enjoy the show??\"]","In the chaos, Long Yuntian felt like he was being kicked and stomped on repeatedly, almost passing out from the pain!","It felt like some people were taking out their anger on him!","They were trying to kill him!","Xia Xuechun, oblivious, gave him heart medicine: \"Brother, are you okay?!\"","Long Yuntian quickly took the medicine but cried out in pain!","No!","He wasn’t okay!","He was in agony!","Qiao Chuchu peeked through the crowd, mocking him: \"All that abalone and shark fin you’ve been eating has given you high blood pressure and high cholesterol, hasn’t it?~\"","Long Yuntian opened his tear-filled eyes and glared at Qiao Chuchu!","Suddenly, the platinum-blond man in the cap kicked him again!","And stomped on his crotch once more!","Long Yuntian: \"AHHH!!!\"","The others, who had been concerned, grew annoyed: \"Why are you screaming so much? Can’t you calm down? It’s so loud.\"","Long Yuntian: \"...\"","It wasn’t him being loud!","He was being targeted!!","He gritted his teeth and looked at Qiao Chuchu, only to widen his eyes in shock!","Qiao Chuchu stood in the center, with the entire Pei family behind her!","Even the two bodyguards took off their sunglasses, revealing identical twin faces, grinning menacingly at him.","Long Yuntian blinked hard, thinking he was hallucinating!","It really was the Pei family!","They all stood behind Qiao Chuchu, glaring at him with murderous intent!","Xia Xuechun, seeing Long Yuntian’s pale face, pleaded with the guests: \"Qiao Chuchu deliberately provoked Brother Long into a heart attack! She called him old!!\"","The guests paused.","They exchanged knowing glances.","They thought of something amusing and struggled to suppress their smiles.","Finally, someone burst out laughing: \"Pfft...\"","One person said: \"Well, he is pretty old.\"","This comment set off a wave of laughter among the guests: \"HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!\"","Xia Xuechun’s mouth twitched as she turned to Qiao Chuchu: \"Qiao Chuchu, are you proud of yourself for bullying a sick man?!\"","Qi Xiaojia suddenly shouted: \"And what about you locking your best friend in a room and letting a group of strange men assault her?! Are you any better?!!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?!\"","Long Yuntian: \"?!\"","They both looked toward the entrance.","Qi Xiaojia, her clothes torn and tattered, stumbled in, her face bruised from being beaten.","Xia Xuechun turned pale, standing up in disbelief as she stared at Qi Xiaojia.","Qi Xiaojia wrapped herself in a wool coat, trembling as she spoke: \"The artist you see before you, Xia Xuechun, had several men ambush me in my home, locked me inside, and let them assault me. All because I witnessed her trying to kill Qiao Chuchu! She wanted to silence me with a video!!\"","The guests gasped, turning their shocked gazes toward Xia Xuechun.","Xia Xuechun hunched over, panic written all over her face: \"Qi Xiaojia... why are you here?\"","\"I saved her,\" Qiao Chuchu stepped in front of Xia Xuechun. \"And I brought her here.\"","Xia Xuechun stiffened, staring at Qiao Chuchu in disbelief: \"You?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, pulling out her phone and playing a recording—","A panicked male voice came through: \"Yes, I’m Xia Xuechun’s ghost painter. The painting she sold today was done by me!\"","\"Xia Xuechun can’t paint at all. She paid me to paint for her, and her taste is so tacky! She kept forcing me to revise the work to her liking. I had no choice—I need to make a living!\"","Xia Xuechun’s eyes widened in terror!","What?!","Her ghost painter had been exposed too?!","Qiao Chuchu locked her phone and addressed the guests: \"The truth is, Xia Xuechun can’t paint at all. The reason her work sold for one and a half million is because she hired a ghost painter and had her own people inflate the price to boost her reputation.\"","\"Not only that, she betrayed her friend, had men ambush her friend’s home, and locked her friend inside, nearly leading to her assault.\"","Her voice rose: \"This is the kind of liar and criminal that Long Yuntian of the Dragon Family and Madam Wang Ru Tang have been supporting!\"","Wang Ru Tang: \"?!\"","Long Yuntian: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu held up her phone, showing everyone photos of Xia Xuechun and Long Yuntian kissing!","\"Xia Xuechun claims to be his sister, but she’s been intimately involved with Long Yuntian!\"","\"So today, I, Qiao Chuchu, am serving you all a big scandal, exposing the hypocrisy of Xia Xuechun, Long Yuntian, and Wang Ru Tang!\"","She grabbed Xia Xuechun’s wrist and pulled her closer: \"Xia Xuechun, you wanted to go viral and have your name known throughout the entire art world, right?\"","Xia Xuechun stared at her, speechless with fear.","Qiao Chuchu’s lips curled into a triumphant smile: \"Let me help you with that.\""]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205: Xia Xue Chun Yi Swears and Thunder Strikes.","paragraphs":["When Xia Xuechun heard Qiao Chuchu's words, her pupils contracted in fear, and she exclaimed, \"You're helping me? What are you planning to do to me?!\"","She furiously grabbed Qiao Chuchu by the collar, shouting, \"What are you going to do to me?!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci pushed Xia Xuechun away!","Xia Xuechun stumbled and fell onto Long Yuntian's stomach!","Long Yuntian let out a cry of pain: \"Ah!!\"","Suddenly, a familiar BGM began playing in the venue!","It was the battle anthem personally chosen by Qi Xiaojia!!","\"For all the pain caused by love~\"","\"For all the wounds caused by hatred~\"","\"I can no longer distinguish between love and hate, is this how it ends?~\"","As the unforgettable theme song played, the expressions of the guests grew more and more intrigued: \"This is way more interesting than the auction!~\"","\"I was almost falling asleep, but now I'm wide awake!\"","\"But does anyone really believe that Long Yuntian and this girl are just siblings? Isn't it obvious they're in a sugar daddy relationship?\"","\"Everyone knows, they just don't say it out loud. Long Yuntian's wife doesn't bother with this kind of thing anyway. After all, Long Yuntian has several women outside, and Xia Xuechun is just his favorite. As long as she doesn't touch the family assets, it's fine!\"","Xia Xuechun's palms were drenched in sweat, and her ears were ringing.","Surrounded by people.","All watching the drama.","Many of them familiar faces.","She didn't pay attention to anyone else, her focus solely on Qiao Chuchu at the center.","Qi Xiaojia stood beside Qiao Chuchu, tears in her eyes as she looked at Xia Xuechun.","Feeling betrayed, Xia Xuechun stood up and shouted, \"Qi Xiaojia, you betrayed me!! And I thought you were my best friend!!!\"","Without a word, Qi Xiaojia slapped her!","Xia Xuechun fell back onto Long Yuntian's stomach!","Long Yuntian's eyes rolled back, and he fainted.","Pei Ci picked up a glass of champagne and splashed it on Long Yuntian: \"Wake up! No sleeping!\"","Long Yuntian jolted awake, staring blankly at Xia Xuechun, who was still sitting on his stomach with no intention of getting up: \"...\"","Xia Xuechun, with all her heart, tried to explain to the surrounding guests: \"I'm innocent, I really am innocent!\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked, \"Innocent or not, you'll find out when you go with the police. You and Long Yuntian are both involved in this. Those thugs might have been hired by the two of you.\"","Police officers emerged from the crowd, showing their badges: \"We've received reports from the victim. Xia Xuechun and Long Yuntian are suspected of instigating a crime. Please come with us to the police station for questioning.\"","Xia Xuechun's face turned pale, and she scrambled to her feet: \"It's not me! I didn't do anything! I'm innocent!\"","A female officer approached her calmly, \"Cooperate, and we'll investigate thoroughly. Don't make any sudden moves.\"","Xia Xuechun refused to admit guilt, pushed the officer away, and tried to run: \"Don't touch me! I can't be arrested! I'm clean, I didn't harm anyone! If I go in, my life is over!!\"","The pushed officer's expression darkened, and she tackled Xia Xuechun to the ground: \"Cuff her!\"","Xia Xuechun was pinned to the ground, unable to break free, and glared at Qi Xiaojia: \"Qi Xiaojia, how much did Qiao Chuchu pay you?! How could you be so cheap! You sold out for just 50,000 yuan!!\"","Qi Xiaojia, tears streaming down her face, laughed bitterly, \"And how much did you pay those thugs to assault me?! How can you have the nerve to turn this around on me!!\"","Xia Xuechun screamed, \"I didn't! We're best friends, how could I do something like that?! If I really did that, may I be struck by lightning!!!\"","\"Boom!\"","A thunderclap rolled across the sky!","Even the lights in the hotel flickered!","The entire room gasped in shock!","Qiao Chuchu looked up at the window, stunned: \"Xia Xuechun, are you the Thunder God? You summon lightning with your words?!\"","Xia Xuechun couldn't believe it, her face ashen: \"This... this doesn't count... this doesn't count!\"","\"Doesn't count?\" Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow, then shouted at the sky, \"If I'm falsely accusing Xia Xuechun today, may I also be struck by lightning!\"","Nothing happened.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes lit up, and she poked Xia Xuechun: \"Can you do that again? You know, the 'if I harmed Qi Xiaojia, may I be struck by lightning' thing.\"","The crowd eagerly chimed in: \"Yes, yes, do it again!\"","Even the police looked at her with curiosity.","Xia Xuechun, still restrained by the police, looked up at the ceiling, her voice tentative: \"If... if I harmed Qi Xiaojia, may I be struck by lightning?\"","\"CRACK!!\"","Another bolt of lightning struck!","Everyone was stunned!","\"OMG! I'm not superstitious, but this is definitely some kind of divine intervention!\"","\"Xia Xuechun and Long Yuntian are the Thunder God and Lightning Goddess!!\"","\"Is this the legendary wrath of heaven?!\"","Xia Xuechun stared out the window, finally realizing the lightning was targeting her.","Why?!","How is this possible?!","Terrified, she tried to run but couldn't, wailing, \"No! I can't go out there! It's too dangerous, I'll be struck by lightning!\"","The officer forcefully held her down: \"You won't. Just don't make any more reckless oaths outside. You know what you've done, don't you?! Stop talking nonsense!!\"","Xia Xuechun cried, \"I didn't do it, I really didn't! I don't know why the lightning is targeting me!!\"","She was dragged into the police car.","Long Yuntian also stumbled to his feet, held by the police, muttering, \"I need to go to the hospital. I think someone stomped on me down there. Someone kicked me a few times in the chaos... You need to investigate this too.\"","The police officer: \"Huh???\"","This job is full of absurdities.","Qi Xiaojia followed closely, giving Qiao Chuchu a grateful look and hugging her tightly: \"Thank you for saving me. If it weren't for you, I don't know what would have happened to me. Thank you so much!\"","She quickly followed the police out.","Xia Xuechun was still shouting at the top of her lungs: \"I'm really innocent! I have such a good relationship with Grandma Wang and Brother Long! How could I do something so terrible?! You've all been fooled by Qiao Chuchu! She's the one who harmed Qi Xiaojia! I wanted to save Xiaojia!\"","Her voice faded into the distance.","The noisy venue gradually quieted down.","Qiao Chuchu turned to Wang Ru Tang, her tone dripping with sarcasm: \"Madam Wang, there are so many talented newcomers in the circle, yet you chose to promote someone who can't even paint, who plotted to harm her best friend, and who meddled in someone else's marriage. You truly have an eye for talent.\"","Wang Ru Tang's face turned green!","An elderly woman in a black cheongsam chuckled softly, adding to Qiao Chuchu's words: \"Wang Ru Tang, you're a master in the art world. Whoever you promote rises to fame. Yet, instead of nurturing talented individuals, you promote someone who can't even paint, whose hired ghostwriters can't even meet our standards. How can you still hold your position as a master?\"","Wang Ru Tang clenched her teeth, her expression stiff and haughty: \"I didn't know Xia Xuechun did these things.\"","\"You didn't know?\" Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes, raising her voice: \"You knew Xia Xuechun tried to frame me by stealing. You knew she wasn't a real artist. Despite her poor character and lack of talent, you still chose to promote her. How do you deserve the respect and trust people have for you?!\"","Wang Ru Tang was left speechless, opening her mouth but unable to utter a single word!","A few women behind her hesitated, wanting to retort, but Qiao Chuchu gave a signal to the reporters waiting outside!","The reporters swarmed in, surrounding Wang Ru Tang: \"Madam Wang! Is it true that you promoted someone who instigated a crime?!\"","\"Madam Wang, as a master painter of China, how do you justify promoting a criminal who used ghostwriters? Do you think you deserve your current status?!\"","\"Madam Wang, were those online marketing accounts hired by you? Are all the artists you promote unworthy of their positions?!\"","\"Madam Wang, is it true that you accept gifts in exchange for promotions?!\"","\"Please answer, Madam Wang! We're live-streaming this, and many people are waiting for your response!\"","Wang Ru Tang stepped back in shock, staring at the reporters surrounding her.","How did so many reporters get in?!","Who let them in?!"]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206: Completely Nip All Potential Threats in the Bud","paragraphs":["Wang Ru Tang didn’t say a word. Shielded by her entourage, she fled in panic!","The reporters chased after her: “Ms. Wang, please answer our questions!”","“Ms. Wang, don’t evade us! How many of the artists you’ve promoted are actually unworthy of their fame?!”","Qiao Chuchu watched Wang Ru Tang’s retreating figure with satisfaction and opened her phone. The trending topics had already exploded.","#Qiao Chuchu is a painter#","#Unknown painter upstages Qiao Chuchu?#","#The so-called genius grassroots painter Xia Xuechun’s works are ghost-painted#","#Xia Xuechun hired someone to assault her best friend?!#","#This is the fastest downfall I’ve ever seen#","#Just started promoting and already crashed—is this black fame or just black?#","#Wang Ru Tang shields the grassroots genius painter Xia Xuechun#","#Xia Xuechun is the mistress of two men#","#Is Wang Ru Tang undeserving of her position?#","Qiao Chuchu curled her lips and tapped her phone playfully: *Originally, this outcome wouldn’t have been possible.*","*But because I went viral online today, I gave it a push by buying a trending topic about me being a painter, letting everyone know my achievements.*","*At the right time, the marketing accounts bought by the Dragon Family started promoting Xia Xuechun as a grassroots genius painter.*","*The influencers I secretly hired then hyped Xia Xuechun up, claiming she was so talented that she could surpass me. Although I’m an academic underachiever, my art skills are solid, and with my current popularity, all the attention was drawn in.*","*While netizens debated who was better between me and Xia Xuechun, Qi Xiaojia would post an essay online detailing everything that happened today, exposing Xia Xuechun’s kissing photos with the Dragon Family brothers, as well as their wedding photos.*","She found Qi Xiaojia’s Weibo and clicked on the essay.","It was filled with Qi Xiaojia’s resentment toward Xia Xuechun.","But at the end of the essay, Qi Xiaojia specifically thanked her: *Thank you, Ms. Qiao, for saving me today. I was also on the boat when it happened. The rope Ms. Qiao used to tie up her brother was mine, so she came to my house to thank me.*","*At that moment, I was being forced by someone, but Ms. Qiao arrived with her bodyguards just in time to save me. I’m truly grateful! If it weren’t for Ms. Qiao, I can’t imagine what would have happened to me! Ms. Qiao saved my life!*","The comments below were flooded with sympathy and praise for her:","“I can’t even imagine how terrifying it must have been, locked in your own home by your best friend. If Qiao Chuchu hadn’t shown up, what would have happened?”","“How could Xia Xuechun do something like that?! Is Wang Ru Tang blind?! How could she still promote her?! As for the Dragon Family brothers, those scumbags are always chasing after 18-year-olds—disgusting! I hope they die horribly!”","“Ahhh, I’m totally stanning Qiao Chuchu for saving people!!”","“I’m officially a fan of the eighth young lady! She saves her family and other girls too. I can’t imagine what would’ve happened if she hadn’t shown up!”","“My instincts were right! My online daughter is the absolute best! Protecting the best little eighth!”","Wang Ru Tang’s account was being bombarded with hate.","The Dragon Family’s company was also exposed, and their stock prices were plummeting. At this rate, it was going to crash off a cliff!","Qiao Chuchu scrolled through the comments, feeling more and more pleased.","The other guests gradually caught on, whispering among themselves: “In my opinion, Wang Ru Tang’s position is untenable now, and the Dragon Family is probably going to get what’s coming to them.”","“If Wang Ru Tang falls, who can take her place?”","Everyone thought for a moment, then turned their gazes toward Qiao Chuchu.","The Pei Family also quietly looked at Qiao Chuchu’s back.","Qiao Chuchu put away her phone, smiling confidently. “My painting hasn’t finished auctioning yet. Let’s continue the auction and not delay things.”","Everyone was momentarily stunned, then nodded with smiles. “Indeed, Ms. Qiao’s painting has already reached ten million!”","“Ms. Qiao is so talented. It’s a shame she hasn’t returned to painting.”","Qiao Chuchu smiled and said firmly, “I’ve already decided to return to painting.”","If she didn’t return, how could she seize Wang Ru Tang’s precarious position? How could she climb to the top?","Even if she wasn’t old enough, she would become the most promising candidate, rising to the highest position to control all the resources and prevent people like Wang Ru Tang from bullying her.","She returned to her seat and glanced at the two empty seats beside her, feeling a sudden clarity.","*Having foresight is truly different. Every step I take hits my enemies where it hurts!*","She chuckled to herself, feeling both hatred and satisfaction: *Xia Xuechun hides behind everyone, doing nothing but relying on luck to overshadow me. With just a few words, she can get Wang Ru Tang to lock me up in a mental institution!*","*As for Wang Ru Tang, she took advantage of my sincerity, deceived me, and despised me in her heart while pretending to treat me like a granddaughter, only to stab me in the back in the end!*","*The Dragon Family brothers are Xia Xuechun’s lapdogs. They claim to love her but never miss a chance to hurt me!*","*Let’s see how Xia Xuechun can still go viral after what I’ve done today. Let’s see how she can cozy up to Wang Ru Tang like a granddaughter and lock me up in a mental institution while letting those Dragon Family scumbags assault me!*","The memories made her tremble with anger. She rubbed her hands together, trying to calm herself down.","Pei Buxian’s eyes reddened, and he stood up to go to her.","Pei Che grabbed him: “This is her personal time. We can’t disturb her. She said she didn’t want us here!”","Pei Buxian hesitated but ultimately sat back down.","The others watched her trembling back with hearts full of pity.","Qiao Chuchu sat at the edge, her head bowed low. No one knew she was crying.","She wept in silence.","Even though Wang Ru Tang wasn’t dead, Xia Xuechun wasn’t dead, and the Dragon Family brothers weren’t dead, she still felt a sense of triumph.","Because if she hadn’t nipped everything in the bud today, she and those around her would have been plunged into hell.","She felt cold, frantically looking for her bodyguard to get a coat, but a pair of hands landed on her knees.","They were bony hands, so thin they were almost frightening.","But they were warm, dispelling the chill in her body and spreading warmth through her limbs.","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. She slowly looked up and met a pair of all-too-familiar eyes.","A gaunt red-haired girl stood before her.","She had the same face as Qiao Chuchu.","The girl’s cheeks were hollow, dark circles heavy under her eyes, and her hair was sparse.","She wore a heavy-looking black outfit and smiled awkwardly at her.","“Hello, Qiao Chu.”","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in shock. “You’re the me who failed in that timeline?”","How could she be so thin?","How could she be so pitiful?","The girl didn’t deny it. She opened her arms and gently embraced her.","Qiao Chuchu caught the scent of her favorite perfume on the girl.","Suddenly, she was overwhelmed with sorrow. “How much suffering did you endure?”","The girl didn’t answer. She held her gently and said, “You’ve exceeded expectations in reversing the plot and altering many people’s fates, so you’ve completely changed the future. But your ultimate ending is still yet to come. The new path is yours to explore alone, Qiao Chu.”"]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207: The Debut of the Sickly Youth","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was stunned, and the scenes before her eyes replayed once more.","The leering faces of the Long Brothers turned pale and faded, disappearing into nothingness.","The image of Xia Xuechun and Wang Rutang snuggling close together also began to crumble.","Even the memory of her chasing after Xia Xuechun was vanishing.","She stood there, dazed. \"Everything has been rewritten. What about the ending between me and Xia Xuechun—\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up and realized that her frail self was no longer there.","Instead, two bodyguards were crouching obediently in front of her.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci looked up at her, their brows slightly furrowed, their eyes behind their sunglasses faintly revealing concern. \"Miss, are you alright?\"","For some reason, Qiao Chuchu had suddenly frozen.","She didn’t move a muscle.","It was as if her breathing had stopped.","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of it, feeling an emptiness in her heart, as if a piece had been carved out. \"I'm fine.\"","[I just... saw another version of myself, that’s all.]","Pei Ci knelt up straight, gently wiping the tears from her face, his eyes filled with pity.","Pei Mu slowly took her hand. \"Are you really okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu sniffled, lowering her head, her voice muffled. \"I’m fine, I—\"","Suddenly, she grew wary.","[Wait a minute!]","[Why are these two bodyguards being so intimate with me?!]","Tears still in her eyes, she looked up and gave each of them a solid punch!!","Pei Mu: \"!\"","Pei Ci: \"!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s anger flared up instantly. \"Sexual harassment, huh?! Or do you think acting like this will win over your female employer?!\"","The Pei brothers, still on video call: \"!\"","Originally, their faces were filled with worry, but seeing Qiao Chuchu so full of energy, they couldn’t help but smirk.","That’s Qiao Chuchu for you—her emotions shift so quickly!","Pei Ci and Pei Mu covered their faces, looking utterly wronged. \"No, Miss, you’ve misunderstood us! We were just genuinely concerned about you!\"","She snorted, lowering her voice to scold them. \"Do you think I’m stupid? Concerned about me, so you wipe my tears? And hold my hand?\"","[So intimate, do you think you’re my boyfriends or something?! You have no sense of boundaries!]","The two of them looked pitiful. \"We really were just concerned.\"","Though there was no denying the fact that they had crossed a line.","Because the moment they saw her cry, they felt distressed and wanted to comfort her.","Qiao Chuchu scoffed. \"Concern my foot. Are you trying to seduce me with your looks, make me fall for you, and then pull off some cliché ‘rich heiress falls for her bodyguards’ trope, marry me, drain my wealth, and then one day when I refuse to give you money, plot to chop me into pieces?!\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","Just how many crime documentaries has she watched?!","Qiao Chuchu sneered. \"Let me tell you something, even if I cry my eyes out, you two better not lay a finger on me. I have a brain, and I’m not some love-starved fool. I won’t be won over by your so-called ‘gentle and caring’ act. I’m not the type to fall for romance! You’ve got the wrong idea!\"","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","Everyone else who heard her: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu angrily pointed outside. \"You two, get out of here right now. Go pack your things and hand in your resignations. I don’t want to see you anymore.\"","[I’ve watched so many crime shows, you think I’m naive or something?!]","[If someone’s being overly nice for no reason, they’re definitely up to no good!]","Pei Mu and Pei Ci’s expressions changed, and they pressed down on her knees. \"Miss, please don’t send us away. We’ve learned our lesson.\"","Qiao Chuchu warned them. \"Take your hands off me, or I’ll tell my brother! And my brother isn’t exactly the most reasonable person!\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","The Pei family: \"?\"","Pei Mu paused, then let out an exasperated laugh. \"What’s wrong with your brother’s head?\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked. \"Ever seen a rabid dog? That’s what my brother’s like when he’s angry. He doesn’t listen to reason.\"","She leaned in, lowering her voice mysteriously. \"And he happens to have a pair of twins who’d be perfect for you two—one for each of you.\"","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu lifted her chin proudly. \"So, if you don’t want trouble, you better leave now. And by the way, those twins are quite handsome. You’ve seen them before.\"","Pei Ci: \"? They’re handsome?\"","Pei Mu: \"? They’re handsome?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Is that really the point here?]","Pei Mu and Pei Ci suddenly stood up, full of energy. \"We’re sorry, Miss. We were out of line. Since you’ve brought up your dashing fifth and sixth brothers, we’re absolutely terrified. We’ll leave right away!\"","They nodded in unison!","And strode off confidently!","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She stared blankly as they walked away, utterly confused.","[Did changing the ending make everyone around me act weird?]","Suddenly, the venue grew noisy.","Qiao Chuchu looked up in confusion and saw the auctioneer still bidding on her artwork. \"Thirty-six million, does anyone bid thirty-seven million?\"","\"Alright, thirty-seven million on the phone. Does anyone bid thirty-eight million?\"","The guests exchanged glances, shocked. \"Qiao Chu’s painting has reached thirty-eight million?\"","\"This is insane. I thought it was already overpriced at thirty million.\"","\"Could it be that someone has a crush on Qiao Chuchu?!\"","\"Ha, spending tens of millions to buy your crush’s painting is definitely a way to get their attention.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...???\"","She had been so focused on the two bodyguards that she hadn’t noticed her painting had reached such a price!","Who on earth is bidding so recklessly on her painting?","It’s not *that* valuable, is it?","The auctioneer continued, looking expectantly at the regular bidders. \"Any higher bids?\"","Pei Yuan decisively raised his hand.","Pei Che followed suit, his face cold as he raised his paddle.","Pei Youchuan raised his paddle with determination.","Pei Fengnong didn’t hesitate to raise his.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci clasped their hands together, joining the fray!","Qiao Chuchu had complimented their looks!","So they were determined to win!","Lin Shen also raised his paddle, his expression serious yet hopeful.","Pei Buxian held up his paddle with a sneer. \"None of you will outbid me.\"","His gaze locked onto Qiao Chuchu, but she turned around, staring intently at the eight of them.","They: \"...\"","The auctioneer smiled. \"Forty-four million. Any higher bids?\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at them without blinking, her expression calm yet unsettling, giving off a quietly unhinged vibe.","For some reason, they felt a pang of guilt and lowered their heads.","\"Fifty million.\"","A cool, youthful voice suddenly rang out.","Qiao Chuchu and the eight men were startled, turning toward the source of the voice.","A sickly-looking boy in a wheelchair had his assistant lower the paddle, and he turned to look at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu frowned in confusion.","The boy wasn’t particularly handsome, but he had a gentle, androgynous beauty. He gave her a soft smile. \"Miss Qiao’s paintings are always worth it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","Who is this guy?"]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208: The First Son of Fortune, Shi Yu","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was still in a daze when the auctioneer suddenly struck the gavel, declaring, \"Fifty million, sold to this gentleman!\"","As the venue erupted in noise, the Pei family members gradually came to their senses and turned their attention to the frail young man.","The young man gestured for the elderly butler behind him to push his wheelchair closer to Qiao Chuchu. He extended his hand to her: \"Hello, Miss Qiao, my name is Shi Yu.\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced down at his hand.","His fingers were long and slender, but they were an unnatural pale blue, almost skeletal, with only a thin layer of skin covering them—barely more flesh than what she had seen on her own hand moments ago.","They looked as though they might shatter at the slightest touch.","From what she had seen of the many striking beauties in her life, Shi Yu was the epitome of a delicate, understated beauty. His narrow, phoenix-like eyes slanted upward, his lips were small and exquisitely shaped, and his bone structure was fine and delicate. His face was as small as a palm, and his exposed wrist seemed only slightly thicker than hers.","His features were indeed understated, but he made up for it with an extraordinary aura.","There was a scholarly elegance about him, as if he carried the grace of someone well-read.","Qiao Chuchu inhaled sharply, unable to help herself from thinking:","[People always talk about the beauty of fragility, and now I finally understand what they mean.]","[He has the kind of beauty that makes you want to punch him, just to see him cry for three days straight.]","Shi Yu's eyelid twitched, and his raised hand hesitated, as if he wanted to lower it.","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her thoughts and quickly shook his hand: \"Hello, Qiao Chuchu.\"","Shi Yu regained his composure: \"I know. The first painting sold at your debut exhibition was bought by me.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"Huh? I remember it was an elderly gentleman.\"","\"That was my butler at the time,\" Shi Yu said with a smile. \"He's retired now and has gone back home to enjoy his old age.\"","Qiao Chuchu finally understood and became more enthusiastic: [So he's a long-time client! I should really thank him properly!]","She expressed her gratitude: \"Thank you for your appreciation! But fifty million for this painting is really too much.\"","Shi Yu averted his gaze, looking at the eight people behind her who were eyeing him with suspicion: \"Miss Qiao, your paintings are so popular that if I hadn't drawn everyone's attention, the bidding might still be going on.\"","The Pei brothers were peeking from behind, clearly uneasy.","Pei Buxian couldn't hold back any longer and stood up, walking over.","Shi Yu's eyes darkened. He suddenly pressed Qiao Chuchu's hand and spoke quickly: \"Miss Qiao, do you know why Xia Xuechun always gets struck by lightning when she swears?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Why?\"","Shi Yu tilted his head and smiled at her: \"Because those favored by heaven, when they commit acts of cruelty and refuse to repent, daring to make bold oaths in defiance, exhaust their good fortune.\"","\"Xia Xuechun didn't just harm Qi Xiaojia; she hurt others too.\"","\"The second son of the Long family, Long Yunxiao, and his wife were deeply in love. At first, Xia Xuechun was kind to her, but when the wife discovered that Long Yunxiao had fallen for Xia Xuechun, she went to confront her privately. Xia Xuechun dismissed her with the excuse that 'they were innocent,' and then told Long Yunxiao about the confrontation.\"","\"Long Yunxiao flew into a rage and struck his wife. She fell down the stairs, injuring her neck, and was left paralyzed from the waist down.\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked: \"Long Yunxiao's wife is paralyzed? Why hasn't anyone talked about this?\"","Shi Yu explained: \"The Long family suppressed the news. They don't allow family scandals to be exposed. Even the wife's family doesn't know the truth—they were told she fell on her own, and it had nothing to do with anyone else.\"","\"The woman is still in a coma and can't defend herself. Xia Xuechun even visited her in the hospital, standing by her bedside and saying that although she had wronged her, she would take care of her children. Long Yunxiao even praised Xia Xuechun for her kindness.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...I feel so disgusted I don't even know what to say.\"","Shi Yu shrugged: \"She's always been like this. I know.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","You've known since she was young?","Pei Buxian walked over and sat down next to Qiao Chuchu, staring intently at Shi Yu.","Shi Yu frowned, covering his mouth as he coughed twice: \"If your brother is here, I won't say anything more.\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback and shot Pei Buxian a look of annoyance: \"Why are you here?\"","Pei Buxian ignored her displeasure and continued to stare at Shi Yu: \"You can speak freely in front of me. I'm Qiao Chuchu's seventh brother, Pei Buxian. Don't worry, I won't get angry no matter what you say. In fact, I'm very friendly.\"","He leaned closer to Shi Yu, his face darkening as he spoke slowly: \"I~ am~ really~ friendly~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Shi Yu: \"...\"","He didn't look friendly at all.","Shi Yu's lips twitched, as if he wanted to laugh, but then he was overcome by another fit of coughing!","He coughed so hard he could barely breathe, his pale face flushing slightly, giving him a touch of vitality. Clutching his chest, he said: \"I only have two months left. Before I die, I'd like to have a private word with my idol, Miss Qiao. Would you give me that time, Mr. Pei?\"","He handed Pei Buxian a piece of paper: \"Here, this is my diagnosis.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Why is he carrying his medical report around?","Pei Buxian took the paper suspiciously, examining it carefully. His eyes widened in shock: \"Multiple organ failure?\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned and looked at Shi Yu in surprise.","Shi Yu gasped weakly, tears of pain glistening in his eyes: \"Yes, I have unexplained organ failure. No matter what medicine I take or what treatments I try, nothing works. At this rate of decline, in a month I'll be bedridden, and in two months, I'll be dead.\"","He pleaded with Pei Buxian: \"So, as a dying man, I just want to have a few words with my idol. Is that okay?\"","Pei Buxian's expression gradually softened, and he patted Shi Yu's shoulder sympathetically: \"Please, stay strong.\"","Shi Yu smiled as he watched Pei Buxian walk away: \"Thank you. You're a good person.\"","Pei Buxian hung his head, muttering to himself: \"I shouldn't have been jealous of someone so sick...\"","As Pei Buxian left, Shi Yu turned to Qiao Chuchu with a smile: \"Your brother is a good person. I thought he might be one of those overprotective, strange types, but he's not.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She wasn't sure if her brother was overprotective, but she was certain he was strange.","She got straight to the point: \"So, do you know the whole story?\"","Shi Yu nodded: \"I was the original male lead, the first 'chosen one' of fate.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Wait, can the 'chosen one' change?","Shi Yu lowered his chin and sneered: \"Since I was seven years old, I've known the entire plot. I knew Xia Xuechun would become my wife in the future. I observed her secretly and found that she had no redeeming qualities whatsoever.\"","He leaned closer to Qiao Chuchu, his voice filled with resentment: \"I, Shi Yu, have always been top of my class, excelling in everything I do. Even when buying a cat, I only get the best, show-quality ones. But I was destined to marry this brainless woman who climbed over others to get ahead, all because of 'fate'? Why should I accept such a fate?\"","\"After that, I started avoiding Xia Xuechun. Once, I was even kidnapped, and Xia Xuechun happened to pass by. To avoid being saved by her, I stayed silent in the trunk, hiding from her rescue scene.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened in shock: \"Weren't you afraid you'd suffocate?\"","Shi Yu shrugged dismissively: \"My watch has a tracker. I would have been rescued eventually, sooner or later.\"","He slumped back in his wheelchair, defeated: \"But after that, my luck ran out. My body started to weaken. It's as if the world is trying to erase me.\"","Qiao Chuchu analyzed calmly: \"So, if you want to survive, you need to reclaim the role of the male lead and take back the luck that Ji Yanchuan stole?\"","Shi Yu nodded: \"Yes.\"","She raised an eyebrow: \"Then why haven't you gone to Xia Xuechun?\"","Shi Yu's face turned pale: \"I'd rather die than go to Xia Xuechun!\""]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209: The Fate of the Female Protagonist Now Lies Within You, Qiao Chuchu","paragraphs":["Shi Yu gritted his teeth and said, \"If we were to switch places, and you had to marry Long Yuntian to survive, would you marry him?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Ugh!\"","She imagined herself marrying Long Yuntian.","Shi Yu: \"...Ugh!\"","He imagined himself marrying Xia Xuechun.","Qiao Chuchu and Shi Yu exchanged a nauseated glance, silently patting each other's shoulders, understanding each other without words.","Pei Youchuan looked at the two of them in confusion: \"What are they talking about? Why are they suddenly acting like buddies and patting each other's shoulders?\"","Pei Buxian sighed: \"Don't mind them. He's just a fan of Qiao Chuchu, and he only has two months left to live. He means no harm.\"","Shi Yu gasped weakly: \"If I want to survive, I must become the new male lead.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned: \"Then wouldn't it be safer for you to get close to Xia Xuechun?\"","Shi Yu pressed his hand to his chest, speaking weakly: \"Xia Xuechun has lost her luck. After she actively harmed Qi Xiaojia and Long Yunxiao's wife, most of her luck was transferred away. Only a tiny remnant remains, and soon she'll become an ordinary person.\"","He looked up at Qiao Chuchu: \"If I'm not mistaken, the new luck has already transferred to you. You're practically the female lead now. You'll follow the script written by fate and marry Ji Yanchuan.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","Who’s marrying Ji Yanchuan?","Her? Marrying Ji Yanchuan??!","Shi Yu sensed her resistance and tremblingly grabbed Qiao Chuchu's hand: \"I was the original male lead. I understand how you feel about not wanting to be tied to someone you don't love. If you choose me, I'll become the new male lead, and the luck will naturally transfer to me. I can survive.\"","His gaze grew resolute: \"Please marry me, Miss Qiao. I'll treat you well.\"","Pei Youchuan craned his neck from behind: \"What are they talking about? Why does this guy sound so desperate?\"","Pei Buxian sighed: \"He doesn't have much time left. He's probably pouring his heart out, hoping Qiao Chuchu will give him an autograph or something.\"","The others nodded in understanding.","Ah, so that's it.","Lin Shen commented: \"It's nice that Qiao Chuchu has such a devoted fan. I'm happy for her.\"","The others nodded again: \"Yes, Qiao Chuchu must be touched, even if it's a male fan.\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at Shi Yu, who had red eyes, in disbelief.","Shi Yu's eyes were red from speaking too much, but his voice remained warm and youthful: \"I know this is sudden, but I don't have much time. I'm afraid I might collapse at any moment because... I have a tendency to faint. When I do, I might sleep for days. That's why I'm in such a hurry.\"","He lowered his gaze, masking his anxiety: \"Of course, I know this is unfair to you, asking you to be with a man you don't love. But to compensate, I'll give you 50 billion as a token of gratitude for saving me.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened: \"How much?\"","Shi Yu: \"50 billion.\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","She covered her mouth.","Clenched her teeth in thought.","Scratched her head.","Hesitantly asked: \"If I marry you, you'll give me 50 billion? Really, billion??\"","Shi Yu nodded: \"Yes, I can sign a contract with you, a voluntary gift. I even brought the contract.\"","Qiao Chuchu scratched her cheek: \"Can we get a divorce later?\"","Shi Yu frowned: \"No, and you can't cheat on me. I won't cheat on you either. I genuinely want to marry you, Miss Qiao. Besides, the male and female leads in novels don't get divorced.\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed regretfully: \"Can't we just have a bad ending?\"","Shi Yu: \"...Then wouldn't I just be setting myself up for a 'chasing my wife to the crematorium' scenario?\"","Qiao Chuchu covered her eyes, heartbroken: \"I never thought I'd be the kind of person to turn down money.\"","Shi Yu: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu stood up, leaving sadly: \"I'm sorry, I can't marry you. I'm a non-marriage advocate.\"","Shi Yu was surprised: \"Even for 50 billion?\"","Qiao Chuchu's nose tingled: \"Yes, even for 50 billion!\"","She left in anguish!","[Ahhh, who wouldn't be tempted by 50 billion? But I really don't want to get married!]","Shi Yu: \"???\"","He stood up, calling after Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao, Miss Qiao?\"","The butler behind him was shocked: \"Good heavens, young master! You're standing! You actually have the strength to stand!\"","Shi Yu looked at himself in surprise.","Indeed, he was standing.","He had been unconscious for days, too weak to move, but he rushed to the charity event. And now, after just a short conversation with Qiao Chuchu, he was standing!","He staggered after Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao, please wait.\"","Pei Buxian stopped him, puzzled: \"What's wrong? Did you two have a fight?\"","Shi Yu panted, already drenched in sweat after just a few steps. He looked at the seven Pei brothers: \"I... I just want Miss Qiao to talk to me a little more.\"","Pei Fengnong frowned: \"But you're in no condition to do that. Let it go. If you have something to say, you can tell us, her brothers.\"","Pei Youchuan was also concerned: \"Yes, Qiao Chuchu isn't a cruel person. What did you say to upset her?\"","Shi Yu looked at them earnestly: \"I told her I wanted to marry her.\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Pei Che: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","Pei Buxian picked up his phone: \"Let me call you a ride. How about a hearse?\"","Shi Yu: \"?\"","-","Qiao Chuchu rushed to the hotel entrance, analyzing calmly: \"I’ve taken half of Xia Xuechun's luck? That's great!\"","With the female lead's luck and the favor of fate, the heavens would no longer plot against her. Instead, she would be showered with endless opportunities.","It was hard to imagine how carefree she’d be, no longer fearing sudden death or worrying about her loved ones dying.","She could finally relax!","A sports car screeched to a halt in front of her.","Ji Yanchuan slowly rolled down the window, his fox-like eyes gleaming with amusement: \"Hey, crazy girl~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Ji Yanchuan?\"","Ji Yanchuan stepped out of the car and stood in front of her, smirking: \"I saw online that you saved Pei Youchuan and an ordinary woman. You're quite impressive.\"","He lowered his voice, his tone laced with charm: \"Someone as loyal and righteous as you must have misunderstood me before. I thought it'd be best if we cleared things up.\"","Ji Yanchuan leaned against his car, crossing his legs comfortably, and said cheerfully: \"I was wrong before. Forgive me, crazy girl.\""]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210: Warning: The Female Lead Is Not Allowed to Swear","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu: \"???\"","How did this guy suddenly appear in front of her and start showing off by apologizing on his own?","His face is so thick that even if seven billion people on Pinduoduo tried to cut it, they might not even make a dent!","She frowned in disgust, recalling what Shi Yu had said.","—\"The new luck has just been transferred to you. You are now practically the female lead. You are destined to marry Ji Yanchuan, as written in the heavens' script.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt like she had swallowed a fly, forcing herself to look at Ji Yanchuan despite the nausea.","There was no doubt that Ji Yanchuan, as the male lead, was decent-looking.","His appearance was above average, but compared to the handsome men around her, he was nothing special.","And his character was absolutely terrible!","She would rather die outside, jump off a building, than marry Ji Yanchuan!","So—","Qiao Chuchu opened her mouth: \"I forgive you, you bleep bleep bleep!\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Why does it start beeping every time I curse?","She angrily said, \"I'll never bleep bleep forgive you, you bleep bleep bleep!\"","Ji Yanchuan was stunned for a moment, then smiled: \"Listen to your little mouth, it sounds like a nightingale, and it even auto-censors!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?????\"","What's going on?!","The female lead's luck doesn't allow her to curse, huh?!","She picked up her phone: \"Don't worry, I'll type it out to curse you.\"","\"Heh.\" Ji Yanchuan chuckled: \"Want to add me on WeChat?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan smiled and picked up his phone: \"I'll scan your QR code. It's better for girls to be a bit passive.\"","Qiao Chuchu really wanted to punch him: \"Do you know phones have a memo app? You can type things for people to see without adding them, you know?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","A shabby van sped towards them from a distance.","Qiao Chuchu glanced over and teased, \"Oh, the kidnapper's van is here for you.\"","After all, in this novel, the male and female leads are always kidnapped together, a pair of star-crossed lovers who find true feelings in adversity.","Ji Yanchuan looked at the van and scoffed, \"Who would want to kidnap me?\"","The van stopped right in front of them.","A group of people jumped out and immediately grabbed Ji Yanchuan!","Ji Yanchuan panicked: \"Run!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was already running: \"No need to tell me! I already flashed away!\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu, in her high heels, spread her fingers like blades and ran as fast as an Olympic athlete!","Ji Yanchuan: \"????\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked confidently!","She was the wind!!","Suddenly, someone struck the back of her head hard, and she blacked out, collapsing to the ground.","Both she and Ji Yanchuan were forced into the dirty van.","Pei Yuan hurriedly walked out of the hotel, only to see Ji Yanchuan's car at the entrance, but no sign of Qiao Chuchu.","He dialed her number.","The familiar ringtone sounded at the entrance.","It was Qiao Chuchu's old backup phone.","Pei Yuan's face turned pale: \"Chuchu...\"","---","Qiao Chuchu endured the pain and opened her eyes.","Her high-slit skirt had been replaced with a pair of sweatpants, and her upper body was covered with a hoodie that wasn't hers, preventing her from being exposed.","A very considerate kidnapper.","But her mouth was taped shut, and her limbs were tied with ropes. She struggled to sit up against the wall, looking around and seeing Ji Yanchuan sitting across from her, his expression grave.","Ji Yanchuan blinked at her worriedly, as if asking if she was okay.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She didn't know who the kind soul was who had put the sweatpants and hoodie on her, but she was really grateful she hadn't been exposed in front of this dog of a man.","Ji Yanchuan winked at her again.","His eyebrows raised twice, and he blinked five times, as if trying to convey something.","But what was most disgusting was that Qiao Chuchu felt like she understood!","She felt like Ji Yanchuan was saying, \"Don't worry! Leave it to me, I'll protect you!\"","She sneered, loosened the ropes, and tore off the tape from her mouth: \"I don't need you to save me.\"","She was skilled in stealth, practically an invincible assassin.","Getting out of this kind of binding was child's play.","Ji Yanchuan's eyes widened like saucers: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu walked to the door and peered through the crack.","Ji Yanchuan squirmed: \"Mmmph!\"","What about him?!","Save him too!","Chuchu was annoyed.","In the original plot, Xia Xuechun and Ji Yanchuan were kidnapped together, and at this point, they were supposed to fall in love.","The kidnappers would hold a knife to Xia Xuechun, forcing Ji Yanchuan to submit.","To protect Xia Xuechun, Ji Yanchuan would endure the beating, while Xia Xuechun cried, \"Stop hitting him~\" in a tragic scene.","It seemed like fate was forcing her to follow Ji Yanchuan's storyline.","But she wasn't the helpless Xia Xuechun.","Qiao Chuchu crouched down, her gaze as sharp as a wolf's, looking outside.","These kidnappers had messed with the wrong person.","Ji Yanchuan was frantic: \"Mmmph!!\"","\"Quiet!\" Qiao Chuchu picked up a discarded chopstick from the ground and used it to tie up her hair, whispering, \"I'll check if anyone's outside, then I'll let you go, you deadweight!\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"!\"","Under the dim yellow light, Qiao Chuchu, wearing a slightly too-small hoodie, tied up her hair while giving him a disdainful look.","He slowly widened his eyes, staring at her in a daze, his ears turning pink.","Qiao Chuchu saw that no one was outside, so she tore off the tape from his mouth and began untying him.","Ji Yanchuan gazed at her dreamily: \"I was supposed to be mad at you for cursing at me, but for some reason, my heart is racing because I find your stubbornness really charming.\"","He smirked slightly: \"Are you trying to get my attention, you crazy woman?\"","Qiao Chuchu paused while untying him.","Then she quickly tied an ultra-tight knot!!","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu turned and walked away!","Ji Yanchuan: \"Wait, I'll pay you to save me! I'll give you a million!\"","Qiao Chuchu opened the door.","Ji Yanchuan: \"Five million!\"","Qiao Chuchu closed the door.","Ji Yanchuan: \"Ten million!!\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly opened the door again, walked over to him, and untied the ropes: \"Don't make a sound, follow me, crouch when I crouch, move when I move.\"","Ji Yanchuan rubbed his wrists resentfully and nodded.","Qiao Chuchu led him down the hallway, cautiously looking around, when she heard voices from the next room: \"This Weisheng Huailing is the one the boss wants, right? He's just a deaf guy, doesn't seem special at all.\"","Qiao Chuchu's breath hitched. She pressed against the wall and peered through a hole.","Weisheng Huailing sat slumped in a chair, his silver-white hair dusted with dirt, his hands and feet bound.","She couldn't believe it.","[Weisheng Huailing?]","Weisheng Huailing's eyes lit up, his gaze flickering towards Qiao Chuchu's direction.","Sister?","What a coincidence.","He had let himself be caught on purpose to find out who wanted him dead and who had betrayed his whereabouts, but he hadn't expected to run into someone he knew.","But... if she was here too, didn't that mean she had also been kidnapped?","Huailing's eyes narrowed dangerously.","Then he would have to make his move!","Qiao Chuchu looked at Weisheng Huailing's pitiful profile and her expression darkened.","[Huailing looks so pitiful, I have to save him!]","Huailing: \"?\"","Well, if that's the case, he was looking forward to it!"]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211: You're in the way, blocking my sister from saving me, you know that Useless man.","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu glanced around.","This was an unfinished building.","And it looked very much like some kind of hideout for bad guys, with people seemingly in every room.","Only the person guarding them was missing.","It felt quite eerie, not knowing when one or two people might pop out.","Ji Yanchuan wondered, \"Could this be an organization specialized in kidnapping people?\"","She whispered in surprise, \"Do such organizations exist?\"","Ji Yanchuan replied calmly, \"In this world, all kinds of strange things can happen. An organization dedicated to kidnapping isn’t that far-fetched, is it?\"","He irritably rubbed his neck. \"For example, I’m very wealthy, so there are always people who want to kidnap me for ransom. Even billions can’t satisfy their greed. So, we should leave quickly. If we get caught, we’ll only suffer. And as a woman, you’ll suffer even more than I would.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned and whispered, \"There’s a friend of mine captured here. I won’t leave without saving him!\"","Huai Ling lowered his head, unable to hear what Qiao Chuchu was saying.","But he was delighted, filled with anticipation.","He even had to deliberately suppress the corners of his mouth to keep them from curling upward.","He had seen the video of Qiao Chuchu rescuing Pei Youchuan and had originally planned to go find her.","Unfortunately, while on his way to her, he noticed someone following him. To avoid bringing danger to her, he simply let himself get captured.","How would Qiao Chuchu come to rescue him?~","Would she also tie him up with a rope?~","Would she, for safety, loop the rope around his neck and tie the other end to his wrist, keeping him securely by her side?~","Ah~","He opened his mouth slightly, as if thirsty, breathing in small gasps. His thoughts drifted, his gaze becoming hazy, and his cheeks flushed red.","The thug across from him looked puzzled. \"Is he running a fever?\"","Another thug, casually eating instant noodles, said dismissively, \"Probably just nervous. Being captured would make anyone tense.\"","Huai Ling bit his lower lip, glancing sideways through a crack.","Come and save him~","Save him, save him~","Qiao Chuchu observed the layout of Huai Ling’s room, trying to figure out the best way to sneak in.","Suddenly, she heard footsteps approaching.","Her expression changed, and she quickly pulled Ji Yanchuan into hiding in the previous room.","Huai Ling: \"?\"","He caught a glimpse of a man passing by.","His brow slowly furrowed as he stared at the crack. The suspicious blush on his face vanished instantly, and even the light in his eyes dimmed.","What kind of useless man was this, getting in the way of Qiao Chuchu’s rescue?","How annoying.","The thug eating noodles warned him, \"Hey, no looking around!\"","Huai Ling didn’t hear him, still staring at the crack.","The thug clicked his tongue in irritation, put down his noodles, and walked over to Huai Ling, raising his hand to slap him. \"I’m talking to you! Are you listening?!\"","Huai Ling’s expression darkened, and he suddenly kicked the thug away!","The thug fell to the ground with a cry.","The other thug’s face turned pale, and he swung a fist at Huai Ling!","Huai Ling tilted his head, freeing his hands from the rope, and delivered a powerful punch to the thug’s face!","The thug collapsed on the spot, unconscious!","The remaining thug pulled out a knife and charged at him!","Huai Ling grabbed his wrist, disarmed him, and in one swift motion, plunged the knife into the thug’s throat!","The thug’s eyes widened in disbelief as he fell to the ground, lifeless.","Huai Ling picked up a black cloth from the floor, originally used to blindfold him, and walked out of the room.","Other thugs, hearing the commotion, rushed over. When they saw him, their faces turned pale, and without a word, they attacked!","Qiao Chuchu, hiding by the door, heard the chaos outside. \"What’s going on? It sounds like a fight broke out.\"","The people who had been heading toward them turned back to join the fray.","She made a quick decision. \"Let’s take advantage of the chaos and move! Go!\"","Ji Yanchuan followed closely behind, remarking with surprise, \"I didn’t expect you to have leadership skills, you crazy woman.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face twisted in disgust. \"Every time you speak, I feel nauseous. If you keep spouting nonsense like this, I’m going to demand hazard pay.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","She listened as the screams outside grew louder. \"It sounds like some big boss has arrived. Stay behind me and don’t wander off.\"","Ji Yanchuan sneered. \"Crazy woman, even though I’m paying you, I’m still a man. I should be walking in front of you.\"","He straightened his posture, his figure appearing more imposing. \"Let me lead the way for you.\"","Ji Yanchuan opened the door with a smirk. \"Allow me to prove myself as a real man—\"","A long leg suddenly kicked him, sending him flying!","Ji Yanchuan hit the ground, retching. \"Man...\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in shock. Before she could turn to see who it was, a powerful force pinned her against the wall!","A tall, imposing figure loomed over her!","The strong scent of blood filled her nostrils!","She tried to fight back, but her opponent countered every move, pressing her harder against the wall and rendering her immobile.","Qiao Chuchu grew increasingly panicked. \"What do you want?!\"","Huai Ling’s face was stern as he wrapped a black cloth around her eyes and tied her up with a complex knot using a rope.","Qiao Chuchu shuddered. \"Let me go!!!\"","[Was this the person who had been attacking everyone outside?!]","[Did he take down all those people by himself? Is he a monster? How am I supposed to fight him?!]","[What about Huai Ling? Is he in danger?]","Qiao Chuchu urgently asked, \"What did you do to the silver-haired boy?!\"","Huai Ling turned her around, watching her lips.","Qiao Chuchu, receiving no answer, grew more anxious. \"Where is the silver-haired boy?! Did you see him? Did you fight him?\"","Huai Ling raised an eyebrow, pressing her against the wall as he looked down at her.","Qiao Chuchu was wearing an old hoodie that didn’t belong to her, and her red hair was tied up with a worn-out chopstick.","But none of that detracted from her beauty.","The black cloth covered her damp eyes, and her red lips moved as she spoke.","So... tempting.","He reached out, gently touching her face, then turned his gaze to Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan was on the ground, unable to speak from the pain.","Wasn’t this the person Qiao Chuchu had wanted to save earlier?!","If he had such skills, why had he been captured in the first place?!","Ji Yanchuan struggled to get up, but a gun was pressed against his forehead.","He froze, staring in terror at Huai Ling’s expressionless face.","Huai Ling looked down at him, then suddenly grinned.","It was a strange, eerie smile, like that of a circus clown.","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu tried to free herself from the rope, but no matter how she twisted or turned, the knots only seemed to tighten.","Ji Yanchuan gasped for breath, his body drenched in cold sweat. He opened his mouth to speak—","Huai Ling pulled the trigger!","Click.","The gun jammed.","Ji Yanchuan’s soul nearly left his body. His eyes widened in shock as he stared at the gun.","Huai Ling, equally confused, examined his silver pistol, then fired at Ji Yanchuan again.","Click.","Still jammed.","He aimed at the wall and fired.","Bang! The bullet embedded itself in the wall.","Huai Ling narrowed his eyes and tried shooting Ji Yanchuan again.","Still jammed.","He fired several more times in frustration.","Not a single bullet would fire."]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212: Weisheng Huailing: Even Being Abandoned is Normal","paragraphs":["Huai Ling: \"???\"","What? Did his weapon suddenly decide to embrace Buddhism?! No more killing?!","Shooting into the air was fine.","But the moment it was aimed at Ji Yanchuan, it jammed?!","Huai Ling decided to put the gun away and pulled out a claw knife instead. He grabbed Ji Yanchuan by the collar, ready to slash his throat in one swift motion!","Suddenly, a large chunk of cement fell from the ceiling, knocking him down!","Huai Ling passed out instantly!","The entire building began to tremble, as if it were about to collapse!","Qiao Chuchu could barely keep her balance when she felt someone cut the ropes binding her and pull her away: \"This place is coming down! Let’s go!!\"","She tore off the black cloth covering her eyes and, as her vision cleared, realized it was Ji Yanchuan dragging her.","She anxiously asked, \"What about the man who tied me up?!\"","\"He’s dead!\" Ji Yanchuan didn’t even look back. \"A piece of cement from the ceiling crushed him!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What about Huai Ling?\"","Ji Yanchuan snapped, \"We need to survive! Do you still want your money or not?!\"","Under the weight of the cement, Weisheng Huailing opened his eyes, blood streaming down his forehead.","His world was painted in red.","The shaking building seemed to be enduring someone’s wrath, and he couldn’t move, only able to look ahead.","Qiao Chuchu stumbled as Ji Yanchuan pulled her along, turning a corner and disappearing from his sight.","He was surprised, but only mildly so, not shocked that Qiao Chuchu had left.","He showed no reaction, lowering his eyelashes and lying there obediently, waiting for death, a stream of disappointment flowing in his eyes.","As Qiao Chuchu passed by Huai Ling’s room, she noticed the floor was littered with bodies.","But Huai Ling was nowhere to be seen.","Ji Yanchuan hurriedly urged her in the hallway: \"Hurry up!!\"","She hesitated, a sharp pain shooting through her head, and a vision flashed before her eyes—","She stood in front of Huai Ling’s tombstone, sobbing uncontrollably.","Weisheng Yucan closed her eyes, suppressing her emotions: \"We always knew this day would come. He chose this path, and death was inevitable.\"","Qiao Chuchu gasped for breath, overwhelmed with guilt: \"No, it’s my fault. I didn’t know he was in the building. I didn’t know...\"","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality and turned around, running toward the room: \"Huai Ling hasn’t left yet! He’s still here!!\"","Ji Yanchuan was stunned: \"Qiao Chuchu! What are you doing?!\"","The building was crumbling, pieces of debris raining down!","Ji Yanchuan glanced nervously at the ceiling: \"I’m not waiting for you. If you die, it’s your own fault!\"","He turned and rushed downstairs!","Qiao Chuchu ran back to the room and found Weisheng Huailing trapped under a slab of cement.","Huai Ling’s eyes were closed, his body lying on the ground, only a strand of silver-white hair visible, now covered in dust.","She strained to lift the heavy slab!","[It hurts, it hurts!!]","[My muscles are giving out, but I have to push harder!]","Huai Ling opened his eyes in surprise to see Qiao Chuchu struggling to move the cement off him!","His bloodstained eyes widened in astonishment, staring at her without blinking, the dim light in his pupils reigniting with hope!","Qiao Chuchu, ignoring the pain in her arms, quickly helped him up: \"Can you walk?!\"","Huai Ling stood up dazedly, like a child, gesturing excitedly: *Why did you come back?! I was ready to die!*","Qiao Chuchu grabbed his hand and pulled him along: \"There’s no time to explain!!\"","[Of course, it’s because I saw his funeral that I came back!]","[But was it Huai Ling who blindfolded me?! I’ll have to ask him once we’re safe!]","[We can’t die together now!]","A rock suddenly struck Qiao Chuchu’s shoulder!","She cried out in pain: \"Ah!\"","Huai Ling’s expression darkened, and without hesitation, he scooped her up and carried her away!","He would never allow Qiao Chuchu to get hurt right in front of him!"]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213: Little Madman Huailing","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was stunned, perched on Huai Ling's shoulder: \"Hey, you're still bleeding!\"","Huai Ling couldn't hear her, full of energy as he carried her down the stairs with a thudding rhythm!","Several people below heard the commotion and rushed up, only to freeze at the sight of the two before charging at them with drawn blades!","Qiao Chuchu was shocked, glancing at the vibrating ceiling: \"I mean, don’t be so dedicated! The building’s about to collapse—shouldn’t we be running for our lives right now?!\"","A swarm of fearless people surged forward: \"With you two here, there’s money to be made! Grab them!\"","Without hesitation, Huai Ling carried her back up the floor and gently placed her on a wheeled chair, looking at her expectantly as he gestured: *\"Do you trust me, sis?\"*","Qiao Chuchu nodded without a second thought.","*[But why is he asking if I trust him right now?]*","A blade came slashing down toward Huai Ling’s head!","Huai Ling smiled, sidestepping it effortlessly, then spun around to deliver a powerful roundhouse kick to his attacker!","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","*[Holy—his reflexes are insane!]*","As the building shook, dust rained down like a storm. Huai Ling glanced back at her with a smile, his silver hair seeming to glow like the only light in the chaos.","He gestured confidently: *\"If you trust me, don’t move.\"*","With that, he plunged into the encircling crowd!","Huai Ling moved like a video game character powered by an invincibility star, weaving through his enemies with ease. He anticipated every move, dodging and countering with fluid precision!","He was like a madman, growing more exhilarated with every strike!","Qiao Chuchu picked up a fallen blade from the ground, ready to act, but the more she watched, the more lost she felt.","*[He’s so strong.]*","*[It’s like watching a movie starring Huai Ling—I have no idea how to even help!]*","Suddenly, a man with a blade appeared behind her!","Qiao Chuchu reacted quickly, about to defend herself, but Huai Ling flashed in front of her, crouching down to grab the chair handles and grinning at her.","\"Hey!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Huai Ling pushed her chair aside, kicked the sneak attacker away, and drove a claw-like blade into his throat!","More and more people were charging toward Qiao Chuchu!","She tried to get off the chair, but Huai Ling forced her back down and started pushing her chair through the vast, unfinished building!","Qiao Chuchu, curled up in the chair: \"???\"","She looked back at him, completely bewildered.","Huai Ling pushed the chair effortlessly, his tousled hair flying in the wind, a wide grin on his face.","If he could make a sound,","he’d probably be laughing wildly as he ran.","Qiao Chuchu felt like she was about to be flung off at any moment, so she turned to face him, clutching the back of the chair tightly.","Huai Ling suddenly leaned down and kissed her forehead.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","Before she could say anything, another attacker came at them from behind!","Huai Ling, as if he had eyes on the back of his head, tilted his head to dodge and continued dragging her chair around the room!","He was completely in his element, a madman who didn’t even glance away from her face as he charged toward the window with her!","Qiao Chuchu panicked: \"We’re going to fall! This is the sixth floor!!\"","Huai Ling yanked her into his arms, kicked the chair out the window, and jumped down with her!","Qiao Chuchu: \"Holy—! You’re really jumping off a building?!\"","Her heart nearly leaped out of her throat as she clung to Huai Ling for dear life: \"I’m scared of heights, ahhhhhhh!\"","Despite her fear, she couldn’t help but watch as the ground rushed closer.","*[At least if I die, I want to know how it happened!!]*","But just as they were about to hit the ground, their momentum swung them like a pendulum, carrying them to the opposite building!","Huai Ling held her tightly as they landed safely.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Thanks, my soul’s already left my body and is still floating out there somewhere.","She stared blankly at Weisheng Huai Ling as he put away some kind of high-tech device that had allowed them to swing across.","The moment they landed, the unfinished building behind them collapsed with a deafening crash!","A wave of dust surged toward them!","She quickly pulled Huai Ling behind a load-bearing column!","Huai Ling, pinned against the wall by her, his eyes darkened as he flipped their positions, pressing her against the wall instead!","Before Qiao Chuchu could react, his warm lips sealed hers in a kiss!","???!!"]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214: Qiao Chuchu: Let's Break Up, Huailing.","paragraphs":["He invaded her space without restraint, pinning her hands above her head as his breathing grew heavier.","Qiao Chuchu pushed against him with all her might, but no matter how hard she tried, she couldn’t break free!","Huai Ling seemed intoxicated, even letting out an involuntary moan from deep in his throat: “Mmm...”","As Qiao Chuchu shoved at his shoulders, he simply lifted her up, tilting his head to kiss her.","His eyes were closed, his breathing ragged, as if it still wasn’t enough. He pushed her down against the wall, kissing her fiercely.","Dust swept past the support columns on either side, and the howling wind couldn’t drown out his soft moans.","His hands gripped Qiao Chuchu’s wrists tightly, his leg pressing between hers, leaving her no room to resist.","When he finally pulled away, panting heavily, he licked his lips, still craving more.","Qiao Chuchu’s lips were numb, and she stared at him in a daze.","He placed her hand on his abs, blushing as he gestured: “Let’s take the next step, sis.”","His eyes were half-lidded, pleading with her: “It’s fine if you don’t like me. I don’t mind. I want to be with you, and I believe I can make you feel good.”","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her trance, grabbed a handful of sand from the ground, and threw it in his face!","Huai Ling closed his eyes, dodging most of it.","She stood up angrily, wiping her mouth furiously. All the curses she wanted to hurl swirled in her throat, but in the end, all she managed was: “I was just about to thank you for saving me!!”","Huai Ling calmed down, kneeling on the ground and looking up at her.","Half of his face was smeared with blood, while the other half remained clean. His bloodstained suit made him look like a disheveled, dangerous man.","Qiao Chuchu glared at him: “Did you kiss me because you like me, or were you just caught up in the moment and needed to vent?!”","Huai Ling blinked, not responding.","Qiao Chuchu grew even more furious, her hands gesturing sharply: “Answer me!”","Huai Ling continued to look up at her, still silent.","Qiao Chuchu crouched down, gesturing again: “Answer me!”","Weisheng Huailing watched her signing hands and suddenly chuckled, laughing softly.","Qiao Chuchu: “? What are you laughing at?”","Huai Ling stifled his laughter and leaned closer to her.","She instinctively leaned back, losing her balance and falling onto the ground.","He took the opportunity to kneel upright, looming over her: “I do like you. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have kissed you.”","Qiao Chuchu: “Huh?”","[He likes me? What does he like about me? When did he start liking me?!]","He leaned down, smiling: “Do you remember the last time I fought with my fourth brother?”","She nodded cautiously.","Huai Ling gestured gently: “I fought him because I didn’t like him being with you.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Huai Ling gazed at her tenderly: “At first, I just thought you were interesting. But then I realized you’re genuine, and you truly care about me. And since you like me too, I’ve grown to like you more and more.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?? When did I ever say I like you?”","Huai Ling smiled without answering.","[She’s always complimenting how handsome I am in her thoughts. Isn’t that liking me?]","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t accept it and stood up, gesturing: “Even if you like me, you need to understand that you can’t kiss someone without their consent. Kissing me like that was a violation!”","Weisheng Huailing froze, then quickly knelt properly: “Then I was wrong. Please don’t be angry, sis.”","Qiao Chuchu helped him up: “Get up and talk properly!”","Huai Ling shook his head, gesturing earnestly: “Your lips are sweet, soft, and yet firm, like gummy candy. I couldn’t pull away because it was my first kiss, and I wanted to savor it.”","Qiao Chuchu’s face turned bright red, and she gestured angrily: “Stop talking! You’ve already crossed the line! I don’t want to talk to you anymore!”","She turned and walked away.","[I thought I’d made a friend I could trust with my life. What a disappointment.]","Huai Ling’s expression changed drastically. He wrapped his arms around her legs, shaking his head in panic.","If he held her, he couldn’t speak.","If he spoke, he couldn’t hold her.","After a moment of hesitation, he clung to her tightly.","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened: “Don’t do this. I don’t want to talk to you right now. As for the thank-you gift for saving me, I’ll have my brother deliver it to your house.”","Huai Ling hugged her thighs tightly, shaking his head repeatedly!","No thank-you gift!","No thank-you gift!!","His breathing grew more erratic: “I was wrong, sis. Please don’t be angry. I really know I was wrong!”","Qiao Chuchu’s heart was as hard as steel: “Huai Ling, I pushed you several times, but you wouldn’t let go. It was like your lips were welded to mine!”","After a moment of thought, she decided to reject him outright: “If we keep going like this, it won’t do either of us any good. I don’t have romantic feelings for you, so let’s just end things here. I’m not the type to string people along. Let’s part on good terms, and you can find someone else who truly cares for you.”","Huai Ling blinked hard, afraid he’d misread her lips, and asked again: “You’re cutting things off with me?! What about my sister? What about my brother?!”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","Huai Ling grew desperate: “Just me?! You’re only cutting things off with me?!”","He let out a whimper and hugged her legs again, shaking his head.","“Sis, I was wrong. I really know I was wrong. I won’t like you anymore.”","He clasped his hands together in front of his face, pleading: “I won’t cross the line again. Please don’t leave. I was wrong. I really know I was wrong!”","Qiao Chuchu turned her head away, her fists clenched tightly at her sides, refusing to look at him.","Huai Ling stood up and moved in front of her, gesturing pitifully: “I was really wrong. Give me another chance!”","She shook her head, still avoiding his gaze.","Huai Ling cupped her face, gesturing anxiously: “Don’t look away. I can’t speak; I can only use sign language. If you don’t look at me, how can I explain myself?”","“Sis, please forgive me. I promise this was the first and last time!”","Huai Ling’s eyes turned red, and his body began to tremble.","His limbs went numb, and a wave of fear spread through his body. He hunched over, as if trying to suppress nausea.","Qiao Chuchu’s expression changed: “Are you feeling this way because you hit your head? Are you dizzy? Nauseous?”","Huai Ling’s vision was unfocused, but he still managed to look at her, his lips trembling.","Tears streamed down his face as he convulsed slightly, raising a shaky hand: “Don’t leave me, sis.”","He was someone who cried easily.","But this time, the tears were real.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t have time to stay angry. She assessed his symptoms: “Are you feeling dizzy and numb in your limbs?”","Huai Ling blinked.","Qiao Chuchu understood.","[It must be respiratory alkalosis.]","[How can a big shot like him get respiratory alkalosis from emotional distress?!]","She looked around and spotted a dirty plastic bag that had blown in from somewhere. She quickly ran over, took off her hoodie, used it to clean the bag, and placed it over Huai Ling’s head, letting him breathe into it.","It wasn’t as good as a paper bag, but it would help ease his symptoms.","Huai Ling refused to wear it, pushing the bag aside and pleading: “Don’t leave me, okay? Don’t leave me!”","Qiao Chuchu nodded repeatedly, concerned: “I’m not going anywhere. I’m not leaving. Stop crying and calm your breathing!”","Huai Ling hesitated: “Really?”","Qiao Chuchu nodded: “Really. As long as you don’t do this again, I’ll act like nothing happened.”","His nose tingled, and he leaned down to hug her!","Qiao Chuchu quickly placed the plastic bag over his head.","[This guy’s physical resilience is really something...]","Huai Ling rested his head on her shoulder, dizziness and numbness spreading through his body.","Terrified, he nuzzled into her neck, slowly calming his breathing and letting out a series of muffled sounds.","“Mmm, mmm, mmm, mmm, mmm.”","It sounded like he was trying to speak, but the tone was monotonous, making it impossible to decipher what he was saying.","Qiao Chuchu: “? What? Are you trying to talk?”","Huai Ling, still shaken, held her tightly and closed his eyes.","He really, really liked his sis."]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215: The Child Who Just Returned Was Taken Away Again","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu supported the weakened Huai Ling as they descended the stairs.","Pei Yuan's car happened to be parked outside the unfinished building.","His heart clenched at the sight of the ruins, but he breathed a sigh of relief when he saw Qiao Chuchu and Huai Ling stumbling out. He approached them and asked, \"Chuchu, are you okay?!\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head and looked around, realizing that not only had Pei Yuan come, but her other brothers, Weisheng Yucan, and Lin Qing had also arrived.","Even Lou Tingsi was there.","The desolate place was now packed with cars, making it feel somewhat lively.","Lin Shen immediately took off his coat and draped it over her shoulders. \"Are you alright?\"","She nodded, feeling a sense of relief and happiness. \"Why are you all here?\"","Lou Tingsi stepped forward, his brows furrowed with concern. \"Your brothers told us you might have been kidnapped, so I started investigating and found this location. When we saw you and Ji Yanchuan being brought here, we rushed over immediately.\"","He glanced at the ruins. \"Is there anyone else inside?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded wearily. \"Yes, but I don’t know who they are.\"","Pei Che felt her forehead and then her neck to check her temperature. After ensuring she was unharmed, he calmly said, \"These people are part of a kidnapping-for-ransom group. They probably targeted Ji Yanchuan because of his wealth, but since you were with him, they took you too.\"","Pei Youchuan nodded in agreement. \"Don’t worry, little sister. We’ll handle the aftermath. You don’t need to worry about it.\"","Pei Fengnong walked up to her with concern. \"You should rest. Let’s go home, okay?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci pushed past Huai Ling. \"They didn’t hurt you, did they, Chuchu?\"","Pei Buxian took off his own coat and covered Qiao Chuchu with it. \"You’re not wearing enough. Stay warm.\"","She nodded gratefully and glanced at Huai Ling. \"Huai Ling fought bravely. They didn’t even get a chance to hurt me, but Huai Ling got hit on the head.\"","Weisheng Yucan sighed in relief upon hearing she was unharmed. \"It’s fine. Huai Ling has always been tough. I’m just glad you’re both okay.\"","Lin Qing nodded vigorously, his brows furrowed. \"We just finished work when we heard what happened. It scared us to death. I’m just glad you’re alright, Chuchu.\"","She nodded, touched by their concern. Thinking back to what had just happened, she unconsciously pursed her lips.","*Everyone is so worried about me and Huai Ling. If they knew Huai Ling confessed his feelings to me and even kissed me, it would probably be awkward. Thankfully, Huai Ling and I agreed to keep this between us and not tell anyone else.*","The Pei family: \"?\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"?\"","Lin Qing and Lin Shen: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi’s mind buzzed with anger, and he let out a bitter laugh, giving Huai Ling a meaningful look. \"It seems our Huai Ling has been working very hard, hasn’t he?\"","Pei Youchuan licked his teeth and cracked his knuckles. \"Yeah, it looks like the Pei family owes him a big thank you.\"","Lin Qing groaned, covering his face in frustration. \"I knew it! My brother, who’s always so proper and married, wouldn’t even get a crumb of affection!\"","Lin Shen frowned, his gentle eyes filled with disappointment as he looked at Qiao Chuchu.","A hint of resentment flashed in his gaze as he glanced at Huai Ling, his lips pressed into a thin line of displeasure.","Pei Che was already furious, his expression dark as he glared at Huai Ling. \"Mr. Weisheng, we should express our gratitude to you. Shall we have a chat?\"","Huai Ling, reading their lips, lowered his eyes dejectedly and glanced at the car keys dangling in Weisheng Yucan’s hand.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci approached him. \"Huai Ling~\"","Suddenly, Huai Ling snapped. He shoved Pei Mu and Pei Ci aside, snatched the car keys from Weisheng Yucan, grabbed Qiao Chuchu’s hand, and ran!"]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216: I Don't Want to Have Overnight Grudges with You, Sister","paragraphs":["They were stunned, reaching out to grab Qiao Chuchu!","Huai Ling reacted swiftly, hoisting Qiao Chuchu onto his shoulder, shoving her into Yu Can's sports car, smoothly getting in, and stomping on the gas pedal as they sped off!","Pei Fengnong wanted to jump in and chase after them!","But Yu Can said, \"Don't bother chasing. You won't catch him. He doesn't just take on jobs to eliminate targets; he also takes on rescue missions. So, you can't beat him, and you certainly can't catch up to him.\"","Pei Fengnong turned around, incredulous. \"You think I can't catch him?!\"","Yu Can crossed her arms, calmly replying, \"Your skills are decent, but my brother is a complete madman. He'd even drive a car off a cliff. Do you want him to take Qiao Chuchu flying off a cliff with him?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...With Qiao Chuchu in the car, would he dare?!\"","\"Huai Ling doesn't do things he's not confident about. He would dare.\" Yu Can stared at him firmly. \"Would you dare to watch?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","After a moment of thought, he punched the car in frustration. \"Then tell him to get back here right now!\"","Yu Can picked up her phone. \"I'll call Weisheng Lin to catch him. Don't worry, he won't hurt Qiao Chuchu. He just kissed her earlier, and it's clear Qiao Chuchu was angry. He's scared too.\"","\"Oh?\" Lou Tingsi's smile was laced with venom, his tone drawn out. \"Sister Yu Can, you can actually tell that your brother, who kills without batting an eye, is scared? If he were scared, he shouldn't have done it in the first place.\"","Weisheng Yucan shrugged indifferently. \"He shouldn't have, but Huai Ling is the type who acts on impulse. He doesn't understand restraint or compromise. All he knows is to seize and possess. I can't teach him that. Only Qiao Chuchu can.\"","She smiled with delight. \"After all, when the child grows up, the mother can't control them anymore.\"","Lin Qing: \"...You seem quite happy about this?\"","Yu Can's eyes curved into crescents as she whispered, \"The stocks I bought went up. How could I not be happy?\"","Lin Qing fell silent, glancing at Lin Shen with a look of disappointment. \"Buying Pei family stocks is more reliable than counting on my brother!\"","She turned her gaze to the seven members of the Pei family.","The seven of them picked up their phones, wanting to call Qiao Chuchu, but then remembered she hadn't brought her phone. Their frustration had nowhere to vent!","Damn it!!","---","Qiao Chuchu clung tightly to her seatbelt, looking at Huai Ling in fear. \"Huai Ling, can you calm down? I already told you I don't care anymore. You don't have to go this far, do you?!\"","Huai Ling remained expressionless, driving her straight to the beach.","The moonlight spilled like ink, and the beach was devoid of lights.","The sea rose and fell like dark ink.","The sound of waves could be heard inside the car.","Qiao Chuchu's palms were cold as she hesitantly looked at Huai Ling.","Huai Ling first took a wet wipe from the storage compartment to clean the bloodstains off his face, then meticulously wiped his fingers clean before turning to look at her seriously.","She felt uneasy under his gaze. \"What are you doing?\"","[Is he going to kiss me again?!]","Huai Ling's eyes dropped, filled with disappointment, as he leaned closer to her.","His hands, which carried the scent of disinfectant alcohol, gently caressed her cheeks.","Qiao Chuchu shrank back warily, but Huai Ling cupped her face with both hands, carefully examining every part of her features.","The light inside the car was dim.","His brows were slightly furrowed, his eyes tinged with sorrow.","His gaze swept down from her forehead, passing over her eyes, the tip of her nose, and her lips.","Huai Ling's eyes lingered for a moment, then slowly lifted to meet her fearful gaze.","Without a word, he reached out and pulled her into an embrace.","His movements were gentle, like comforting a frightened child, as he buried his head in the crook of her neck.","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled but didn't move.","After several minutes, Huai Ling pulled away, offering a pleading gesture in sign language: *\"If you're angry, hit me, sister.\"*","She was taken aback. *\"Is that why you brought me here?\"*","*\"I wanted to talk to you properly,\"* he signed, his lips slightly pouting in sadness. *\"I don't want us to have unresolved issues.\"*","Qiao Chuchu let out a sigh of relief.","[That scared me. I thought he was going to do something extreme.]","She nodded cheerfully and said decisively, *\"Don't worry, I won't hold a grudge against you. I'm easygoing. As long as you don't do something like that again, I won't be mad at you!\"*","Huai Ling's eyes lit up, and he exhaled in relief. *\"I'm glad you're not mad at me, sister.\"*","His expression finally brightened. *\"No one in my family likes me. You're the first outsider who's been so close to me. I don't want to lose you.\"*","As he spoke, he happily took her hand, intertwining their fingers firmly.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She tried to pull her hand back.","But Huai Ling held on tightly, not intending to let go, beaming at her with eyes full of joy.","She awkwardly said, \"How am I supposed to sign if you're holding my hand like this?\"","*\"You don't need to sign. I can read your lips,\"* Huai Ling leaned closer to her face, waiting patiently for her to speak.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[This guy really doesn't get it, does he? He doesn't understand boundaries between men and women at all.]","Huai Ling froze, his eyes suddenly welling up with tears.","Qiao Chuchu's scalp tingled. \"Why are you crying again?!\"","Huai Ling's nose turned red, his lips quivering as he began to sob.","*\"Sister hates me now~\"*","He whimpered, *\"Sister doesn't love me anymore~\"*","Qiao Chuchu clutched her head. \"When did I ever love you?!\"","Huai Ling, with teary eyes, signed pitifully, *\"Sister never used to mind holding my hand before.\"*","Qiao Chuchu tugged at her hair. \"When did we ever hold hands?!\"","Huai Ling pouted, *\"No one in my family likes me. I don't want you to dislike me too.\"*","She was taken aback. \"Your family doesn't like you? That can't be. Isn't it said that you're the most doted-on youngest son of the Weisheng family?\"","Huai Ling was also surprised but then smiled.","His eyes, already filled with tears, now looked even more bitter. *\"I'm deaf, sister. To my parents, my condition doesn't earn their pity. Instead, it annoys them.\"*","He signed, *\"My mother was an older woman when she had me. The doctors advised her not to go through with the pregnancy, but she did anyway, hoping I'd compete with my older siblings.\"*","His gaze grew increasingly somber. *\"I was born deaf. My parents wanted to implant a cochlear implant in me, but my ear canals were malformed, so it couldn't be done. They gave up on me and left me to my sister to raise.\"*","*\"They didn't even want to give me a name, but my sister was kind. She named me Huai Ling, hoping I wouldn't forget to surpass myself.\"*","He picked up his phone and typed, *\"Actually, it was supposed to be Huai Ling, but my sister thought the characters looked better with the 'Ling' character, so she gave me a homophone name.\"*","The more he typed, the happier he became. *\"Just like how your name, Qiao Chu, sounds like 'outstanding'! Isn't that a funny coincidence?!\"*","Qiao Chuchu couldn't bring herself to smile, instead feeling a pang of sadness for him.","[So, the rumors about Huai Ling being doted on were just a façade created by his family to project an image of harmony.]","She asked curiously, \"Then why did you take on this kind of job?\"","Huai Ling's expression was indifferent. *\"I don't like myself, so I thought it would be fine if my life ended randomly somewhere. I just didn't expect them to be so weak that they couldn't beat me.\"*","Qiao Chuchu was horrified. \"No, you can't think like that!\"","She quickly grabbed his hand. \"I'm not mad at you anymore. Don't think like that!\"","Huai Ling was surprised, tilting his head.","Qiao Chuchu said sincerely, \"If you can avoid this job, don't do it. I don't want to attend your funeral.\"","[I've already attended one in my premonition. I really can't go through that again!]","[Losing someone you care about is too painful. It's impossible to recover from.]","Huai Ling's eyes gradually widened as he took her hand and placed it over his heart.","It was warm.","He nodded with a smile. *\"I promise you.\"*"]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217: You're Not Going Anywhere","paragraphs":["Chuchu was overjoyed: \"Really?!\"","He nodded: \"I'm quitting this job. I can learn about investing, and I'll still be able to make money.\"","Huai Ling leaned closer to her: \"As long as you're happy, sister.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded and hugged him proactively: \"That's good. I'm just glad you're safe.\"","Huai Ling shivered, not expecting her to hug him so suddenly. His heart raced a few beats faster.","Qiao Chuchu felt a heaviness in her chest: *I can't stand it when my favorite characters die. Even though he has secrets he's keeping from me, which is a flaw in his character, as long as he's alive and well somewhere in the world, that's what matters. As for my own issues, I plan to go abroad once I've sorted them out.*","Huai Ling: \"?\"","He pushed Qiao Chuchu away, his expression wary.","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled and was about to ask him something when she heard the loud roar of an engine.","She rolled down the car window and stuck her head out.","A helicopter hovered in the air, and a familiar face appeared.","Weisheng Lin shouted through a megaphone: \"Weisheng Huailing, hand over Miss Qiao right now! Stop acting crazy! If you're covered in blood, go to the hospital! Don't cause trouble for others! Aren't you embarrassed for the Weisheng family?!\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned and signed to Huai Ling: *Is your brother talking to you? Doesn't he know you can't hear?*","She was utterly shocked: *And does Weisheng Lin always have to make such a dramatic entrance? Does he really have to come in a helicopter?*","Huai Ling's face darkened, and he gave Qiao Chuchu an inscrutable look, offering no response.","Weisheng Lin descended from the helicopter, wearing a black coat, and strode toward them.","Qiao Chuchu sensed that Weisheng Lin was angry and quickly got out of the car to greet him: \"Brother Lin.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Brother?","He raised an eyebrow: \"There's a twenty-year age gap between us. You should call me uncle.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Oh no no no, I call Wen Zhan 'brother' too. You're not that old.\"","Weisheng Lin brushed it off: \"Wen Zhan and I are different. Let's keep it separate. You call him 'brother,' but you call me 'uncle.'\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","Weisheng Lin snapped his fingers at his subordinate: \"Take my brother to the hospital.\"","He then leaned into the car window and spoke sternly to Huai Ling: \"Get yourself to the hospital for a check-up. Don't make people worry. You took your sister's car, and she had to ride a bike back. Did you know that?\"","Huai Ling: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Weisheng Lin chuckled: \"Just kidding. Go to the hospital now.\"","His subordinate opened the car door for Huai Ling.","Huai Ling reluctantly got out of the car and walked to the passenger seat.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly remembered something and gently patted his shoulder: *Huai Ling!*","Huai Ling turned to look at her.","Qiao Chuchu smiled and signed: *You were really cool today. Thank you for saving me.*","She gave him a thumbs-up: *Super impressive!*","Huai Ling's face darkened, and he suddenly cupped the back of her head, pressing his forehead against hers.","It felt like some strange pact had been made.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Huai Ling pulled away, his expression grim, and signed: *You're not going anywhere.*","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","Huai Ling got into the car, fastened his seatbelt, and stared at her with a sinister smile.","It was the smile of someone who had everything under control.","Like a predator that had caught its prey but chose to keep it alive, watching and waiting.","Qiao Chuchu felt a chill run down her spine as she watched Huai Ling's car drive away.","Weisheng Lin stood beside her, teasing: \"Can't bear to see him go?\"","She snapped out of her thoughts and shook her head: \"Of course not.\"","*I just feel a little strange. What did he mean by that?*","Weisheng Lin smirked: \"I still have work to do. I'll have your brother pick you up from my club. There's a shower there, and I'll have someone find you a change of clothes.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked down at her dress.","It was covered in blood and dirt.","It really was a mess.","She nodded: \"Thank you, Brother Lin.\"","Weisheng Lin frowned, displeased with her choice of address: \"Did you forget? You should call me uncle.\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched: \"Are you serious? Who likes being called old?\"","\"I do!\" Weisheng Lin leaned down and grinned mischievously at her: \"Call~me~uncle~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She swallowed hard and forced out the words: \"Uncle.\"","Weisheng Lin burst into laughter, his captivating peach-blossom eyes sparkling: \"Accepting the age gap isn't so hard, is it? 'Uncle' sounds nice, right?~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","*The five members of the Weisheng family all have their quirks. Every time I interact with them individually, I discover something new. It seems Weisheng Lin is another uncharted territory.*","Weisheng Lin chuckled and pulled her by the arm: \"Come on! I'll take you to my club. There's a competition happening today.\"","Qiao Chuchu was curious and quickened her pace to keep up: \"A competition?\"","\"Yep, a bodyguard competition.\" Weisheng Lin smiled at her: \"I also run a security company that trains bodyguards. Your brother asked me to pick one for you. Today's the final round. If the winner meets your brother's approval, you can take them home.\"","She was surprised: \"My brother arranged this with you?\"","Weisheng Lin helped her into the helicopter and said cheerfully: \"Yes, originally your brother only wanted a female bodyguard, but I said if we really want the best, we should consider both men and women. So he agreed.\"","Weisheng Lin winked at her: \"Today's the final selection. You can also take a look and see if you vibe with anyone.\"","She thought it was a bit odd, but it was a good idea.","She did need a bodyguard, after all. She couldn't keep borrowing her brother's.","\"Have you met them yet?\"","Weisheng Lin shook his head: \"Not yet, but I heard there's one who's really outstanding, scoring top marks in every category.\"","He narrowed his eyes, trying to recall: \"Apparently, he's quite good-looking too. The girls are all talking about him. What was his last name? I think it's Shen?\"","But that wasn't important.","Weisheng Lin smiled: \"You've seen so many handsome guys. A decent-looking guy probably won't make your heart skip a beat, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu was confused: \"Uh, right, but whether my heart skips a beat isn't important, is it?\"","Weisheng Lin wagged his finger mysteriously: \"No no no, it's very important.\"","He gave her a meaningful smile: *Extremely important.*","Qiao Chuchu thought for a moment, then suddenly understood and clapped her hands: \"Oh! I get it! You're worried I might fall for a scumbag and end up chopped into pieces and flushed down the toilet!\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu patted his arm: \"Good thinking, buddy. We're on the same page!\"","Weisheng Lin: \"???\"","He was momentarily stunned but then laughed: \"You really are a smart one.\"","Qiao Chuchu snorted proudly: \"Of course~\"","Weisheng Lin couldn't help but ruffle her hair and murmured affectionately: \"You're so adorable.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't hear him, busy putting on the helicopter's headphones, her excitement palpable: \"It's been a while since I've been in a helicopter.\"","Weisheng Lin put on his headphones too and raised an eyebrow: \"Why didn't you choose me last time? I could've taken you for a ride.\"","She hesitated, feeling awkward: \"You guys almost got into a fight. How could I choose?\"","*And I had just found out you were all keeping secrets from me. I wasn't ready to handle that.*","Weisheng Lin smiled leisurely at her: \"It's fine. There's still time now.\"","He crossed his legs, propped his chin on his hand, and admired her smiling face: \"Uncle will show you the night view of Lan City. Enjoy the ride, Miss Qiao!~\""]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218: Miss Qiao","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu sat in the helicopter, gazing at the scenery outside Lan City. She wanted to take out her phone to capture the view, only to realize she didn’t have one with her.","A unlocked phone was handed to her.","Weisheng Lin’s phone swayed slightly in his hand. “Use mine. I’ll send the photos to you on WeChat later.”","Qiao Chuchu gratefully accepted it. “Thank you!”","She took a photo of Lan City’s nightscape. “I’ve never been in a helicopter over Lan City before. I didn’t expect it to be this beautiful.”","Hesitating, she asked, “Can I take a selfie? You can send it to me and then delete it afterward?”","Weisheng Lin agreed with a smile, leaning closer to her. “Mind if I join?”","“Of course not!” Qiao Chuchu raised the phone toward the window, grinning widely.","Weisheng Lin rested his hand on the back of her seat, raising an eyebrow at the camera.","A photo was captured.","She checked it and, satisfied, said happily, “We both look great in this! It’s good enough to post on social media!”","She handed the phone back to Weisheng Lin. “You always take helicopters. Do you get to enjoy the scenery often?”","Weisheng Lin took the phone and, without hesitation, set the photo they had just taken as his wallpaper. “I never look at the scenery.”","Qiao Chuchu was curious. “So, you take helicopters because they’re convenient and fast?”","Weisheng Lin glanced up at her from behind the phone. “No, I like taking helicopters because I’m vain. Not everyone can get access to helicopters in Lan City.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","[So blunt?]","Weisheng Lin put his phone away, smiling as he looked at her. “Any problem with that?”","She wasn’t sure how to respond. “I thought you’d say something more polite.”","Weisheng Lin burst into laughter, leaning closer to her. “Miss Qiao, since you’re being honest with me, I’ll be honest with you. I’m a vain person, but I don’t pretend to be something I’m not. I only flaunt what I truly have.”","Qiao Chuchu understood.","[But if the Weisheng family were to pretend, other families wouldn’t even stand a chance.]","Weisheng Lin chuckled, propping his chin on his hand, looking at her playfully. “For the upcoming bodyguard competition, I’ve found someone with a similar height and weight as you to act as a stand-in. They’ll compete to protect the stand-in, and whoever does the best job and gets the stand-in to the destination will become your personal bodyguard.”","Qiao Chuchu was surprised. “That’s how it’s done? I thought it would be a test of strength or something. Will they get hurt?”","Weisheng Lin shrugged. “The weapons are safe, so no one will get injured. What’s harder to predict is whether they’ll resort to underhanded tactics to win. After all, I told them that the top performer will get a monthly salary of 100,000 during the probation period. They’re all fighting tooth and nail to become your bodyguard.”","She was shocked. “100,000 during probation?”","“Yes, your brother set the price.” Weisheng Lin smiled at her. “But I don’t think it’s too high. Protecting a precious gem like you, 100,000 a month is just the standard rate. It’s to ensure they’ll give their all for you.”","“And don’t you think...” Weisheng Lin’s hand reached over the back of her seat, his gentle voice coming through the headset, “that it’s kind of sexy to have a group of people fighting over you, even to the point of drawing blood?”","She was puzzled. “Sexy?”","He leaned closer, like a snake, his voice carrying through the headset but giving the illusion of whispering in her ear. “They fight over you, yet they must protect you. They bare their fangs like wolves, but they also have to show their softest side to you, all while fighting desperately, panting and sweating for you.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","She seemed to get it.","But then she pinched her chin, analyzing rationally, “Though, rather than fighting over me, they’re probably fighting over the salary. If it were me, if I didn’t have money, I’d fight just as hard for the sake of the young lady.”","Weisheng Lin’s mouth twitched, the excitement in his eyes dampened. “And you call yourself a manga artist? You don’t get the tension at all.”","Qiao Chuchu: “? What’s that supposed to mean? If you want to talk about manga, I can definitely keep up.”","She spread her hands, like a mischievous witch, her tone growing excited. “In manga, a group of predators fights over the heroine’s love and body. On the surface, they want to conquer her with pride, but deep down, they’ve already submitted, so lowly that they can’t live without her. When they can’t see her, it’s like ants are crawling all over their bodies!”","Whenever she talked about her work, Qiao Chuchu’s eyes sparkled with a strange light. “If that’s the kind of tension you’re talking about, I’m absolutely hooked!”","Weisheng Lin was taken aback, then smiled, looking at her without a word.","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of it, awkwardly scratching her head. “You don’t get it, do you?”","Weisheng Lin raised an eyebrow, narrowing his eyes meaningfully. “No, I think I’ve witnessed exactly what you’re describing.”","Qiao Chuchu: “! Who?! Can I watch? Can you introduce me to them?!”","“Miss Qiao.” Weisheng Lin suddenly called her.","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head. “Huh?”","Weisheng Lin’s dark, ink-like eyes stared at her, as if toying with her in his gaze, and he called her name slowly—","“Miss Qiao.”","He curled his lips into a smile and invited her, “Let’s go test those bodyguards together later. Let them fight to protect you, and I’ll join in too, playing the villain who’s trying to snatch you away~”"]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219: Shen Zhuoyan's True Feelings","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu didn’t hesitate to refuse: “I don’t like being fought over. You’re testing their on-the-spot reactions, but if I go, wouldn’t I just be joining them?”","Weisheng Lin nodded in understanding but still coaxed her temptingly: “But don’t you want to experience it firsthand? Don’t you want to see what those people would do to win? What if the final winner turns out to be someone with terrible morals? Could you really feel safe being around them every day?”","Her expression shifted slightly, and she lowered her head in thought.","Weisheng Lin spoke leisurely: “Some people would fight tooth and nail for a salary, while others might betray you for a higher offer. It’s not uncommon for bodyguards to sell out their employers. After all, they’re just here to work, not to risk their lives. That’s just how it is.”","He leaned back lazily in his chair: “If a bodyguard betrays their employer, I’d have to pay compensation. I’d also have to spend money to rescue the employer. To prevent betrayal, I’ve set up many safeguards, but it still happens. Just last year, five employers were betrayed. If it weren’t for Huai Ling stepping in to save them, those employers might have died. After all, the people who kidnapped them were ruthless criminals.”","“So,” Weisheng Lin patted Qiao Chuchu’s shoulder, as if he had already convinced her, “when it comes to someone who’s going to be by your side, someone you’ll often entrust your safety to, it’s best to choose someone with good character. You wouldn’t want to hire a scoundrel for 100,000 a month, would you? Your brother’s money is still money, after all.”","Qiao Chuchu was indeed swayed: “If I go, will they know who I am?”","Weisheng Lin’s eyes sparkled with amusement: “Don’t worry. Everyone will be wearing masks and special outfits. I’m also concerned about someone getting too competitive and hurting others.”","She nodded: “Alright, I’ll play the role of the model, as you suggested.”","Weisheng Lin’s lips curled into a pleased smile, and his entire demeanor brightened: “That’s wonderful. Thank you for giving me this opportunity.”","Qiao Chuchu frowned in disgust: “...You definitely have some kind of kink. I’m probably just part of your little game.”","Weisheng Lin widened his eyes and laughed heartily, not denying it: “I told you, I just enjoy the thrill of competition and playing around.”","Qiao Chuchu replied coldly: “Yeah, and once you win, you lose interest.”","“Miss Qiao, you really get me,” Weisheng Lin said, growing even more delighted. “I don’t have many hobbies, and no one really cares about me. If I don’t find some fun, life would be so boring.”","His gaze drifted past Qiao Chuchu, settling on the dazzling nightscape outside.","After all, nothing in the world could truly make him happy.","---","Shen Zhuoyan put on his mask and walked out of the changing room, moving silently down the hallway.","Other bodyguards, holding their masks, leaned against the walls, chatting in small groups: “I heard the employer this time is a woman in her twenties, just graduated from university.”","“That’s great! If I get the job, I’ll be with her every day. Who knows? Maybe she’ll take a liking to me, and I’ll end up as her husband!”","“You idiot, her family’s loaded. Even if she has a husband, he’d be a live-in son-in-law.”","“So what? A live-in son-in-law still gets money! She’s the daughter of a wealthy family! I’ll have her give me two kids—one with her last name, one with mine. If we break up, I’ll still get a share of the marital assets. Isn’t that a sweet deal?”","Shen Zhuoyan stopped in his tracks and turned to look at the tall, burly man.","The man smirked arrogantly: “Besides, a young lady like her might be into some wild stuff. Maybe she’d want to play out some bodyguard-and-mistress fantasy, even in the car~~”","His tone was suggestive, and the other men laughed lewdly, chiming in: “Ohhh, yeah!~”","The man licked his teeth and adjusted his pants smugly: “I can’t promise much, but with my skills, I guarantee I’ll make that young lady cry beneath me!”","A shadow lunged forward and punched him hard!","The man was caught off guard and fell to the ground, clutching his face in shock: “What the hell are you doing?!”","Without a word, Shen Zhuoyan stomped hard on the man’s most vulnerable area!","The man howled in pain: “Ah!”","Shen Zhuoyan calmly withdrew his foot: “You’re out of the running.”","The man’s face turned pale with pain: “You bastard! How dare you hit me?!”","His friends quickly surrounded Shen Zhuoyan!","A crisp female voice cut in: “What, you think it’s okay to fantasize about the employer and then get upset when someone punches you?”","Everyone turned toward the voice.","A group of female bodyguards stood behind them, their expressions filled with disdain: “If this guy hadn’t stepped in, we would’ve done it ourselves. You all have nothing but filth in your heads, don’t you? The moment you see a female employer, you start imagining dirty things! We’re reporting this to the manager—you all can’t control your urges and tried to get involved with the employer. You scumbags are out of the competition!”","The men panicked and retorted: “Do you have any proof that we tried to get involved with the employer?!”","The man on the ground struggled to his feet, still clutching his groin: “You have no evidence. We could just say you’re framing us. Anyway, it’s still a competition, and only one of us will get the job. If you’re so confident, why don’t you beat us and make sure we don’t become the young lady’s bodyguard?”","He hunched over, gritting his teeth: “Or maybe you’re just not confident enough to beat us?”","Shen Zhuoyan narrowed his eyes, his gaze dangerous as he took in the man’s appearance, memorizing his features: “With me here, you don’t stand a chance.”","With that, he turned and walked away.","The man glared at Shen Zhuoyan’s retreating figure, full of disdain: “Is he that top performer, Shen Zhuoyan?”","The female bodyguards sneered: “Yeah, he’s more hardworking and dedicated than any of you. He keeps his head down, does his job, and doesn’t act like a creep. Losing to someone like him is something we can accept. But scum like you? Even if you win, the young lady would never like you!”","The male bodyguards protested: “Don’t celebrate too early! Shen Zhuoyan might not even win!”","“Yeah, he’s not that great!”","Shen Zhuoyan arrived at the central square to prepare. One of the female bodyguards approached him: “The manager told me the young lady is here. She’ll be watching the competition from the spectator area to choose her real bodyguard. Do your best.”","Shen Zhuoyan’s eyes lit up, and there was a rare hint of excitement in his voice: “Really?”","“Really. The manager’s my sister. She wouldn’t lie to me.” The female bodyguard looked at him curiously: “Do you like the young lady? It seems like you’ve been targeting her from the start.”","When the Pei family came to select bodyguards, the news spread quickly through their company.","At the same time, Shen Zhuoyan had just joined and quickly rose to the top of the newcomers with his exceptional physical abilities, earning the right to compete for the Pei family bodyguard position.","From her perspective as an outsider, Shen Zhuoyan had been working incredibly hard.","But Shen Zhuoyan denied it: “No.”","He turned away: “I’m just looking for a job.”"]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220: He Felt That the Model Looked Familiar","paragraphs":["Someone shouted, \"The employer is here!\"","Shen Zhuoyan's expression changed, and he quickly turned to look.","A young girl in a long dress walked out from the second-floor railing.","She had reddish-brown curly hair, wearing sunglasses and a mask, strolling leisurely from inside.","Beside her stood another black-haired girl wearing a white mask, standing obediently.","One was dressed in an elegant suit, the other in a hoodie and jeans, both of the same height.","The other bodyguards sighed, \"The real young lady is so different from us working folks. Look at her, so aloof and untouchable.\"","Shen Zhuoyan didn’t say anything, his gaze lingering briefly on the red-haired girl before he looked away.","This redhead wasn’t Qiao Chuchu.","The so-called arrival of the employer was just a gimmick to make them work harder.","But—","He turned his attention to the girl in the white mask, unable to look away.","Why did she feel so familiar?","Qiao Chuchu glanced down at the masked contestants below.","Weisheng Lin had hired a model to impersonate her as the observer, while the real her was to be the \"prize\" in the upcoming competition.","It had to be said, Weisheng Lin knew how to play the game.","Her gaze swept across the room, suddenly stopping at one spot.","A man with broad shoulders, a narrow waist, and long legs was looking at her.","His face was hidden behind a specially designed mask, but his posture was impeccable, the best among the group.","He felt strangely familiar.","Shen Zhuoyan noticed her looking at him, frowned slightly, and turned his head away.","Weisheng Lin picked up the microphone and made a few polite remarks before explaining the rules: \"The lady beside me is your employer for this mission. She will be observing your performance from the glass room. The employer hopes to see a fair and just competition, with no infighting or harm to one another. I also hope you all compete with integrity. Anyone caught cheating or harming their colleagues will be immediately dismissed from the company.\"","He then turned to Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Model, today you will be playing the role of an unconscious employer. No matter what happens, you are not allowed to intervene or participate in the competition. Understood?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, unable to suppress her inner complaints: *[So why exactly was I designed to be completely immobile?]*","Weisheng Lin smiled without answering.","Simulating the most dangerous scenarios required the highest level of difficulty.","An employer who couldn’t move or take care of themselves was the ultimate challenge.","Meanwhile, Shen Zhuoyan was stunned.","He had heard Qiao Chuchu’s thoughts!","Could this redhead really be Qiao Chuchu?!","Weisheng Lin smiled and said, \"Please take your position, Miss Model.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded and walked down the steps into the competition area.","Shen Zhuoyan was still staring intently at the red-haired girl on the railing.","The red-haired girl stood with her hands clasped, showing no reaction, as if she were completely detached from the situation.","The others whispered among themselves: \"With the employer here, we have to perform even better. Even if we don’t succeed, maybe we can leave a good impression and get close to her.\"","\"Of course! We have to give it our all.\"","The man Shen Zhuoyan had kicked earlier stood behind him, grinning maliciously.","Shen Zhuoyan was going to get what was coming to him!","Weisheng Lin announced, \"Please enter the arena, contestants.\"","Shen Zhuoyan stepped into the arena, his mind filled with doubts.","Weisheng Lin explained, \"This arena is a maze. Not only are there dead ends, but there are also dangers lurking everywhere. Once you enter, you will face various hazards. All the bullets are paintballs—if you’re hit, you’re out. The knives are wooden—if you’re struck in a fatal area, you must withdraw. Your goal is to find the model, escort the immobile model safely to the exit, and you will be declared the winner. The model can be hit by paintballs, but not in fatal areas. Do you all understand?\"","The bodyguards responded, \"Understood!\"","Weisheng Lin raised an eyebrow, pleased. \"Let the competition begin.\"","A horn sounded, and all the bodyguards rushed into the arena!","Shen Zhuoyan wasn’t in a hurry to run off. Instead, he looked up at the red-haired girl in the transparent room.","He gave her a deep look before sprinting into the maze!","The man followed closely behind, ready to trip Shen Zhuoyan at any moment!","Chaos erupted in the maze!","Bodyguards lost their way, enemies ambushed them from the shadows, and within minutes, over a dozen people were eliminated.","Qiao Chuchu sat in a chair, her hands and feet bound, with a screen in front of her.","It was a live feed from a drone.","Even without the feed, she could hear the screams coming from the maze.","This wasn’t about rescuing her.","This was pure chaos.","And whoever the camera focused on seemed to \"die\" immediately!","She watched as one contestant after another was hit by paintballs and fell to the ground.","Some were so lost they were running in circles, panicking.","The drone switched from one contestant to another, each one \"dying\" as soon as they came into view.","Finally, it landed on someone decisive and ruthless!","The man tackled an enemy holding a gun, disarmed him, and shot him with his own weapon before rushing to the next location without hesitation!","Qiao Chuchu gradually became intrigued, focusing on the screen.","This seemed to be the man with the best physique she had seen earlier.","Was he really this strong?","Shen Zhuoyan ran forward, his right hand brushing against the wall as he moved.","He was like an unstoppable warrior, quick and decisive.","Qiao Chuchu was there.","She was watching him!","He wanted her to see him!","He turned a corner and saw Qiao Chuchu tied to the chair.","Qiao Chuchu had been staring at the screen, but when she looked up and saw Shen Zhuoyan, she was startled.","Both of them were wearing masks.","They couldn’t see each other’s eyes, but in the midst of the chaos, a strange sense of connection formed between them.","Somehow, Qiao Chuchu felt that it had to be him.","Shen Zhuoyan strode toward her, but suddenly, someone yanked him back!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Shen Zhuoyan was caught off guard. He turned around and was immediately kicked to the ground!","He fell hard!","The man he had fought earlier stomped on his throat!","Shen Zhuoyan winced in pain, struggling to breathe!","The man gritted his teeth, his face twisted with rage beneath the mask: \"You’re pretty good, huh? Following you was a lucky break! And you even found the model! Hahahahahahahahaha!\"","He pressed his foot down harder, then quickly released Shen Zhuoyan and ran toward Qiao Chuchu.","Shen Zhuoyan clutched his throat, coughing violently, unable to get up immediately: \"Cough! Cough!\"","From her position around the corner, Qiao Chuchu couldn’t see what had happened. All she saw was the man running up to her, excitedly saying, \"How about that? Am I the first? Am I amazing?!\"","She felt absurd: \"Amazing? I just saw you drag someone else away! That guy was the real winner!\""]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221: Emotionally Inexperienced Wei Sheng Lin","paragraphs":["The man paused as he untied her, his tone annoyed. \"What are you, a model, spouting nonsense? I won fair and square. Don’t forget what President Wei said—you’re supposed to be unconscious, so you can’t talk!\"","He roughly untied the ropes around her feet, even knocking her shoes off in the process.","But he had no intention of letting her put her shoes back on. Instead, he moved to pick her up. \"Just shut your mouth!\"","She slapped his hand away. \"Don’t touch me! You cheated!\"","The man’s expression darkened as he shoved her back into the chair. \"You’re not some high-class lady. Why do you care so much?!\"","Qiao Chuchu felt her insides ache from the force, and she was so angry she wanted to jump up and hit him!","[If I weren’t here, he’d treat the model this roughly, wouldn’t he? So disrespectful!!]","[How could someone like this be my bodyguard? He’d probably sell me out on the first day!]","Shen Zhuoyan stumbled to his feet, hearing that familiar inner voice. His breath hitched.","The redhead wasn’t Qiao Chuchu.","The model was!","This scumbag had insulted her!","His blood rushed to his head, and without thinking, he tackled the man to the ground, ripped off his mask, and delivered several hard punches to his head!","One after another!","He swung with a numb, obsessive force, like a madman, not stopping until the man was completely knocked out.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She could feel the overwhelming aura of rage emanating from this man.","She shrank back into the chair, staring at him with a mix of fear and confusion.","Shen Zhuoyan stood up from the unconscious man and noticed Qiao Chuchu’s shoes were off.","He knelt down and began to put them back on for her.","The sudden shift in his demeanor left Qiao Chuchu flustered. She quickly leaned forward. \"No, no, I can do it myself!\"","[His hands are still bloody!]","Shen Zhuoyan kept his head down. \"The rules state that you’re supposed to be unconscious right now, so you can’t speak or move.\"","His large hands gently grasped her slender ankle as he slipped the white sneaker back on. \"Don’t be shy. I’m your person now. Taking care of you is my duty.\"","She was stunned, letting him do as he pleased, biting her lower lip. [Thank goodness I showered and put on new socks and shoes. Otherwise, I’d die of embarrassment.]","Shen Zhuoyan chuckled softly as he tied her shoelaces into a neat bow.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Why does this hand look so familiar?]","Shen Zhuoyan looked up at her.","Through the mask, his gaze was soft and tender, as if it could melt into water.","He knew the position of Qiao Chuchu’s bodyguard was meant for him.","Suddenly, a dark figure lunged from the shadows!","He reflexively dodged, turning to see a man in a red mask wielding a wooden sword aimed at him!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Is this Weisheng Lin playing the villain?!]","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","Weisheng Lin?","What’s he doing here? Isn’t he the CEO of this security company?!","Weisheng Lin held the wooden sword, his eyes provocatively looking at Shen Zhuoyan.","He knew this guy was Shen Zhuoyan, Qiao Chuchu’s old classmate.","He also knew why Shen Zhuoyan was here.","But he hadn’t told the Pei Family.","Because he loved watching drama, and he loved being part of it.","Weisheng Lin pulled out a gun and fired directly at Shen Zhuoyan!","Shen Zhuoyan ducked behind cover the moment he saw the gun.","A red paintball exploded against the wall!","Weisheng Lin hoisted Qiao Chuchu over his shoulder and ran, disappearing around the corner in an instant.","Shen Zhuoyan, still hiding, didn’t hear anything. When he peeked out, both Weisheng Lin and Qiao Chuchu were gone.","His face turned pale, and he immediately gave chase!","Weisheng Lin ran with Qiao Chuchu on his shoulder, laughing maniacally. \"This is thrilling! Too thrilling! I’ve never snatched something from someone else’s mouth before. How do you think that guy feels, having his prey stolen right from under his nose?!\"","Qiao Chuchu, jostled uncomfortably, complained, \"You’re really into this, aren’t you?\"","[Coming down personally to play the villain boss? If he doesn’t like playing house, I don’t know what he likes.]","Weisheng Lin paused.","Playing house?","He didn’t like playing house.","He just loved situational training because life was too boring when everything went smoothly!","He expertly led Qiao Chuchu to a dead-end alley.","In the alley was a prop wardrobe used for set decoration.","Without hesitation, he shoved Qiao Chuchu inside and climbed in after her, closing the door and waiting for Shen Zhuoyan to find them.","The wardrobe was cramped, barely fitting the two of them.","Qiao Chuchu, squished and struggling to breathe, said, \"Lin, maybe you should wait outside. It’s too tight in here for both of us.\"","Weisheng Lin removed his mask and looked at her, his expression gradually turning cold.","The wardrobe was dimly lit, with only faint light filtering in, casting shadows on Weisheng Lin’s icy eyes.","He asked, \"Who’s your brother?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","In the confined space, Weisheng Lin leaned down, pressing the gun barrel hard against her chin. \"You’re just a hostage. You don’t get to talk to me.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyelids twitched, her irritation growing. \"Keep the jokes within limits. I may have a good temper, but I don’t appreciate every kind of humor. It’s just the two of us here. Stop acting.\"","\"What?\" Weisheng Lin narrowed his eyes, pressing the gun harder against her chin. \"You’re just a hostage in my hands. If I want to kill you, I can. If I want to do whatever I want with you, I will. What can you do about it?\"","Qiao Chuchu was forced to tilt her head back, her displeasure mounting. \"Stop messing around.\"","\"I’m not messing around!\" Weisheng Lin barked. \"You’re a hostage! You don’t get to speak! I’m the boss here!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened. She grabbed his wrist, disarmed him, and pressed the gun to his forehead!","Weisheng Lin: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow, smirking at him. \"Now are you done acting?\"","Weisheng Lin froze, his dark eyes slowly filling with amusement. \"You think just because you have a gun, you can threaten me? I’ve been through hell and back to get where I am. You think a little girl like you can scare me?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","[...Why doesn’t this guy go into acting? Is it because he doesn’t like it?]","Weisheng Lin proudly lifted his chin.","No, it’s because he has billions to inherit.","He pressed his forehead against the gun barrel, his dramatic flair in full swing. \"Go ahead, shoot me! Do you dare, you little brat?!\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed. \"It’s just a paintball gun. You won’t die; you’ll just get splattered with red dye.\"","Weisheng Lin, still provocative, insisted, \"I said shoot me!\"","Her expression hardened. She twisted his body, slamming him against the wardrobe. \"You just can’t stop playing, can you?!\"","Weisheng Lin let out a muffled grunt of surprise. \"Hmph!\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly pulled off his tie and used it to bind his hands behind his back.","Weisheng Lin’s face changed as he snapped out of his dramatic act. \"Qiao Chuchu, what are you doing?! I’m older than you! I’m practically your uncle!!\""]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222: Disturbing the Sweet Dream: Shen Zhuoyan","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow, savoring the two words with amusement: \"Uncle?\"","She tied his wrists and sneered, \"What kind of uncle are you supposed to be?\"","Weisheng Lin's breath hitched, and his body suddenly went weak.","He could have struggled.","But his limbs felt as if they were sealed.","The sensations in his body felt utterly foreign.","His cheeks burned as he pressed himself tightly against the wall. \"L-Let go!\"","As soon as he spoke, Weisheng Lin was startled.","That soft, cotton-candy-like tone—was that really coming from him?","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head. \"Hmm?\"","[Why did his voice go soft? Is this part of his role-playing game?]","She thought of a line and pressed the gun to the back of his head. \"Uncle, you're getting old. Isn't it time to step down? I've had my eye on your throne for a long time. I want to be the boss too.\"","Weisheng Lin's ears buzzed, his thoughts in disarray. He misheard her words as—","\"Uncle, I've had my eye on you for a long time. I want to sit on your throne and be your boss.\"","Weisheng Lin shook his head, forcing himself to stay focused. \"I could never give myself to you! Don't even think about it!\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"What nonsense are you spouting? I want your throne, not you! Rethink your lines!\"","Weisheng Lin was stunned. \"It's not me?\"","She pressed the gun harder against his head, her tone fierce. \"Rethink it!!!\"","Weisheng Lin shuddered, a hoarse whimper escaping his throat. \"Mmm!\"","He faced the wall, his back to Qiao Chuchu, his palms slick with sweat.","Why was it so hot?!","Why was it so unbearably hot?!","He gasped for air. \"What did you want again?\"","Qiao Chuchu reminded him, \"The throne! The boss's throne you've worked so hard for all these years!\"","He licked his lips, tilting his head back as he panted. \"Ah, the throne.\"","Weisheng Lin rubbed his wrists, still bound by the tie, beads of sweat rolling down his jawline. All the heat seemed to gather in one part of his body!","His breath caught.","He—he—","He stared down in shock, his back still turned to Qiao Chuchu, silent.","Qiao Chuchu sensed something was off and lowered the gun. \"Are you feeling unwell?\"","She reached to untie his tie. \"I told you we should've stopped playing earlier. You're way too into this role-playing.\"","But Weisheng Lin suddenly dodged her hand. \"It's fine. I just got stuck on my lines, that's all. Don't untie it.\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated. \"Are you sure? Your voice is really hoarse. Are you not getting enough air?\"","Weisheng Lin's face flushed red as he kept his back to her. \"No, I can keep playing.\"","Qiao Chuchu's lips twitched. \"...I can see you've never played house before. I got bored of this stuff when I was a kid.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","He stayed silent, his Adam's apple bobbing as he slowly processed the sensations.","This feeling was so strange.","His body tingled, as if electrified.","He finally managed to think of a line. \"After all these years, I can't just hand over what I've worked so hard for. Not unless you—\"","Suddenly, the closet door swung open!","Shen Zhuoyan, looking frantic, glanced at Qiao Chuchu and, without even looking at Weisheng Lin, scooped her up and ran off!","Qiao Chuchu quickly tossed the gun to Weisheng Lin. \"Game over. I have to go back to being a half-dead model now.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","He remained kneeling in the closet, watching as Qiao Chuchu disappeared from his sight.","It was as if a bucket of cold water had been poured over him, leaving him utterly stunned.","Shen Zhuoyan came to rescue her?","At such a critical moment?","Weisheng Lin tore off the tie, clutching it in his hand. Anger, like gasoline poured on a fire, erupted within him in an instant!","Damn...","This Shen Zhuoyan...","Damn it!!!!"]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223: Play a Little Longer, Miss Pei","paragraphs":["Shen Zhuoyan was almost at the exit!","Victory was within reach!","He couldn't help but feel elated: \"Do you see it?! I'm about to win, I'm about to become your—\"","At this point, his words abruptly stopped.","He couldn't let Qiao Chuchu know that he had already noticed her.","Because the masks made it impossible to see anyone's face.","Qiao Chuchu didn't catch the last part of his sentence, but she could sense his excitement and asked curiously, \"Are you really that eager to get this job? Is it because the salary meets your expectations?\"","Shen Zhuoyan paused in his steps.","No.","It was because of the person.","Instead of answering, he asked in return, \"If you were the young lady, would you be happy to see a bodyguard like me?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded without hesitation, \"Of course I would be happy! I can feel your dedication and seriousness toward this position, so you'll definitely achieve the results you want.\"","She pointed to the red-haired model inside the transparent glass room, \"She's watching. She'll definitely choose you.\"","Shen Zhuoyan's heart skipped a few beats, and the corners of his mouth faintly turned upward.","\"I know,\" he smiled. \"I'm already looking forward to it.\"","Qiao Chuchu also felt relieved and looked toward the exit, \"We're almost there.\"","Suddenly, Weisheng Lin appeared in front of them and fired a shot, \"Who told you to ruin my plans?!\"","Shen Zhuoyan quickly shielded Qiao Chuchu behind cover!","Qiao Chuchu nearly flew off his shoulder, shouting in shock, \"Weisheng Lin, what are you doing?! Are you out of your mind?!\"","Weisheng Lin didn't respond.","He stood in front of the path, holding a paintball gun, and glared at the cover, his tone filled with resentment, \"Shen Zhuoyan, do you not know how to read the room?\"","Shen Zhuoyan furrowed his brows, unsure what he had done wrong.","Finding Qiao Chuchu, protecting her, and ensuring she wasn't hurt—he had been doing everything right.","What had he done wrong?","Qiao Chuchu also felt indignant on Shen Zhuoyan's behalf.","She peeked out from behind the cover, \"Aren't you just wronging him? He hasn't done anything wrong! Are you getting too into your villain role?\"","Weisheng Lin lowered his gaze, looking at her little head peeking out.","Qiao Chuchu was wearing a white mask, so he couldn't see her face.","But he wasn't wearing one.","Naturally, Qiao Chuchu could clearly see his features.","The Weisheng family had a unique youthful appearance, and Weisheng Lin was no exception.","He was the second son of the family and looked very similar to Weisheng Wenzhan.","Weisheng Wenzhan resembled an untouchable vampire noble.","Weisheng Lin, on the other hand, had a bit more vitality, like a half-demon. The main difference from his older brother was that his eyes were larger, more expressive, and his brow was smoother.","Although his facial muscles tried to make him appear gentler than his older brother, his aura was still striking, like a broadsword shrouded in a bloody mist, making people want to stay away when he was furious.","His gaze shifted downward, staring at Qiao Chuchu's mask, his dark eyes swirling with desire.","Qiao Chuchu shrunk back, quickly hiding behind the cover again, hugging herself as she questioned her life choices.","Why did she feel so uneasy?","Weisheng Lin said in a deep voice, \"Shen Zhuoyan, you interrupted my fun.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at the wary Shen Zhuoyan, \"Wait, you're Shen Zhuoyan?\"","[And what kind of fun is Weisheng Lin even talking about?!]","Shen Zhuoyan remained silent, only listening intently.","Weisheng Lin pressed his Bluetooth earpiece, \"Tell those useless people who haven't arrived yet to leave. Clear the area so only the three of us remain.\"","He looked toward the corner and said in a low voice, \"I want to face him one-on-one.\"","The person on the other end of the earpiece was shocked, \"But that's not safe!\"","Weisheng Lin, \"Stop wasting time! Get them out now!\"","His subordinates exchanged uneasy glances and quickly left.","Weisheng Lin then picked up his phone and turned off the surveillance cameras in the venue.","The transparent glass room slowly descended, enclosing the space.","The venue was now cleared, leaving only the three of them.","Weisheng Lin's lips curled into a slow smile, \"Shen Zhuoyan, if I take Qiao Chuchu away from you and you don't get her back, you lose. If you lose, you can't become her bodyguard. How does that sound?\"","Shen Zhuoyan glared at Qiao Chuchu, \"What were you two doing just now?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked bewildered, \"He was just messing around, and I played along.\"","Shen Zhuoyan's voice dropped even lower, \"What were you playing?\"","She slowly recalled, \"I held a gun to him and even tied his hands with his tie.\"","\"His tie?\" Shen Zhuoyan's tone rose slightly, displeased. \"Do you not know what it means to tie someone's hands with a tie?!\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned, \"I was angry at the time, and the only thing I could use as a rope was his tie, so I just went with it.\"","[After all, I have stealth skills. I can not only tie someone's hands with a tie, but I could even strangle them with it.]","Weisheng Lin narrowed his eyes and licked his lips.","How delightful~","He hummed a tune cheerfully as he slowly walked toward them, \"Qiao Chuchu, I'm coming to catch you.\"","Qiao Chuchu's expression changed, her internal alarm bells ringing, \"Oh no! Did I accidentally trigger some strange trait of his?!\"","[After all, five members of the Weisheng family, but six are weirdos!]","[Weisheng Huailing even kissed me earlier!]","Shen Zhuoyan's eyelids twitched, \"What?!\"","Weisheng Lin, \"What did you say?!\"","Both of them suddenly stood in front of her, staring at her in shock.","Qiao Chuchu looked confused, \"What did I say?\"","The two exchanged a glance and suddenly reached out to grab her!","Qiao Chuchu screamed and bolted!","Weisheng Lin and Shen Zhuoyan, with their long legs, started chasing her, \"Don't run!\"","Qiao Chuchu, \"Only a fool wouldn't run!!\"","She agilely climbed over obstacles in the maze, disappearing from their sight!","Shen Zhuoyan decisively chose to take a detour to find her.","Weisheng Lin, without hesitation, followed Qiao Chuchu as she leaped over a stack of boxes!","Qiao Chuchu held onto the walls, twisting and turning as she ran toward the entrance.","[The exit is probably blocked, so I'll have to head for the entrance!]","But as she turned a corner, she found herself in a dead end.","Qiao Chuchu gritted her teeth, \"Who designed this place as a maze? What an idiot!\"","\"This idiot,\" Weisheng Lin's voice came from behind her. \"I must say, this makes it easier to catch you.\"","She turned around in shock.","Weisheng Lin stood at the entrance, slowly pulling a black tie from his pocket.","His pale, slender fingers wrapped around the tie, like vines coiling around someone who couldn't bear hardship, creating an alluring sight.","Weisheng Lin's eyes were filled with a teasing smile as he extended his hand toward her, \"Miss Qiao, come here.\"","Qiao Chuchu shivered, feeling inexplicably cold.","Probably because he was disgusting her.","She spoke earnestly, \"Weisheng Lin, everyone has their little quirks. I get it. I used to be a weirdo too, but I've turned over a new leaf. Look at me now—I have so much hair!\"","Weisheng Lin's smile twitched, \"Are you saying I'm balding?\"","She nodded emphatically, \"Don't you think you're going bald?\"","Weisheng Lin's expression suddenly changed, and he pulled out his phone to check his reflection, \"No way, I don't lose hair, and there's no history of baldness in my family.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes lit up, and she tried to climb over the wall to escape!","[Perfect opportunity!]","Weisheng Lin, \"?!\"","She actually used the excuse of him going bald to trick him!","He grabbed her leg and yanked her down!","The sudden weightlessness made her scream, \"Ah!\"","She landed safely in Weisheng Lin's arms, her soul still seemingly floating in the air as she met his confident gaze.","Effortlessly holding her, he shoved her into a wardrobe!","Her face paled as she struggled in disgust, \"Let me go!\"","Weisheng Lin held her ankle, speaking in a calm, coaxing tone, \"Let's play a little longer, Miss Qiao.\""]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224: I Am Already Miss Qiao's Bodyguard, Please Let Me Go With Her","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu: \"??? Do you think I'm stupid? At first, I thought you were just playing around with me, but now I see it—you're just here for your own amusement! Your tastes are way too bizarre!!!\"","Weisheng Lin’s breath hitched. Even after being scolded, he wasn’t angry. Instead, his eyes sparkled with excitement. \"I’m not here for amusement,\" he said, leaning closer to her, his voice softening as if he were about to kiss her cheek. \"Really, I’m not.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s hair stood on end, and she kicked him hard in the shoulder. \"Get lost, you freak!!\"","Weisheng Lin grunted from the impact. \"Oof!\"","She bolted away as fast as she could!","[He looks so refined on the outside, but turns out he’s just a masochistic weirdo! Who would’ve thought the Weisheng family could produce a masochist? I thought they were all sadists!]","Weisheng Lin glanced at the footprint on his shoulder and chuckled delightedly. \"Miss Qiao, your words hurt me. I’m not a freak. I just enjoy having fun. No one’s ever dared to scold me before—you’re the first outsider besides my family to do so. It’s refreshing.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face flushed red as she turned to look at him.","Seeing her panic, Weisheng Lin playfully covered his eyes, as if coaxing her. \"Alright, how about this? I won’t look. I’ll count to fifty, and you run. I’ll come find you, okay?\"","He drew out his words with a smirk. \"One~\"","\"Two~\"","\"Three~\"","Qiao Chuchu shivered, feeling both hot and cold, her mind foggy and disoriented.","Something was wrong with her.","It was probably because she’d been under so much pressure all day.","After all, she’d saved Pei Youchuan on the ship, outsmarted Xia Xuechun, been kidnapped with Ji Yanchuan, argued with Weisheng Huailing, and now she was caught up in this maze chase with them—all in the same day!","It felt like she’d crammed a year’s worth of events into just a few hours.","She was exhausted...","Qiao Chuchu staggered a few steps, leaning against the wall as she gasped for breath. Her body felt weak and light, as if she were walking on cotton, but her head felt heavy, creating a jarring disconnect.","It was like audio and video out of sync.","Weisheng Lin’s low voice whispered in her ear. \"Found you.\"","Goosebumps erupted all over her body as she turned in terror—","Shen Zhuoyan scooped her up and carried her away!","Weisheng Lin’s face darkened. \"Shen Zhuoyan, it’s you again!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan ran swiftly, carrying Qiao Chuchu to a corner and removing his mask.","His cold, handsome face was revealed, his disheveled hair doing nothing to diminish his looks.","His gaze was intense and concerned. \"Do you like Weisheng Lin? The age gap between you two is huge! Even if he looks young, you can’t be with him!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him weakly. \"What gave you the idea that I like Weisheng Lin?\"","\"Then what about his brother?\" Shen Zhuoyan’s brows furrowed as he gripped her wrist, his tone urgent. \"Weisheng Huailing—do you like him?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[And where did he get the idea that I like Weisheng Huailing? I even scolded him earlier. If he hadn’t begged me, I’d have cut ties with him.]","[Besides, who I like is none of his business.]","She was too tired to argue. \"Shen Zhuoyan, I don’t want to fight. I’ve been through too much today. I’m exhausted. I just want to sleep.\"","Her bones ached for some reason, too.","Shen Zhuoyan noticed her state. \"Are you feeling unwell?\"","She shook her head. \"I’m just tired. It’s already 11 PM. I need to sleep.\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed his wrist, pleading. \"Shen Zhuoyan, stop messing around. I’m the one who hired you. You’re my bodyguard now.\"","Shen Zhuoyan froze, feeling the heat of her palm. \"Your hand is burning.\"","Qiao Chuchu dismissed it, pushing him away and forcing herself to walk. \"It’s probably from running.\"","Suddenly, Weisheng Lin dropped down in front of her and wrapped her in a hug. \"Caught you~\"","Qiao Chuchu buried her face in his chest, not resisting.","Weisheng Lin was surprised by her lack of struggle. He cupped her face, delighted. \"So obedient now, are you—\"","His smile faltered as he felt her skin. \"Why is your face so hot?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up at him, dazed. \"I’m just warm from running.\"","\"No, this isn’t from running.\" Weisheng Lin’s expression turned serious as he pressed his forehead to hers. \"You’re burning up. Are you running a fever?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s face changed, and he pushed Weisheng Lin aside, pressing his own forehead to hers. \"You’re definitely running a fever!\"","Weisheng Lin shoved him back and touched her cheek again, his brow furrowed with worry. \"You’re really hot.\"","Qiao Chuchu was completely out of it. She reached up to touch her own forehead.","Looking up at the two of them with watery, confused eyes, she asked, \"Am I really sick?\"","Both men stared at her, then nodded solemnly.","Suddenly, she felt a wave of grievance. \"Then why were you two shoving me around like wild boars?!\"","Weisheng Lin and Shen Zhuoyan froze, then immediately apologized, standing on either side of her.","\"I’m sorry. I didn’t know you were sick,\" Weisheng Lin said, crouching down to her level.","Shen Zhuoyan’s brows were tightly knit. \"I’m used to being tough and rarely get sick, so I didn’t notice you weren’t well. That’s my fault.\"","Weisheng Lin added, \"I’ve never had to take care of anyone before. People always take care of me. I didn’t even know what a fever felt like until I touched you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Please, both of you, shut up. Just let me go home.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"I’ll take you!\"","Weisheng Lin: \"I’ll take you.\"","The two men glared at each other and said in unison, \"Don’t let him take her!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She felt her blood pressure spike, and before she could argue, her vision went black, and she fainted.","Both men caught her. \"Qiao Chuchu?!\"","She didn’t respond, hanging limply in their arms like a soft, floppy bag.","Weisheng Lin and Shen Zhuoyan exchanged worried glances, but before they could say anything, they felt the atmosphere shift.","They looked up.","Pei Yuan and the rest of the Pei family stood before them, their eyes sharp as poisoned daggers.","Pei Buxian’s expression was icy, his aura darker than a ghost’s. \"This damn maze took us ten minutes just to find you three.\"","Pei Yuan strode forward and snatched Qiao Chuchu from their arms, cradling her protectively.","Weisheng Lin stepped back, guilt written all over his face.","Shen Zhuoyan’s eyes remained fixed on Qiao Chuchu, filled with concern.","Pei Yuan was furious. \"Mr. Weisheng, didn’t I tell you to have my sister wait for us once you found her? Why were you dragging her around like this?! Do you have any idea how exhausted she is after today?!\"","Weisheng Lin stiffened, his confidence crumbling.","He looked like a chastised criminal, lowering his head in sincere apology. \"I’m sorry. I didn’t know she was sick. She seemed fine when I found her. I didn’t realize she had a fever.\"","Pei Yuan’s expression remained stern as he turned to Shen Zhuoyan.","Shen Zhuoyan met his gaze, his resolve firm. \"Miss Qiao just confirmed that I’m her bodyguard. Please let me accompany her.\""]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225: The White Moonlight in Our Hearts","paragraphs":["Pei Ci and Pei Mu were taken aback and refused in unison: \"Letting you in would be like inviting a wolf into the house! We won’t agree to it!\"","\"But I’m the one who won!\" Shen Zhuoyan straightened his back, his confidence unwavering. \"I can also guarantee that I won’t betray Qiao Chuchu no matter what temptations come my way. Are you really going to shut me out just because I have feelings for her?!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci scoffed: \"We brothers can take turns protecting her!\"","Qiao Chuchu, disturbed by the noise, opened her eyes weakly: \"Brother?\"","Pei Yuan looked at her with concern: \"Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu was in pain all over, and her head was throbbing: \"I want to go home... Oh, right, Shen Zhuoyan won. He can be my bodyguard. He needs this job.\"","Shen Zhuoyan was stunned for a moment, then quickly stepped forward: \"Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu weakly raised her hand and said to him, \"You’re amazing, Shen Zhuoyan. You’re loyal and righteous. I trust you to be my bodyguard. Besides... you need a job.\"","Shen Zhuoyan instinctively grabbed her hand, his eyes filled with worry: \"I’m not doing this for the job. I’m doing it for—\"","Pei Yuan abruptly handed Qiao Chuchu to Pei Youchuan.","Shen Zhuoyan’s hand was left empty, and he looked at Pei Yuan in confusion.","Pei Yuan’s face was expressionless, but his eyes clearly showed suppressed anger: \"One-month probation. If I find out you’re trying to take advantage of your alone time with her, you’re out.\"","Shen Zhuoyan straightened his back without hesitation: \"Understood.\"","Pei Yuan walked over to Qiao Chuchu and gently patted her shoulder to wake her: \"Chuchu, let’s go to the hospital, okay? You’re running a high fever.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned in resistance: \"No hospital. I want to go home.\"","[I’ve been running around all day. I really want to go home.]","Pei Yuan’s heart ached, and he couldn’t bring himself to refuse her: \"Alright, we’ll go home. But if your fever gets worse, you’ll have to go to the hospital, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t respond, drifting off into a restless sleep.","Weisheng Lin suggested, \"I’ll come with you.\"","Pei Yuan shot him a displeased look.","Weisheng Lin scratched his head apologetically: \"After all... I didn’t let her rest. It’s my fault. I should stay with her.\"","Pei Yuan smiled, though the warmth didn’t reach his eyes: \"Sure, why don’t you call your brother too?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Pei Yuan turned around and said coldly, \"I’ll have a word with your brother about your little adventure today, taking someone else’s sister through a maze.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","—","Weisheng Wenzhan stood by the bed, watching Qiao Chuchu as she slept.","Her face was flushed, and a cooling patch was stuck to her forehead, but it didn’t seem to help much. Her sleep was restless due to the high fever.","He reached out and touched her jaw.","Still burning hot.","He used a digital thermometer to check her temperature.","38.5°C.","Weisheng Wenzhan frowned and turned to Weisheng Lin: \"Do you know how old you are?\"","Weisheng Lin, with his hands behind his back and his tie still wrapped around his palm, mumbled, \"I know.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan glanced at Qiao Chuchu, his expression dark: \"And do you know how old she is?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"...I know.\"","\"You know, and yet you still did this?!\" Weisheng Wenzhan’s eyes were filled with anger. \"She’s practically a child in front of you. Don’t you know how to care for her?!\"","Weisheng Biehe sat on the sofa across from the bed, taking in Weisheng Lin’s discomfort.","He was also annoyed and couldn’t help but add sarcastically, \"Second Brother has always been the most spoiled in our family. He’s gotten everything he’s ever wanted since he was a child. What could possibly worry him? He doesn’t know how to care for others.\"","Weisheng Lin glared at him: \"Fourth Brother, you—\"","Weisheng Wenzhan cut him off: \"Talking back, are we?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","Weisheng Biehe twirled his prayer beads, his tone mockingly kind: \"Huai Ling got hit on the head and is still in the hospital for observation. We haven’t told him yet. If he finds out Qiao Chuchu has a fever because of you, what do you think he’ll do?\"","Weisheng Lin’s face darkened, but he remained silent.","Weisheng Wenzhan didn’t want to waste any more words on him and ordered, \"You caused this mess, so you’re staying up tonight to change her cooling patches.\"","Weisheng Lin’s eyes lit up: \"Just me and her?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan smiled warmly, but the smile disappeared in an instant.","\"Dream on. We’ll all be in this room, but you’re the only one changing the patches.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Weisheng Biehe sneered: \"Don’t just stand there, Second Brother. It’s time to change her cooling patch.\"","Pei Che stepped forward to change Qiao Chuchu’s cooling patch: \"No need. We can handle it ourselves.\"","Letting others take care of Qiao Chuchu? Not unless his brain was fried too.","Weisheng Wenzhan stopped him, a glint of something unreadable in his eyes, his tone steady: \"He caused this mess, so he should clean it up. Otherwise, how can our families continue to get along?\"","Qiao Chuchu stirred uncomfortably, her lips dry as she looked up at the ceiling.","The air was filled with the scent of the incense she had chosen.","She was in her room.","Finally, she relaxed.","[My head hurts so much... I’m so thirsty...]","Everyone in the room froze, then rushed toward the water pitcher!!","Weisheng Lin reacted the fastest, pouring a glass of water and bringing it to Qiao Chuchu’s lips: \"Here, drink.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt the warmth and turned her head away: \"Not hot water. I want cold water. My throat feels like it’s on fire.\"","Weisheng Lin nodded eagerly: \"Got it. Want some ice in it?\"","The others: \"?\"","Ice?","Weisheng Wenzhan snatched the glass from him and scolded in a low voice: \"Are you out of your mind? She can’t drink cold water when she’s sick.\"","Weisheng Lin was confused: \"But she wants it.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was furious: \"It doesn’t matter what she wants! She can’t have it!\"","He sat on the edge of the bed, helped Qiao Chuchu sit up, and clumsily brought the glass to her lips: \"Here, drink a little. You’re running a fever. Cold water isn’t good for you.\"","She sighed, knowing she wouldn’t get her ice water, and obediently took a few sips.","A drop of water rolled down her chin.","Pei Che leaned down and gently wiped it away with a tissue.","Qiao Chuchu weakly opened her eyes and realized her bed was surrounded by people.","All seven of her brothers were there.","From the Weisheng family, aside from Yu Can and Huai Ling, the other three were also present.","Even Shen Zhuoyan was there.","And Shen Zhuoyan was now dressed in the Pei family’s bodyguard uniform, a Bluetooth earpiece in his ear, standing opposite her bed, watching her with concern.","...Why are there so many people here?","She looked around in confusion, her gaze settling on Weisheng Wenzhan, who was feeding her water: \"Why are you all here?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan adjusted the pillow behind her back: \"We came as soon as we heard. It’s Weisheng Lin’s fault for being so careless and causing you to get sick.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked, then looked at Weisheng Lin, who was standing awkwardly to the side.","He was still clutching his tie, looking at her with guilt: \"I’m sorry, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt a bit awkward: \"It’s not really his fault. My immune system is just weak. I happened to catch a fever.\"","They didn’t seem to agree, all staring at her with gloomy expressions.","Qiao Chuchu felt uneasy under their gaze: \"Why are you all looking at me like that? Do I have some terminal illness or something?\"","Everyone: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu grew more panicked.","[Is the world finally trying to eliminate me through illness?! But I thought I’d already gained the protagonist’s aura! Is my elimination still ongoing?!]","Suddenly, she felt like she couldn’t breathe. Weakly clutching her chest, she started crying like a tragic heroine from a period drama: \"If I get sick now, I’ll become the short-lived villainess!\"","Weisheng Lin quickly leaned down and comforted her gently: \"No, if you die now, you’ll just become the early-departed white moonlight in our hearts.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","The others: \"?\"","Pei Che couldn’t take it anymore: \"Someone get this idiot out of here!\""]},{"number":226,"title":"Chapter 226: Xiao Xie's Wonderful Adventure","paragraphs":["Early morning, six o'clock.","Little Xie was feeling a bit nervous in the Pei family's kitchen.","The reason for her anxiety was this:","She had been documenting the daily lives of seven handsome bosses on a certain app, which had made her somewhat of an internet sensation, turning her into a minor celebrity blogger.","Since Qiao Chuchu had joined the group, her updates now included an \"Eighth Lady.\"","Because her current phone was a gift from Qiao Chuchu, she had praised her extensively, leading to Qiao Chuchu's favorable reputation online. She had even garnered a small but dedicated fanbase.","But earlier that day, Qiao Chuchu had gone viral, and her account had exploded in popularity!","Countless people were asking her if Qiao Chuchu was the \"Eighth Lady.\"","Little Xie vehemently denied it!","But it was no use.","In her previous posts, the third brother, Pei Youchuan, was described as a tanned, muscular man.","And the Pei Youchuan in the viral video, even while unconscious, was clearly the same person!","Moreover, the legendary \"Eighth Lady\" was said to have reddish-brown curly hair and a talent for painting.","Qiao Chuchu also had reddish-brown curly hair and could paint, so netizens had analyzed the situation thoroughly, practically writing a thesis on why she must be the \"Eighth Lady\"!","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu had been busy all day, and her phone had gotten waterlogged, so she hadn’t had a chance to see what was being said about her online.","She had no idea that Little Xie had been sharing their daily lives on the internet.","As for the Pei brothers, they hardly ever surfed the web. Even if they did use their phones, they likely wouldn’t stumble upon Little Xie’s niche content.","Qiao Chuchu was the one most likely to find out.","If she did, she might get angry.","And then Little Xie’s job would be on the line.","She considered deleting her account, but doing so would only make things worse. Besides, her posts had already been screenshot and compiled by netizens.","So...","The best course of action was to take care of Qiao Chuchu, who was running a fever, and confess her mistake, hoping for forgiveness.","Little Xie made up her mind and decided to cook some porridge for Qiao Chuchu.","As the assistant housekeeper, she no longer needed to work in the kitchen.","But to apologize, it was best to handle things personally.","Just then, the kitchen door was pulled open.","Little Xie turned around: \"Mr. Pei Yuan?\"","Pei Yuan nodded and walked straight into the kitchen, rummaging through the cabinets.","Surprised, she approached him: \"What do you need? Let me help you.\"","\"No need. The young lady is sick, and when she’s ill, she prefers porridge,\" Pei Yuan said, finding the rice and pouring it into a bowl with practiced ease.","Little Xie tried to take over: \"Why don’t I make it, then?\"","Pei Yuan avoided her hand, not even looking up: \"You can leave. She only eats what I make when she’s like this.\"","Little Xie: \"...\"","Fine, she’d go prepare some hot water instead.","Little Xie trudged out of the kitchen and headed to the tea room.","Weisheng Lin was bent over, fiddling with something in the tea room.","A bad feeling crept over her: \"Mr. Weisheng Lin, do you need something?\"","Weisheng Lin stepped aside, his expression serious: \"I want a pot of fresh hot water, but I don’t know how to work this machine. Can you show me how to use it?\"","Little Xie: \"? You don’t know how to make hot water?\"","Weisheng Lin frowned: \"?\"","She awkwardly stepped forward: \"It’s fine if you don’t know. I can handle it.\"","\"No, I said I want to do it myself,\" Weisheng Lin replied, hands in his pockets, clearly annoyed. \"I don’t want anyone saying I’m a spoiled brat with no life skills.\"","Little Xie: \"...\"","Not knowing how to make hot water pretty much confirmed that, didn’t it?","She had no choice but to teach him: \"First, do this, then this. But what do you need the hot water for? I can set the temperature for you.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"It’s for Qiao Chuchu. She has a fever and needs to drink more hot water.\"","Little Xie: \"?\"","Was someone else competing with her over hot water too?","Finally, Weisheng Lin adjusted the temperature and stood back, satisfied.","Little Xie pinched the bridge of her nose.","Fine, she’d go get some flowers instead.","She entered the greenhouse and heard three familiar voices.","Pei Buxian sneered: \"This is hilarious. With your taste, even if you tried to make a flower arrangement for a funeral, no one would buy it. And you want to give her flowers?\"","Pei Ci leaned in, grinning: \"Pei Buxian, do you know why Mom named you ‘Buxian’? It’s because you’re the youngest, and she wanted you not to envy your older brothers’ resources—or their sense of style.\"","Pei Buxian shot him a look: \"I’d have to be blind to envy you.\"","He proudly picked up a bouquet of soft pink tulips: \"See these? My flowers will be the centerpiece. You two should just give up and not embarrass yourselves.\"","Pei Mu scoffed: \"Buxian, we’re your older brothers. Can’t you show a little respect?\"","Pei Buxian feigned innocence: \"What do you mean? I’m reminding you both as your brother. Since I’m giving her flowers, you two should just forget it. Why not put a couple of clowns by her bedside? They’d look just like you.\"","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","The two exchanged a glance, then grabbed Pei Buxian and lifted him off the ground!","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Little Xie closed the greenhouse door, feeling utterly bewildered: \"Why does the atmosphere between them feel so strange lately? It’s like watching a reverse harem drama!\"","She shook her head quickly.","The hot water task was taken, the porridge task was taken, and now even the flowers were claimed.","Her only option was to personally take care of Qiao Chuchu. That would show her sincerity.","Little Xie went upstairs and gently pushed open the door to Qiao Chuchu’s room.","The light from the hallway spilled into the dimly lit room.","The air was filled with the faint scent of shampoo and body wash.","She peeked inside and saw a group of handsome men sitting around—some by the bed, others at the desk or on the sofa. They were dressed in comfortable loungewear, some with laptops on their knees, others simply sitting quietly.","They all seemed to have just showered, their casual appearance adding to their charm.","As Little Xie opened the door, they all turned to look at her.","...","There was no room for her here!","Little Xie instinctively wanted to leave, but after a moment’s hesitation, she steeled herself and said, \"Gentlemen, maybe I should take over? You’ve been up all night, and there’s a flu going around. Qiao Chuchu probably caught it, and if you stay here too long, you might get sick too.\"","Pei Youchuan waved her off: \"We’re all strong and healthy. We’re not that easy to infect. Don’t worry about it; we’ll take care of her.\"","Little Xie: \"...Alright.\"","She closed the door dejectedly, pouting and on the verge of tears.","How could this be happening?","She couldn’t even get a chance to earn some goodwill!","Pei Che, watching the closed door, said calmly, \"Little Xie has a point. There’s been a lot of viral flu lately, and many people are getting fevers.\"","He glanced at the group of men crowded in the room: \"Maybe you should all leave. It’s safer that way.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan looked up from behind his laptop: \"Mr. Pei, are you worried about us getting sick, or are we just in your way?\"","Pei Che: \"...?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan adjusted his glasses and smiled gently: \"If you want some alone time, just say so. I’ll leave and give you two some space.\""]},{"number":227,"title":"Chapter 227: People in love will always play tricks, won't they","paragraphs":["Pei Che's deep eyes glinted with a cold intensity as he stared at him without speaking.","Qiao Chuchu struggled to get up from the bed and managed to stand. Pei Che quickly reached out to support her: \"You're awake? Do you need to use the bathroom?\"","Qiao Chuchu pushed him away, staggering into the bathroom and locking the door behind her.","When she came out, a crowd had gathered at the door.","They were all dressed in their casual home clothes, looking at her with concern, as if they had been living together all along. In unison, they asked, \"How are you feeling? Any better?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She felt as though her fever had addled her brain, making her reactions slow. She stared at them for a while, unable to recall what she was supposed to do. The only thought that crossed her mind was—","【There are so many people here.】","They exchanged glances, their worry deepening.","Pei Youchuan poked his head forward: \"Did the fever fry your brain?\"","Weisheng Biehe elbowed him: \"If you don’t know how to talk, just don’t.\"","Qiao Chuchu, feeling dizzy and heavy-headed, returned to the sink and began to wash up.","Pei Fengnong pushed through the crowd: \"Let me adjust the water for you.\"","He adjusted the water temperature, motioning for Qiao Chuchu to wash, and stood by with the facial cleanser.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t have the energy to move much, so she went along with the help.","Pei Youchuan stood beside her, handing her the cleanser, then used a towel to wipe her face, and finally passed her the toothbrush, assisting her every step of the way.","Although Pei Fengnong was careful, his touch was still a bit rough, leaving Qiao Chuchu feeling like a calf that had been licked by a cow, her cheeks being tugged this way and that.","Feeling slightly more awake, she swayed back toward the bed: \"You all can leave now. I want to be alone.\"","【These guys are so tall and talkative. It feels like my room is filled with talking refrigerators. It’s too crowded.】","They: \"?\"","Are they refrigerators?","Pei Che washed his hands and stopped her: \"Open your mouth, let me see.\"","Exhausted, she opened her mouth.","Pei Che turned on his phone flashlight: \"Say 'ah.'\"","Qiao Chuchu weakly complied: \"Ahhhhh—\"","Pei Che leaned in, carefully examining her throat, his brow furrowed.","Her throat was severely inflamed.","As he continued to look, his expression suddenly changed.","Qiao Chuchu, noticing his reaction, kept her mouth open: \"Ahhh? Ahhhhhhhhh?\"","What’s wrong? Is her throat in bad shape?","Pei Che didn’t answer, his eyes growing more complex and somber, his chest rising and falling slightly.","He reached out: \"Don’t move. I can’t see clearly.\"","His slender, pale fingers entered her mouth, one at first, then two, pressing down on her tongue.","The others: \"?\"","Pei Che licked his lips and withdrew his hand: \"The inflammation is severe. If the fever doesn’t break by today, we’ll have to go to the hospital.\"","Qiao Chuchu pushed him away irritably: \"Got it.\"","She walked out of the crowd, climbed back into bed, and went back to sleep.","Pei Che, with his hands behind his back, rubbed his fingers together for a moment, then turned to leave the bathroom.","Weisheng Wenzhan, however, pushed him back: \"Wait, don’t leave yet.\"","Wenzhan stepped forward first, and the others, with suspicious looks, surrounded him, blocking the bathroom door.","Weisheng Biehe closed the door behind them.","Pei Che raised an eyebrow, calmly scanning each of their faces: \"What? Is there a problem?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan lowered his voice: \"Your actions just now were a bit off, don’t you think?\"","\"What’s off about it?\" Pei Che’s expression remained unreadable, as if he had no idea what they were talking about. \"I was checking her throat. Did I do something wrong?\"","Pei Youchuan scoffed, cutting straight to the point: \"Second Brother, don’t lie. You pressed her tongue with your fingers? Do you do that with all your patients?\"","Pei Che replied with confidence: \"I washed my hands.\"","Pei Fengnong’s face darkened: \"Second Brother, this isn’t about washing your hands.\"","Pei Youchuan added: \"Exactly! Even the idiot Fourth Brother figured it out. You were just being inappropriate!\"","Pei Fengnong: \"? Who are you calling an idiot?\"","Weisheng Biehe, twirling his prayer beads, gave a sinister smile: \"Mr. Pei Che, it seems like you’re the most cunning one in the Pei family.\"","Pei Che, now surrounded, remained calm.","He said nonchalantly, \"I think you’re all just jealous. After all, the Weisheng family has no room for mistakes. One misstep, and you’ll end up like Weisheng Huailing, earning my sister’s dislike.\"","Biehe frowned: \"What does Huailing have to do with this?\"","Pei Che sneered: \"Oh, you don’t know? It seems Weisheng Yucan didn’t tell you. Huailing kissed Qiao Chuchu today, and we haven’t settled that score yet.\"","Pei Youchuan and Pei Fengnong, successfully distracted, joined forces: \"Yeah, how do you manage your brother?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan’s brow furrowed: \"...\"","Weisheng Biehe’s expression cracked for the first time: \"That kid kissed Qiao Chuchu? Was it a deep kiss or a peck? How long did it last?\"","Pei Youchuan, furious at the mention, snapped: \"How would we know? He didn’t kiss me! I just want to know how he had the audacity to kiss Qiao Chuchu. I haven’t even kissed her yet!\"","Pei Fengnong hissed in a low voice: \"Keep it down. Qiao Chuchu can hear you, and why are you saying your true feelings out loud?\"","Weisheng Biehe’s face darkened with anger: \"I never expected that kid would be crazy enough to force a kiss!\"","Pei Che stood a few steps away, watching them argue in hushed tones, his fingers still lightly rubbing together.","The soft, warm sensation lingered.","A faint smile threatened to appear on his lips, but he quickly suppressed it, adopting a stern expression: \"Gentlemen of the Weisheng family, your brother has offended my sister. Don’t you think you owe us an explanation?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan, his face grim, saw right through his ploy: \"You really found a good excuse to divert attention, didn’t you?\"","Pei Che smiled, like a cunning fox, and raised an eyebrow challengingly: \"I’m just a brother trying to seek justice for his sister. What’s wrong with that?\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced toward the bathroom.","Shadows of people moved inside.","They were whispering about something.","Her head was pounding, and her throat felt like she had swallowed razor blades. She couldn’t sleep peacefully.","She desperately wanted water but didn’t have the strength to call for anyone.","Weisheng Lin pushed the door open, carrying a thermos: \"Huh? Where did everyone go?\"","His eyes then fell on Qiao Chuchu, who was rolling around in bed.","Qiao Chuchu was wearing a geometric-patterned pajama set reminiscent of Crayon Shin-chan, lying twisted on the bed like a limp snake.","He brought the water to her side: \"Are you awake?\"","Her eyes lit up at the sight of the cup: \"Is it cold water?\"","Weisheng Lin shook his head: \"Warm water. I set it to 60 degrees. Do you want some?\"","Her interest waned: \"Thanks, I’ll just have a sip.\"","Weisheng Lin could sense her disappointment. He poured the water and handed it to her: \"Do you really dislike drinking hot water that much?\"","Qiao Chuchu took a sip, soothing her throat: \"My throat feels so hot. Drinking hot water just makes it worse.\"","She set the cup down and sneaked a glance toward the bathroom, whispering hoarsely: \"Can you ask Xiao Xie to bring me some cold water? I’ll drink more, and they won’t notice.\"","\"No, they said you can’t drink cold water when you’re sick.\" Weisheng Lin glanced around cautiously, making sure no one was listening, and explained: \"I mentioned giving you cold water yesterday, and they gave me the cold shoulder for hours. That’s why I brought you hot water.\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed, taking a few sips: \"Thank you. Sorry for the trouble.\"","Weisheng Lin frowned, sensing her low spirits.","Qiao Chuchu lay back down, ready to rest.","Someone gently tapped her shoulder.","She opened her eyes to see Weisheng Lin holding a bottle of mineral water, glancing nervously toward the door: \"Drink this quickly. I haven’t touched it yet.\""]},{"number":228,"title":"Chapter 228: Qiao Chuchu: I Think I've Gone Mad with Fever, Might as Well Let It Consume Me","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's eyes lit up, and she quickly grabbed the water bottle, gulping down several mouthfuls!","Weisheng Lin was surprised, feeling as if she had been thirsty for days. He teased, \"Is it that good?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, finally quenching her thirst. Not daring to speak loudly, she simply gave him a thumbs-up: \"Absolutely amazing!\"","Weisheng Lin looked at her smiling face and couldn't help but curve his lips slightly.","Suddenly, the room door was pushed open!","He snatched the water bottle from Qiao Chuchu's hand!","Shen Zhuoyan walked in, noticing the awkwardness between them: \"What were you two doing just now?\"","Weisheng Lin glanced at him arrogantly: \"Nothing.\"","Shen Zhuoyan's face darkened as he grabbed the water bottle from Weisheng Lin: \"Did you give her cold water to drink?\"","\"Of course not,\" Weisheng Lin retorted, snatching the bottle back. \"She didn’t want cold water. This is for me.\"","\"Good,\" Shen Zhuoyan said sternly, pushing him aside. \"She had a fever twice last night and is still running a low-grade fever now. She’s just starting to recover, so we need to be extra careful with her care.\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at him blankly: \"Tell me the truth, Shen Zhuoyan. Am I really going to die? Is that why you’re all still here, waiting to carry me out?\"","\"Don’t talk nonsense,\" Shen Zhuoyan chided her, tucking her blanket in gently. \"You just have a cold.\"","She groaned, holding her head: \"I need peace and quiet when I’m sick. There are way too many people here.\"","Shen Zhuoyan looked around, confused: \"There are only two of us here. If you don’t like me talking, I’ll stop.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Is it about the talking?","It’s about the sheer number of people crammed in here!","Even if her room were bigger, it couldn’t accommodate a bunch of human statues, could it?","Qiao Chuchu sighed: \"I really miss the days when people thought I was a weirdo. Back then, no one cared if I fainted.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","Both of them felt a pang of pity and leaned down to comfort her: \"Don’t worry, those hard days are over.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes were lifeless: \"No, those were my happy days.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","She waved her hand weakly: \"I’m tired. Could you two please leave? This illness is contagious.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"It’s fine. We won’t talk.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Just let the fever take her. Let it burn her to ashes.","She lay on the bed, turning her back to them in silence.","Weisheng Lin sensed her mood and pulled Shen Zhuoyan aside: \"Come with me.\"","He led him to the bathroom, but as soon as they opened the door, everyone inside turned to look at them.","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","Weisheng Lin was momentarily stunned. After entering the bathroom and closing the door, he asked, \"Are you all... waiting in line for the toilet?\"","They: \"...?\"","Pei Buxian cheerfully walked into Qiao Chuchu’s room, holding a bouquet: \"Is Chuchu awake?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Here we go again.","She propped herself up and saw Pei Buxian approaching with flowers, a West Highland Terrier trotting at his feet.","Finally, it wasn’t just people!","She brightened up: \"The Westie!\"","The Westie jumped onto the bed, settling into her arms, wagging its tail happily. Its round, black eyes were full of affection.","Pei Buxian picked up the Westie and scolded it sternly: \"Mommy has a fever. Don’t disturb her.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Mommy?\"","Pei Buxian looked at her: \"Yes, Mommy.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...If I’m Mommy, what does that make you?\"","Pei Buxian put the dog down and handed her the flowers, chuckling: \"I’m Daddy, of course. Can’t you figure that out?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s headache worsened: \"We can’t call each other Mommy and Daddy.\"","\"Why not?\"","Pei Buxian sat on her bed, counting on his fingers: \"Big Brother is First Daddy, Second Brother is Second Daddy, Third Brother is Third Daddy, and so on. I’m Seventh Daddy, and you’re Eighth Mommy.\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at him in shock: \"Is that how the family hierarchy works? Shouldn’t I be its aunt?\"","Pei Buxian looked at her as if she were stupid: \"You must be delirious from the fever. We’re following the family order. I’m Seventh Daddy, and you’re the only girl in our family, so you’re Eighth Mommy. What’s so hard to understand?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","She clutched her head: \"Stop talking. I need to think.\"","Pei Buxian grabbed her hand to stop her from pulling her hair: \"Don’t think. I just Googled it, and it says you might have COVID again. You probably have brain fog and can’t think straight.\"","Qiao Chuchu muttered to herself: \"How can your dog call me Mommy? Shouldn’t I have given birth to it for that to happen?\"","Pei Buxian sighed: \"You’re definitely delirious. The most a human can give birth to is something worse than an animal, not a dog.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Buxian took the tulip from her hands and presented it to her again: \"Here, look at my flowers. Aren’t they pretty?\"","The flowers were delicate and charming.","She nodded: \"They’re beautiful.\"","He smiled, his eyes curving as he leaned closer: \"Do you want to put them by your bedside?\"","\"Sure,\" Qiao Chuchu agreed readily. \"Just put them here.\"","Pei Buxian smiled contentedly, then tentatively asked, \"What if someone else gives you flowers too?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Then I’ll put them all together.\"","Pei Buxian’s face darkened, his tone turning demanding: \"No! Your bedside is only for my flowers! If anyone else gives you flowers, throw them in the trash!\"","Qiao Chuchu pinched the bridge of her nose helplessly: \"That’s rude, Seventh Brother. Don’t be childish.\"","Pei Buxian suddenly looked hurt: \"Am I not special to you?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","His brows furrowed slightly, as if in emotional pain, his eyes clouded with confusion: \"If you gave me flowers, I’d treasure them. But when I give you flowers, you want to mix them with others’? Don’t I deserve to be treated specially?\"","Qiao Chuchu thought he was overreacting: \"I’ve given you flowers before. I don’t see you treasuring them.\"","\"Just because you didn’t see it doesn’t mean I didn’t,\" Pei Buxian said, sitting on her bed and staring into her eyes. \"What if I showed you the flowers you gave me?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Buxian continued: \"Ever since you started earning money, you’ve given me flowers every year for eleven years. The most beautiful flower from each year, I’ve dried and preserved in resin.\"","His expression was serious, his dark eyes reflecting her stunned face. His hands clenched into fists: \"Do my flowers deserve a special place now?\"","Qiao Chuchu shivered and quickly placed the flowers by her bedside: \"I swear they’ll stay right here!\"","Pei Buxian’s gloomy expression instantly brightened. He pressed his cheek against hers: \"Seventh Brother knew you’d be the best! You wouldn’t make Seventh Brother upset!~ Seventh Brother loves you so much!~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","He stood up, beaming: \"Later, when Pei Mu and Pei Ci come, just toss their flowers out the window!~ I’m going to wash my hands now!~\"","Qiao Chuchu watched him head to the bathroom, feeling a chill run down her spine. She pulled the blanket over herself, feeling even colder.","Pei Buxian happily pushed open the bathroom door, but his smile froze as soon as he entered.","The bathroom was packed with people.","They all turned to look at him, their eyes narrowing slightly in displeasure.","Only Weisheng Lin smiled: \"Are there more coming?\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the lively voices of Pei Mu and Pei Ci echoed from outside—","\"Chuchu, we’re here!~\""]},{"number":229,"title":"Chapter 229: The Strange Twins","paragraphs":["Pei Youchuan couldn't take it anymore: \"I can't stand this anymore, I need to get out! We can deal with Weisheng Huailing and Chuchu's situation later! I don't want another man walking in here, giving them more time alone!\"","Pei Buxian blocked the doorway, eavesdropping with a sly grin: \"No way. Earlier in the greenhouse, I had a fight with Pei Mu and Pei Ci. Those two are definitely talking trash about me. I need to hear what they're saying!\"","Besides, he wanted to see if Qiao Chuchu had followed through on their agreement and thrown out the flowers he had given her!","He glared suspiciously at the people behind him: \"You all go do whatever you need to do. Don’t mess up my plan!\"","The others: \"...\"","Inside the room, Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Mu and Pei Ci as they burst into her room.","The two of them were dressed in black and white shirts, both paired with jeans.","Pei Mu wore a white shirt, jeans, and white sneakers.","Pei Ci was in a black shirt, jeans, and a pair of ankle boots.","Each of them carried a plate—one with strawberries, the other with sliced cantaloupe. They slithered over to Qiao Chuchu's bedside in unison: \"Good morning, little sister.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt like she had been drained of half her life force. Every part of her ached terribly.","These healthy people were like energy-sucking demons.","She was being completely drained.","Qiao Chuchu sighed: \"What now?\"","Pei Ci sat on her right, his voice low and deep: \"When you're sick, you don’t have much of an appetite, but you like fruit, right? Your brothers just washed some for you.\"","Pei Mu's voice was softer as he sat on her left: \"Now we’re here to feed you some fruit, help you stay hydrated, and get some nutrients.\"","Her head was pounding: \"The best nutrient for me would be you two shutting up and leaving. You’re so loud when you’re together.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci exchanged a glance, speaking in unison: \"How can you say that? We’re not loud at all when we talk!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","They were being loud right now.","Pei Mu glanced at the tulips on the bedside table: \"Did Pei Buxian just drop off flowers and leave?\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t be bothered to think about it: \"I don’t know, and I don’t care. Just leave already and give me some peace.\"","Pei Ci didn’t say anything, scanning the room for any hiding spots.","The bathroom door moved slightly.","Pei Ci raised an eyebrow.","Aha.","He walked over to the bathroom, shut the door, and locked it with a key he pulled out of his pocket.","Who would’ve thought he carried a key to Qiao Chuchu’s bathroom with him at all times?","Pei Buxian: \"?!\"","The others: \"?\"","Pei Ci happily pocketed the key, sat back down on Qiao Chuchu’s bed, and wrapped an arm around her from behind, covering her eyes with his hand: \"You dare refuse your brother’s heartfelt gesture?\"","Qiao Chuchu shivered at his closeness: \"...You two know I have a fever, right?\"","Pei Ci leaned closer to her cheek: \"Yes, you’re burning up.\"","Pei Mu leaned in from the other side: \"Yeah, really hot.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes were covered, so she couldn’t see anything around her.","She was used to it.","Back when they were on good terms, they always liked covering her eyes.","It was their strange little quirk.","Her voice was flat and unyielding: \"I don’t want to deal with this. I just want to sleep.\"","Pei Mu picked up a fork and held a piece of cantaloupe to her lips: \"Just a little bite to soothe your throat, and then we’ll let you sleep.\"","Pei Ci kept his hand over her eyes.","Pei Mu brought the cantaloupe to her mouth.","The cool, refreshing taste spread across her tongue.","She felt a bit better.","Pei Mu’s amused voice echoed in her ear: \"Is it good?\"","She nodded: \"Yes.\"","Pei Ci’s voice was slightly hoarse as he still covered her eyes: \"Our Chuchu loves fruit, doesn’t she?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt herself getting drowsy again.","Pei Ci’s deep voice murmured in her ear: \"Right?\"","She responded sluggishly: \"Right.\"","Pei Ci held a strawberry to her lips: \"Here, eat the tip of the strawberry.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What’s with the strawberry tip?\"","She opened her mouth wide and devoured the entire strawberry in one bite.","Pei Ci’s fingers brushed against her lips, and his smile widened. He handed her another one: \"Here, have another.\"","She turned her head away.","A piece of cantaloupe was promptly offered instead.","Pei Mu coaxed her: \"Eat this.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave up and lay back down: \"No more. I’m full.\"","The two of them didn’t push her further, tucking her in: \"How are you feeling now?\"","She felt much better: \"Thank you. You can eat the fruit, but don’t use the same fork as me. That’s gross.\"","Pei Mu twirled the fork in his hand, his tone affectionate: \"I don’t think it’s gross. I think it shows how close we are.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes snapped open, and she snatched the fork from his hand, tossing it straight into the trash!","Her expression was stern: \"*I* think it’s gross.\"","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","She added with disdain: \"You two can be weird, but don’t be disgusting.\"","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu flopped back onto the bed, exhausted: \"You two should leave. I probably have COVID, and it spreads fast. Stay away from me, and don’t come showing off in front of me. If you get a fever, I’m not taking care of you.\"","Pei Ci scoffed: \"If we were going to catch it, we would’ve already. Why wait until now?\"","Pei Mu propped his chin on his hand, smiling at her: \"Do you think our fruit is better than Pei Buxian’s flowers?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Buxian pressed his ear against the door, his nerves on edge: \"I knew these two were targeting me! They can’t compete with my flowers, so they resort to fruit! What does the sweetness of fruit have to do with them?!\"","The others: \"...\"","Shen Zhuoyan couldn’t take it anymore: \"Can we just kick the door down?\"","Pei Buxian glared at him: \"No! I need to see who she’ll choose! It’s just some fruit. My flowers were carefully selected and arranged early this morning. I already talked to Qiao Chuchu about it! She said she’d treasure my flowers!\"","\"...\" Shen Zhuoyan looked at Pei Che in disbelief: \"Do you all usually act like this?\"","Pei Che glanced at him calmly: \"Yes. I hope you don’t get dragged into this mess.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Inside the room, Pei Mu leaned lazily on the bed, resting his head on his hand, and spoke gently to Qiao Chuchu: \"Flowers are all show and no substance. Fruit is much more refreshing, don’t you think?\"","Qiao Chuchu grew wary: \"Why are you comparing yourselves to Pei Buxian? You know he’s a bit unhinged, right?\"","Pei Mu patted her arm, his tone light: \"Just asking. We’re his older brothers. We wouldn’t bully him, would we?\"","Pei Ci lay on the other side, arms crossed behind his head, completely at ease: \"It’s fine, Chuchu. Even though we’re not related by blood, Buxian is our younger brother. Blood is thicker than water.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s headache worsened, and she cut straight to the point: \"Buxian’s better.\"","A strange, excited noise that sounded a lot like Pei Buxian came from the bathroom: \"Whoo!\""]},{"number":230,"title":"Chapter 230: Pei Yuan's Promise","paragraphs":["Pei Mu and Pei Ci’s expressions darkened as they propped themselves up, glaring at her with a hint of resentment. “Are our fruits inferior to his?”","Qiao Chuchu glanced toward the bathroom and whispered, “Pei Buxian’s mental state isn’t great. He’s moody and prone to anger. Just let him be.”","After all, ever since Pei’s mother passed away, they had all been bullied. Pei Buxian had been beaten daily since he was eleven, and because he looked somewhat feminine, he had endured countless verbal insults.","She didn’t want to provoke him, so she gestured for the two to come closer. “Just give him a break. In my eyes, your gifts are equally good. I can’t choose between them.”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci were taken aback but quickly leaned back down beside her, complying with her request. “Hmph, you’re such a master at playing it safe,” they teased.","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow. “Oh? If I sent you both gifts with my friends, would you be able to tell which one’s better?”","“Of course,” Pei Ci said with a smile. “Your gift is always the best, no question.”","Qiao Chuchu pouted. “What if I sent you a giant cockroach?”","Without hesitation, Pei Ci and Pei Mu replied in unison, “That would still be great!”","She burst out laughing. “Hah, you’re just saying that. I know you two are terrified of bugs.”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci gazed at her triumphant smile and couldn’t help but laugh along. Their eyes softened with a tenderness like spring water, and they reached out to poke dimples into her cheeks, one on each side. “Even if you sent us bugs, no matter how scared we are, we’d still accept them with a smile.”","Qiao Chuchu was surprised.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci exchanged a glance, then leaned in closer to her ear. “But while we’re grateful, we’d also sneak more cockroaches into your closet.”","Qiao Chuchu blinked. “What?”","She kicked them. “Get out of here!”","The two burst into laughter, completely unfazed by her kicks, and settled down by her pillow.","Qiao Chuchu wrinkled her nose in disgust, while Pei Mu and Pei Ci wore content smiles.","Pei Buxian, who had been locked in the bathroom, was probably fuming by now, listening to their whispers.","The two exchanged another glance. “Let’s go to the bathroom!”","Qiao Chuchu frowned. “What? You two go to the bathroom together now?”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci replied in unison, “Yeah~ We’re just that inseparable~”","Qiao Chuchu grimaced. “Ew.”","Pei Ci grabbed the key, opened the door, and pushed his way in, only to come face-to-face with Pei Buxian.","He shoved him further into the bathroom, lowering his voice smugly. “Pei Buxian, didn’t expect us to know you were here, huh? I said all that on purpose. How’s it feel? Pretty mad, right?”","Pei Buxian remained expressionless, though a hint of amusement flickered in his eyes as he silently watched them.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci suddenly felt something was off and turned to look around.","Dozens of sharp eyes were glaring at them.","The spacious bathroom was packed with people!","The two froze.","Pei Che stood in the center and spoke softly, “Close the door. Let’s have a proper chat.”","Pei Mu: “...”","Pei Ci: “...”","Damn it!","---","Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt something was amiss.","Wait.","Hadn’t the people who entered her bathroom not come out yet? She hadn’t seen any of them leave.","It was as if they had been swallowed into some unknown dimension, with no sign of movement since.","Or maybe she was just delirious from her fever and hadn’t noticed them leaving.","Qiao Chuchu wobbled out of bed and made her way to the bathroom. Just as she was about to open the door, Pei Yuan walked in, carrying a tray.","“You’re awake?” he asked.","She looked surprised. “Big brother?”","Pei Yuan set the tray on the table and walked over to her. “Need to use the bathroom?”","Qiao Chuchu shook her head. “No.”","Pei Yuan helped her back to bed. “Then rest. I made you some sweet porridge with red beans, black glutinous rice, and red dates—all good for replenishing your energy.”","She didn’t have much of an appetite and felt guilty. “I might not be able to eat much.”","“I understand. Just eat what you can,” Pei Yuan said, picking up the bowl of porridge. “Here.”","She turned her head away. “I can feed myself.”","Pei Yuan paused, his expression calm but his tone gentle. “Let me feed you.”","Qiao Chuchu reached out. “I can do it.”","He dodged her hand, placing the bowl on the nightstand, and asked softly, “Don’t you like your big brother anymore, Xiao Ba?”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","Seeing him like this reminded her of when she had just entered adolescence. Back then, the system had forced her to complete tasks, and she had struggled to accept it, often hiding away.","At that time, Pei Yuan had taken on the role of the family patriarch, bringing her into his study and asking gently, “Why do you always avoid me, Xiao Ba? Don’t you like your big brother anymore?”","She snapped out of her memories and explained slowly, “My hands aren’t broken. I can feed myself. This has nothing to do with whether I like you or not.”","“But I want to feed you,” he said, holding her hand. His dark eyes seemed to pull her into his world. “If you don’t like me anymore, that’s fine. Just tell me. I won’t force you. You can eat by yourself.”","Qiao Chuchu frowned. “Isn’t this emotional blackmail?”","“I’m not blackmailing you,” Pei Yuan said, gripping her wrist and locking eyes with her.","He was gentle, yet stubborn.","“I’m asking you now. I want to feed you. I want to take care of you. Are you willing or not? If you’re not, just say so. I won’t be angry. Really, I won’t.”","She struggled for a moment, then glanced at his fingertips, which were red from holding the hot bowl.","She sighed silently.","Big brother was always like this.","He was strict with the other brothers, but with her, he used nothing but soft tactics.","He would ask her seemingly harmless questions, but in reality, he was using his gentleness to corner her, to make her comply.","She could refuse.","But she knew that if she did, he would simply leave, just as he said, without showing any anger.","He would just sit alone, quietly, leaving her with a desolate image of his back.","It was like a dull knife—not sharp enough to hurt, but enough to make her uncomfortable.","Pei Yuan seemed easygoing, but deep down, he was a relentless “mother figure.”","Qiao Chuchu sighed.","People always said the Wei family had their share of oddballs.","But didn’t her own family have seven of them?","She finally nodded. “Thank you, big brother.”","The gloom in Pei Yuan’s eyes instantly lifted, like the moon breaking through dark clouds. “Don’t thank me. I should be thanking you. I thought we’d grown distant.”","He picked up the porridge and brought it to her lips. “I made this in a pressure cooker. How is it? Have I lost my touch?”","The sweet, sticky flavor of the porridge spread in her mouth.","She nodded. “Big brother’s cooking is the best.”","Pei Yuan chuckled. “It’s been a while since I made porridge for you. I still remember the first bowl you taught me to make. After I learned, I never let you cook again.”","Qiao Chuchu shrugged. “True. You never liked me doing housework.”","Pei Yuan scooped another spoonful and brought it to her mouth. “Because I felt that, as your big brother, I failed to protect you and let you suffer. I couldn’t let you bear any more burdens.”","She disagreed. “I didn’t suffer.”","Pei Yuan wiped the corner of her mouth with a tissue, his gaze profound. “No, you did.”","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled.","Pei Yuan continued feeding her. “Chuchu.”","“Hmm?”","He held the spoon to her lips and said calmly, “No matter what happens, your big brother will always care about you the most. As long as you don’t leave, I’ll be fine with anything.”","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, unsure what he meant.","Pei Yuan smiled at her. “Let’s just keep living like this, the eight of us together. Don’t get married. Don’t fall for anyone else. Okay?”","That’s it?","Qiao Chuchu answered without hesitation. “Sure. I wasn’t planning to get married anyway.”","Pei Yuan’s eyes lit up. “Promise?”","She patted her chest confidently. “Promise!”","Pei Yuan’s smile widened, genuine and bright, like the first thaw of spring. “From now on, I’ll only spend money on you. My inheritance will all be yours too. Don’t worry, I won’t let you lose out.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...No need for the inheritance. If you have kids in the future, it should go to them.”","“I won’t have kids,” Pei Yuan said with a smile.","His affection was almost overflowing, a mix of brotherly tenderness and a man’s possessiveness. He pinched her cheek lovingly. “Because my Chuchu is just too good.”"]},{"number":231,"title":"Chapter 231: As Expected of the Qiao Chuchu He Personally Raised","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She didn't know what to say, only asking in confusion, \"What does me being fine have to do with you having children or not?\"","Pei Yuan smiled meaningfully, picking up the porridge and saying, \"Come on, open your mouth.\"","She was truly exhausted and waved her hand, \"I’ve already said so much to them earlier. Brother, I want to sleep now.\"","Pei Yuan didn’t force her to finish the porridge. Instead, he helped her lie back down and gently touched her forehead. \"It seems like you might be getting a fever again. Sleep well.\"","She lazily hummed in agreement, closing her eyes with a sigh.","*Although Big Brother can be quite troublesome at times, he’s really good at taking care of people. Being by his side always feels as comforting as being with Mother Pei.*","Pei Yuan’s smile deepened as he tucked the blanket around her and softly brushed her cheek with the back of his fingers.","The bathroom door opened.","Pei Che walked out at the front, his face cold and frosty, glaring at Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan, as if he had anticipated this, calmly looked up, still wearing his warm, gentle smile.","The others who followed weren’t as cheerful. They all wore dark expressions, each harboring their own thoughts as they stared at him.","Pei Yuan seemed to be provoking them, his gaze sweeping over each of them before landing on Qiao Chuchu. \"Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu was breathing evenly, already fast asleep.","Relieved, he lowered his voice, \"As expected of the Chuchu I’ve raised so carefully since she was young. She’s perfect in every way, and I’m just as perfect for her. You all can sense that, right?\"","They scoffed, \"We don’t sense anything.\"","Pei Yuan chuckled lightly, \"It’s enough that I can sense it. Whether you do or not doesn’t matter.\"","He gently caressed Qiao Chuchu’s cheek, \"I just want her to get better soon and not fall ill again.\"","The others exchanged glances, each lost in their own thoughts.","Weisheng Biehe turned to Pei Che, \"I take back what I said earlier about you being the most scheming. Clearly, your brother is the real mastermind.\"","Pei Che gritted his teeth, \"Why do you think he’s the eldest brother?\"","Pei Yuan heard this but pretended not to, simply smiling faintly.","In her drowsy state, Qiao Chuchu had a dream.","She dreamed that her high fever had subsided, and while recuperating at home, she received a call from Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan invited her out.","She bluntly refused, but accidentally slipped and fell. Coincidentally, the pencil tangled in her hair fell and pierced her eye.","She died and came back to life.","Her lives decreased from 3 to 2.","She returned to the moment before Ji Yanchuan invited her out again.","This time, she answered Ji Yanchuan’s call, removed the pencil from her hair, and threw it into the trash. She walked out of her room and down the stairs, firmly rejecting him once more.","But as soon as she finished speaking, she fell down the stairs, broke her spine, and died again.","Her lives went from 2 to 1.","Once again, she returned to the moment before Ji Yanchuan invited her out.","This time, she did nothing, sitting on the couch in her room as she answered the call, still refusing him.","But the moment she finished speaking, the chandelier above her head fell and struck her!","As luck would have it, a shard of glass pierced her skull.","She died once more.","Her lives went from 1 to 0.","She was down to her last life.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly woke up, sitting in bed and gasping for air.","Her entire body was cold and clammy, and even though she was wrapped in a warm blanket, she couldn’t stop shivering.","What was this?","A prophetic dream?","If Ji Yanchuan really did invite her out and she refused, would she die?!","Why? The protagonist's luck was like an invincibility charm for Xia Xuechun, but for her, it was a forced pairing with Ji Yanchuan. If she refused, would the world just erase her?!","Still shaken, Qiao Chuchu picked up her phone.","It was 10 PM.","There were several messages on WeChat.","Weisheng Huailing: *\"Sister, why aren’t you talking to me? Do you think I’m illiterate?\"*","Lou Tingsi: *\"I heard you have a fever. I’ll come see you as soon as I return to the country. I’m busy right now, so don’t be mad at me.\"*","Lou Yuejue: *\"Sister, you have a fever?! I’m abroad for a competition right now, but once I win the championship, I’ll give you my trophy! You have to get better soon!\"*","Weisheng Yucan: *\"Wen Zhan told me you have a fever. I had to rush abroad for work, so I won’t be able to see you for a while. But I’ve ordered some new spring collections from top brands for you. They’ll be delivered tomorrow around 10 AM. Don’t be mad at me~\"*","Lin Qing: *\"You have a fever? Is it serious? Did you catch COVID? I’ll come see you with my brother once I finish work!\"*","Lin Shen: *\"How are you? How’s your mental and physical state?\"*","Ying Chen: *\"I heard you have a fever? I’m not sure what to send you to help you recover, but I have two excellent bottles of wine—a 1945 Romanée-Conti and a 1947 Château Cheval Blanc. I’ll have someone deliver them to you tomorrow. Drink them, and I’ll come see you once I’m done with work.\"*","After replying to each of them, she opened two new friend requests.","Shi Yu’s friend request: *\"I took the liberty of finding your WeChat, Miss Qiao. It’s fine if you don’t think highly of me now, but in the future, we can help each other. After all, I’m the only one in this world who has awakened. Don’t you agree?\"*","She chose to accept.","The other friend request was from Ji Yanchuan.","*\"I had my assistant find your WeChat. How are you? Did you manage to escape with that white-haired guy? I was in a hurry earlier and didn’t have time to explain. The reason I didn’t bring him was because he wanted to kill me! If his gun hadn’t jammed, I’d be dead!\"*","Qiao Chuchu sneered, about to reject him.","But just as her finger hovered over the \"Reject\" button, the room suddenly vibrated twice.","It felt like a threat."]},{"number":232,"title":"Chapter 232: Qiao Chuchu is the Last Person in the World Who Can Lie","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's expression darkened, but she finally clicked \"Agree.\"","Ji Yanchuan, who had been waiting at home, heard a ding and immediately grabbed his phone.","It was a friend request notification.","He was thrilled: \"Qiao Chuchu, I knew you weren't dead!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't want to deal with him: \"What do you want?\"","Ji Yanchuan hissed, lying on his bed as he typed: \"I want to invite you out.\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"Not going.\"","As soon as she said that, the ceiling above her began to buzz and tremble!","Qiao Chuchu quickly withdrew the message!","The ceiling stopped shaking.","She was furious and yelled at the ceiling, \"You're just spoiling your precious chosen one, aren't you? Just wait until I survive to the end—I'll take him down! We'll see who has the last laugh!!\"","The room remained silent.","Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath, gritted her teeth, and typed: \"When and where?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"Three days from now. I'll pick you up. Where we're going is a surprise.\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered.","Fine.","She'd deal with it as it came.","The plot was forcing her like this, clearly wanting them to end up together.","But she wasn't going to give it that chance.","She picked up her phone and called Lin Qing, speaking earnestly: \"Lin Qing, there's something I need to tell you. Ji Yanchuan invited me out, and I have reasons I can't explain, so I have to agree. Can you promise not to be mad at me? I swear I won't get emotionally involved with him.\"","On the other end, Lin Qing was surprised. Before she could respond, she heard Qiao Chuchu's inner thoughts—","[Ugh, I hope Lin Qing won't be mad at me. If I don't agree, the world will force me to be erased. I only have three lives left, and there's still so much time until the end. I can't afford to gamble.]","[But how do I explain this? Ji Yanchuan is her ex-fiancé, someone she truly loved. Now I have to go on a date with him—it's so disgusting.]","Lin Qing was silent for a moment, then said sympathetically, \"It must be really hard for you to do something you don't want to do, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, not expecting her to think that way, and nodded tearfully: \"Yes, but I'm more afraid you'll misunderstand me.\"","\"I won't misunderstand you, Chuchu,\" Lin Qing said cheerfully. \"I would never let a man come between me and my sister.\"","She added gently, \"No matter what, when you go out with Ji Yanchuan, make sure to protect yourself.\"","Qiao Chuchu's nose tingled: \"Lin Qing, you're so kind.\"","[I was so scared Lin Qing would think I'm a scheming girl. Lin Qing is so good to me, waaah!]","Lin Qing felt a warmth in her heart but was still concerned. She then thought of something: \"But while I'm okay with it, your brothers might not be so easy to convince.\"","Qiao Chuchu was reminded: \"Oh right, so on the day I go out with Ji Yanchuan, can you cover for me? I can't let them know.\"","[I'm already disgusted enough being forced into this plot. I don't want my brothers to know I'm interacting with Ji Yanchuan.]","Lin Qing hissed: \"Alright... fine.\"","Though it might be tricky.","Because when Qiao Chuchu lies, her inner thoughts might slip out.","Who knows how they'll react if they hear them?","-","Three days later.","Qiao Chuchu was feeling much better.","Though her throat still felt like she'd swallowed razor blades and her body was still weak, not having a fever was a good sign.","She walked into the dining room and peeked inside.","All seven of her brothers were there.","The three Weisheng brothers were also present.","Shen Zhuoyan was standing by her seat, waiting for her to join them for breakfast.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Her brothers were one thing, but the Weisheng brothers—three of them—had been staying here for three whole days. Why were they still here?","And every day, they casually left her house to go to work, stopping by her room to check on her and say goodbye before heading out, then returning in the evening.","They had breakfast and dinner with her every day, as if they were determined to stay until she fully recovered.","What, was she some kind of fragile, endangered species?","Qiao Chuchu hesitated at the doorway.","It wasn't that she disliked having people stay at her house—after all, the house was huge, and everyone had their own private rooms, so it didn't affect their personal lives.","The main issue was that with so many people around, lying would be harder to pull off.","She lightly punched the wall.","[With so many people here, I'm afraid they'll see through my lie if I try to deceive them.]","[Maybe I should just talk to Pei Youchuan alone. He's not very sharp—he'd probably believe me right away.]","Everyone at the dining table paused, glancing subtly at Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Youchuan looked up, confused: \"?\"","Weisheng Biehe waved at her: \"Chuchu, why aren't you coming in? After staying here for days, are you suddenly feeling shy?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Why would I be shy about you staying at my house?\"","Weisheng Biehe propped his chin on his hand, lazily watching her: \"Then come over here.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned and reluctantly walked to the dining table.","She was going out with Ji Yanchuan, and to make sure she didn't lose face in front of others, she had put on light makeup and chosen a stylish outfit: a cropped leather jacket, high-waisted wide-leg jeans, and chunky sneakers.","She had considered dressing down to annoy Ji Yanchuan.","But Ji Yanchuan wasn't worth it. Why should she make herself look bad? Her appearance was her own pride, and making herself look bad would only embarrass herself.","So after some deliberation, she went with the most comfortable option.","Everyone at the table was struck by her appearance.","Since Qiao Chuchu had come down with a high fever four days and five nights ago, her face had been pale, and she had looked half-dead.","But today, her cheeks were rosy, her eyelashes long and delicate, and she looked radiant.","She was stunning.","Though she was always beautiful.","But this level of effort clearly wasn't for them.","Weisheng Wenzhan tapped the table with his fingertips, asking gently: \"Are you going out?\"","Qiao Chuchu sat down, forcing a natural smile: \"Yes.\"","\"With whom?\" Weisheng Wenzhan picked up his coffee, squinting at her: \"I'm heading to work after breakfast. If it's on the way, I can drop you off.\"","Qiao Chuchu waved her hand with a smile: \"I'm going out with Lin Qing. Our schedules don't match, so no need to trouble yourself.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded, not pressing further, but exchanged a meaningful glance with Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan looked at Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan received the silent cue and hissed: \"Wait, that's odd. I heard Lin Qing say she was going abroad for a business trip today. Did I get the date wrong?\"","Everyone turned to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Youchuan in surprise: \"That can't be. I confirmed with Lin Qing. You must have the wrong day.\"","She panicked internally.","[What’s going on?! Lin Qing promised to cover for me today. I even called her last night to confirm. Did she forget about me?!]","She picked up a glass of soy milk from the table, sipping it absentmindedly, her eyes darting around nervously.","Pei Youchuan's smile faded: \"Ah~ I must have mixed up the dates.\"","Qiao Chuchu breathed a sigh of relief and quickly smiled: \"See? There's no way she'd go abroad without telling me. I thought she was ditching me.\"","[That scared me. I almost got caught by the dumbest one here, Pei Youchuan.]","Pei Youchuan: \"...Hmph.\""]},{"number":233,"title":"Chapter 233: Qiao Chuchu's Cold Spreads to the Entire Group","paragraphs":["Pei Che handed Qiao Chuchu a plate of sandwiches: \"Maybe you shouldn’t go today. You’re still sick with a cold. If you end up infecting Lin Qing, she’ll get a fever too.\"","She hesitated: \"Sister Lin Qing said she doesn’t mind.\"","\"Even if she doesn’t mind, it’s still not okay.\"","Pei Che sat down beside her, his gaze sharp like venomous needles, staring straight at her: \"Listen to me, don’t go. If you’re bored, I’ll see if I can come back in the afternoon to keep you company. Even if I can’t, there are plenty of people here who might be able to come back early.\"","He glanced at Shen Zhuoyan: \"Besides, aren’t you close with Shen Zhuoyan? You two can reminisce about your school days. Isn’t that nice?\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned in annoyance: \"I’m not some sheltered lady who can’t see the sun. I don’t need you all to babysit me. And the way you’re talking, I feel like I’m being treated like a pig in a pen.\"","Pei Che’s expression remained calm: \"The sandwich in front of you was made by me, pig.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...No, I have to go. I promised. I can’t break my word.\"","Pei Che picked up his phone: \"Then I’ll call Lin Qing. You can’t go out right now. You might relapse and get a fever again.\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly pressed down on his phone: \"No!!\"","The atmosphere in the dining room instantly turned tense.","Their expressions darkened slightly.","Pei Che’s eyes flashed with anger, though his face remained expressionless: \"Why not?\"","She feigned calmness and pushed his hand down: \"I’m an adult now. If you call Sister Lin Qing, what will she think? She’ll think I’m a momma’s girl.\"","Pei Che: \"I’m your brother.\"","\"Then it’s a brother’s girl!\" Qiao Chuchu pressed down on his phone, anxiously saying, \"Anyway, I can’t be labeled as some ‘precious girl.’ If you call her, you’re disrespecting me.\"","Pei Che choked, defeated.","So she’s threatening him like this, huh?","Fine.","He looked at Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan scanned the room and gave Pei Mu and Pei Ci a look.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci chuckled, speaking in unison: \"Chuchu, are you lying by any chance?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","She calmly raised her eyes and retorted, \"Me, lying? I can call Sister Lin Qing right now and put it on speaker for all of you to hear.\"","\"But what if you’ve already conspired with her?\" Pei Ci walked over to her and placed a hand on her shoulder. \"Then wouldn’t we just be fooled by you?\"","Pei Mu also approached her, leaning down close: \"Yeah, if you and Lin Qing are in on it together, how would we know?\"","Qiao Chuchu shrugged nonchalantly: \"Don’t you all have little secrets too?\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","The others: \"?\"","Her gaze swept across their faces, her tone meaningful: \"Like, little secrets you’re all keeping from me? That’s possible too, right?\"","They: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu snorted and looked around: \"Anything else to say?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci exchanged awkward glances: \"Nothing. Have fun.\"","The two of them slinked away sheepishly.","Weisheng Lin leaned closer to Pei Youchuan, whispering: \"That’s a double kill, huh?\"","Pei Youchuan’s face was dark: \"Yeah.\"","\"Ahem!\" Weisheng Wenzhan coughed lightly, covering his mouth.","Weisheng Lin looked at Wenzhan.","Wenzhan frowned at him.","Receiving the signal, Weisheng Lin smirked and leaned closer to Pei Youchuan: \"Watch how I get this little girl to talk.\"","He turned to Qiao Chuchu, who was eating her sandwich: \"Chuchu, what are you planning to buy today?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t even look up: \"I’m not buying anything.\"","[He said he has a surprise for me. I don’t even know what we’re doing.]","Weisheng Lin: \"? Who?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up: \"What?\"","Weisheng Lin realized he almost slipped up and quickly changed the subject: \"Going out without buying anything doesn’t count as going out. Take me with you. I’ll pay for whatever you want.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...No need.\"","She finished her sandwich, picked up her bag, and headed out: \"I’m driving out now.\"","\"Wait!\" Pei Buxian suddenly stood up, his voice hoarse: \"I’m coming with you.\"","Qiao Chuchu stopped in her tracks and looked at him in confusion.","Pei Buxian looked a bit pale, covering his mouth as he coughed twice, his expression nervous: \"I want to go out too.\"","She bluntly refused: \"No, this is a private gathering between me and Lin Qing. Besides, you don’t look so good.\"","She then carefully scanned everyone at the table, concerned: \"Are any of you feeling unwell? Did I infect you all?\"","Pei Fengnong suddenly started coughing violently: \"Cough cough cough! Cough cough cough!\"","He stood up from the table, turning his back to everyone as he coughed loudly, looking as though he was struggling to breathe.","Qiao Chuchu’s face turned pale, and she rushed over to him: \"What’s wrong, Fourth Brother?! What’s wrong?!\"","[Did I really infect him?!]","Pei Fengnong’s face turned red from coughing, and he gasped heavily: \"I’ve been feeling unwell these past couple of days. Now I feel like I can’t breathe.\"","Pei Youchuan looked horrified and stood up: \"Could it be a lung infection?! The flu these days can easily lead to lung infections!\"","Pei Fengnong looked at Pei Youchuan in confusion.","Pei Youchuan gave him a meaningful look.","Pei Fengnong suddenly understood: \"Ah, right, I might have a lung infection.\"","Qiao Chuchu panicked: \"Then why are you just standing there? You need to go to the hospital!\"","Pei Fengnong hesitated and looked at her: \"Will you come with me?\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback.","Pei Fengnong lowered his head in disappointment: \"If you won’t come with me, then forget it. I can tough it out.\"","Pei Youchuan crouched beside Pei Fengnong, patting his shoulder reassuringly: \"Fourth Brother, it’s okay. Even if Chuchu won’t accompany you, the virus will! The virus will guard you in Chuchu’s place!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Pei Buxian coughed twice and weakly glanced at Qiao Chuchu: \"To be honest, I’m not feeling well either. I’ve been infected too. Cough cough cough...\"","\"What do we do? So many of us are sick now,\" Weisheng Biehe picked up his water glass, soothing his sore throat. \"We all have to go to work today, but if we’re all feeling unwell, it’s going to affect our work.\"","Qiao Chuchu grew more guilty, nervously fidgeting with her hands: \"I told you all to stay away from me, but you didn’t listen. Now you’ve all been infected.\"","She looked at the others: \"Are all of you feeling unwell?\"","Pei Yuan pinched the bridge of his nose, pretending to be weak: \"I’m fine, just a headache.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was perfectly healthy: \"I’m fine. My pale complexion is just natural.\"","Biehe twirled his prayer beads, looking at Qiao Chuchu: \"To be honest, my throat hurts.\"","Pei Che also admitted his throat was inflamed: \"Yeah, my throat hurts too.\"","Pei Youchuan recalled: \"My nose has been stuffy since yesterday.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...I really have been coughing a bit.\"","Qiao Chuchu was in disbelief: \"So I caught a cold, and ended up infecting all of you?!\"","They didn’t respond, just stared at her expressionlessly.","Each of them looked a bit pitiful."]},{"number":234,"title":"Chapter 234: Pei Buxian: Who on Earth is the Dog Man She's Dating (Scratching Head in Frustration)","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu felt utterly hopeless. She closed her eyes and said, \"I'll call and cancel, then take the seriously affected ones to the hospital.\"","[I can endure my own illness, but I can't let others suffer because of me.]","She picked up her phone, but it rang before she could dial.","The screen displayed a row of text: 「The idiot who deserves to be struck by lightning」","...It was Ji Yanchuan.","[Damn it, just as I was about to reject him, he calls.]","Qiao Chuchu walked out with her phone in hand.","Shen Zhuoyan followed closely behind.","Qiao Chuchu swiped to answer, turned around with her hands on her hips, and bumped into Shen Zhuoyan, who appeared like a ghost. She was startled: \"Why did you come out?\"","Shen Zhuoyan stared at her intensely, his tone firm: \"I need to protect you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...This is my home, it's safe. You don't need to protect me. Go back to the dining room.\"","Shen Zhuoyan stood motionless, like a statue, looking down at her.","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Aren't you leaving?\"","After a moment of hesitation, he turned and left.","Ji Yanchuan's voice came through the phone: \"Who are you talking to?\"","Shen Zhuoyan paused mid-step and returned to the dining room.","Pei Buxian immediately pulled Shen Zhuoyan inside and closed the door: \"Well? Did you hear the person on the other end of the call? Was it a man or a woman?\"","Shen Zhuoyan's expression was gloomy, his reply brief: \"A man.\"","The atmosphere in the dining room shifted.","Pei Buxian looked as if he had been struck by lightning: \"I knew it! She's been acting secretive because she's meeting a man!\"","He pressed on urgently: \"Who was it on the phone? Was it Weisheng Huailing?!\"","The three Weisheng family members: \"?\"","Weisheng Lin chuckled: \"What, did my brother gain some mysterious power after kissing Qiao Chuchu? Can he talk now?\"","Pei Youchuan snapped: \"Don't bring that up again!\"","The others also glared at Weisheng Lin.","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","Pei Buxian was still fixated: \"Who is this man, anyway?\"","Shen Zhuoyan remained calm: \"I don't know. Miss Qiao didn't let me listen.\"","\"Then you should've been more forceful!\" Pei Buxian fumed. \"Are you even a man?!\"","\"I'm her bodyguard, Mr. Pei,\" Shen Zhuoyan said, suppressing the anxiety in his eyes, his tone steady. \"I always have to obey her. But you're different.\"","Shen Zhuoyan opened the door and stepped aside to make way: \"You can go and investigate.\"","Without hesitation, Pei Buxian rushed out.","But he only eavesdropped from around the corner.","Qiao Chuchu, with her back to Pei Buxian, argued with Ji Yanchuan: \"I told you my brother is sick, and I can't go today. He needs me to take care of him!\"","Ji Yanchuan sneered: \"Qiao Chuchu, stop lying. Does your grown brother really need you to take care of him? I told you to come see me, so you have to come! We had an agreement, and you can't break it! I've already prepared for our date!\"","Qiao Chuchu was disgusted and warned in a low voice: \"I'll say it again, this is not a date!\"","If she weren't being forced, she would never go out with Ji Yanchuan!","Ji Yanchuan and Xia Xuechun were equally repulsive in her mind!","Ji Yanchuan retorted: \"There's nothing I, Ji Yanchuan, want that I can't get. I'm at your doorstep right now!\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked and ran to the living room.","A luxury car was parked outside the gate.","Ji Yanchuan stepped out of the car, clearly dressed to impress in a denim outfit paired with boots, standing at her front gate, about to ring the doorbell.","Qiao Chuchu's face turned pale!","[No, no, no!]","[I absolutely can't let my brother see him!!]","[I can't even explain this!!]","She sprinted to the gate!","Ji Yanchuan saw her and his eyes lit up: \"Qiao Chuchu, you're just playing hard to get. You can't bear to—\"","Qiao Chuchu kicked him flying!","Ji Yanchuan: \"!!!!\"","Inside, Pei Buxian walked to the dining table, picked up a knife, and said coldly: \"Let's go, outside.\"","Without a word, everyone stood up, looking at him in confusion.","Pei Buxian's expression was dark and terrifying, twirling the knife in his hand.","\"That bastard is here.\""]},{"number":235,"title":"Chapter 235: Pei Buxian: Swallow Don't Go, Swallow (Just Kidding)","paragraphs":["Ji Yanchuan scrambled to his feet, fuming with rage: \"Qiao Chuchu, are you out of your mind?! You just can't resist kicking me whenever you see me, can you?!\"","He lifted his T-shirt, revealing his well-defined eight-pack abs.","There was a clear red mark on them.","He was both aggrieved and angry: \"Look! You even kicked my abs red!\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored him, her eyes fixed warily on her front door.","Pei Buxian stormed out, exuding murderous intent.","Others followed closely behind, marching toward her with an intimidating air.","Without a word, she grabbed Ji Yanchuan by the head and shoved him into the car.","Ji Yanchuan winced in pain: \"Ow! You're hurting me!\"","Hearing this, Pei Buxian's face darkened, his lower lip trembling with anger as he sprinted toward the gate!","Qiao Chuchu grew increasingly anxious.","They were about to see everything!","She didn’t want the people around her to witness this. Everyone knew she disliked Ji Yanchuan, and suddenly going back on her word like this—she had no idea how to explain it!","Qiao Chuchu quickly got into the car and ordered the driver: \"Go!\"","The driver immediately sped away.","Pei Buxian just missed them, shouting in panic: \"Qiao Chu! Get out of the car!!\"","Qiao Chuchu held Ji Yanchuan's head down and glanced back at her front gate.","Pei Buxian chased after the car, yelling her full name: \"Qiao Chu! Come back! Come back!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu hurriedly grabbed her phone and called Pei Buxian, hoping to explain.","But it was clear Pei Buxian hadn’t brought his phone with him.","He was still chasing, though falling farther and farther behind, eventually disappearing around a corner.","Qiao Chuchu's phone buzzed.","She answered: \"Hello?\"","\"Get out of the car.\" Pei Che's voice on the other end was icy. \"Don’t make me repeat myself.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded: \"I’ll get out right—\"","Ji Yanchuan struggled free from her grip and sat up, furious: \"Qiao Chuchu, I’ve got everything planned out! You’re not going anywhere! I’ve prepared so many surprises for you—are you just going to let all that go to waste?!\"","Qiao Chuchu glared at him with disgust: \"What do I care about your surprises? I don’t want them. Something came up, we’ll meet tomorrow!\"","\"I said today means today!\" Ji Yanchuan barked at her: \"You dare refuse me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened. She pulled out a self-defense dagger and pressed it against his neck: \"Shut up.\"","The bodyguard in the passenger seat paled: \"Miss Qiao!\"","Suddenly, a cat darted across the road.","The driver swerved sharply!","Qiao Chuchu stumbled and fell toward Ji Yanchuan!","In that instant, her right hand seemed to move on its own, twisting the blade away from Ji Yanchuan’s neck and turning it toward herself!","Her left hand shot out to brace against the window, her eye just inches from the dagger’s tip!","Terrified, she slowly turned the blade away, creating a safe distance.","She stared at her right hand, shaken to the core.","It was as if she were looking at a traitor.","Ji Yanchuan, still leaning against the window, looked at her in shock: \"Are you insane? You carry a dagger with you? Am I some kind of emperor? You actually tried to stab me!\"","Qiao Chuchu said nothing, slowly sitting upright as horrifying thoughts began to surface in her mind.","Could it be... that if she defied Ji Yanchuan’s wishes or tried to kill him, she would be forcibly erased from existence?","Of course, she could try to test it by getting out of the car against his will.","But her prophetic dreams had clearly hinted that the plot was irreversible, and everything she was doing now was following the path meant for Xia Xuechun.","Besides, she only had three lives left.","She couldn’t afford to risk one just to test the theory."]},{"number":236,"title":"Chapter 236: Perfunctory Yet Perfunctory Happiness","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath and calmly explained to Pei Che on the phone, \"I'll be back in three hours at most.\"","Pei Che's face darkened, his tone resolute: \"Where are you going? I'm coming with you.\"","\"Don't come,\" she said calmly. \"I'll be back as soon as possible.\"","\"No,\" Pei Che's voice was filled with an unyielding harshness. \"Who's that man beside you? Your boyfriend? Your crush? Why won't you let us see him? Is there something shady about him? Or are you worried about something?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Brother—\"","\"Don't call me brother!!\" Pei Che snapped. \"I'm not your brother! From now on, call me by my name!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Is he serious?]","Pei Che's voice was icy: \"Why can't you get out of the car? Is he threatening you? Or do you just not want to upset him?\"","...","Qiao Chuchu felt dizzy from the barrage of questions: \"He's just a friend. I made plans to go out with him, and I'll definitely be back within three hours.\"","Pei Che had already gotten into his car, his tone flat: \"Get out of the car right now. I'm already on my way to meet you.\"","Qiao Chuchu choked up, firmly stating, \"I'm not getting out. I'll go home after I'm done.\"","Pei Che's voice suddenly turned fierce: \"What's so great about him?! That you'd let Pei Buxian chase after the car like a madman?!\"","He demanded, \"Do you know how crazy Pei Buxian just acted?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She could guess.","Pei Buxian had probably cried his way into a car and was now flooring the accelerator to catch up.","Because Pei Buxian was the type to be fiercely assertive, yet also prone to crying uncontrollably when emotionally overwhelmed.","When he got worked up, he'd do things while sobbing.","Seeing Qiao Chuchu's silence, Pei Che's heart sank: \"Tell me the truth, Qiao Chuchu. Are you in a relationship? If you are, I'll—I'll get rid of that guy—I mean, I'll wish you both well.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? No, I'm not. Really, I'm not.\"","[Did I just hear something strange?]","[And why does he keep insisting I'm in a relationship? I really have no interest in romance at all.]","Pei Che let out a relieved breath: \"Then tell me, what's so great about him that you're so protective of him?\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent, glancing at Ji Yanchuan.","He had straightened up and was sulking on the other side of the car.","She said earnestly, \"He's not great at all. He's not even worth a single strand of your hair.\"","Pei Che was stunned, his anger dissipating instantly: \"Really?\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed, exhausted: \"Yeah.\"","On the other end of the line, Pei Che seemed to be breathing unevenly: \"Then why won't you get out of the car?\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes darkened with a hint of menace: \"I can't get out. I have something to do.\"","\"Tell me what it is.\"","\"I can't.\" Qiao Chuchu's expression hardened.","Pei Che pressed on: \"Then explain. I'm listening.\"","Qiao Chuchu closed her eyes in frustration, unable to hold back: \"Pei Che, I said I'll be back in three hours, and I will. You're not Pei Buxian. Can't you just listen to me for once?\"","Pei Che: \"...You called me by my name?\"","\"Didn't you tell me to?\" Qiao Chuchu glanced back at the cars chasing them, unsurprised: \"Don't follow me anymore, or I'll get angry.\"","Pei Che was incredulous: \"You're threatening me?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't deny it, staring at the luxury cars closing in: \"If you keep following, I won't go home.\"","She enunciated each syllable of his name: \"Pei. Che.\"","Pei Che: \"...\"","The cars chasing them came to a halt.","Pei Che gritted his teeth, growling through clenched teeth: \"Qiao Chuchu, you're taking advantage of the fact that I indulge you. Just wait until you get back. I'll make you regret this!\"","Qiao Chuchu's mood unexpectedly brightened: \"You scold me, but you're still afraid of making me angry. You're such a nice guy, aren't you?\"","Pei Yuan's breath hitched, his cheeks faintly warm: \"Just wait until you get back!\"","The bodyguard in the passenger seat was surprised: \"We're not following anymore?\"","Pei Che, his face red, hung up the phone: \"Don't let her notice. Follow them quietly!\"","Pei Yuan sat beside him, his long legs crossed, his expression cold: \"What did she say to you? Why is your face so red?\"","Pei Che, feeling unbearably hot, twisted his neck and said hoarsely, \"She just said some things to placate me, that's all.\"","\"She placated you, and it made you happy?\" Pei Yuan propped his chin on his hand, delivering a haughty verdict—","\"Right now, you're like a dog wagging its tail so hard it's practically a propeller.\"","Pei Che shot him a sidelong glance: \"And what are you? A dog that can cook?\"","Pei Yuan was momentarily stunned, his eyes filling with layers of anger: \"Hmph.\"","Pei Che wasn't about to back down, sneering in return: \"Heh.\"","-","Qiao Chuchu played with her phone, glancing at Ji Yanchuan, who was sulking, and pondered seriously.","If she could steal Xia Xuechun's protagonist aura,","then she could also steal the male lead's protagonist aura.","As long as the aura wasn't gender-locked, she could block the male lead's path and leave him with nowhere to go.","\"Where are you planning to take me today?\" Qiao Chuchu broke the silence. \"Didn't you say you had a surprise for me?\"","\"It's gone now,\" Ji Yanchuan glared at her, his tone resentful. \"You've been so cold and harsh with me. Why should I give you a surprise?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't bother arguing: \"Fine. Let's end today's meeting here. I'll get out.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"? No way.\"","Qiao Chuchu pressed the window button: \"If you don't stop the car, I'll jump out.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"??? You'll break your bones if you jump.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"If I break my bones, you'll pay for it. I'm not afraid of getting hurt.\"","Ji Yanchuan's temper flared: \"Why do you hate me so much?! Is that dagger you're carrying meant to kill me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu, her head aching from the wind, rolled the window back up: \"I carry a knife so I can protect myself quickly and efficiently if you ever try to hurt me.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"? When have I ever tried to hurt you?!\"","Sure, he had once hired someone to assault her.","But it hadn't worked out, had it?!","And he hadn't been exposed. She didn't know about it.","So where was all this hostility coming from?","Ji Yanchuan gritted his teeth, forcing himself to calm down.","The more Qiao Chuchu acted this way, the more he wanted to conquer her.","He slowly moved closer to her, placing his hand on the back of her seat, trying to encircle her in his arms: \"You agreed to go on a date with me because you like me, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed his arm and shoved him toward the window!","He slammed into the glass with a loud *thud*: \"Oof!!\"","Qiao Chuchu's voice was as calm as death: \"If you say I like you again, I'll throw your head out the window.\"","The bodyguard turned around in shock: \"Young master!\"","Ji Yanchuan, pressed against the window with his face distorted in pain, his face flushed: \"Don't mind me!\"","He glanced sideways at Qiao Chuchu, struggling to speak: \"I was just asking. Why are you being so rough with me?\"","Qiao Chuchu held him effortlessly: \"Because I don't want you to misunderstand that I like you. So I'm going to show you, physically, how I really feel about you.\"","\"But this is way too physical!\" Ji Yanchuan roared. \"You've been hitting me since the moment we met! If you hate me so much, why did you agree to see me?!\""]},{"number":237,"title":"Chapter 237: I Don't Like You, Ji Yanchuan","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","She didn’t want to see him anyway.","She threw the question back at him: “What about you? You know I’ll beat you up if we meet. Why do you want to see me?”","As long as Ji Yanchuan didn’t extend the invitation, nothing would happen.","She wouldn’t be forced to follow the script.","Ji Yanchuan was stunned by her words, leaning against the car window in confusion, unsure how to respond.","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes in disbelief: “You don’t like me, do you?”","That couldn’t be.","The script’s template was clear: the female lead falls for Ji Yanchuan first, knowingly becoming the third party and confessing her feelings, stealing him away from the supporting female character, Lin Qing.","He was the script’s golden boy—could he really fall for her first?","Sure enough, Ji Yanchuan exploded: “Like you? Bullshit!”","She breathed a sigh of relief: “Good. If you liked me in this kind of fire-and-water relationship, you’d be nothing but a spineless fool.”","Ji Yanchuan shuddered, abruptly lowering the car’s partition to prevent the driver from overhearing.","Once the partition was down, he pressed himself against the window, watching the bustling traffic outside. Some passersby noticed him, their eyes widening in surprise as they stared until his car disappeared into the distance.","A sense of unprecedented humiliation washed over Ji Yanchuan.","To be gawked at like this in his own car!","Hatred and a desire to dominate surged within him like a volcano ready to erupt. He gritted his teeth, glaring at Qiao Chuchu: “I think you’re the one who likes me, deliberately trying to get my attention! Well, let me tell you—you’ve succeeded!”","Qiao Chuchu effortlessly twisted his arm, her eyebrow arching mischievously as a wicked smile spread across her lips.","Her watery eyes held no warmth, only a mocking disdain for him.","“Me? Like you?”","Her voice, still hoarse from a lingering cold, carried a nasal tone: “Ji Yanchuan, do you ever look in the mirror?”","The car entered a tunnel.","Qiao Chuchu grabbed his hair, forcing him to look at his reflection in the window.","Ji Yanchuan winced in pain, staring at his disheveled reflection.","His bangs were tousled, making him look utterly pathetic.","Qiao Chuchu said coldly: “See that reflection?”","Ji Yanchuan endured the pain, his eyes fixed on the glass.","Qiao Chuchu continued: “No matter what tricks you pull, or what anyone else tries, even if my life is threatened, I’ll never like you.”","She sneered: “Because you’re nothing but trash who’d emotionally cheat. No matter how many halos heaven bestows on you, no matter how dazzling they are, you’re still a scumbag who’d abandon your fiancée for a scheming woman, and a jerk who’d emotionally abuse her.”","Ji Yanchuan: “...I’ve never done any of those things.”","“Then why did you go comfort Xia Xuechun when she was crying?”","She tightened her grip on his short hair, her voice dripping with sarcasm: “Lin Qing had just broken off the engagement with you. Instead of going to her, you went to console Xia Xuechun. How can you justify your flirtatious behavior?”","Ji Yanchuan’s temple throbbed with anger: “Who I comfort is my own business! What’s wrong with giving someone a hug?!”","He sounded almost wronged: “Besides, I never really loved Lin Qing! We were just childhood friends, and it was an arranged marriage! I was never happy about getting engaged to her!”","“Unhappy, yet you still got physically involved?” Qiao Chuchu laughed at his response: “What, did Lin Qing force you to take things further?”","Ji Yanchuan froze, unable to retort.","She chuckled darkly.","When the system handed her the novel, she found it ridiculous.","All the male characters who fell for Xia Xuechun—whether it was the seven obsessive male leads from the Pei family or characters like Wei Sheng Biehe—were all handsome, wealthy, and pure.","Of course, Xia Xuechun was also a female lead who had never been in a physical relationship.","But the male lead, Ji Yanchuan, wasn’t pure.","In her opinion, pairing Xia Xuechun with someone like Ji Yanchuan was unfair.","At the very least, Ji Yanchuan should also be pure for the relationship to be balanced.","But Ji Yanchuan had been with Lin Qing since adulthood.","And they had been together for years.","In the story, after falling for Xia Xuechun, he began emotionally neglecting Lin Qing.","The years of emotions he shared with Lin Qing were dismissed as—","A forced marriage for family alliances.","「I never experienced love with Lin Qing.」","「Xia Xuechun showed me what real love feels like.」","Qiao Chuchu’s disgust grew as she twisted his wrist harder: “A man who denies his past relationships is nothing but a worthless man. How can anyone expect you to have genuine feelings?!”","Ji Yanchuan’s tears welled up from the pain, biting his lip to keep from crying out.","Qiao Chuchu released him with a look of disdain.","Ji Yanchuan finally caught his breath, clutching his reddened wrist as he leaned back in his seat.","He cradled his injured hand, turning to look out the window, forcing back his tears.","He didn’t dare wipe them away, afraid Qiao Chuchu would see.","If she knew he’d cried from the pain, she’d probably be thrilled!","But the more he thought about it, the more wronged he felt. His body trembled from the pain, his voice shaking with helpless anger: “I’ll kill you...”","He turned to her and shouted: “I’ll fucking kill you!!!”","Qiao Chuchu felt something wet hit her face and frowned in disgust: “Did you just spit on me?”","She looked at him and saw Ji Yanchuan’s tear-streaked face, his eyes brimming with tears as he glared at her.","She was momentarily surprised, wiping her face: “Oh, it’s just your tears.”","Ji Yanchuan: “?”","She rubbed the moisture between her fingers, mocking him: “All I did was twist your wrist a bit, and you’re crying from the pain? And here I am, still sick with a cold. You’re as weak as a puppy. How are you going to kill me?”","Ji Yanchuan's eyes widened, his chest heaving as if he had been deeply wronged. But his clumsy tongue failed him, and he couldn't muster a single retort.","Instead, he only felt more wronged.","The tears flowed even harder.","Qiao Chuchu smiled maliciously, delighted by his tears.","The car pulled up in front of a luxurious club.","The bodyguard in the passenger seat spoke nervously: “Young Master, we’ve arrived.”","Qiao Chuchu opened the door and stepped out without hesitation.","Ji Yanchuan’s eyes were bloodshot as he glared at her with hatred.","She impatiently said: “Not coming? Then I’m going home.”","Ji Yanchuan didn’t respond, roughly wiping away his tears before stepping out of the car with red-rimmed eyes.","The bodyguard noticed his tear-stained face and stared in shock.","He’d heard the commotion.","But... had the usually cold and aloof Young Master really been reduced to tears?","Ji Yanchuan lowered his head, avoiding the bodyguard’s gaze: “You don’t need to follow.”","The bodyguard: “...”","He’d been beaten to tears, yet he didn’t want backup? Wasn’t he afraid of being reduced to tears again?","Reluctantly, the bodyguard obeyed: “Understood.”","Ji Yanchuan put on his sunglasses, shooting Qiao Chuchu a venomous glare as he spat out a threat: “Qiao Chuchu, this is the last time I’ll seek you out. Next time we meet, I’ll be your trouble. For today, I’ll let you off.”"]},{"number":238,"title":"Chapter 238: He Discovered That Qiao Chuchu Was Teetering on the Edge of Hurting Him","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu sneered, \"It's not that you're letting me off; it's that you can't beat me.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...I can't beat you, but my bodyguard can!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"If your bodyguard attacks me, I'll just call my bodyguard to deal with yours.\"","Ji Yanchuan bristled: \"What?! I haven't even said I'd call anyone yet!\"","Qiao Chuchu shot him a cold glance: \"Did I stop you from calling someone to deal with me? You can still do it now if you want.\"","Ji Yanchuan's expression shifted, watching her walk away in disbelief.","Since childhood, everyone around him had catered to his every whim.","Xia Xuechun had a fiery temper, but even she would cry and nestle into his arms, borrowing his shoulder for comfort.","But Qiao Chuchu...","Qiao Chuchu didn't treat him like a human being at all!","Every time she saw him, she pushed him to the brink of madness!","After all, who brings a knife to a date?!","His blood pressure skyrocketed, his hands trembling with anger. He gritted his teeth, walking beside her while taking deep breaths, trying to hide his rage from her.","Qiao Chuchu stared straight ahead: \"After seeing your so-called surprise, I'm leaving. We'll be even.\"","Ji Yanchuan gripped his trembling hand, his bangs shadowing his eyes as he muttered darkly, \"How can we be even? You twisted my wrist until it swelled! You'll owe me for the rest of your life!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Then take your revenge. Just stop inviting me out in the future.\"","She'd rather clash with him than follow the nauseating romantic script the plot had laid out for her.","Ji Yanchuan held his swollen wrist, bewildered: \"Do you really hate me that much?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked even more shocked: \"? Isn't it obvious how much I hate you? If it's not clear, just twist your wrist. The pain you feel is exactly how much I despise you.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","The club manager had been waiting for a while. Seeing Qiao Chuchu, her face lit up with joy as she presented a bouquet of roses: \"Welcome, Miss Qiao and Mr. Ji! These are specially prepared for you by Mr. Ji. Twenty-two Manta roses, symbolizing a perfect pair.\"","Qiao Chuchu forced a smile, accepting the flowers with both hands: \"Thank you~\"","She then disdainfully shoved the bouquet back into Ji Yanchuan's arms.","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","The manager beamed: \"Mr. Ji reserved this outing with us three days ago. He personally chose these flowers, saying you'd love them.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded with a smile: \"You've worked hard.\"","\"Not at all, it's our pleasure,\" the manager stepped aside. \"Please follow me.\"","Ji Yanchuan trailed behind Qiao Chuchu, clutching the flowers, muttering in a low voice, \"Why don't you treat me with the same respect? You're nice to a stranger, but she's only being friendly because I paid her.\"","Qiao Chuchu scoffed: \"Why should she bear the brunt of our emotions? She's here to work, not to deal with your nonsense. As for the money you spent, I'll pay you back. I'd rather spend extra than owe you a single favor.\"","Ji Yanchuan chuckled bitterly: \"I invited you on a date. How could I take your money? What do you take me for?\"","\"I don't know what to take you for, but definitely not a human,\" Qiao Chuchu replied flatly. \"I don't want to owe you anything. Add the medical fees to the bill later.\"","Ji Yanchuan fell silent, staring at her cold profile. A strange thought crossed his mind.","Did Qiao Chuchu know that he was the one who had sent those people to humiliate her? Was that why she was tormenting him like this?","His grip on the bouquet tightened, his palms sweating, his entire body tense as he slowly followed her, his mind drifting.","The manager led them to the shooting range: \"Miss Qiao, this is the shooting range Mr. Ji customized for you. Feel free to enjoy everything the club has to offer. Let us know if you need anything.\"","Qiao Chuchu picked up a gun, fiddling with it disinterestedly: \"Is this the surprise you prepared for me?\"","Ji Yanchuan snapped out of his daze, looking at her in confusion: \"Isn't it surprising? The flowers, the guns, and everything else are all things you love. I'm willing to play along with you.\"","She shrugged indifferently: \"Your willingness deducts a hundred bucks from my interest.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu checked the time: \"How about this? Let's compete. If I score higher than you, I'll go home, and from then on, we're enemies. Do whatever you want to deal with me.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?? Why are you so determined to make me your enemy? People say it's better to have more friends than enemies. I—\"","\"I don't need you as a friend,\" Qiao Chuchu cut him off, her tone icy. \"Every time I see you, I want to punch you, disgust you, and curse at you because I hate you. Do I need to go on?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","Was it because he had sent those people to humiliate her? Was that why she hated him?","But they hadn't succeeded, right? Why was she still holding it against him?","And why wouldn't she just say it outright?","Frustrated, he took off his sunglasses, revealing eyes red from crying: \"I'll apologize, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan looked at her cold gaze, feeling a pang of guilt but unsure how to express it: \"I... I really disliked you back then, so I treated you badly and did a lot of wrong things. But lately, every time I see you, I think you're actually not bad. Plus, seeing how you saved your brother online, I realized you're someone who values loyalty and family. I want to start over with you.\"","He held out the bouquet, offering it to her sincerely: \"I caused you a lot of pain back then, and I was wrong. But I'm genuinely apologizing now. Can you forgive me? Let's put the past behind us and have a good time today. I promise I'll never hurt you again. Is that okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at his earnest eyes, her lips curling into a mocking smile: \"Your apology is worth a dime to me.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan grew angry: \"If you don't forgive me, I won't let you leave. No matter what, I won't let you go!!\"","Qiao Chuchu brushed past him, unimpressed.","Suddenly, the knife in her pocket slipped out, clattering to the ground with a sharp \"clink.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Well, well.","He couldn't even wait to threaten her.","She must have been terribly mistaken.","The one favored by fate was never Xia Xuechun.","As the female lead, Xia Xuechun was merely the male lead's accessory.","Ji Yanchuan was the true protagonist of this script.","Because fate couldn't bear to let Ji Yanchuan's desires go unfulfilled.","She walked back to the shooting range, picking up the gun: \"I won't forgive you, Ji Yanchuan.\"","Ji Yanchuan froze, about to speak.","Qiao Chuchu cut him off: \"But if you want me to stay now, that's not impossible. If you balance an apple on your head and let me shoot it, I'll stay with you for two hours.\"","Ji Yanchuan's eyes widened in disbelief: \"What?! You dare ask me to do that?! Do you know who I am?!\"","She smirked at him provocatively: \"If you're too scared, just let me go. I'll pay you back every penny you spent. Do you dare to take the challenge?\"","Ji Yanchuan's face turned pale, his eyes downcast as he remained silent.","Qiao Chuchu's lips curled in satisfaction.","It seemed he wouldn't agree.","As long as he refused, the plot wouldn't force her to do anything.","She walked past Ji Yanchuan.","But he grabbed her arm.","Qiao Chuchu turned back, puzzled.","His face was pale, but he looked at her with reluctant determination: \"I'll do it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\""]},{"number":239,"title":"Chapter 239: The Fortune of the Female Protagonist with Great Resentment","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu stood outside the shooting range, watching Ji Yanchuan inside. Several staff members stood nervously beside her, trying to persuade her: \"Miss Qiao, this is too dangerous. Even though the bullets aren’t real, they can still hurt people. Please don’t do this.\"","Qiao Chuchu kept her eyes fixed on Ji Yanchuan as she loaded the gun, casually taking in his appearance.","As the male lead in a CEO romance novel, Ji Yanchuan had the standard features: a height of 185 cm, broad shoulders, a narrow waist, and long legs. His foundation was undeniably solid.","His looks weren’t bad either—narrow phoenix eyes, sharp brows, full lips, and fair skin. Even as a target, he exuded an air of nobility. When he wasn’t expressing any emotion, a natural aura of dominance radiated from him.","It was a pity that while heaven had blessed Ji Yanchuan with a cold, aloof appearance, it had also given him a reckless personality.","She could understand the character design in the script. Ji Yanchuan’s personality was meant to clash and create tension with Xia Xuechun, the grass-roots heroine.","Ji Yanchuan would be captivated by Xia Xuechun’s resilience and refusal to give up, eventually becoming a doting husband and her strongest supporter.","Unfortunately, the growth of this couple had nothing to do with their own efforts.","It mainly relied on Xia Xuechun sucking the lifeblood of supporting characters, keeping a small portion for herself and transferring the majority to Ji Yanchuan.","When the supporting characters’ sincere feelings were betrayed, they would become bitter, imprison Xia Xuechun, and then Ji Yanchuan would appear to suppress them, leading to their demise.","The supporting characters’ wealth, seemingly blessed by fate, always ended up effortlessly in Ji Yanchuan’s hands.","Every time a supporting character died, Ji Yanchuan’s fortune would grow by billions or even tens of billions.","Ji Yanchuan would accept it all without a second thought, holding Xia Xuechun possessively in his arms, and in a \"love story filled with setbacks and hardships,\" he would become the world’s richest man.","But times had changed. The heroine who could help him suck others dry was now her.","Qiao Chuchu tapped the table lightly with the gun: \"Ji Yanchuan, it’s not too late to back out now.\"","Ji Yanchuan hesitated, standing in front of the target: \"If I stop now, will you stay?\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed mockingly: \"No.\"","Ji Yanchuan’s handsome face turned pale with anger. He clenched the apple in his hand: \"Qiao Chuchu, you’re the first woman to humiliate me like this.\"","From the moment they met, when she kicked him, to pinning him against the car window for everyone to see, he had been simmering with rage.","His eyes were filled with suppressed anger: \"Everything you’ve done to me today has been more humiliating than anything I’ve endured in over twenty years. No one has ever dared to treat me like this!\"","But—","He placed the apple on his head, his voice trembling with nervousness: \"Now, I’m willing to tolerate you this once.\"","Qiao Chuchu was amused. \"Ji Yanchuan, I already told you, your willingness means nothing to me.\"","Ji Yanchuan widened his eyes in surprise, the apple on his head making him look ridiculous: \"Then what will it take for you to forgive me? Don’t you think you’re being unreasonable—\"","\"Bang!!\"","The apple on his head shattered!","Ji Yanchuan’s words were cut off, his pupils shrinking to pinpoints.","The apple fragments fell to the ground. The bullet seemed to have hit the center, splitting it cleanly in half.","His mind went blank. Slowly, he raised his gaze to Qiao Chuchu, who stood ten meters away.","She held the gun, her clear eyes filled with undisguised disdain and contempt: \"You agreed to this, Ji Yanchuan.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu placed the gun on the table and sneered: \"I hit you, scolded you, humiliated you, made you lose face in the car, and you agreed. I made you balance an apple on your head, and you still agreed. Instead of blaming me, maybe you should reflect on why you’re so willing to let yourself be treated like this. Did a donkey kick your head or something?\"","With that, she picked up her phone: \"The two-hour timer starts now. If you’re taking me somewhere, hurry up. I’ll wait for you in the hallway.\"","The staff watched in shock as Qiao Chuchu walked away.","One of them exclaimed in awe: \"Wow! She’s an amazing shot! I didn’t even see her aim. Is Miss Qiao a sharpshooter or something?\"","An older staff member shushed her: \"Quiet!\"","They glanced at Ji Yanchuan in the shooting range and whispered: \"Mr. Ji got shot at.\"","Ji Yanchuan stood frozen, then slowly bent over.","The fear of having a bullet pass so close to his head made him tremble uncontrollably.","A sour, aching sensation spread through his chest, coursing through his limbs.","He hunched over, clutching the fabric over his heart, taking shallow breaths.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t respect him...","She didn’t respect him at all!!","Ji Yanchuan gritted his teeth, his eyes filled with a mix of hatred and confusion. His brows furrowed so tightly they could crush a fly. Suppressing the discomfort in his chest, he stumbled weakly into the hallway.","Qiao Chuchu looked up and saw Ji Yanchuan, pale and trembling like a leaf, glaring at her resentfully.","He looked like a dog drenched in a storm.","She scoffed: \"If you were so scared, why did you agree to be the target?\"","Ji Yanchuan clenched his fists in frustration: \"Don’t worry about me. I have my own pace!\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes and turned to the staff: \"Get him a cup of hot water, please.\"","Ji Yanchuan was taken aback as he accepted the hot water from the staff.","The warmth in his palms dispelled the chill of fear.","He glanced at her, surprised by her sudden kindness, and drank the water: \"I need to use the restroom.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t respond but quietly followed him, standing by the door and eavesdropping.","Ji Yanchuan made a call: \"Did you expose the plan I asked you to carry out to humiliate Qiao Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","Ji Yanchuan’s voice was laced with irritation: \"I know your people took the blame for it, but the problem is I’m with her now, and she’s been treating me terribly! I need to know if you’ve been exposed!\"","She covered her mouth in disbelief.","The men who had tried to assault her and record it—they were sent by Ji Yanchuan?!","She had no idea!","Back then, the thugs had confessed that no one had hired them, that they had targeted her on their own.","In her world, kidnappings and targeted attacks weren’t uncommon, so she had easily believed their story.","She never imagined that Ji Yanchuan was behind it all!!","Not only had he hit her with his car, but he had also sent men to assault her!","If Pei Fengnong hadn’t arrived in time, she would have been violated, and the video would have spread everywhere, impossible to delete or recover.","And after all that, Ji Yanchuan had the audacity to show up in front of her, even asking her out on a date?!","The more she thought about it, the more nauseous she felt. She leaned against the wall, speechless.","Pei Buxian, dressed in staff uniform, arrived with a group of people.","Following the directions of the other staff, he found Qiao Chuchu around a corner.","He stopped and turned to the others behind him: \"Wait, she’s right there.\""]},{"number":240,"title":"Chapter 240: Only Fans, All Are Only Fans","paragraphs":["Weisheng Wenzhan, Weisheng Biehe, Pei Yuan, and Pei Che were all watching from the surveillance room.","Apart from them, several others dressed in staff uniforms were approaching Qiao Chuchu.","They managed to sneak in because this club was owned by Weisheng Lin.","Not only could they enter, but they could even pose as employees.","This gave them the perfect opportunity to watch Qiao Chuchu on a date with a stranger up close.","Pei Buxian quietly peeked out and muttered, \"That guy seems to be in the restroom. Qiao Chuchu is waiting for him.\"","Pei Youchuan felt a pang of jealousy. \"Qiao Chuchu has never waited for me while I was in the restroom.\"","Pei Fengnong rolled his eyes. \"Why would she wait for you in the restroom? That's just gross.\"","Weisheng Lin clicked his tongue. \"The point isn’t the restroom. The point is who she’s on a date with. Can’t you guys focus on what’s important?\"","Shen Zhuoyan quietly peeked out, watching Qiao Chuchu leaning against the wall.","Pei Mu frowned sadly. \"How much does she love him? She’s hiding his identity from us, afraid that we won’t approve of their relationship.\"","Pei Ci seemed to have lost his mind, his gaze unfocused. \"No, I can’t accept this! Absolutely not!\"","He stepped forward. \"I’m going to ask her!\"","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu’s voice echoed in their minds: **[I want to tear Ji Yanchuan into a thousand pieces!]**","They were startled.","Qiao Chuchu leaned against the wall, trembling with anger.","Her face was pale, veins bulging on her temples, and a wave of nausea surged from her stomach. She clutched her aching and nauseous stomach, biting her lower lip in distress.","**[Ji Yanchuan is the one who sent people to humiliate me. He tried to have me assaulted, and now he’s acting like a lunatic, coming back to me!]**","**[It’s probably because Xia Xuechun is no longer the female lead. Most of her luck has transferred to me, making me the female lead paired with Ji Yanchuan. I’m forced to follow this romantic plot.]**","**[But I don’t understand. Ji Yanchuan has done so many horrible things to me. Why did the script transfer the female lead’s fate to me? He humiliated me, treated me like garbage. Can’t the script see that?!]**","**[Even though he’s done such disgusting things, I have to hide it from everyone and play along with this forced romance. If I don’t comply, I’ll die!]**","**[I can’t even tell the people close to me that I’m on a date with Ji Yanchuan!]**","**[Pei Fengnong is still struggling to breathe at home, Pei Buxian chased after the car, and Pei Che told me to get out of the car, but I couldn’t because Ji Yanchuan wouldn’t let me!]**","**[This isn’t the fate of a female lead. This is the fate of a doormat, a stepping stone, a life controlled by the male lead!]**","The group in the corner grew more and more horrified as they listened.","Overwhelming heartache filled their expressions.","So, Qiao Chuchu was on a date with Ji Yanchuan, but she was being forced into it.","The reason she didn’t tell them wasn’t to protect Ji Yanchuan, but because she couldn’t bring herself to say it. She was deeply repulsed and disgusted!","Pei Che, watching from the surveillance room, furrowed his brow. His calm eyes were filled with intense heartache and guilt.","He hadn’t realized Qiao Chuchu’s suffering and had even pressured her to get out of the car.","Around the corner, Pei Buxian’s eyes turned red, and he covered his mouth, on the verge of tears.","His Chuchu still remembered him chasing after the car!","He decisively pulled out the knife he always carried. \"Take care of the West Highlands and Chuchu for me. I’m going to take care of Ji Yanchuan!\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed: **[Unfortunately, Ji Yanchuan still has his protagonist luck. We can’t kill him directly. Weisheng Huailing was hit by cement because he tried to harm Ji Yanchuan. Forcing harm on him will result in punishment. The only thing I can do now is dismantle his luck.]**","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan suddenly understood, his expression grave. \"No wonder all our efforts to restrict Ji Yanchuan’s company have been futile. He’s protected by the script.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci sneered. \"And here we thought we weren’t trying hard enough. Turns out, he has a buff. We, as supporting characters, can’t touch him.\"","Weisheng Lin was puzzled. \"Qiao Chuchu is being erased by the world while also being forced to be with Ji Yanchuan? So, she’s trapped between these two forces, and if she doesn’t comply, she’ll die?\"","The thought made their brows furrow, and their chests ache with a dull pain.","How exhausting and painful must it be to live a life so out of control, constantly threatened with death?","But Qiao Chuchu suddenly laughed. \"Ha!\"","**[Now that I have the female lead’s luck, it means the script is protecting me, but not fully, since I still have the erasure buff on me.]**","**[If I can steal Ji Yanchuan’s luck, I’ll have both the male and female lead’s luck. I’ll be a dual-luck master!]**","**[At that point, who in this world could stand against me? I might be able to have anything I want!]**","**[I can’t even imagine how arrogant, overbearing, and insufferable I’ll become!]**","Qiao Chuchu grew more and more excited, her lips curling into a sinister smile.","**[Come on, Ji Yanchuan! Give me a chance to hurt you! I’ll take your protagonist luck and replace you as this world’s ultimate hero!]**","The group in the corner: \"...\"","The people watching the surveillance: \"...\"","Their brows were so furrowed they could crush a fly, their eyes filled with murderous intent as they glared in Ji Yanchuan’s direction.","Ji Yanchuan, completely unaware, was still on the phone. \"Good, you didn’t expose yourself. Have someone spook Qiao Chuchu’s horse at the equestrian area later. I’ll go save her.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan sounded annoyed. \"Why would I want to have her assaulted now? I’m not into that anymore. Just make sure her horse gets spooked, and she gets scared. I’ll save her then!\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed.","**[I thought he was planning something big, but he’s just going for the cliché hero-saves-the-damsel routine. How lame.]**","The people in the corner pricked up their ears.","Hero-saves-the-damsel?","Qiao Chuchu sensed Ji Yanchuan was about to come out and moved to the farthest spot to wait for him.","Her gaze accidentally fell on a pair of shoes in the corner, and her expression changed.","Pei Buxian was still brooding over Ji Yanchuan’s hero-saves-the-damsel plan.","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu appeared in front of them. \"Are you spying on me?!\"","Pei Buxian was startled and stumbled back!","He stepped on Pei Youchuan’s foot!","Pei Youchuan: \"!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at them suspiciously.","Each of them was wearing thick black glasses, masks, and the club’s hats. Before Qiao Chuchu could get a good look, they all lowered their heads in unison, avoiding her gaze.","Pei Buxian lowered his voice. \"No, miss, we were just passing by. Our manager told us not to disturb you, so we were waiting.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t find the explanation suspicious.","But...","The air was filled with a familiar scent.","And it was a mix of many familiar scents.","She stood on her tiptoes and sniffed, leaning closer to Pei Buxian. \"You smell familiar.\"","Pei Buxian’s eyes lit up. \"Oh? You recognize my scent?\"","The others: \"?\"","Was he really being this shameless right now?!"]},{"number":241,"title":"Chapter 241: Speak your mind, but hold your farts—that's Qiao Chuchu's motto.","paragraphs":["\"Qiao Chuchu?\" Ji Yanchuan walked up to Qiao Chuchu, glancing suspiciously at the waitstaff in front of her. \"What are you doing?\"","Qiao Chuchu, interrupted, responded indifferently, \"Nothing much. Where to next?\"","\"How about horseback riding? I heard you love it,\" Ji Yanchuan said smugly. \"You probably didn’t expect me to have researched all your preferences, did you?\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled at him. \"Yeah, I didn’t.\"","Her smile was laced with sarcasm.","If Ji Yanchuan had dug a little deeper, he would have discovered that she was an exceptional rider.","She loved thrilling, high-speed competitions.","But to Ji Yanchuan, her smile seemed different this time.","Her eyes sparkled, and the sarcastic edge from earlier was gone.","It almost felt like she approved of him.","Ji Yanchuan stared as Qiao Chuchu brushed past him, his lips twitching upward before he quickly suppressed the smile and walked alongside her.","They were mismatched in height but dressed in similar styles, their silhouettes not clashing as they walked.","Ji Yanchuan kept sneaking glances at Qiao Chuchu, his lips curling slightly despite his efforts to stay composed.","Pei Buxian grabbed a knife from the table, ready to charge!","Pei Youchuan swiftly confiscated it. \"Didn’t you hear Qiao Chuchu say that attacking Ji Yanchuan head-on would backfire?! Do you want to cause trouble for her?!\"","Pei Buxian narrowed his eyes, picked up a decorative pebble from a potted plant, and hurled it at the back of Ji Yanchuan’s head!","Ji Yanchuan yelped as the pebble struck him. \"Ow!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to him in surprise.","He clutched his head and looked around. \"Who threw that?!\"","Qiao Chuchu paused, glancing toward the corner.","The waitstaff who had been there earlier were gone.","But their faint scent lingered, mingling with the fragrance of her favorite body wash.","Qiao Chuchu thought for a moment, then looked up at the security camera.","The four men in the surveillance room met her gaze, their expressions shifting as they guiltily averted their eyes.","But realizing she couldn’t see them, they turned their attention back to the screen.","She slowly looked away, standing beneath the camera. \"Are you bleeding?\"","Ji Yanchuan blinked, still holding his head. \"No.\"","She nodded. \"Good.\"","Ji Yanchuan frowned. \"Why did you ask if I was bleeding?\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored him and walked off.","Ji Yanchuan followed closely behind, unable to hide his excitement. \"Were you worried about me, you crazy woman?\"","She didn’t answer, instead glancing over her shoulder.","Someone was storming out of the corner, only to be yanked back by another person!","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Suddenly, she felt a headache coming on.","She pinched the bridge of her nose and, once out of the camera’s range, bluntly told Ji Yanchuan, \"No, I just wanted to laugh at you.\"","The light in Ji Yanchuan’s eyes dimmed, and he gritted his teeth in frustration. \"I hope you stay this arrogant in front of me forever!\"","Later, when the horse spooked, he’d make her scream his name in panic! Then he’d save her and show her just how amazing he was!","Qiao Chuchu could read Ji Yanchuan like an open book.","It was always the same old routine—make her panic so he could play the hero.","She wasn’t interested, but she glanced back again.","The group was still tailing her, sneaking around.","Feeling her gaze, they quickly ducked out of sight!","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","A staff member handed her a small white horse. \"Miss Qiao, this is the gentlest horse. Please mount it.\"","Qiao Chuchu waved him off, walking past to select a black Arabian horse instead. \"I’ll take this one.\"","The staff hesitated. \"This horse is too fast. You might not be able to control it.\"","\"This one,\" she said firmly, patting the horse’s head and shooting Ji Yanchuan a challenging look. \"Ji Yanchuan, pick a good horse too. Let’s race—ten laps, first to finish wins.\"","Ji Yanchuan hesitated. \"Uh...\"","He could ride, but he wasn’t great at racing.","He glanced at the staff. \"He said it’s hard to control. Falling could be fatal.\"","Plus, if the horse was too fast, it’d be hard to stage a heroic rescue.","Qiao Chuchu saw right through him and led the horse out. \"Fine, you can ride the gentle pony. It suits you—won’t make much of a splash.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Without hesitation, Ji Yanchuan chose a thoroughbred. \"I’ll show you what it means to soar like an eagle on horseback!\"","Qiao Chuchu mounted her horse with ease, leisurely watching him.","Pei Buxian and the others sneaked over to the edge of the track, pretending to chat with the staff. \"You know it’s going to rain tomorrow?\"","The confused staff member: \"Huh?\"","Pei Buxian, keeping an eye on Qiao Chuchu and Ji Yanchuan, added, \"Great weather today, right?\"","Staff: \"Huh??\"","Ji Yanchuan leapt onto his horse, glaring at Qiao Chuchu. \"Qiao Chuchu, let’s make a bet.\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow. \"What bet?\"","Ji Yanchuan gripped the reins, lifting his chin proudly like a noble prince. \"If I win today, you have to agree to another date with me, and you can’t hit me anymore.\"","She nodded. \"Deal.\"","Pei Buxian: \"!\"","She agreed?!","She actually agreed?!","Ji Yanchuan: \"!\"","She agreed!","She actually agreed!!","He puffed up with confidence. \"You won’t beat me, Qiao Chuchu. I’ve been riding since I was a kid, and I’m a strong man. There’s no way you can outrun me.\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked. \"It’s not like you’re running on four legs.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","She gently urged her horse forward, lining up at the starting point.","Ji Yanchuan rode up beside her. \"You haven’t said what you want if you win.\"","Qiao Chuchu tied her hair back, revealing her delicate face, and said simply, \"If I win, you stop asking me out.\"","Ji Yanchuan froze.","She gave him a confident smile. \"If we meet again, treat me as an enemy. No more pestering. Use whatever means you want against me, and I’ll do the same to you.\"","Ji Yanchuan was baffled, growing more confused. \"Why do you insist on making us enemies?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Because you once hired men to assault me.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?!\"","Her smile turned dark. \"I was almost violated by a group of men, and you were behind it. You covered your tracks so well that even if I tried to sue you, there’s no evidence.\"","She had foolishly forgotten to record the conversation earlier.","But it didn’t matter. As the chosen one favored by fate, even with evidence, she’d likely face backlash and die.","Ji Yanchuan’s face drained of color.","Twenty meters away, Pei Buxian strained to hear but couldn’t make out Qiao Chuchu’s words. He stomped his foot in frustration. \"Why aren’t I a horse? Then I could be ridden by her!\"","The others stayed silent, watching the confrontation from a distance.","Qiao Chuchu said something.","Ji Yanchuan seemed to turn to stone.","He gripped the reins, shaking his head unconsciously as worry crept into his expression. \"It wasn’t me—\"","Qiao Chuchu cut him off, uninterested in lies. \"I don’t understand why you think being nice to me, apologizing, or bending over backward for me would make me forgive you.\"","She gave him a mocking smile. \"You’re a despicable man who deserves to rot in hell.\"","Ji Yanchuan’s chest heaved as he stared at her in disbelief, trying to explain. \"Qiao Chuchu, I—\"","Qiao Chuchu interrupted again. \"Ten laps. First to finish wins. Get ready.\"","Ji Yanchuan frowned, his concern deepening. \"If I win, will you give me a chance to explain?\"","\"Sure,\" Qiao Chuchu said with a bright smile under the sun. \"But only if you can win.\"","Ji Yanchuan’s expression hardened, as if he’d made a decision, and he signaled for the staff to start counting laps.","The whistle blew!","Ji Yanchuan shot forward!","Qiao Chuchu followed closely, watching him push ahead with a cold smile before speeding past him.","Ji Yanchuan stayed calm, his palms sweating, not daring to slack off or panic!","She grew faster, nearing the end of the first lap, even waving casually at Pei Buxian and the others.","They didn’t know what she was up to but, as if entranced, stepped forward and lined up.","Qiao Chuchu leaned sideways from her horse, approaching them in a daring and precarious manner.","They stared at her in stunned silence.","Pei Buxian stood in the center, watching as Qiao Chuchu slowly reached out—","and removed his glasses and hat!","His platinum hair cascaded down in an instant!","He panicked, quickly covering his head with his hands!","The other men were even more astonished, their eyes wide with shock and admiration as they gazed at Qiao Chuchu, their expressions filled with awe.","Qiao Chuchu, still on her horse, flashed a triumphant smile and tossed the glasses back to Pei Buxian. \"I'll come back to settle the score with you after I win!\"","Pei Buxian caught the glasses, his gaze fixed on Qiao Chuchu's flowing hair. His expression gradually turned dazed. \"She's so cool...\"","She really, really is so cool!!!"]},{"number":242,"title":"Chapter 242: She's Really Awesome","paragraphs":["Weisheng Wenzhan watched Qiao Chuchu galloping on the screen, a subtle smile tugging at the corner of his lips. He narrowed his eyes in anticipation, \"Do you think Qiao Chuchu only recognized Pei Buxian, or did she recognize all of us?\"","Weisheng Biehe chuckled lightly, \"Looking at Pei Buxian's shameless behavior, whether she recognized him or not doesn’t really matter anymore.\"","Pei Yuan stared intently at the screen without a word.","Pei Che took a deep breath, his gaze also unable to shift away from the figure on the screen.","Pei Buxian, whose identity had been exposed, stopped pretending altogether. He pulled off his mask, cupped his hands around his mouth like a megaphone, and shouted with zero dignity, \"Go, Chuchu! You can do it!!\"","Not to be outdone, Pei Youchuan also removed his mask and yelled, \"Qiao Chuchu, show the spirit of our family! Win this, and I’ll give you a red envelope! A big one!!\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced back at them, both amused and exasperated, but she maintained her speed and continued forward.","Ji Yanchuan, on the other hand, was struggling to keep up.","He sat uncomfortably on his horse, feeling like his backside was being shattered by the relentless bouncing!","If this kept up, he was going to lose!","Frustrated, he shot a glare at one of the staff members.","Hurry up and execute the plan!","The staff member understood immediately and picked up the phone to make a call.","Qiao Chuchu, riding her horse, scanned her surroundings.","She remembered Ji Yanchuan’s plan to sabotage her.","Would she give him the chance? Not a chance~","From her elevated position, she spotted a man walking toward her, clutching what seemed to be a handful of pebbles.","Hah, trying to startle her horse, huh?","She slowed her pace slightly, keeping an eye on Ji Yanchuan as he caught up.","Ji Yanchuan’s face lit up with excitement!","He was about to overtake her!","He looked at Qiao Chuchu expectantly, only to see her suddenly accelerate, charging straight toward the man!","Ji Yanchuan: \"?!\"","What was she doing?!","The man was also caught off guard by Qiao Chuchu’s move and turned to run, \"Hey! What are you doing?!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t answer. Just as she was about to collide with the man, she skillfully steered her horse back onto the track!","The man, still shaken, stared at her retreating figure in disbelief before angrily hurling the pebbles at her, \"Are you crazy?!\"","Ji Yanchuan happened to be passing by at that moment.","The pebbles landed squarely on his horse’s head!","The horse reared up in fright, neighing loudly, and began galloping wildly!","Ji Yanchuan, unable to regain control, was thrown off and landed face-first in the mud, swallowing a mouthful of dirt, \"Ah!!\"","The man panicked and rushed over to Ji Yanchuan, \"Mr. Ji! Mr. Ji, are you okay?!\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced back at Ji Yanchuan, who had fallen off his horse, and let out a light scoff before riding off with a satisfied smile.","Pei Buxian burst into laughter, \"Hahaha, is Ji Yanchuan really this bad? He actually fell off!\"","Pei Fengnong thought for a moment and remarked with amusement, \"Is this what Ji Yanchuan meant by ‘hero saving the beauty’? Except Chuchu ended up outsmarting him?!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci’s eyes sparkled as they whistled and cheered, \"Chuchu, you’re amazing!!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan pursed his lips, his gaze fixed intently on Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Lin also watched her with unwavering focus.","Qiao Chuchu waved at them, \"Hi!!!\"","Pei Youchuan trembled with excitement, his fists clenched tightly in front of him, \"This is incredible. I think I’m falling head over heels for her!\"","Meanwhile, Ji Yanchuan was in too much pain to speak, his face contorted in agony. When he finally regained his senses, he looked up in a daze at Qiao Chuchu.","She had already completed another lap and was heading back toward him.","Her eyes locked onto his.","Ji Yanchuan, lying on the ground, stared at her blankly.","For a moment, he felt like she might come over to help him up.","But then the man beside him started shouting, snapping him out of his trance, \"Mr. Ji, get up! She’s coming right at you!\"","Ji Yanchuan finally realized—Qiao Chuchu wasn’t slowing down!","She was heading straight for him!!"]},{"number":243,"title":"Chapter 243: So Clingy It Gives Her the Creeps","paragraphs":["Ji Yanchuan tried to get up, but a sharp pain shot through his wrist, leaving him unable to rise. He could only look at Qiao Chuchu in panic.","The bright sunlight bathed her figure.","She was riding a horse, galloping toward him without a care in the world.","Then, with a leap, the horse effortlessly jumped over him!","His eyes widened, his heart pounding so hard it felt like it might burst out of his chest. His gaze followed her relentlessly!","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes sparkled with mischievous delight as she turned her head to look back at him, laughing freely. “Ji Yanchuan, you lost!”","Ji Yanchuan was stunned, unable to speak.","From the very beginning, Qiao Chuchu had carried an air of arrogance, as if she didn’t take him seriously at all.","She was confident he wouldn’t win against her.","On top of that, she had proactively attacked the people he had arranged, throwing his subordinates into disarray...","Could it be that she had anticipated he would try to trick her?!","Ji Yanchuan’s expression changed drastically!","If she really had guessed his plan, then was Qiao Chuchu even human?!","How did she always seem to know everything? And why did she always manage to outdo him?","A chilling sense of dread mixed with an inexplicable electric sensation surged through his body.","Ji Yanchuan stumbled to his feet, his eyes fixed on Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure.","She was galloping toward a man with platinum-blonde hair.","Qiao Chuchu reached out her hand to Pei Buxian. “Pei Buxian, want to join me for a ride?”","Pei Buxian’s eyes lit up with amazement, and without hesitation, he took her hand.","With a gentle tug, Qiao Chuchu pulled him onto the horse!","Pei Youchuan was frantic. “Why didn’t Qiao Chuchu invite me too?!”","Weisheng Lin immediately dashed to the stables to pick a horse!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci quickly followed suit.","Shen Zhuoyan stood awkwardly in place, watching them with longing eyes as they headed to the stables.","Pei Youchuan turned to go to the stables but noticed Shen Zhuoyan standing still. He waved at him. “Come on, or else all the good horses will be taken by those scheming guys!”","Shen Zhuoyan hesitated, tempted to join but still rooted to the spot.","“C-can I really?” he asked uncertainly.","Pei Youchuan chuckled warmly. “Of course you can! Everyone’s playing, so why not you? It’s not like our family is stingy or anything.”","Shen Zhuoyan’s eyes brightened, and after a quick glance in Qiao Chuchu’s direction, he hurried into the stables.","Qiao Chuchu focused ahead, calling out to Pei Buxian, “Are you okay?”","Pei Buxian was puzzled. “What do you mean?”","She glanced at him sideways. “Weren’t you chasing after the car earlier? I didn’t get out because I had no choice, not because I didn’t care about you.”","*Sigh, even though I said that, Pei Buxian’s unreasonable nature probably won’t believe me.*","Pei Buxian’s brows furrowed almost imperceptibly. “I know.”","Qiao Chuchu was surprised. “You know?”","His hair fluttered slightly in the wind, revealing a face so delicate it was almost androgynous, like a beautiful kitten. He rested his head on her shoulder and said softly, “Sometimes I might not understand, but if you say you had no choice, I’ll believe you.”","Whether he could hear her thoughts or not.","As long as she said she had no choice, he would believe her.","But Qiao Chuchu didn’t believe him. “You’re so carefree, yet you chased after the car?”","“Chasing the car and being carefree are two different things,” Pei Buxian said, nuzzling her shoulder with a hint of insecurity. “At that moment, I was terrified, afraid you’d leave me behind like you did seven years ago.”","Qiao Chuchu was baffled. “Huh?”","His long lashes lowered, making him look like a child afraid of losing something precious. “Ever since we had that rift between us, I’ve always felt like I couldn’t hold onto you.”","Qiao Chuchu found it absurd and glanced at his hand clutching her sleeve. “But aren’t you holding on right now?”","Pei Buxian was taken aback.","She noticed Pei Youchuan and the others catching up on their horses and cheerfully announced, “And now you better hold on tight—I’m speeding up!”","Pei Buxian’s heart raced as he tightened his grip around her waist. “I’m holding on! And I’m holding on tight!”","Pei Youchuan rode up hastily. “Pei Buxian, get off! A grown man sitting behind a young lady—aren’t you embarrassed?!”","Pei Buxian stuck out his tongue. “No way! You’re just jealous!”","Pei Youchuan was speechless. “???”","Weisheng Lin galloped ahead, closing in on Qiao Chuchu, and even managed to make a phone call. “Play that song—‘The Brave and Mighty Herdsman’!”","The person on the other end of the line was confused. “What song?”","Soon, the corresponding BGM began playing over the speakers at the riding field.","Pei Yuan and Pei Che hurried to the stables, unable to resist joining in after seeing the commotion on the monitors.","Weisheng Biehe followed closely, turning back expectantly. “Big brother, are you coming?”","Weisheng Wenzhan adjusted his glasses and sat in the waiting area, smiling as he glanced at the scene. “I’ll pass. I’ll just watch you all have fun.”","Qiao Chuchu rode by and spotted Weisheng Wenzhan, stopping her horse in exasperation. “Wenzhan, why are you here too? Don’t you all have work to do?”","Weisheng Wenzhan crossed his legs, leaning back comfortably in his chair, and smiled up at her. “Delaying work to come here was worth it. After all, what happened earlier was hard to ignore.”","Qiao Chuchu sighed. “You’re all such gossips.”","Wenzhan pushed his glasses up and replied calmly, “In a way, I don’t think it’s gossip. It’s more like concern. You just got over a cold, and my brother is especially worried about you.”","Pei Buxian, sitting behind Qiao Chuchu, poked his head out with a sulky expression. “If your brother’s so concerned, why are you here? Can you split his concern?”","Weisheng Wenzhan’s smile stiffened, and he shot Pei Buxian a cool glance. “Keep playing the pitiful crybaby, Mr. Pei Buxian.”","Pei Buxian retorted, “Chuchu doesn’t mind if I cry.”","Qiao Chuchu wriggled out of his grasp, pouting. “Actually, I do mind.”","Pei Buxian puffed out his cheeks. “You’re just saying that. I don’t believe you!”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci rode up, scolding, “Pei Buxian, let go of Qiao Chuchu! Stop clinging to her!”","Pei Yuan led his horse out and barked, “Pei Buxian, have you no shame? Get down right now!”","Pei Che gripped his reins, glaring coldly at Pei Buxian. “Pei Buxian, I’ll count to three. If you don’t get down, don’t bother coming home tonight. Go wherever you want.”","Pei Buxian pouted, hiding behind Qiao Chuchu and muttering, “No, I won’t.”","Qiao Chuchu, now noticing Pei Che’s presence, was puzzled. “Didn’t I tell you all not to follow me? Why are you here?”","*And they all came. It’s starting to feel a bit creepy. Don’t they realize they’re getting too close? It’s really clingy.*","Pei Che froze for a moment but quickly replied, “Who said we’re following you? We’re just here to ride horses.”","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow. “Really?”","Pei Youchuan nodded. “Yeah, we’re just here to ride horses. Who said we came for you?”","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes, seeing right through them. “Then why are you wearing staff uniforms?”","Pei Youchuan’s mouth twitched. “I changed jobs, okay?”","She drawled sarcastically, “Oh~ so you all changed jobs. Fine, you can all work here from now on. Just transfer your companies to me.”","The Pei family members chorused, “Sure, go ahead. You already own shares in our companies anyway.”","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. “What?”","Weisheng Lin burst out laughing, teasing, “What are we waiting for? Let’s congratulate Qiao Chuchu on becoming the chairman of so many companies!”"]},{"number":244,"title":"Chapter 244: Ji Yanchuan's Choice","paragraphs":["Biehe and Wen Zhan clapped enthusiastically: \"Congratulations, Miss Qiao.\"","Shen Zhuoyan rode his horse up to Qiao Chuchu, chuckling. \"Qiao Chuchu, you’ve always wanted to be a famous painter, but now you finally have the chance to become a company CEO.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Ji Yanchuan, cradling his injured hand, trudged away with a dejected expression.","After a few steps, he paused and looked back at Qiao Chuchu.","She was surrounded by a crowd in the center, wearing a bitter smile. \"You all really leave me speechless.\"","The handsome men on horseback subtly lowered their postures around her, their eyes fixed on her face, watching her reactions. When she smiled, they mirrored her joy, their eyes crinkling.","Even the usually distant Weisheng Wenzhan joined in, occasionally chiming in before quietly observing her with a faint smile.","Ji Yanchuan had a strange illusion.","Qiao Chuchu seemed to be their center.","An indispensable center.","His heart ached as he recalled her scathing words—","*\"You’re just a worthless scumbag who deserves to be torn apart and thrown into hell.\"*","A suffocating pain gripped his chest. Staggering forward, his vision darkened, and he collapsed.","The staff member beside him gasped. \"Mr. Ji! Mr. Ji, what’s wrong?!\"","Hearing the commotion, Qiao Chuchu glanced over the crowd and saw Ji Yanchuan cradled in the staff’s arms.","She indifferently averted her gaze. \"Who else isn’t feeling well? Do you need to go to the hospital? I can accompany you now.\"","The men exchanged glances before shaking their heads. \"Just a minor cold. It’s nothing. We still have to go to the company, but let’s take one last ride with you. Enjoy yourself.\"","Her eyes lit up. \"Really?\"","\"Of course,\" Weisheng Wenzhan replied, taking the reins from a staff member. \"I’ll join too. Let’s see who wins.\"","She confidently urged her horse ahead. \"I won’t lose. I’m definitely taking first place!\"","They exchanged amused glances, following behind her with indulgent smiles. \"Yes, you’re the champion, the most amazing champion.\"","Ji Yanchuan weakly opened his eyes, the distant laughter and joy piercing his haze. He wanted to see her again, but his strength failed him.","Something dragged him under, pulling him into a murky dream.","In the dream, two familiar figures stood before him.","Xia Xuechun basked in warm sunlight, smiling brightly with three children. \"Ji Yanchuan~\"","The three boys waved enthusiastically. \"Daddy!\"","Confused, he took a step toward them—until Qiao Chuchu’s laughter echoed.","Ji Yanchuan turned toward the sound.","Qiao Chuchu stood amidst a blur of faces, pampered and adored, lazily plucking a cherry from a fruit tray someone handed her. She glanced at him, her expression cold, then turned away.","He lurched forward. \"Wait!\"","\"Ji Yanchuan!\" Xia Xuechun grabbed his hand, pleading. \"Don’t go to her. Come with me!\"","She pointed toward the radiant sunlight. \"Let’s go there together. I promise you won’t get hurt!\"","The path toward Qiao Chuchu had twisted into a dark, narrow alley, oozing unknown terrors.","Xia Xuechun urged earnestly, \"That road is too harsh. You won’t make it out. It wasn’t meant for you—trust me!\"","He shook his head, pushing her hand away. \"I know. I just need to talk to her. I won’t stay long.\"","He just wanted to explain.","Once he did, he’d leave immediately.","He’d never linger by her side!","He plunged into the thorny path, forcing his way forward. \"Qiao Chuchu!\"","Sweat drenched Ji Yanchuan as he tossed in bed, muttering, \"Qiao Chuchu... Qiao Chuchu...\"","Ye Huining frowned, checking his temperature with a digital thermometer.","38.5°C.","She set it down sharply, turning to the butler. \"Has he been like this since returning?\"","The butler nodded. \"He’s also been delirious.\"","Worried, she sighed. \"I’ve never seen my son so distressed. When his engagement with Lin Qing was called off, he acted like nothing happened.\"","Suppressing her anger, she demanded, \"Did you investigate?\"","The butler confirmed, \"Only one person matches—Qiao Chu, the daughter of the painter Qiao Qiao. Her nickname is Qiao Chuchu.\"","Ye Huining’s brow furrowed. \"Qiao Qiao’s daughter? Isn’t she Pei Nan’s daughter-in-law?\"","She had attended the same school as Qiao Qiao and Pei Nan.","Back then, Pei Nan had cut ties with her family, and Qiao Qiao supported her by selling paintings to fund her education.","The two were inseparable.","When Qiao Qiao had a daughter, Pei Nan threw an extravagant first-birthday celebration, declaring the child her future daughter-in-law and warning others to back off.","The opulence of that party even made headlines.","Now, years later, both women were gone—leaving behind Qiao Chu and Pei Nan’s seven sons.","Ye Huining didn’t know much about Qiao Qiao.","But she knew Pei Nan well.","In business, the woman was a predator.","In relationships, she was obsessive.","Qiao Qiao had been a popular painter in school.","Ye Huining once tried befriending her to ride on her fame, but Pei Nan cornered her in a hallway, warning her that Qiao Qiao’s only friend would ever be her.","Convinced Pei Nan was unhinged, Ye Huining tried turning Qiao Qiao against her.","Qiao Qiao confronted Pei Nan—only for Pei Nan to \"accidentally\" fall down the stairs, breaking her leg.","The incident terrified both Qiao Qiao and Ye Huining, especially when Pei Nan clung to Qiao Qiao, weeping while glaring daggers at her.","Ye Huining believed in the inheritance of flawed traits.","Pei Nan’s seven sons must have inherited her obsession and ruthlessness.","And Qiao Chu had grown up surrounded by them.","What did that make *her*?","After a pause, Ye Huining ordered, \"Keep him indoors these next few days. Call a doctor for an IV drip.\"","Ji Yanchuan gripped the sheets, still mumbling, \"Qiao Chuchu... listen to me... let me explain...\"","Ye Huining hesitated before closing her eyes in resignation. \"Butler, contact Qiao Chu. Tell her I have her mother’s first sold painting and ask if she wants to buy it back.\"","After Qiao Qiao’s death, her artwork skyrocketed in value.","Many wealthy women capitalized on the trend.","To stand out in high society, Ye Huining had acquired Qiao Qiao’s first piece, using it to bolster her status.","With the bait set, Qiao Chu would come.","And she would make that girl take care of her precious son!"]},{"number":245,"title":"Chapter 245: I Am Qiao Chu","paragraphs":["The next day.","Qiao Chuchu stood before an opulent estate, feeling as though she had stumbled upon an upgraded version of the Wei Sheng Family’s mansion.","So grand.","So luxurious.","Just walking from the gate to the front door would probably take five minutes.","Ye Huining stood on the second floor, a teacup in hand, gazing down at her.","Qiao Chuchu, impeccably made up and dressed in a soft yellow knit linen set, approached the house with a spring in her step.","Beside her walked a bodyguard.","He towered over her by two heads, broad-shouldered and long-legged, clad in a tailored suit.","His features were strikingly handsome, yet his eyes were shadowed, as if veiled in gloom, his presence imposing.","And the longer she looked, the more familiar he seemed.","Suddenly, the man lifted his gaze to meet hers.","Ye Huining’s pupils constricted. She clapped a hand over her mouth, disbelief washing over her.","Good heavens—Qiao Chuchu’s bodyguard was Shen Zhuoyan, the eldest son of the Shen Family!","That father-killing bastard!","Shen Zhuoyan’s eyes lingered on her face for a few seconds before he coldly averted his gaze.","Ye Huining remained shaken, feeling as though she had been marked by a wolf, her back prickling with unease.","A bodyguard like that absolutely must not come near her son!","She hurried to Ji Yanchuan’s side. \"Son, get up. We have a guest.\"","Ji Yanchuan opened his eyes with difficulty, his voice hoarse and dry. \"I have no strength. I don’t want to entertain anyone.\"","Ye Huining pulled him up with effort, coaxing gently, \"Come on, this is a very important guest. You’ll be happy to see them.\"","Ji Yanchuan pushed her away irritably. \"No! Nothing can make me happy right now.\"","Unless it was Qiao Chuchu.","Ye Huining nearly stumbled but didn’t lose her temper. Instead, she sat on the edge of the bed, smoothing his hair and speaking in a soothing tone. \"The guest is here to buy a painting. You have a good memory and can introduce the pieces properly. Go freshen up.\"","Ji Yanchuan had no choice but to drag himself out of bed. \"Give me the description sheet.\"","---","Qiao Chuchu stood in the art studio, her gaze fixed on an oil painting hanging on the wall.","It was her mother’s work.","She recognized it at once.","Her mother had excelled in impressionist painting—this was the first piece she had ever sold.","According to Aunt Pei, her mother had used the earnings from this very painting to pay for both their tuitions.","With determination, Qiao Chuchu murmured, \"I must have this painting. I’ve already prepared the money.\"","Her wealth was divided into three parts: what she had earned herself, dividends from her shares in the Pei Family’s company, and the red packets her family had given her over the years.","The red packets alone amounted to billions.","So she was determined to succeed!","Shen Zhuoyan nodded, smiling along with her. \"Yes, you’ll definitely get it.\"","The butler approached Shen Zhuoyan. \"Our master will be arriving shortly. Could you wait in the hallway? He prefers not to have bodyguards present when speaking with guests.\"","Shen Zhuoyan frowned. \"I can stay silent, standing in the corner.\"","The butler maintained a polite smile, but his tone was firm. \"That won’t be possible.\"","\"Just listen to him,\" Qiao Chuchu said. \"Some people are particular about these things.\"","Reluctantly, Shen Zhuoyan stepped into the hallway, his eyes lingering on Qiao Chuchu as if unwilling to let her out of his sight.","The butler closed the door, shutting out his gaze, and grinned at Shen Zhuoyan. \"Heh.\"","Shen Zhuoyan scowled and turned away.","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu continued studying the painting, tracing the brushstrokes with her eyes.","Ji Yanchuan walked in from the adjoining room, fastening his wristwatch as he stopped a few steps behind her. \"You have excellent taste. This was the first painting ever sold by the artist Qiao Qiao.\"","His voice was rough and deep, its usual vitality absent.","The mention of Qiao Qiao inevitably made him think of Qiao Chuchu.","His expression darkened with melancholy. \"Her daughter, Qiao Chu, is also a fairly well-known artist. Did you know?\"","\"I do,\" Qiao Chuchu replied, still focused on the painting without turning around. \"Because I am Qiao Chu.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...?\""]},{"number":246,"title":"Chapter 246: Ji Yanchuan: I'm Socially Awkward and Can't Stand People","paragraphs":["Ji Yanchuan stared blankly at Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure, momentarily at a loss for words.","He studied her silhouette again and again.","Confirmed the shade of her auburn hair.","Then he swiftly turned to look behind him.","Ye Huining stood there, smiling at him with indulgent affection before gently closing the partition door.","Ji Yanchuan was utterly stunned.","Qiao Chuchu was in his house!","She wore a tailored suit dress, her high-heeled feet neatly pressed together.","She had clearly dressed up meticulously to see him.","Even her back view was strikingly beautiful.","A flicker of joy rose in Ji Yanchuan, followed by confusion.","Qiao Chuchu had spoken so harshly to him before, even resorting to ruthless tactics against him. So why did she suddenly seem more and more agreeable the longer he looked at her?","As he pondered, Qiao Chuchu began to turn around.","Ji Yanchuan’s expression twisted in panic. He frantically scanned the room, snatched up a decorative mask, and slapped it over his face!","When Qiao Chuchu fully turned, she frowned in bewilderment at the sight of Ji Yanchuan’s bizarrely shaped mask. “Why are you wearing that?”","Ji Yanchuan clutched the mask, avoiding her gaze. “I—I have social anxiety. I can’t talk to people face-to-face.”","Qiao Chuchu nodded in understanding, not pressing further. “May I ask how much you’re asking for this painting?”","Ji Yanchuan glanced at the price list his mother had prepared.","The painting had been purchased twenty years ago, during Qiao Qiao’s peak fame, right after her passing.","The original price was one million.","Adjusting for inflation and the era’s value, five million would be a fair ask now.","After a moment’s hesitation, Ji Yanchuan studied Qiao Chuchu and ventured, “Do you know whose house this is?”","Qiao Chuchu shook her head apologetically. “Only that it belongs to a woman surnamed Ye. She contacted me through an acquaintance, saying she had my mother’s first sold artwork and asked if I wanted to buy it back.”","Ji Yanchuan nodded.","So she didn’t know this was his home—or that he was Ji Yanchuan.","Luckily, his hoarse voice now sounded nothing like his usual tone, so she hadn’t recognized him.","His gaze drifted down to Qiao Chuchu’s hands, and his mind wandered.","Just yesterday, she’d twisted his arm, pinned him against a car, and smirked at him with disdain.","Yet here she stood before him now, soft and sweet as a marzipan cake.","Almost without thinking, he blurted, “I’ll sell it to you for one million—the original price. But on one condition: you spend a harmonious day with me. No inappropriate demands, nothing impolite. I just want to be near you quietly. From now until after dinner, and the painting is yours.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","Excuse me?","Was this guy messing with her?","Buying a painting shouldn’t come with imprisonment!","She wasn’t that bored.","She refused outright. “No. Raise the price if you want, and I’ll consider it. But I won’t entertain this kind of request.”","Ji Yanchuan stiffened. “But this is your mother’s first work before she passed. Doesn’t it mean something to you?”","“Art is lifeless; people aren’t. It’s meaningful, but not *that* meaningful.”","Qiao Chuchu’s brows knitted in displeasure. “If my mother were alive, she’d never want me held hostage or mistreated over a painting.”","She turned to leave. “I’ll go now. Think it over, and I’ll return if you change your mind.”","Ji Yanchuan grabbed her arm in panic. “Wait!”","Qiao Chuchu looked at him.","He recoiled as if burned, stammering, “Sorry, that was rude. I just... don’t have friends. I wanted someone to talk to.”","His face burned with shame as he lied, avoiding her eyes. “It’s rare to meet another fan of Qiao Qiao’s work. I hoped we could discuss it. No ill intent.”","He backtracked hastily. “How about two hours? Just two hours—no unreasonable asks, just talking about art.”","After a pause, Qiao Chuchu relented. “Fine.”","Ji Yanchuan brightened, gesturing to a seat. “Please!”","Two hours would do.","If he could charm her, make her like him, maybe she’d forgive him!","He’d never lacked admirers—handsome, wealthy, effortlessly charismatic. A little effort, and Qiao Chuchu would melt!","---","Meanwhile, Shen Zhuoyan waited in the hallway.","Ye Huining approached, eyeing him with disdain. “You’re Shen Zhuoyan of the Shen family, correct?”","Shen Zhuoyan’s expression darkened as he glared at her.","Her lips curled mockingly. “Surprised someone like you found employment. Does your employer know you’re a murderer? Or did you hide it?”","Shen Zhuoyan turned away, ignoring her.","Unfazed, Ye Huining continued, “If my son dates Qiao Chuchu, you’ll be the first to go. Pack your things.”","His jaw clenched. “What do you mean?”","She smirked. “Exactly that. A threat like you has no right guarding anyone.”","Shen Zhuoyan’s gaze turned venomous. “If I err, my employer will reprimand me. Not you.”","Ye Huining scoffed. “Ungrateful wretch. Your father raised you diligently, and you repaid him with *that*? I attended his funeral—heard your grandmother’s wailing!”","“I don’t care how they grieved!” Shen Zhuoyan ground out, fists shaking. “My father drove my mother to her death!”","She laughed coldly. “Your mother was weak. Her fault, not his. You’re just making excuses for your crimes!”","---","Inside, Qiao Chuchu frowned. “Is that an argument outside?”","Ji Yanchuan waved it off. “Just my mother. Her voice is shrill—sounds worse than it is.”","But Qiao Chuchu rose, moving to the door to listen.","Shen Zhuoyan’s fists trembled with suppressed rage.","No matter how provoked, he couldn’t retaliate.","He was a bodyguard. His duty was silence.","Swallowing his fury, he stared at the floor.","He wouldn’t cause trouble for Qiao Chuchu.","Ye Huining sneered. “Look at you—unstable, criminal, seething at a few words. How can you protect anyone?”","Qiao Chuchu yanked the door open, eyes blazing. “Mrs. Ye! Direct your remarks to *me*!”","Shen Zhuoyan looked up in surprise as the petite Qiao Chuchu strode out of the art studio and planted herself squarely in front of him.","Her arms lifted slightly, like a fledgling shielding its mother hen, as she snapped indignantly, \"You summoned me here to buy paintings—was it just to humiliate my bodyguard?!\""]},{"number":247,"title":"Chapter 247: She Was the Love of His Youth, the Lady He Vowed to Protect in Adulthood","paragraphs":["Ye Huining didn’t expect Qiao Chuchu to hear her. Embarrassed, she covered her mouth and quickly backtracked, \"Miss Qiao, do you even know who this bodyguard you’re protecting is? He’s—\"","Qiao Chuchu cut her off: \"I know!\"","Ye Huining froze, then scoffed in disbelief: \"You know he used to be a murderer?\"","Without hesitation, Qiao Chuchu replied, \"Yes, I know.\"","Ye Huining: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Shen Zhuoyan stood helplessly behind Qiao Chuchu, gazing at her with guilt.","Qiao Chuchu’s expression turned steely. \"I don’t care what Shen Zhuoyan has done in the past. Right now, he’s my bodyguard. Insulting him is the same as slapping me in the face. I’m not happy with this deal anymore—I’m calling it off!\"","She grabbed Shen Zhuoyan’s hand and turned to leave.","Shen Zhuoyan followed closely behind her. \"Miss, what about the painting?\"","\"Forget it!\"","Her back was ramrod straight. \"I won’t let a painting chain me down and make me—and my people—suffer. It’s just a painting. My mother sold plenty of her works; I can buy something else.\"","Shen Zhuoyan tightened his grip on her hand. \"But that was your mother’s first piece. You should buy it. It’s what you wanted.\"","He hurriedly explained, \"I’m fine. That person was just telling the truth. I can take it. But I don’t want you to leave empty-handed. Really, I’m okay.\"","He had endured plenty of humiliation since his release from prison.","Some had even tracked down his address just to taunt him.","The Shen family had also given him no shortage of trouble, both openly and covertly.","He was used to it by now.","Shen Zhuoyan squeezed her hand. \"Stay, Miss. I don’t mind. Buy the painting, and then we’ll go.\"","Qiao Chuchu stopped and looked at him seriously. \"Shen Zhuoyan, my mother passed away twenty-one years ago. If reincarnation exists, she’d be twenty-one by now.\"","She held his hand tighter. \"I wanted that painting for some emotional comfort. But if buying it comes at the cost of your dignity, what kind of comfort would that bring me?\"","Shen Zhuoyan stared at her, stunned, his eyes reflecting her unwavering resolve.","The unspoken love in his heart bubbled up like a spring, warming every inch of his body.","At a loss for words, he could only fix his gaze on her face, watching her with an almost reverent intensity. \"How could I ever deserve this...?\"","Qiao Chuchu tugged him along. \"Let’s go home.\"","Ji Yanchuan snapped out of his daze and hurried after her. \"Miss Qiao, wait! It was my mother’s fault—let’s talk this over, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t look back, shoving Shen Zhuoyan into the car before declaring firmly, \"Don’t bother. I’m not buying it!\"","Shen Zhuoyan kept staring at her, his expression unconsciously adoring.","Qiao Chuchu angrily told the driver, \"Drive.\"","The driver nodded and pulled away.","Ji Yanchuan watched helplessly as the car disappeared into the distance. He tore off his mask, struggling to catch his breath. \"Mom! What was that for?! I just got her to agree to talk to me!\"","He glared at Ye Huining. \"Why did you have to stir up trouble?!\"","Ye Huining shrugged, equally aggrieved. \"I was just worried he’d hurt you if you got involved with her! Who knew Qiao Chuchu would be so unreasonable, keeping a murderer like him around?!\"","Not to mention, Shen Zhuoyan’s father’s mistress had been her friend.","Shen Zhuoyan had gone berserk, killing his own father and her friend. It was only natural she still resented him.","She just hadn’t expected Qiao Chuchu to have such a temper.","Fuming, Ye Huining snapped, \"Ji Yanchuan, mark my words—that look in Shen Zhuoyan’s eyes? He’s in love with Qiao Chuchu. And that woman isn’t short of men around her. If you really want to win her over, you need to eliminate the competition, not just fawn over her like one of her many admirers!\"","Ji Yanchuan blinked. \"Eliminate the competition?\"","\"Exactly!\" Ye Huining huffed, hands on her hips. \"Back in the day, I was the other woman. Your father had a wife. I got rid of her, then edged out the rest of his women, and that’s how I married him. So unless you deal with those men, she’ll never notice you. She’s got too many options—she won’t see how good you are!\"","Ji Yanchuan lowered his gaze in thought, then looked back toward where the car had gone.","That... made sense.","He pulled out his phone. \"Given what Shen Zhuoyan did, the Shen family must want him gone, right?\"","Ye Huining rolled her eyes. \"Of course, but what can they do? He’s still their blood. They just enjoy tormenting him whenever they can.\"","A sly grin spread across his face. \"Maybe I can fan the flames.\"","---","Inside the moving car, Shen Zhuoyan stole several glances at Qiao Chuchu.","Hesitantly, he said, \"Maybe... I shouldn’t be your bodyguard anymore.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"Why?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s brows furrowed. \"What happened back then was a huge scandal in our circles. Everyone around you knows what I did. Keeping me close will only bring you trouble. They’ll talk.\"","\"Let them talk,\" Qiao Chuchu dismissed with a wave. \"I don’t see anything wrong with you. You’re loyal and principled. Having you by my side makes me feel safe. Unless it’s my family guarding me, no one could replace you.\"","She met his eyes. \"Shen Zhuoyan, you never used to care about what others thought. You don’t need to start now. You’ve got me.\"","Shen Zhuoyan stiffened, his heart pounding wildly.","A restless heat surged through him. Afraid she’d see him blush, he pressed the back of his hand to his cheek and forced a calm tone. \"I’m your bodyguard. Why are you protecting *me*?\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed and patted his shoulder. \"Then from now on, I’ll handle the verbal attacks, and you take care of the physical ones. And don’t worry—people won’t dare insult you too often with me around. Even kicking a dog requires checking who its owner is first!\"","She quickly added, \"Not that I’m calling you a dog, of course.\"","The ghost of a smile touched Shen Zhuoyan’s lips. If anything, he found the comparison fitting. \"Miss, I told you—as long as you employ me, I’m your loyal hound. Point, and I’ll bite. I’d never defy you.\"","Qiao Chuchu faltered, at a loss for how to respond. Just as she was about to awkwardly laugh it off, the driver suddenly slammed the brakes!","She nearly hit the seat in front of her. Looking up, she saw a luxury car blocking their path.","Several imposing men stepped out, led by a scowling figure who marched to her window and rapped on the glass.","\"Shen Zhuoyan,\" he snarled. \"Get the hell out here!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face paled. Shen Zhuoyan’s smile vanished as he pressed her back into the seat. \"I’ll handle it.\"","He shrugged off his suit jacket, his gaze turning lethal.","\"They’re the physical kind. Give me five minutes.\""]},{"number":248,"title":"Chapter 248: Worthy Opponents in the Art of Scamming","paragraphs":["Ji Yanchuan, wearing a mask and sunglasses, eagerly leaned out from his family’s car.","He had told the Shen family that Shen Zhuoyan had insulted his mother.","Eager to please him, the Shens immediately inquired about Shen Zhuoyan’s whereabouts and sent people over—led by none other than Shen Zhuoyan’s uncle.","Ji Yanchuan smirked triumphantly at his bodyguard. \"Make sure the recording is clear, especially Shen Zhuoyan’s face!\"","\"Understood, Young Master.\"","Confidently placing his hands on his hips, Ji Yanchuan declared, \"Qiao Chuchu is just a spoiled rich girl. Seeing so many people surrounding her will definitely scare her. And since these troublemakers were brought here by her own bodyguard, she’ll have no choice but to back down.\"","Most people hire bodyguards for protection, but if a bodyguard fails to safeguard their employer and instead brings trouble, even if Qiao Chuchu wants to protect Shen Zhuoyan, the Pei family won’t allow it.","The bodyguard glanced at Ji Yanchuan. \"So, when Qiao Chuchu is terrified, you’ll swoop in as the hero?\"","Ji Yanchuan nodded emphatically.","The bodyguard frowned, looking skeptical. \"Young Master, she already beat you up once. Why do you still think you can play the hero?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"What did you just say?!\"","The bodyguard: \"...My apologies, Young Master.\"","Ji Yanchuan narrowed his eyes with cold determination. \"I’ve thoroughly investigated Qiao Chuchu’s past. I know all her preferences and triggers. She’s completely within my grasp now!\"","The bodyguard, holding up the phone to record, couldn’t hide his doubt. \"Are you sure she’s in your grasp, and not the other way around?\"","Ji Yanchuan shot him a deadpan stare.","The bodyguard awkwardly lowered his head. \"Forgive me, Young Master.\"","Ji Yanchuan scoffed. \"Qiao Chuchu has disrespected me enough. I’ll make her pay for it—by making her fall for me. And just when she’s hopelessly in love, I’ll reveal my true self!\"","He removed his sunglasses, revealing his sparkling, confident eyes. \"I’ll watch her suffer, loving me yet doomed to despair, even throwing herself off a building for me!\"","According to his research, Qiao Chuchu appeared sweet and docile on the surface, but in reality, she was a troublemaker.","Her possessiveness was terrifying—she treated the seven Pei brothers as her playthings, even faking suicide attempts to prevent them from talking to other girls. She’d even suffered alcohol poisoning multiple times.","Once a love-struck fool like her fell for someone, she’d lose all rationality, drowning helplessly in obsession!","Once she loved him, she’d follow his every command!","His plan was foolproof—she would inevitably fall for him!","The bodyguard watched him with confusion. \"No wonder you’re the Young Master.\"","Only someone born into privilege, never knowing hardship, could obsess over such petty romance dramas and meticulously plot for love.","\"Enough nonsense,\" Ji Yanchuan snapped. \"Record properly! Get Shen Zhuoyan’s vicious expression clearly—I need to show the Pei brothers!\"","Shen Zhuoyan stepped out of the car, calmly eyeing the man at the center of the group. \"Shen Tuo, if you have something to say, step aside. My employer is here—don’t scare her.\"","Shen Tuo sneered, scanning Shen Zhuoyan with disdain. \"You actually found a job? Or are you just some rich woman’s pretty boy?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s expression darkened. He stepped forward, eyes blazing like a wolf’s. \"Don’t insult my employer!\"","Shen Tuo laughed, his face twisting into something ugly. \"Shen Zhuoyan, I’m not insulting your employer—I’m insulting you, you father-killing bastard! You and your mother should’ve just died together!\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s fist lashed out, striking Shen Tuo square in the face!","Shen Tuo staggered back, and his lackeys swarmed Shen Zhuoyan!","From inside the car, Qiao Chuchu watched the brawl unfold at close range.","Shen Zhuoyan remained composed.","Even after taking a few hits, he swiftly overpowered one attacker after another!","The entire group couldn’t pin him down—several were already groaning on the ground.","Qiao Chuchu stared, awestruck.","**[Hiring Shen Zhuoyan as a bodyguard was the right call! His skills are insane!]**","Shen Zhuoyan, initially tense, paused at her thoughts—then slowly grinned.","Yes.","He’d prove that choosing him was the best decision she’d ever made!","He lunged at Shen Tuo again!","The scene descended into chaos!","Ji Yanchuan, seeing his opportunity, strode forward.","Now was the perfect moment—Qiao Chuchu must be terrified!","Time for him to save the day!","But inside the car, Qiao Chuchu was practically vibrating with excitement, licking her lips as if itching to join the fight.","The driver, however, grew increasingly frantic. \"Miss, what should we do? Should I help him?\"","Qiao Chuchu waved him off eagerly. \"No need! You’re paid to drive, so just drive.\"","The driver: \"?\"","She yanked open the car’s storage compartment—a custom feature she’d requested for self-defense.","Inside lay an arsenal of blunt weapons!","She grabbed a baseball bat and stormed out, murder in her eyes.","Ji Yanchuan, who had just reached the car: \"Miss Qiao—wait, what?!\"","Why was she holding a bat?!","Ignoring him, Qiao Chuchu marched up behind one of Shen Tuo’s men and swung!","The thug yelped, whirling around. \"The hell?! Who hit me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu leaped up and smacked him again. \"Me, that’s who!\"","The man howled in pain. \"OW!!\"","Ji Yanchuan flinched in shock.","The bodyguard recording: \"...\"","Told you. This girl wasn’t the type who needed saving.","Shen Zhuoyan, sporting a bruise on his cheek, paled when he saw Qiao Chuchu and pulled her protectively behind him. \"Why did you come down? I can handle this!\"","Qiao Chuchu shoved past him, bat resting on her shoulder. \"Relax, I’m just out for a stroll.\"","She glared at Shen Tuo. \"What’s your problem?!\"","Shen Tuo blinked, momentarily wary of her. \"This is a family matter, Miss Qiao. Stay out of it!\"","Qiao Chuchu scoffed. \"I would, but Shen Zhuoyan’s on the clock right now—he’s my bodyguard!\"","She crossed her arms. \"No interfering with my bodyguard during work hours. Talk to him after his shift!\"","Shen Tuo: \"? Then when does he get off?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"When he quits. He’s on 24/7 duty.\"","Shen Tuo’s eyes bulged. \"24/7?! So I have to wait until he quits? What if he never does? I’ll be on my deathbed before I get a word in!\"","\"Too bad!\" Qiao Chuchu tilted her chin up defiantly. \"What do you even want with him? You already cut ties!\"","Shen Tuo fumed. \"Cutting ties doesn’t mean we can’t settle things!\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped back, \"Well, I won’t let you!\"","Shen Tuo’s temper flared. \"If you won’t let me talk to him, then I’ll just hit you instead!\"","Qiao Chuchu refused to back down: \"You think this stick in my hand is just for show?!\"","Shen Tuo clutched his chest in frustration: \"If I get hurt, you’ll have to pay for it!\"","Qiao Chuchu shot back sharply: \"You brought all these people to surround my car—I’m so terrified right now that I could collapse on the spot, convulsing, foaming at the mouth, kicking my legs in circles, and flinging sand right at your face!\"","Shen Tuo: \"????\""]},{"number":249,"title":"Chapter 249: Successfully Sowed Discord","paragraphs":["Shen Tuo's eyes widened in anger as he pointed a trembling finger at the stick in Qiao Chuchu's hand. \"How are you scared?! You haven't even dropped that stick of yours!\"","Ji Yanchuan appeared like a ghost from behind, gripping Qiao Chuchu's arm.","She instinctively yanked away. \"Don't touch me!\"","Before Ji Yanchuan could even get a word of caution out, the stick came crashing down on his head. \"Ouch!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned and saw a stranger in a baseball cap and sunglasses. Her face paled as she stood on her tiptoes to get a closer look. \"I’m so sorry! I thought you were one of them! Are you okay?!\"","Ji Yanchuan rubbed his aching head, ready to snap at her—\"Are you out of your—\"","But Qiao Chuchu’s face was right there, inches from his.","She leaned in, her damp eyes brimming with concern.","Ji Yanchuan’s angry retort died in his throat, his voice fading weakly. \"...mind?\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t make out his muttering and worried she’d knocked him silly. \"Are you hurt? Should I take you to the hospital?\"","Ji Yanchuan snapped out of it, shaking his head despite the pain. \"I’m fine, Miss Qiao. It’s me—I’m Madam Ye’s son.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked in recognition. \"Oh, it’s you?\"","Then she frowned. \"Then why didn’t you say anything earlier?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","He *had* tried to speak, but she hadn’t given him the chance. He’d only meant to hold her arm to calm her down.","And then she’d whacked him!","He considered explaining, but then remembered—he was supposed to be playing the socially awkward recluse.","He lowered his head, feigning nervousness. \"You forgot. I have social anxiety. I couldn’t speak up.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Was *this* what social anxiety looked like?","Qiao Chuchu, however, didn’t question it. \"I’m so sorry, sir! I thought you were one of them coming for me. Let me take you to the hospital?\"","Ji Yanchuan waved her off, stepping protectively in front of her. \"No need. I’ll handle this.\"","He turned to Shen Tuo, voice icy. \"I don’t care who you are. Miss Qiao is under *my* protection. If any of you dare trouble her again, you’ll regret it!\"","Shen Tuo hesitated, glancing past Ji Yanchuan to his bodyguard.","The bodyguard gave a subtle signal.","Understanding, Shen Tuo feigned wariness and backed away. \"Since Mr. Ye is involved, we’ll leave it at that. Let’s go.\"","Qiao Chuchu peeked out from behind Ji Yanchuan, watching as Shen Tuo and his men left without a backward glance.","She eyed Ji Yanchuan’s back with suspicion.","**[Strange. I’ve never heard of a ‘Mr. Ye’ powerful enough to scare them off.]**","Shen Zhuoyan also studied Ji Yanchuan warily.","He’d never heard of him either.","In Lan City’s elite circles, only the Wei Sheng Family commanded immediate respect. Below them were the Pei and Ji Families.","The Shen Family wasn’t weak either—on par with Lin Qing and Lin Shen. So where did this ‘Ye Family’ come from, able to intimidate the Shens?","They’d have to be at least as influential as the Pei Family.","But if they were, how had neither he nor Qiao Chuchu heard of them?","Ji Yanchuan turned back to Qiao Chuchu, beaming. \"You must’ve been terrified, Miss Qiao!\"","She shook her head. \"I’m fine.\"","Instead, she checked on Shen Zhuoyan. \"Are *you* okay?\"","Shen Zhuoyan smiled gently. \"I’m fine.\"","Ji Yanchuan stepped between them, forcing distance. \"Glad you’re both alright!\"","His gaze burned into Shen Zhuoyan. \"Even though you caused trouble for your employer, she still cares about you. A boss like that is rare—better protect her well. *Never* leave her side.\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s frown was nearly imperceptible. The words felt loaded. He answered carefully, \"I will.\"","Ji Yanchuan’s smile didn’t reach his eyes as he glanced at his bodyguard nearby.","The bodyguard saved the video and sent it to Ji Yanchuan’s assistant.","After editing out the background noise, the assistant forwarded it to Pei Yuan with the caption:","**\"Be wary of the bodyguard around your sister.\"**","In the middle of a meeting, Pei Yuan felt his phone vibrate. He glanced at the screen.","A message.","The subject line made his blood run cold. He opened the video.","The footage showed Shen Zhuoyan surrounded by thugs near a car—Qiao Chuchu’s car, judging by the license plate.","The man confronting him? Shen Tuo.","Shen Zhuoyan’s uncle.","Pei Yuan understood instantly. He stepped out and dialed Shen Zhuoyan’s number.","Shen Zhuoyan excused himself to answer. \"Mr. Pei.\"","Pei Yuan cut to the chase. \"I just saw a video of you fighting your uncle. Is this true?\"","Shen Zhuoyan paused. \"...Yes.\"","Silence stretched between them.","Finally, Pei Yuan spoke. \"Shen Zhuoyan, I want you to leave. I hired you to protect her, not bring danger to her doorstep.\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s expression shifted as he watched Qiao Chuchu laughing with Ji Yanchuan.","Gripping the phone, he asked, \"Can’t I stay? I swear this won’t happen again.\"","Pei Yuan was firm. \"You’re supposed to keep her safe from the world’s erasure—not drag her into your family’s mess. If Shen Tuo harms her, *we’re* the ones who led him to her.\"","Shen Zhuoyan said nothing.","\"I’ll pay you for this month,\" Pei Yuan continued. \"Pack up and leave the city—leave this entire twisted plot. If you go, maybe you’ll break free of the narrative. But knowing her temper, you *can’t* let her find you. She’d never forgive me.\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s voice was hollow. \"Understood. I’ll go. Keep the money.\"","He hung up, gaze lingering on Qiao Chuchu.","She noticed and smiled. \"Something wrong, Shen Zhuoyan?\"","His throat tightened. \"I need to step out for something important.\"","Her smile faltered. \"Where?\"","He couldn’t answer, eyes reddening. But he forced a smile. \"I’ll be back when I’m done.\"","Something was wrong.","Ten steps separated them.","She moved toward him—but Ji Yanchuan caught her wrist.","Hidden behind sunglasses and a mask, his tone was cheerful. \"Let him go! He might really have urgent business!\"","Ji Yanchuan was smug.","He *knew* Pei Yuan wouldn’t tolerate Shen Zhuoyan after seeing that video.","Qiao Chuchu hesitated, searching Shen Zhuoyan’s face.","He didn’t step closer.","His dark eyes held hers—full of longing, grief, and unspoken goodbye.","She took a step forward.","He retreated twice the distance, shaking his head.","His voice was thick. \"Don’t, Qiao Chu.\"","Tears glistened in his eyes."]},{"number":250,"title":"Chapter 250: Shen Zhuoyan's \"I Do\" Has Been Said for Many Years, and He Wants to Say It for Many More","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu took a closer look and noticed his expression was normal, with no trace of tears.","She found it strange. \"Where are you going?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s lips quivered downward as if he were about to cry, but he forced them into a smile instead. \"I’m going to see a friend. Don’t worry!\"","He gave her a deep look, then turned and walked away.","Qiao Chuchu grew increasingly uneasy and called after him, \"Shen Zhuoyan, wait a second!\"","Shen Zhuoyan didn’t turn back. Instead, he quickened his pace.","Ji Yanchuan gripped her arm tightly, coaxing her in a gentle tone. \"Miss Qiao, let him go. He’s a grown man—it’s not like he’ll get lost. My head is still hurting. Why don’t you come with me to the hospital?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t answer, her gaze fixed on Shen Zhuoyan’s retreating figure.","As Shen Zhuoyan reached the corner, he glanced back in her direction, as if wanting to see her one last time.","But in the end, he didn’t turn around and strode out of her sight.","Qiao Chuchu never looked away.","Ji Yanchuan stepped in front of her, bending down to grasp her shoulders, speaking as if soothing a child. \"Miss Qiao, how about this? Come home with me now, and we’ll retrieve your mother’s painting. I’ll give it to you as a gift, and we can consider it the start of our friendship. How does that sound?\"","Qiao Chuchu remained silent, hesitating before shifting her gaze to Ji Yanchuan.","She was thinking.","Ji Yanchuan eagerly ushered her toward the car. \"Come on, Miss Qiao, let’s go!\"","Qiao Chuchu furrowed her brow and suddenly pulled away. \"No.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"Huh? What do you mean ‘no’?\"","\"Shen Zhuoyan doesn’t have friends.\" Her expression darkened as she untangled the messy thoughts in her mind. \"Shen Zhuoyan only has me as his friend!\"","With that, she broke into a run!","Ji Yanchuan: \"Huh?! Qiao Chuchu?! Qiao Chuchu!!\"","Qiao Chuchu sprinted in Shen Zhuoyan’s direction, pulling out her phone to call him.","But Shen Zhuoyan’s phone was turned off.","Shen Zhuoyan stood listlessly by the roadside, waiting for a taxi.","An empty cab pulled up, and he raised his hand before climbing in with his head down.","Qiao Chuchu reached the corner just in time to see it happen. \"Hey! Shen Zhuoyan!!\"","She choked back her frustration. \"Why are you taking a *taxi*, Shen Zhuoyan?!\"","She scanned a nearby electric scooter with her phone, hopped on, and gave chase!","Shen Zhuoyan gave the driver an address: \"Tangqing Academy.\"","Leaning against the window, he recalled the day he and Qiao Chuchu had first met.","It was a week into the school year, and he was spacing out in the stairwell.","His parents had been fighting again.","He couldn’t stand it and had urged his mother to divorce his father.","But his mother refused, insisting his father would change his ways.","He truly couldn’t understand—how could someone love another person so deeply that they’d willingly stay by their side, even when hurt?","As he sat alone in the stairwell, he suddenly overheard a group of students gossiping upstairs.","\"That Shen Zhuoyan guy is such a pretentious jerk,\" one said.","He frowned, ears perking up.","A girl chimed in, \"Right? My friend tried talking to him, and he barely reacted. She even invited him to eat, but he refused. No matter what you invite him to, he turns it down. Who does he think he is? It’s ridiculous.\"","Another boy sneered, \"Same. I just wanted to get to know him so our parents could connect for business, but he acted all aloof with me too. I invited him to go abroad with us, and he still said no.\"","\"Don’t you get it? He has no friends. He’s just cold to everyone.\"","\"People like that annoy me. Who are they trying to impress?\"","\"Hey, what if we put bugs in his desk? It’s not like anyone likes him anyway—he probably wouldn’t even care if we pranked him.\"","\"Ooooh, great idea!\"","They burst into laughter, eagerly discussing what kind of bugs to put in his desk and which brand of glue would work best on his chair.","His disdain grew, and he stood up, ready to confront them.","But then a bright, bold voice cut in: \"If you’re so brave about pranking him, why don’t you say all this to Shen Zhuoyan’s face?\"","He froze, quietly ascending the stairs to peek.","Back then, Qiao Chuchu hadn’t dyed her hair yet. Her black curls cascaded neatly as she stood on the higher steps, looking down at them. \"What if he’s just reserved and doesn’t like socializing? Does he have to conform to *your* expectations? Who do you think you are?\"","The gossipers were troublemakers from various classes, and at the sight of Qiao Chuchu, their expressions shifted. They shoved each other and hurried off. \"It’s that freak Qiao Chuchu—don’t mess with her. Let’s go!\"","Once they were gone, only the two of them remained in the stairwell.","Qiao Chuchu lifted her chin proudly, like a victorious peacock, and descended the steps—only to run straight into him eavesdropping.","He flushed with embarrassment. \"Thanks for standing up for me.\"","Qiao Chuchu said nothing, just hugged her tablet and studied him.","He was bad with words—not because he disliked people, but because he genuinely didn’t know how to talk to them. So he turned to leave.","But then a crisp voice called from behind: \"Shen Zhuoyan, let’s be desk mates!\"","He turned in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu clutched her tablet, feigning nonchalance but clearly a little awkward. \"My current desk mate doesn’t want to sit with me, and Tangqing Academy has that dumb ‘two-to-a-desk’ rule. Since no one wants to sit with you either, why don’t we pair up? Saves us both the trouble.\"","He was puzzled. \"How do you know your desk mate doesn’t want to sit with you?\"","\"She asked the homeroom teacher to switch seats, and I overheard.\" Qiao Chuchu grinned at him. \"The teacher said no one wants to sit with me and told her to tough it out. I don’t want to force anyone.\"","He raised an eyebrow. \"So you’re forcing me instead?\"","Qiao Chuchu burst out laughing, brushing past him. \"If you don’t want to, forget it!\"","He quickly backtracked. \"No, I’m willing.\"","Her eyes lit up. \"Really?\"","He nodded stiffly. \"Really.\"","Little did he know, over the next two years as desk mates, he would never refuse a single suggestion of hers.","He always told her, *I’m willing.*","Shen Zhuoyan swallowed the lump rising in his throat.","He really *should* leave Qiao Chuchu and stop burdening her.","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu tailed the taxi on her electric scooter, her voice hoarse from shouting. \"Shen Zhuoyan! Look back at me, Shen Zhuoyan!! If you won’t turn around, at least turn your phone on!!\"","Inside the cab, Shen Zhuoyan’s heart pounded. He clutched his phone, desperate to check if Qiao Chuchu had called.","But if he was going to cut ties, he had to do it cleanly—no room for her to suspect anything.","Gritting his teeth, he stuffed his phone away and glanced out the rear window.","An electric scooter was speeding alongside the road. \"Shen Zhuoyan!\"","His face paled. He rolled down the window and stuck his head out.","Qiao Chuchu waved at him. \"Don’t go! At least explain yourself!\"","Shocked, he hastily handed the driver a hundred-yuan bill. \"Stop here! Keep the change!\"","He scrambled out of the car, staring at her in disbelief.","Qiao Chuchu, still on the scooter, had cranked the speed to max. Spotting a bike parking zone ahead, she quickly pulled over.","If she went any farther, she wouldn’t be able to return the rental.","She shouted at him, \"Wait right there! Let me return this scooter first!\"","Shen Zhuoyan stood frozen, watching Qiao Chuchu return the rented bike by the roadside, when suddenly a pang of emotion hit him.","He loved her so much.","Truly, deeply loved her.","He loved her sincerity, the way she responded to every little thing, how she always kept her heart open for him.","During those unbearable days in prison, whenever it got too hard, he’d imagine himself back in the classroom—attending lectures with her, sharing meals, listening to her gush about shoujo manga.","He didn’t want to leave her.","Not even for a second.","Shen Zhuoyan strode toward Qiao Chuchu, his steps quickening, then breaking into a run before he pulled her tightly into his arms!"]},{"number":251,"title":"Chapter 251: Where Did This Scheming Green Tea Bitch Come From","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu staggered two steps, nearly knocked off her feet by his sudden impact, only to be swiftly pulled back into Shen Zhuoyan’s arms!","It felt like being enveloped by an unyielding wall from behind.","Shen Zhuoyan’s broad shoulders encircled her, as if he could lift her effortlessly with a single motion.","His breath brushed against her ear, carrying a barely detectable tremor, his voice firm yet unsteady as he buried her petite frame against his chest: “Why did you come after me?”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Puzzled, she tucked her phone away, peeled his arm off, and tilted her head to meet his gaze: “Why did you hug me?”","Shen Zhuoyan: “...”","She pocketed her phone, her expression utterly bewildered: “You’re acting weird, so I’m wondering if someone said something to you?”","A flicker of guilt crossed Shen Zhuoyan’s face: “No.”","Qiao Chuchu saw right through him: “Really? Can I check your phone then?”","Without hesitation, Shen Zhuoyan handed over his phone—only to abruptly snatch it back, his expression shifting: “No!”","Qiao Chuchu dodged his reach, powered on the device, and instinctively entered her own passcode.","A second later, she clicked her tongue in realization: “Oops, my bad. Why’d I use mine?”","Yet the phone unlocked.","Qiao Chuchu: “? Why is your passcode the same as mine?!”","Shen Zhuoyan froze, awkwardly rubbing his nose, at a loss for words.","Qiao Chuchu gave him a strange look but didn’t press further. She opened his call log and spotted Pei Yuan’s incoming call.","Her face darkened as she dialed Pei Yuan’s number.","Shen Zhuoyan opened his mouth to speak.","She pointed a warning finger at him.","*Stay quiet.*","Shen Zhuoyan: “...”","Pei Yuan answered almost immediately, his tone sharp: “What? Calling to demand money?”","Qiao Chuchu’s voice turned icy: “What money?”","Pei Yuan paused, clearly startled to hear her voice: “Chuchu?”","Furious, she snapped: “What did you say to Shen Zhuoyan behind my back? He took off in a cab and turned off his phone like some dramatic heroine fleeing the country! Meanwhile, I chased after him like an idiot on an electric scooter!”","Pei Yuan: “? Are you hurt? Where’s your driver?”","“Why would I be hurt?!” she fired back. “What exactly did you tell Shen Zhuoyan?”","After a weighted silence, Pei Yuan sighed, his voice measured: “Chuchu, I don’t believe Shen Zhuoyan is fit to be your bodyguard. Someone sent me a video earlier—his uncle, Shen Tuo, confronted him. A bodyguard who brings trouble with him is a liability. I was worried for your safety.”","Qiao Chuchu’s brows knitted together: “If you had concerns, you could’ve discussed them with me. Why just kick Shen Zhuoyan out unilaterally?”","Pei Yuan faltered, softening his tone: “You’re right. I acted rashly. I’m sorry. I should’ve talked to you first, but I was afraid you’d insist on keeping him.”","Her resolve was unshakable: “Exactly. I *am* keeping Shen Zhuoyan. I don’t want anyone else—he’s trustworthy, he aced the bodyguard competition, and I feel completely safe with him handling my schedule!”","Shen Zhuoyan’s breath hitched, stunned by her praise. He lowered his eyes to hide his delight.","But Pei Yuan seemed to short-circuit, firing off rapid questions: “And what about me? Am I not good enough? You’re praising someone else to my face? Do you *want* Shen Zhuoyan to stay or not?”","His threat was deceptively calm: “Qiao Chuchu, one more word of praise, and I’ll make sure he’s gone for good.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...I was only addressing his professional competence as a bodyguard.”","Pei Yuan backtracked, pleading: “But I did this because I care. Do you know how panicked I was watching that video?”","Her frown deepened as she zeroed in on the key detail: “Video? What video?”","“Footage of your car being surrounded.” Pei Yuan clarified: “I saw Shen Zhuoyan fighting them off. I’ll forward it to you.”","Qiao Chuchu opened the video.","The recording was crisp.","Yet oddly devoid of street noise.","As if the audio had been deliberately edited.","The angle felt staged—like a setup to manipulate Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan added: “The sender was anonymous. I knew they had ill intentions, but Shen Zhuoyan *did* attract trouble. I couldn’t risk it. When I dismissed him, I’d already arranged a replacement.”","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip, scrutinizing the footage: “This is clearly meant to drive a wedge between us.”","Suddenly, it clicked. “I know who filmed this!”","She vaulted onto her scooter: “I’m going to confront him!”","Pei Yuan: “?”","Shen Zhuoyan: “?”","Hanging up, Qiao Chuchu slapped the seat and barked at Shen Zhuoyan: “Get on!”","Shen Zhuoyan blinked, then obediently climbed on behind her.","As the scooter roared to life, she lectured him sternly: “You’re *my* bodyguard. Your priority is *me*. Don’t let this happen again.”","He nodded meekly, still buzzing from the thrill of her chase. Shyly, he asked: “How did you figure it out?”","Qiao Chuchu smirked: “You said you were meeting a friend. Then I remembered—you don’t *have* friends. So you were lying.”","Shen Zhuoyan stiffened.","She glanced back: “I’m your only friend, right?”","His eyes sparkled as he tentatively gripped the hem of her jacket: “Yeah. You know me so well.”","She preened: “Obviously! My observational skills are top-tier. That’s why I noticed no one wanted to sit with you in class and claimed you as my desk mate.”","The memory made Shen Zhuoyan smile: “The second happiest moment of my life was becoming your deskmate.”","Qiao Chuchu teased: “And the first?”","His answer dissolved into traffic noise: “Being with you like this—24/7, no breaks—that’s my happiness.”","Unhearing, her expression hardened: “We’re almost there. Time to grill this Mr. Ji!”","Shen Zhuoyan snapped to attention: “Right.”","—","Ji Yanchuan checked his watch, bored.","*Ugh.*","He’d finally gotten rid of Shen Zhuoyan, only for Qiao Chuchu to chase after him.","What was so special about some bargain-bin bodyguard?","Then he spotted her—charging toward him on her scooter, Shen Zhuoyan clinging to her back.","Ji Yanchuan’s smile was instant: “Miss Qiao!”","She braked hard, dismounted, and stormed up to him: “Was it *you* who filmed that video for my brother?!”","Ji Yanchuan feigned innocence: “Me? Of course not!”","Her face darkened, and she pointed an accusing finger at him. \"Ha! I knew I’d smoke you out! I didn’t even mention what video it was, and you’re already scrambling to deny it—as if that doesn’t prove it’s you!\""]},{"number":252,"title":"Chapter 252: Ji Yanchuan, You're the First Green Tea Bitch I've Ever Seen Who Knows How to Sow Discord","paragraphs":["When an innocent person is falsely accused of something they know nothing about, their first reaction is usually bewilderment.","At the very least, they’d ask, *\"What video are you talking about?\"*","But this guy immediately denied it was him!","What an absolute idiot—can’t even set someone up properly!","Ji Yanchuan stumbled back, stammering, \"I-It really wasn’t me! You’ve got the wrong person! Why would you even suspect me?!\"","His heart pounded in panic.","*How did she figure it out?!*","Clutching his chest like he was baring his soul, he insisted, \"I don’t know anything about a video. You’re accusing the wrong person.\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked coldly. \"Fine, keep denying it. I get you—I used to be a scheming little fox too.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...?\"","Her expression turned icy, cutting off any chance for him to explain. \"I don’t care what you and your mother are plotting. From now on, we’re done. Stay away from me, and I’ll stay away from you. That’s final. Don’t bother me again!\"","Ji Yanchuan’s face darkened. He grabbed her wrist. \"Miss Qiao—\"","Qiao Chuchu yanked her hand free—knocking his sunglasses askew!","His expression twisted in alarm as he hurriedly readjusted them.","But Shen Zhuoyan, standing across from him, had already seen everything. His face darkened instantly. \"*Ji Yanchuan?!*\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, then whipped her head toward Ji Yanchuan.","He frantically held his sunglasses in place, turning to flee.","She blocked his path, reaching for his face. \"Oh no, you don’t. Let’s see what you’re hiding!\"","Ji Yanchuan backed away. \"I’m not Ji Yanchuan! I’m not!\"","She tore off his sunglasses, revealing his true face. Her eyes widened. \"*Ji Yanchuan?!* It really *is* you! You lied about your identity to trick me?!\"","Ji Yanchuan fell silent, exposed and humiliated, like he’d been stripped bare.","With a heavy sigh, he pulled his mask down, revealing his full face, his expression grave. \"Yes. It’s me.\"","Qiao Chuchu immediately yanked the mask back up.","Ji Yanchuan: \"...?\"","He pulled it down.","She tugged it up.","He pulled it down again!","She tugged it up again!","\"I don’t want to see your face!\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","His brows furrowed like a wounded puppy’s as he stared at her pitifully.","Disgusted, Qiao Chuchu sneered, \"You’re the one who stirred up trouble. You’re the one who tried to get my brother to kick Shen Zhuoyan out. So why are *you* making that pathetic face?\"","Ji Yanchuan stiffened, refusing to admit fault. \"I was doing it for *your* sake! Shen Zhuoyan is capable of anything—what if he hurts you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes. \"Did *you* call the Shen family here?\"","Ji Yanchuan scowled. \"No, Shen Zhuoyan brought this on himself. It has nothing to do with me.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t answer.","She just stared at him, unblinking.","Ji Yanchuan shifted uncomfortably under her gaze, eventually lowering his head.","A cold laugh escaped her lips. \"Ji Yanchuan, you’re the first scheming fox I’ve met who specializes in sowing discord.\"","Even Xia Xuechun never stooped that low.","He was the first.","She turned to leave.","Ji Yanchuan grabbed her wrist again. \"Wait!\"","Qiao Chuchu jerked free. \"Enough already!\"","He stepped back, hurt. \"Why do you hate me so much?! Just because I hugged another woman while engaged? Is that such a big deal? Even Lin Qing didn’t care!\"","Qiao Chuchu scoffed, about to unleash a tirade—when her phone buzzed with two messages.","Qi Xiaojia:","**\"Xia Xuechun was released. There wasn’t enough evidence—the thugs swore she had no idea about the ambush at my place.\"**","**\"I’m terrified... What if she comes after me again? Next time, it won’t just be assault. They might kill me.\"**","Her expression hardened. She turned on her heel.","Ji Yanchuan blocked her path. \"I don’t get it! What did I even do to make you despise me this much?\"","Shen Zhuoyan stepped between them, voice low and dangerous. \"Back off.\"","Ji Yanchuan ignored him, lunging toward Qiao Chuchu. \"Fine, I was harsh before. I *did* hire people to humiliate you, but I *apologized*! What else do you want?! Name it, and I’ll make it up to you!\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s jaw clenched, fists tightening with the urge to punch him.","Oblivious, Ji Yanchuan shouted, \"Qiao Chuchu, what will it take for you to forgive me?!\"","She finally turned to face him. \"Why do you even *want* my forgiveness? Do you *like* me?\"","Ji Yanchuan froze, then scoffed loudly. \"Like *you*? Don’t flatter yourself! I just can’t stand being hated—your disgust bothers me!\"","Her voice was icy. \"If you don’t like me, why does my forgiveness matter? You think throwing money at me will work? Newsflash: We’re from the same social class. Anything you can buy, I can buy myself. Your so-called ‘compensation’ is worthless.\"","Ji Yanchuan gaped, speechless.","Qiao Chuchu strode to her car. \"Pretending to be a stranger, lying about your name—you’re *disgusting*. I don’t have time for you.\"","Fuming, Ji Yanchuan yelled after her retreating car, \"You’ll chase other men on a *scooter*, but *I’m* a waste of time?! Just you wait—one day, *you’ll* be the one chasing *me* on a scooter!\"","His bodyguard sighed. \"*Why* a scooter, Young Master? Can’t you aim higher? Make her chase you *on foot*?\"","Ji Yanchuan punched the man’s arm repeatedly. \"Shut up, shut up, *shut up*!\"","Bodyguard: \"...Yes, Young Master.\"","Ji Yanchuan stormed into his car. \"Follow her! I want to know which *other* man she’s running to now!\"","Bodyguard: \"Yes, Young Master.\"","---","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu called Qi Xiaojia. \"Did you get the money?\"","Qi Xiaojia’s voice trembled. \"I did.\"","Qiao Chuchu softened. \"Do you have relatives you can stay with for a while?\"","Qi Xiaojia murmured, \"My grandparents. Xia Xuechun doesn’t know their place. But my parents are still in the hospital...\"","Putting the call on speaker, Qiao Chuchu texted Weisheng Lin—she needed to hire some of his men for protection. \"I’ll arrange for someone to escort you to your grandparents’. Don’t worry about your parents; I’ll have people watch over them too. They’re in the ICU—no one can get to them.\"","Qi Xiaojia exhaled in relief. \"Thank you.\"","But guilt crept into her voice. \"I’m sorry... I couldn’t pin Xia Xuechun down for good.\"","Qiao Chuchu shrugged. \"It’s fine. She’s not stupid—if she planned this, she covered her tracks.\"","And now things are already looking up—the heroine’s luck has shifted to her, so Xia Xuechun won’t be able to stir up much trouble anymore."]},{"number":253,"title":"Chapter 253: Time Yu in Power-Off Standby","paragraphs":["In comparison, it was Ji Yanchuan who truly made her tread cautiously.","She couldn’t defy even a single thought of his.","But having been tamed by the system through suffering, Qiao Chuchu considered Ji Yanchuan and the script mere child’s play. Right now, she had more pressing matters to attend to.","After hanging up the phone and arranging for a few female bodyguards to accompany Qi Xiaojia, she leaned back wearily in the car seat. \"What’s on the schedule for today?\"","Shen Zhuoyan glanced at the itinerary. \"An elderly lady named Yun Sui has invited you to a tea gathering in an hour.\"","Qiao Chuchu took a moment to recall.","Ah, right.","During the last charity gala, she had publicly confronted Wang Ru Tang. While everyone else had been watching cautiously, only one lady—Yun Sui—had joined her in rebuking Wang Ru Tang.","Wang Ru Tang had been chased by a swarm of reporters, her frantic escape immortalized across the internet. Once hailed as a paragon of the art world, her reputation had collapsed beyond redemption.","Yun Sui, already a highly esteemed figure, had effortlessly stepped into Wang Ru Tang’s vacated position, seizing most of her resources.","Truthfully, Qiao Chuchu had coveted that spot herself.","But she was too young—despite her fame and talent, she lacked the seniority to claim it.","Still, during her recent illness, Yun Sui had called her, hinting at grooming her as a successor and expressing a desire to build a closer relationship.","She believed it.","Yun Sui had no children of her own, only a businessman husband and a sickly grandson.","Apart from her, no one else in the family pursued painting.","Rumors said the grandson’s condition was severe—mysterious, undiagnosable, with episodes leaving him unconscious for days.","Qiao Chuchu sucked in a breath, muttering, \"This frail grandson... why does he sound so familiar?\"","Shen Zhuoyan frowned. \"Familiar how?\"","She shook her head. \"It’s nothing.\"","**[Could it be Shi Yu? But probably not, right?]**","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Shi Yu? Who was Shi Yu?","---","Yun Sui sat at Shi Yu’s bedside, her gaze tender as she studied his gaunt frame.","Since returning from the auction, he had been unconscious for three days and four nights.","Countless hospital visits yielded no diagnosis, yet his organs continued to fail.","With no treatment proving effective and Shi Yu disliking pointless hospital stays, he had been brought home.","The doctors had quietly suggested preparing for the worst.","Tears welled as Yun Sui adjusted his blanket. \"Shi Yu, you’re only twenty-five. You can’t leave us. Your grandparents already lost your parents—I can’t lose you too.\"","A soft knock interrupted her. The butler announced, \"Madam, Miss Qiao is here.\"","Wiping her tears, Yun Sui straightened her shawl. \"Show her in.\"","Qiao Chuchu stepped inside, her eyes lighting up at the room’s décor.","While Ji Yanchuan’s home dripped with opulence, Yun Sui’s residence exuded classical Chinese elegance.","A cabinet displayed an array of instruments—pipa, guzheng, guqin—each immaculately polished. The faint scent of sandalwood lingered in the air, every detail a testament to the owner’s refined taste.","Spotting the figure on the bed, she averted her gaze politely. \"Madam Yun.\"","Yun Sui turned with a smile. \"You’ve arrived.\"","Dabbing her eyes, she gestured to a seat nearby. \"Come, sit here.\"","Qiao Chuchu complied, presenting a box of premium tea leaves. \"I wasn’t sure of your preferences, so I brought these. I hope they suit your taste.\"","Her eyes flicked toward the bed. \"And this is...?\"","\"My grandson.\" Yun Sui sighed. \"Around your age, though you likely wouldn’t know him. He was homeschooled. His name is Shi Yu.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked. \"Shi Yu?\"","So this ailing grandson *was* the Shi Yu she knew?","Surprised, she said, \"Just days ago, he bought one of my paintings and spoke with me. What happened to him?\"","Yun Sui’s eyes reddened as she pressed a hand to her temple. \"He won’t wake. The doctors say this time... it may be permanent. That’s why I asked you here—to discuss business.\"","She cut to the chase. \"I know you toppled Wang Ru Tang to take her place. But you’re too young, too inexperienced for that role. While I’ve assumed her position, I’m not your enemy. We could be allies. After all, Wang Ru Tang and I have our own history. And as you see, my only heir is Shi Yu—a skilled businessman, but no threat to you.\"","Unfazed, Qiao Chuchu nodded. \"I understand. I came hoping to become your protégée.\"","Her attention drifted back to Shi Yu. \"May I see him?\"","Yun Sui gave a weary nod.","Rising, Qiao Chuchu stepped softly to the bedside, her heels silent against the floor.","Shi Yu lay still, his closed eyes enhancing his ethereal beauty—like a fragile sleeping prince, breathing faintly.","She frowned. **[Last time, he mentioned his susceptibility to comas. I didn’t realize it was this severe. He added me on WeChat—did he collapse right after?]**","From the doorway, Shen Zhuoyan’s gaze sharpened on Shi Yu, his brow furrowing.","Qiao Chuchu eyed the instrument cabinet. \"Does Shi Yu play the guqin?\"","Yun Sui nodded wistfully. \"The guqin, the guzheng... he mastered both. He adored classical arts—calligraphy, ink painting.\"","Her voice broke. \"He used to fill this house with music. Now... he may never wake.\"","Qiao Chuchu studied Shi Yu, her frown deepening.","**[Had I known it was this dire, I would’ve spoken to him properly.]**","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Baffled, he tilted his head.","A string of beads on the floor caught Qiao Chuchu’s eye. \"Whose are these?\"","Yun Sui stood. \"A protective bracelet I had made for him. It must’ve slipped off. Let me—\"","Qiao Chuchu intercepted her. \"Allow me.\"","No elder should bend down in her presence.","She picked up the wooden bracelet and gently slid it onto Shi Yu’s wrist.","A surge of energy shot through him, forcing his eyes open.","The first thing he saw was Qiao Chuchu fastening the bracelet.","Thinking it a delusion, his hand snapped shut around hers!","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","Yun Sui: \"?!\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","Shi Yu, still lying weak, burned with intensity as he felt her warmth. \"I’ve dreamed of this moment. You’ve finally come, Qiao Chu.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze in confusion.","With effort, he propped himself up, offering a frail smile. \"You’re here to choose me, aren’t you?\""]},{"number":254,"title":"Chapter 254: Shi Yu: Strong men are so great, unlike me who is very weak","paragraphs":["Yun Sui was so shocked that her jaw dropped!","She glanced at the revitalized Shi Yu, then at the stunned Qiao Chuchu, her voice trembling: \"H-How did you do that?!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared blankly back at Yun Sui.","She had no idea how she'd done it either.","Yun Sui’s gaze darted between her and Shi Yu, her eyes welling up with excitement: \"The moment you touched my grandson, he woke up!\"","Qiao Chuchu paled in horror, waving her hands in denial: \"This has nothing to do with me, Madam Yun! Superstitions are unreliable! Shi Yu recovered on his own—it wasn’t because I touched him! He just happened to wake up at that exact moment!\"","Shen Zhuoyan strode to the bedside, watching as Shi Yu’s expression grew more animated, his brows knitting together so tightly they could crush a fly.","From his angle, he’d seen Shi Yu’s eyes snap open—as if jolted by an electric shock!","His gaze shifted between Qiao Chuchu’s back and Shi Yu’s face, his confusion palpable.","Shi Yu propped himself up, his eyes lingering on Qiao Chuchu with an intensity that could weave silk: \"Miss Qiao, there’s no need to be modest. You’re the one who saved me.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? I’m not being modest.\"","[All I did was put a bracelet on him—how is that saving him? If it were really that magical, one hug from me would probably make him jump up and start dancing the \"Ke Mu San\"!]","Shi Yu chuckled lightly: \"Shall we test it? A hug might give me even more strength.\"","Qiao Chuchu stumbled back three steps in alarm: \"N-No way! That kind of contact between a man and a woman is... inappropriate.\"","Shi Yu’s smile deepened as he turned to Yun Sui: \"Grandmother, Miss Qiao did save me. I distinctly felt a surge of energy when she touched me. Even now, I don’t feel as groggy as usual.\"","It was true.","Every time he’d woken from unconsciousness before, he’d been weak—even speaking a single sentence made the room spin.","But now, he could sit up effortlessly and hold a conversation.","Qiao Chuchu, feeling the weight of the situation, retreated further: \"Shi Yu, this really has nothing to do with me! It’s just a coincidence. Making me sound like some kind of miracle worker—how could Madam Yun possibly believe that?!\"","\"I believe it!\" Yun Sui burst into tears, clasping her hands together and gazing tearfully out the window. \"I’ve consulted so many masters, and they all told me that once my grandson found his true destiny, he’d recover!\"","She seized Qiao Chuchu’s hands: \"Shi Yu was always collapsing, and when he did wake up, he was so sickly that none of the girls we knew wanted to waste time on him. I’d been wondering how to find his true destiny—and here you are!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"???\"","How could *she* be his true destiny?!","And what even *was* a true destiny?!","Yun Sui wept uncontrollably, bending down to embrace Shi Yu: \"All my years of virtue and prayers have finally been answered! Shi Yu, your fortune has arrived!\"","Shi Yu, moved by her emotions, blinked back tears and looked at Qiao Chuchu: \"My grandmother is devout, so she accepts things that can’t be easily explained.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","She exchanged a stunned glance with Shen Zhuoyan.","Shen Zhuoyan’s face was thunderous, like a wolf guarding its territory, his hostility radiating toward Shi Yu.","Shi Yu, still weak, murmured: \"Grandmother, I’m a little hungry.\"","Yun Sui covered her mouth in delight: \"You’re hungry? That’s wonderful! Before, you could barely eat. I’ll have the kitchen prepare something right away!\"","She wiped her tears and beamed at Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao, why don’t you keep Shi Yu company while we wait? You two can eat together later, alright?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","An elderly woman was tearfully begging her to chat with her grandson, who’d been unconscious for days.","How could she refuse?","She forced a stiff smile: \"Alright.\"","Yun Sui nodded through her tears, already dialing a number as she hurried out: \"Old man, listen! We’ve found Shi Yu’s true destiny! He’s awake, he’s hungry, and he even has the strength to sit up!\"","\"What? You’re coming home?!\"","\"Yes, yes, hurry back and see for yourself—sob!\"","Her voice faded into the distance.","The butler, equally stunned, hesitated before closing the door, offering Qiao Chuchu a deferential smile: \"Miss Qiao, would you like some fruit?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","The butler nodded courteously: \"I’ll bring some shortly.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","The door clicked shut.","Now, only the three of them remained—her, Shi Yu, and Shen Zhuoyan.","The atmosphere turned palpably tense.","Shi Yu struggled to sit up further: \"I should freshen up first. It’d be impolite otherwise.\"","Qiao Chuchu instinctively moved to help, but Shen Zhuoyan shouldered past her, stone-faced, and assisted Shi Yu out of bed.","Shi Yu picked up the dragon-headed cane beside the bed and studied Shen Zhuoyan.","His gaze was slow and penetrating, tracing every contour of Shen Zhuoyan’s face.","Shen Zhuoyan, though supporting him, held himself with a sharp, unyielding posture.","As Shi Yu scrutinized him, Shen Zhuoyan stared back just as intently—like a hook trying to drag out Shi Yu’s thoughts.","Their locked eyes sparked with invisible friction.","Shi Yu’s brow arched slightly before he withdrew his arm from Shen Zhuoyan’s grip. Leaning on his cane, he limped step by step toward the bathroom.","Qiao Chuchu squeezed her eyes shut in distress.","[Oh god!]","[First, I get the heroine’s aura and Ji Yanchuan won’t leave me alone—now there’s a former male lead too?!]","[Did he really recover because of my heroine aura? I’m skeptical... but he *does* seem stronger.]","[Am I Shi Yu’s personal power bank or something?!]","Shen Zhuoyan’s expression darkened further.","Qiao Chuchu paced anxiously: [What if Shi Yu starts clinging to me like Ji Yanchuan?]","She clutched her head in despair: [How am I supposed to handle that? Shi Yu isn’t annoying—he’s actually kind. I can’t just kick him away like Ji Yanchuan.]","[He’s so frail... one kick and he’d probably shatter like a skeleton model.]","In the bathroom, Shi Yu: \"......\"","He studied his reflection.","Hollow cheeks, dull eyes, bloodless lips.","He looked like he was on death’s doorstep.","His features weren’t bad, but his gauntness had erased any trace of his former vitality.","Nothing like that man outside—all hard muscle and vigor.","Who’d want a fragile invalid like him?","His eyes shadowed as he spotted a decorative pair of glasses nearby. An idea struck him.","——","Back in the bedroom, Qiao Chuchu gnawed on her finger, oblivious to the pain.","She was spiraling.","What if Shi Yu *did* start clinging to her for energy?","The more she thought, the more suffocated she felt. There was no clean solution.","The bathroom door creaked open.","Shi Yu emerged, leaning on his cane: \"Apologies for the wait, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned, bracing herself—then froze.","Shi Yu’s hair was slightly long, styled like a wolf cut, with a few strands falling over his collarbone—casual yet effortlessly refined.","His delicate features were accentuated by silver-framed glasses, paired with his black silk pajamas, exuding an air of fragile beauty.","【Oh my god...】","Her eyes widened in awe.","【With those glasses, his sickly pallor is barely noticeable now. He totally looks like the kind of doomed white moonlight described in novels!】","Shen Zhuoyan’s gaze darkened as he stared intently at Shi Yu.","Leaning on a cane, Shi Yu took slow, deliberate steps toward Qiao Chuchu. “How do I look?”","Snapping out of her daze, Qiao Chuchu nodded honestly. “Much more lively!”","Shi Yu smiled and turned to Shen Zhuoyan. “Is this handsome guy your bodyguard?”","She nodded again. “Yes.”","Shi Yu eyed Shen Zhuoyan enviously. “You seem really fit. Do you work out often?”","Shen Zhuoyan frowned slightly, unsure where this was going, but gave a curt nod.","“That’s nice.” Shi Yu covered his mouth with a light cough and said to Qiao Chuchu, “Not like me—I get tired after just a few steps.”","Shen Zhuoyan: “...?”","Was he being petty?","Logically, Shi Yu was just stating facts, but why did it sound so... irritating?"]},{"number":255,"title":"Chapter 255: Shen Zhuoyan: It's the Truth, Yet It Grates on the Ears More and More","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu glanced around, picked up a gray woolen sweater, and stood on tiptoe to drape it over him, soothing him, \"Don't think like that. Once you recover, you’ll be just like him.\"","Shi Yu looked at her tiptoeing and curled the corners of his lips, obediently bending down to put on the sweater. \"Mm, I’ll take your kind words to heart, Miss Qiao.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Shi Yu continued, \"Since Miss Qiao rarely visits me, I’d like to share some personal thoughts with you. Perhaps your bodyguard could step outside for a moment?\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"No.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked in surprise and turned to Shen Zhuoyan. \"Why not?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s expression darkened. \"Mr. Pei Yuan specifically instructed me not to leave your side for even a moment. If something were to happen while I’m gone, I wouldn’t be able to answer to him.\"","Shi Yu smoothly interjected, \"Alright, no need to insist then.\"","With a warm smile, he turned to Qiao Chuchu. \"Since I have some strength now, how about I play a tune for you?\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated, then firmly refused. \"You’re still so weak—playing would be exhausting. Let’s not bother.\"","[Besides, playing music for me feels a little strange.]","Despite his frailty, Shi Yu was adamant. \"It’s no trouble. You’re my guest, and as the host, it’s only right for me to perform for you.\"","Leaning on his cane, he made his way to the instrument cabinet. \"I’ll play the guqin for you.\"","The cabinet door slid open automatically.","He reached for the guqin with difficulty.","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t bear to watch him struggle and quickly stepped forward to lift the instrument down, placing it on the table.","Shi Yu gave her a grateful look. \"Thank you, Miss Qiao.\"","His gaze lingered, almost tangible, and his fingertips brushed lightly against her hand as she withdrew.","Qiao Chuchu chuckled awkwardly, rubbing her hands together. \"No need to thank me.\"","She couldn’t help wondering: [Is Shi Yu trying to win me over with his music?]","[Probably not—I shouldn’t flatter myself.]","Shi Yu settled into his seat, slender fingers resting gracefully on the strings.","Her eyes were inevitably drawn to his hands.","Perhaps due to his prolonged illness, Shi Yu’s hands were even paler and more delicate than Pei Che’s.","Pei Che had the most beautiful hands among the people she knew.","But Shi Yu’s fingers were more slender, each joint tinged with a faint pink, as if naturally dusted with rouge.","Even the faint blue veins on the back of his hands seemed like delicate embellishments.","She couldn’t look away.","[Such beautiful hands—as if they were made for playing music.]","Shen Zhuoyan couldn’t help but glance down at his own fingers.","His hands were long, but the knuckles were broader, noticeably rougher than Shi Yu’s, with thick calluses lining his palms.","Displeased, he tucked his hands behind his back, standing like a brooding statue.","Shi Yu stole a glance at Qiao Chuchu, his smile deepening as he plucked the strings, sending a melodious tune drifting through the air.","All of Qiao Chuchu’s reservations melted away as she listened intently.","Shi Yu played with effortless grace, as if he belonged to another era, every movement exuding scholarly refinement.","His fingers danced lightly over the strings, and when his eyes met Qiao Chuchu’s, he smiled softly.","Outside the door, Yun Sui and Grandpa Shi pressed their ears against the wood, exchanging excited glances when the music began.","Heavens!","Shi Yu was playing!","He even had the strength to play!","Yun Sui was on the verge of tears, slapping Grandpa Shi’s shoulder. \"Didn’t I tell you our grandson needed the right person? You didn’t believe me! Now look—he’s barely woken up from his coma and he’s already playing for her!\"","Grandpa Shi’s eyes reddened with emotion. \"That’s my grandson for you—knowing exactly how to charm a girl with music. Takes after me! These days, pianos are a dime a dozen—if you want to impress someone, it’s gotta be a traditional Chinese instrument!\"","Yun Sui shot him a reproachful look. \"Is that the point? The point is that our grandson is getting better! He wants to eat, and he even has the strength to sit up and play!\"","Grandpa Shi nodded eagerly, seeking her opinion. \"Should I go in and greet the girl now?\"","\"Not yet! We can’t interrupt—this is their time to connect. Let them have dinner together later!\"","Wiping her tears, Yun Sui clasped her hands in gratitude. \"Miss Qiao coming to our home, even entering Shi Yu’s bedroom—it was all fate!\"","By etiquette, she shouldn’t have allowed her into Shi Yu’s private quarters.","But she had been so afraid he might slip away that she hadn’t left his side.","Propriety meant nothing compared to life itself.","So she had let Qiao Chuchu in.","Now it was clear—every step had been preordained!","Dabbing her eyes, Yun Sui nudged the old man away. \"Come on, let’s not get in the way of young love. We’ve got other things to prepare.\"","Just then, the music came to an end, Shi Yu’s hands resting on the strings.","Qiao Chuchu clapped, genuinely impressed. \"That was beautiful!\"","Shi Yu lowered his gaze with a modest smile, then glanced at Shen Zhuoyan. \"Can your bodyguard play? Would he like to try?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s expression had been stormy since meeting Shi Yu. Glowering, he replied, \"I don’t play.\"","Shi Yu tilted his head, blinking innocently. \"Not even the piano? I have one here.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...Not the piano either.\"","He’d never had an interest in music, having spent his childhood training in martial arts instead.","Shi Yu nodded in understanding, a hint of smugness flickering in his eyes. \"Some people are gifted in physical skills but less so in music. Like me—I might be decent with instruments, but I’m frail. I’d trade it all for your health.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly interjected, \"Don’t say that. No one in my family can play the guqin like you. It’s your passion, so you’ve honed it. The rest of us don’t have such hobbies.\"","\"Miss Qiao must have her own talents.\" Shi Yu smiled warmly at her. \"You paint, and you paint well. Your artwork is already hanging in my studio. So far, 'Dragon Slayer' is the finest piece there.\"","She was taken aback by the praise, lowering her head shyly. \"That’s all I’ve got. If I don’t practice, I’d be good at nothing—I’m not exactly a scholar.\"","Shi Yu leaned on his cane and stepped closer, extending a hand to her. \"Don’t say that, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up at him.","His gaze was like a pool of tender spring water. \"I’ve always admired your work. It gives me strength.\"","She froze, unsure how to respond.","Shen Zhuoyan glanced between them and loudly cleared his throat. \"Ahem!\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality, standing abruptly. \"It’s getting late—I should go.\"","Shi Yu’s expression faltered, and he suddenly broke into a coughing fit. \"Cough—cough!\"","Qiao Chuchu reached out to steady him. \"What’s wrong? Are you feeling unwell?\"","Shi Yu gently pushed her hand away, maintaining distance. \"It’s nothing—just an old ailment. I’m used to it.\"","He looked at Qiao Chuchu with sorrow and muttered gloomily, \"Go ahead, Miss Qiao. I know I don’t have what it takes to keep you. The most I can do for you is play the piano.\"","He then glanced at Shen Zhuoyan. \"If I were stronger—if I could be like this gentleman here—I’d follow you around every day as your bodyguard.\"","Shen Zhuoyan finally couldn’t hold back. \"Why do you keep comparing yourself to me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to him in surprise. \"Why are you being so harsh?\"","Shen Zhuoyan was visibly irritated. \"Because he keeps measuring himself against me! Saying he’s weak and I’m strong, making it seem like I’m some chest-thumping gorilla while he’s the refined scholar who plays the piano!\""]},{"number":256,"title":"Chapter 256: Qiao Chuchu, let's just be friends from now on, okay","paragraphs":["Shi Yu flusteredly lowered his head, as if he had committed some grave mistake, guiltily pressing a hand to his chest. \"I'm sorry, Mr. Shen. I genuinely think highly of you. I didn’t expect you to get angry.\"","He looked at Shen Zhuoyan with an appeasing gaze. \"My apologies.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","For some reason, this guy apologizing only made him angrier.","Qiao Chuchu tightened Shi Yu’s cardigan around him. \"It’s not your fault. Shen Zhuoyan just has a bit of a temper. Don’t take it to heart.\"","She turned to Shen Zhuoyan. \"Go wait outside for me.\"","Shen Zhuoyan, suppressing his irritation, said nothing more and strode out.","Now, only the two of them remained in the room.","The corners of Shi Yu’s lips twitched upward briefly before he quickly schooled his expression into concern. \"Miss Qiao, you should go check on Mr. Shen. I’ll be fine.\"","Qiao Chuchu helped him sit on the sofa. \"It’s fine. He’s always been like that—even back in school.\"","She kept her eyes fixed on Shi Yu, as if watching a bomb about to explode.","[Most importantly, this guy better not pass out. If he collapses while alone with me, no amount of explaining will clear my name!]","Shi Yu froze for a moment before smiling faintly. \"Mr. Shen was your classmate?\"","\"Yes.\" Qiao Chuchu rubbed her hands awkwardly. \"We were desk mates in our first and second years of high school.\"","Shi Yu lowered his gaze, his eyes shifting slowly. \"Two years as desk mates... You must have been very close, then?\"","Qiao Chuchu answered honestly. \"We got along well. Neither of us was particularly liked back then. He had no friends, and neither did I, so we became each other’s.\"","Shi Yu nodded, then asked curiously, \"But if he attended the same school as you, doesn’t that mean his family background is also decent? Why didn’t he take over his family’s business and instead became your bodyguard?\"","Qiao Chuchu weighed her words before replying. \"He didn’t get along with his family. For various reasons, he couldn’t find a good job—kept getting harassed wherever he went, plus he had some enemies. So I offered him the position as my bodyguard.\"","Shi Yu’s expression darkened slightly as he stared at her. \"In that case, he must be very grateful to you, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded. \"He likes the job well enough.\"","Shi Yu’s smile deepened. \"Just the job?\"","Without hesitation, she replied, \"Well, the pay too! I offer a pretty high salary!\"","Shi Yu paused, then burst into laughter. \"Hah!\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked, baffled. \"What’s so funny?\"","Shi Yu shook his head, offering no explanation, and smoothly changed the subject. \"Miss Qiao, what I said to you earlier was too presumptuous. I was too hasty and didn’t consider your feelings. I know you’re not the kind of person who values wealth above all else. Offering money for your hand in marriage was terribly rude of me.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Uh, no, I *am* the kind of person who values wealth.\"","Shi Yu: \"...?\"","He took a deep breath and continued calmly, \"Regardless, it was still inappropriate for me to propose such a transaction.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s expression turned solemn. \"No, my dude. If you’re offering *billions* to marry me, there’s no one more polite than you. The only shame is that we can’t get divorced afterward.\"","Shi Yu: \"...What a pity indeed.\"","He then added, \"Then let’s just be friends from now on. It seems being near you gives me strength.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked surprised. \"Really?\"","\"Really.\" Shi Yu met her gaze. \"If you choose me as the male lead, I might recover and become a healthy person. But even if you don’t, as long as I stay by your side as a friend, under these circumstances, I can still survive. And as long as I’m alive, I’ll be content.\"","She hesitated. \"But what if your improvement is just a coincidence? What if it’s all in our heads?\"","\"This body is mine. I can feel it.\" Shi Yu spoke earnestly. \"Last time I was near you, I had the strength to stand. This time, it’s even clearer—I woke up from unconsciousness. So there *is* a connection between us.\"","Qiao Chuchu listened, dumbfounded. \"So I’m basically your human charger?\"","Shi Yu chuckled. \"Exactly. The downside is, the moment I leave you, I lose power. So how about this...\"","He leaned closer, his fingers slowly brushing against hers, his eyes locked onto hers with unwavering focus.","\"I’ll move into your place. I’ll pay rent, and I’ll see you every day. That way, I can recharge, and it won’t inconvenience you. Does that sound acceptable?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","---","Shen Zhuoyan stood in the hallway, the more he thought about it, the more unsettled he felt.","He pulled out his phone and opened the group chat that had been silent for days:","**「I’m at some guy’s house with Qiao Chuchu right now.」**","Pei Buxian: **「?」**","Pei Youchuan: **「?」**","Pei Mu: **「?」**","Pei Ci: **「?」**","Lin Qing: **「!」**","After a moment of deliberation, he typed:","**「This guy started complimenting me the moment he saw me—said I was strong, then went on about how frail *he* was. He even played the piano for Qiao Chuchu, saying he couldn’t protect her like I could, so he’d just play music for her instead. It rubbed me the wrong way, so I snapped at him. Was I too harsh?」**","Pei Buxian: **「???」**","Pei Youchuan: **「???」**","Pei Mu: **「???」**","Pei Ci: **「???」**","Weisheng Huailing: **「? Are you actually this dense or just pretending?」**","Weisheng Biehe: **「@Shen Zhuoyan Where did this fool even come from?」**","Weisheng Lin: **「From my company, apparently.」**","Lin Qing: **「Shen Zhuoyan, *you’re* the one who went too far! How could you yell at that poor guy? You’re so strong, and he’s so weak... (covers face in tears)」**","Weisheng Yucan copied: **「Shen Zhuoyan, *you’re* the one who went too far! How could you yell at that poor guy? You’re so strong, and he’s so weak! (covers face in tears)」**","Shen Zhuoyan: **「...So I *was* in the wrong?」**","Pei Buxian: **「You absolute moron! Wrong my ass! That guy was using your strength to highlight his own weakness—he’s playing the victim to win Qiao Chuchu’s sympathy! And Qiao Chuchu has *always* been weak to that kind of act!!!」**","Pei Fengnong: **「@Pei Buxian So *that’s* why you’re always pulling the ‘poor me’ act around her?」**","Pei Buxian: **「And it works like a charm. Don’t believe me? Ask Weisheng Huailing.」**","Weisheng Huailing: **「Sorry, can’t help you there. I’m not acting—I really *am* pitiful.」**","Pei Buxian: **「Yeah, exactly like this bastard here. Get it now, Shen Zhuoyan?」**","Shen Zhuoyan: **「Huh? But he really *does* look sickly...」**","Pei Youchuan: **「I can’t take this anymore. Where are you right now? Are you at least staying close to Qiao Chuchu?」**","Shen Zhuoyan replied guilelessly: **「After I yelled at him, Qiao Chuchu told me to wait in the hallway.」**","Lin Shen: **「...」**","Ying Chen: **「...」**","Lou Tingsi: **「...」**","Pei Yuan: **「...」**","Pei Che: **「...」**","Pei Fengnong: **「...」**","Lou Yuejue: **「Big bro... don’t you see what’s happening here?」**","Shen Zhuoyan: **「I do. I really shouldn’t have shouted at him.」**","......","The chat was promptly flooded with an endless stream of ellipses.","Weisheng Wenzhan suggested, \"Why don't you go apologize to him? And write a 5,000-word self-reflection while you're at it.\"","Shen Zhuoyan frowned. \"Alright, I’ll do it after they finish talking.\"","Weisheng Huailing was baffled. \"?? You’re seriously going to wait until they’re done talking??????\"","Before Shen Zhuoyan could respond, the Shi family’s butler arrived at Shi Yu’s door and knocked.","\"Mr. Shi, dinner is ready. Also, a friend of yours is here to see you.\"","Shi Yu opened the door, puzzled. \"Who’s here to see me?\"","The butler replied, \"Mr. Ji Yanchuan.\"","Shi Yu: \"?\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s phone buzzed incessantly in his hand.","The group chat was flooded with people tagging him.","They all seemed to be cursing him out.","He didn’t have time to read it, so he quickly typed back: \"Hold on, Ji Yanchuan’s here. Probably looking for Qiao Chuchu again.\"","The group chat erupted with: \"????????????????\""]},{"number":257,"title":"Chapter 257: When the snipe and the clam grapple, the fisherman profits.","paragraphs":["Lin Qing exploded with rage, typing furiously: \"Why would Ji Yanchuan go looking for Qiao Chuchu? Why would Ji Yanchuan go looking for Qiao Chuchu? Why would Ji Yanchuan go looking for Qiao Chuchu?!\"","Lin Shen: \"...Didn't Ji Yanchuan just break off his engagement with Lin Qing not long ago? Why would he go after Qiao Chuchu now?\"","Pei Yuan: \"Judging by Chuchu's inner thoughts, Xia Xuechun is no longer the female lead—Chuchu is. As the male lead, Ji Yanchuan is supposed to have romantic development with her. And if Ji Yanchuan says anything, Chuchu can’t defy him, or else the script will threaten her.\"","Lin Qing: \"? Even as the female lead, Qiao Chuchu is forced to be with trash like Ji Yanchuan? Where does the script put all of you?! Can’t the script at least consider my wishes as the villainess?!\"","Lou Yuejue: \"Sister, what kind of script did you imagine?\"","Lin Qing: \"One where you don’t exist.\"","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","Pei Che: \"Right now, Ji Yanchuan is clinging to Chuchu, and she can’t even kill him. Weisheng Huailing is proof of what happens if you try—he shot at that guy, but the bullet jammed. Then he tried using a knife, but a chunk of the ceiling fell and crushed him. The whole house even collapsed afterward.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"Exactly. That poor girl is stuck with a scumbag she can’t shake off.\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"What a pitiful child, being harassed by such a loser and unable to fight back.\"","Pei Buxian: \"Our Chuchu is still fighting back in her own way! She’s been playing Ji Yanchuan like a fiddle! Chuchu is the smartest!\"","Lou Yuejue: \"I absolutely refuse to let Chuchu end up with Ji Yanchuan!\"","Lou Tingsi: \"Son, I agree, but I have to ask—why are you texting during class?\"","Ying Chen: \"The script chose him as the male lead instead of me? Is it blind? Can’t it see how handsome and well-built I am?\"","[Admin Pei Youchuan has kicked Ying Chen out of the group chat.]","[Admin Lin Qing has invited Ying Chen to rejoin the group chat.]","Lin Qing: \"We’re all family here. If I kick you out, how am I supposed to watch you all tear each other apart?\"","Ying Chen: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"My height, weight, and muscles are perfect. I’m the most suitable male lead.\"","Lin Qing: \"I ship the dark-skinned, broad-shouldered CEO trope!\"","Ying Chen: \"Hah! Ridiculous. Your tan looks fake. Mine is natural. Plus, I’m mixed-race with green eyes. Anyone else here have green eyes?\"","Lin Qing: \"I ship the green-eyed, mixed-race CEO trope!\"","Pei Ci and Pei Mu: \"We’re twins with perfect synergy. Wherever we go, we steal the spotlight.\"","Lin Qing: \"I ship the demon twin trope!!\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"Can you brothers stop being so basic? Look at me. A killer with a sweet face is the ideal male lead.\"","Lin Qing: \"I ship the secretly unhinged killer male lead trope!\"","Lin Shen: \"? Is there anything you don’t ship?\"","Lin Qing: \"I don’t ship you.\"","Lin Shen: \"? You said I’m the most marriageable type.\"","Lin Qing: \"Exactly. That’s why I don’t ship it.\"","Lin Shen: \"???\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"After watching this drama unfold, I’ve already decided my ideal ending. If Qiao Chuchu suddenly gets paired with someone—especially Ji Yanchuan—I’ll burn you all to the ground.\"","Shen Zhuoyan tucked away his buzzing phone and turned to the butler and Shi Yu.","Shi Yu glanced warily at Qiao Chuchu inside the room, then closed the door and said to the butler, \"Don’t let Ji Yanchuan in. Tell him I’m still unconscious and can’t receive guests.\"","He and Ji Yanchuan didn’t get along.","Though they were neighbors as children and had been close, everything changed after Shi Yu’s protagonist aura shifted to Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan grew increasingly arrogant, while Shi Yu declined.","They were no longer friends.","The butler hesitated. \"But Ji Yanchuan heard you playing the guqin. He knows you’re awake.\"","Shi Yu’s expression darkened. He glanced back at Qiao Chuchu. \"Then set two more places. We’ll have dinner together.\"","—","At the dining table, Qiao Chuchu stared blankly at Ji Yanchuan across from her.","Ji Yanchuan, looking pleased, addressed Shi Yu: \"Shi Yu, it’s been so long. I suddenly thought of you and decided to visit. I didn’t expect you to be in such good spirits—even playing music.\"","Shi Yu leaned on his cane and sat beside him. \"Yes, I’d almost forgotten you existed. And yet, here you are. How... nostalgic.\"","\"How could you forget me? I’m unforgettable.\" Ji Yanchuan ignored Shi Yu’s sarcasm, shamelessly grinning at Qiao Chuchu. \"I think you’d find it impossible to forget me.\"","From the shadows, Grandpa Shi frowned. \"I don’t think Ji Yanchuan came for our Shi Yu. His eyes haven’t left Miss Qiao since he arrived.\"","Yun Sui clicked her tongue. \"That’s the appeal of a destined match! Besides, Miss Qiao is famous, beautiful, and talented. Of course suitors are lining up. Is that so strange?\"","Grandpa Shi sighed. \"But our grandson is so frail. How can he compete with other men?\"","Yun Sui smacked his head. \"Our grandson may be frail, but he’s refined, a brilliant businessman, and incredibly wealthy. Most importantly, he has the bearing of nobility!\"","\"If he were a woman...\" She clenched her fist. \"He’d be the epitome of grace—the kind who’d be an empress in ancient times!\"","Grandpa Shi dragged her away. \"Let’s go before you declare him the perfect trophy husband.\"","With the elders gone, only four remained in the dining room: Qiao Chuchu, Shen Zhuoyan, Shi Yu, and Ji Yanchuan.","Qiao Chuchu propped her chin on her hand, staring coldly at Ji Yanchuan. \"Are you here for me?\"","Ji Yanchuan lifted his chin. \"No, I’m just visiting an old friend. Running into you was a coincidence.\"","Shi Yu interjected lightly, \"We’re not friends. You never visited me during my illness. We’re barely acquaintances.\"","Ji Yanchuan smirked. \"I brought gifts for your grandparents. You wouldn’t kick out a guest who came bearing gifts, would you, Shi Yu?\"","Shi Yu’s expression chilled, but he maintained his composure. \"As long as you don’t cross the line.\"","\"Of course I won’t.\" Ji Yanchuan’s gaze locked onto Qiao Chuchu, eyes gleaming. \"I just wanted to see how you were doing. I’d never do anything improper.\"","He then glanced at Shen Zhuoyan standing behind Qiao Chuchu. \"Step back, bodyguard. We’re about to eat.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s temper flared instantly: “Ji Yanchuan, are you just here to pick a fight?!”","Ji Yanchuan looked at her, feigning innocence: “Having a bodyguard hovering over you during dinner is already strange enough. I just asked him to step back so he wouldn’t ruin my appetite. Is that too much to ask, Miss Qiao?”","He smirked provocatively: “If I recall correctly, this isn’t your house, is it? You’re so domineering—careful, no man will want you.”","Qiao Chuchu shot back: “I don’t need a man. But with a mouth like yours, you should worry about whether any man would want *you*.”","Ji Yanchuan: “?”","Shi Yu’s gaze shifted between the bickering pair, and an idea formed.","He spoke up: “Mr. Shen, take a seat. Let’s all eat together.”","Ji Yanchuan: “?”","Shen Zhuoyan: “?”"]},{"number":258,"title":"Chapter 258: Even as a Patient, Still Sarcastically Biting","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu looked at Shi Yu in surprise. \"No need, thank you for the invitation.\"","Shi Yu smiled gently. \"You just told me that Shen Zhuoyan is your friend, so he’s my friend too. What’s wrong with friends eating together?\"","He gestured for Shen Zhuoyan to sit. \"Take a seat, let’s eat together.\"","Shen Zhuoyan refused. \"No, you two eat. I’ll just stand guard.\"","Disappointment flickered across Shi Yu’s expression. \"Mr. Shen, are you still holding a grudge over my earlier rudeness?\"","He glanced sadly at Qiao Chuchu. \"Had I known, I wouldn’t have spoken at all.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, then immediately yanked Shen Zhuoyan down beside her!","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?!\"","She cautiously smiled at Shi Yu. \"Thank you. Shen Zhuoyan is happy too—he’s just a bit reserved, but he’s really pleased inside.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt nervous.","[Ugh, I really don’t know how to handle someone as fragile as Shi Yu. I’m terrified he’ll get upset and start complaining about chest pain, liver pain, or a headache.]","Shi Yu’s smile deepened as he gazed intently at Qiao Chuchu. \"Alright, then let’s eat together.\"","Ji Yanchuan, sitting to the side, felt like a clown. \"Shi Yu, you’re letting a bodyguard eat with us? You can stomach that?\"","\"Why wouldn’t I?\" Shi Yu picked up his bowl and turned to him. \"In my eyes, everyone is equal. Life has no hierarchy, no class distinctions.\"","\"Besides, this is Miss Qiao’s friend.\" His gaze lingered tenderly on Qiao Chuchu. \"Naturally, I should treat him with courtesy.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu’s lips parted slightly in admiration. \"Shi Yu, someone like you is truly rare in our circles.\"","[Shi Yu has this benevolent aura, like an untouched white lotus untainted by the world.]","[Is this the charm of someone who’s been sheltered at home, never exposed to the outside?]","Shi Yu’s eyes sparkled, as if hiding little stars.","Shen Zhuoyan glared at Shi Yu, growing increasingly displeased.","Shi Yu, however, met his gaze with an unruffled smile.","Shen Zhuoyan stood and moved behind Qiao Chuchu. \"I won’t eat after all. I’m not hungry. Thanks.\"","He wasn’t hungry.","Nor was he tempted.","He just knew that if he ate this meal, he’d spend the rest of his life feeling like he was sitting on pins and needles, with a thorn in his back and a bone in his throat.","Besides, he had originally intended to apologize to Shi Yu.","But every word out of Shi Yu’s mouth inexplicably made him furious. What was going on?","He glanced at Ji Yanchuan, wondering if he was overthinking it.","Ji Yanchuan shot Shi Yu a disdainful look. \"Shi Yu, I’ve heard people say you’re ruthless in business—cutthroat, willing to do anything to win. So why are you acting so gentle now? Found religion?\"","Shi Yu chuckled. \"Not at all. I’m Miss Qiao’s friend. Shouldn’t I respect everything about her? Can’t even you do that?\"","Ji Yanchuan choked, looking at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu sneered. \"Shi Yu, don’t compare yourself to something less than human. He’s not worthy.\"","Ji Yanchuan stiffened, glaring at her in frustration.","Qiao Chuchu ignored him.","He let out a cold snort and lightly brushed his foot against her ankle.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Who’s touching me?!]","Shen Zhuoyan and Shi Yu both looked at her in surprise.","She sat rigid, suspicion flickering between their faces.","Shi Yu picked up his bowl and continued eating, though the food tasted like ash.","Ji Yanchuan smirked challengingly at Qiao Chuchu, his pristine black-and-white sneaker gliding over her skin, inching higher—","Qiao Chuchu stomped on his foot!","Her stiletto heel crushed the top of his shoe!","Ji Yanchuan’s face twisted in pain. \"Ugh—!!\"","She stood abruptly, barely containing her fury. \"I need to use the restroom.\"","[Disgusting bastard! If there weren’t outsiders here, I’d beat the crap out of him!!]","Qiao Chuchu strode out of the dining area.","Shi Yu and Shen Zhuoyan simultaneously turned to Ji Yanchuan.","The atmosphere turned lethal.","Ji Yanchuan glanced down at his dirtied shoe and scoffed through gritted teeth. \"Pretentious.\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s eyes burned with murderous intent, fists clenched at his sides.","Shi Yu smirked coldly. \"Ji Yanchuan, what did you just do?\"","Ji Yanchuan feigned innocence. \"Nothing.\"","\"You rubbed your foot against Qiao Chuchu, didn’t you?\" Shi Yu’s voice dripped with disdain. \"Are you some kind of horny mutt?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"What did you just say?\"","Shen Zhuoyan stared at Shi Yu in shock.","Did those words really come from this seemingly frail man?","Shi Yu leaned on his cane, his once-innocent expression shifting into one of icy arrogance. \"Thanks to you, I’ve lost my appetite.\"","Ji Yanchuan scoffed. \"You blame me for your lack of appetite? Then why don’t you blame your own damn name while you’re at it?\"","Shi Yu ignored him, turning to Shen Zhuoyan. \"Mr. Shen, your employer was just humiliated by this trash. Shouldn’t you do something about it?\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s gaze darkened as he cracked his knuckles.","Ji Yanchuan paled. \"What are you two—\"","Before he could finish, Shen Zhuoyan punched him off his chair!","\"Try harassing her again, I dare you!\"","—","Qiao Chuchu scrubbed her ankle furiously with a wet tissue.","The memory of his touch clung like sticky tar.","[Out of all the novels I’ve read, this is the most revolting male lead ever. No wonder the original version had Shi Yu as the protagonist—he and Ji Yanchuan are worlds apart!]","[When I get back, I’m beating the hell out of him!]","She only stopped when her skin turned red, finally feeling somewhat clean.","As she stepped out of the restroom, she nearly collided with Shi Yu, who was waiting quietly outside.","Shi Yu smiled sweetly. \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked. \"Why are you here?\"","She had deliberately come to the second-floor restroom for convenience, but she hadn’t expected Shi Yu to follow.","Concerned, she asked, \"Wasn’t it exhausting to come upstairs? Why did you follow me?\"","Shi Yu didn’t answer. Instead, he knelt, pulling out a sealed antiseptic wipe and gently dabbing at her irritated skin.","Flustered, Qiao Chuchu quickly crouched and snatched the wipe from him. \"I’ll do it myself!\"","She cleared her throat awkwardly. \"So you saw Ji Yanchuan touching my leg, huh?\"","Shi Yu’s dark eyes held hers. \"Yes. You didn’t deserve that.\"","Her ears warmed, and she looked away, resuming her scrubbing.","[I don’t know why he’s doing this, but with Ji Yanchuan already being a nuisance, I can’t afford to get too involved with Shi Yu too.]","Shi Yu sighed almost imperceptibly, catching her wrist and prying the wipe from her grip. His voice softened with concern. \"Stop. You’re hurting yourself.\""]},{"number":259,"title":"Chapter 259: Shi Yu: Check out my layers of tactics. Qiao Chuchu: I'm not into layers.","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality, brushing it off casually: \"It's nothing, my skin is thick. A little redness won't hurt.\"","She grabbed his arm: \"Lean on me. I'll help you up—don't fall.\"","Shi Yu nodded and slowly stood, only for his vision to darken, sending him crashing into Qiao Chuchu and stumbling into the bathroom!","Qiao Chuchu, caught off guard, frantically wrapped her arms around Shi Yu, pinning him against the wall!","Shi Yu winced: \"Mmph!\"","Qiao Chuchu broke into a cold sweat: \"Are you okay?!\"","Dizzy and disoriented, Shi Yu shook his head and looked down at her.","Her arms held him firmly against the wall—like a shorter person attempting to \"wall-slam\" someone taller.","His deep eyes darkened as his hand slowly lifted, hovering behind her waist.","Almost as if embracing her.","A faint smirk tugged at his lips as he leaned in, inhaling her scent: \"Thank you for protecting me, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu exhaled in relief: \"As long as you're fine.\"","\"I am. This is normal for me.\" Shi Yu’s hand settled on her waist, pressing lightly. \"You’ve saved me twice now, Miss Qiao. I don’t even know how to repay you.\"","Qiao Chuchu pulled away, picking up the fallen crutch: \"Don’t talk about repayment. I didn’t do much. It’s just... we’re tied together somehow, like we’re shackled. It’s suffocating.\"","Shi Yu took the crutch, mulling over her words.","Shackled together?","His gaze dropped, melancholy creeping in: \"Earlier, I mentioned wanting to live with you—paying rent, sharing a space. You refused, didn’t you?\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated, apologetic: \"Yes. I don’t think we should be bound like this. I have my own life to focus on.\"","Shi Yu’s eyes dimmed: \"I understand. I know my approach was presumptuous. To you, my intentions must seem impure, so your rejection is justified.\"","\"But I meant every word.\"","\"Being with you, Miss Qiao... it gives me strength. And it’s addictive.\"","He lifted his gaze, locking eyes with her: \"Deep down, I feel this dependence on you—on your very existence—will grow into something deeper.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, his earnestness pressing down on her like an invisible weight.","She shook her head: \"I’m sorry. My decision stands.\"","Shi Yu paled: \"No matter what?\"","\"*No matter what.*\"","His shoulders slumped: \"Alright.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to leave, the air suddenly too heavy: \"I should go.\"","Shi Yu’s voice was hollow: \"Okay...\"","Her chest tightened as she hurried downstairs.","[Ugh... What a mess.]","[Rejecting someone like Shi Yu feels like kicking a stranded seal—if I don’t leave fast, I’ll lose my resolve!]","Shi Yu gripped his crutch, watching Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure before glancing at the staircase. A flicker of determination flashed in his eyes.","A deafening *crash* echoed behind her!","Qiao Chuchu whirled around—just in time to see Shi Yu tumbling down the stairs!","She shrieked like a boiling kettle: \"AHHH!!! SEAL—I MEAN, SHI YU!!!\"","He landed on the landing, face ashen, the crutch clattering onto his stomach.","Qiao Chuchu sprinted over in her heels, shoving the crutch aside: \"How did you fall?!\"","Yun Sui and Grandpa Shi rushed in, horrified: \"Shi Yu!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan, having just straightened his suit, strode upstairs toward the commotion.","Ji Yanchuan staggered out, hair disheveled, lips bruised: \"D-don’t you *dare* walk away! I can still fight! So what if I lost to Qiao Chuchu?! You think I can’t take *you*?!\"","Within seconds, the landing was crowded.","Qiao Chuchu crouched beside Shi Yu, noticing his twisted left foot.","Her expression darkened: \"Your foot’s fractured.\"","Yun Sui burst into tears: \"Shi Yu, why didn’t you call for help? Grandma could’ve assisted you!\"","Grandpa Shi remained calm: \"Call an ambulance! Now!\"","A housemaid rushed off.","Shi Yu, trembling, weakly reached for Qiao Chuchu.","Baffled, she took his hand.","Gritting through the pain, he addressed his family with forced bravery: \"Don’t call an ambulance. Medicine doesn’t work on me anymore. Just let me die.\"","Yun Sui and Grandpa Shi froze, tears streaming: \"Shi Yu, don’t say that! We’ll get you the best treatment—you *will* recover! You can’t leave us behind! You’re all we have!\"","Shi Yu squeezed Qiao Chuchu’s hand, gazing at her with heartbreaking tenderness: \"Miss Qiao, thank you for coming today. I know wasting your time on a dying man was selfish of me.\"","\"But...\"","He smiled weakly: \"This will likely be our last meeting.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","His eyes grew distant: \"The next time you hear my name... it’ll be news of my death. And I... I’m honored to have seen you one final time.\"","Yun Sui wailed: \"Shi Yu, stop this! You’re killing your grandmother!\"","Grandpa Shi wiped sweat from Shi Yu’s brow, voice breaking: \"Hush, child. You’ll pull through. You *have* to!\"","Shi Yu shook his head slowly: \"I know my time is short.\"","His fingers interlaced with Qiao Chuchu’s, his gaze lingering on their joined hands: \"I’ll cherish this moment... forever.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s disbelief morphed into irritation, her chest heavy.","She leaned in, her whisper laced with steel: \"Tell me the truth, Shi Yu. Did you *plan* this fall?\"","He stiffened.","Her breath was hot against his ear: \"You know I don’t like you, right? You know this won’t change anything?!\"","Shi Yu shuddered, fingers tightening around hers.","She squeezed back, a silent threat: \"*Answer me.*\"","A tremor ran through him. His frail facade shattered as he whispered: \"I... I did it on purpose. I wanted your pity.\"","Qiao Chuchu exhaled, resigned: \"Let’s go to the hospital.\"","Shi Yu peeked at her: \"Alone?\"","She yanked her hand free: \"*I’ll* take you. And pack your things—you’re moving in with me. We’ll settle rent and expenses later.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan, swaying: \"?\"","Shi Yu’s face lit up: \"You mean it?!\"","Qiao Chuchu deadpanned: \"I mean it.\"","Shi Yu bolted upright, grabbing Grandpa Shi’s hands in delight: \"Grandpa, have someone pack my bags! I’m moving in with Miss Qiao! *I’m moving in with Miss Qiao!*\""]},{"number":260,"title":"Chapter 260: Looking Forward to the Many Facets of Miss Qiao","paragraphs":["Shi Yu was practically floating on cloud nine!","Grandpa Shi was stunned: \"You want to move into Miss Qiao’s house? Why?\"","Yun Sui, standing beside him, suddenly understood: \"Oh, right, right! Miss Qiao is his destined one—she can improve Shi Yu’s health. Moving in with her is the best choice!\"","She eagerly turned to Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao, don’t worry, my grandson won’t cause you any trouble. He’s been well-behaved and disciplined since childhood. I’ll pay you 500,000 yuan a month for one room, with meals covered separately. We’ll also provide a driver and a male housekeeper to take care of Shi Yu’s daily needs. My husband and I will never visit your home, so we won’t interfere with your private life. What do you think?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened: \"500,000? That’s way too much!\"","Yun Sui warmly grasped her hands: \"No, no, it’s necessary. My grandson’s health is fragile, and we don’t want to burden your emotions. Plus, I’ll bring you along to any work-related events in the future! We’ll be like family! Our companies should support each other too!\"","Shi Yu, still lying on the ground, looked at her hopefully: \"Miss Qiao, you won’t dislike me now, right? I really don’t want to trouble you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She leaned down, her expression darkening as she hissed in his ear: \"Stop pretending. What could be more troublesome than you breaking your own leg on purpose?\"","Shi Yu blinked, then broke into a fascinated smile: \"So Miss Qiao can be this fierce?\"","Qiao Chuchu lowered her voice further: \"I’ve never hidden my true nature. But you? You played the innocent, delicate flower, serenading me with piano music, and when I refused, you threw yourself down to win my sympathy. You’ve got more schemes than a beehive has holes.\"","Shi Yu’s eyes sparkled as he looked up with feigned innocence: \"No, I really am frail.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him a sarcastic smile: \"Right, the only thing real about you is your frailty. The rest is all an act.\"","Shi Yu’s grin widened, watching her with amusement but not denying it.","Qiao Chuchu scoffed.","[And here I thought he was some untouched, pure-hearted soul. Turns out he’s a man-eating flower.]","[But I can understand his desperation. If I were fighting for survival, I’d break my own leg without hesitation too.]","[Even if the person he’s scheming against is me.]","Shi Yu’s smile faded slightly as he studied her with curiosity.","She... actually understood him?","The ambulance arrived soon after.","Yun Sui and Grandpa Shi rushed Shi Yu to the hospital in a panic.","Fortunately, it was just a fracture in his left ankle—a cast and some rest would fix it.","Seated in a wheelchair, he rolled over to Qiao Chuchu, who was leaning against the hallway wall, lost in thought.","Shi Yu glanced around, confirming his grandparents weren’t nearby, then reached out and tugged at the hem of her clothes.","Qiao Chuchu looked down at him coldly.","From his wheelchair, Shi Yu gazed up at her, eyes full of pleading: \"Are you still mad at me for scheming against you?\"","She remained silent, her expression icy.","\"Don’t be angry,\" he said, giving her sleeve a little shake. \"Once I’m better, I’ll work hard and buy you anything you want. I’ll even transfer some of my company shares to you—consider it compensation for putting up with me. You won’t have to work anymore. I’ll take care of you.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened. She grabbed his mouth and pinched hard!","Shi Yu winced: \"Mmph?!\"","He stared at her in confusion: \"Mmmph?!\"","What was that for?!","With a disdainful look, she slowly pulled his lips upward, stretching his mouth like a teapot spout: \"I did think it over earlier and realized I wasn’t considering your desperation to survive. If our roles were reversed, I’d do everything to make you live with me too. I get why you schemed, but understanding doesn’t mean I’m not pissed. Got it?\"","Shi Yu blinked rapidly and nodded.","Got it.","She tightened her grip slightly: \"Since we’re going to be roommates, let me make something clear—I *hate* when men say they’ll ‘take care of me.’ My family can say it all they want, but outsiders? No. If you ever say it again, you can go home and wait to die.\"","Shi Yu’s eyes widened in shock.","She hated that phrase?","Qiao Chuchu released his mouth just as Yun Sui and Grandpa Shi returned from the doctor’s office: \"Shi Yu, we’re all set.\"","Instantly, Qiao Chuchu put on a polite smile for the elders: \"Shall we go, then?\"","Yun Sui nodded, then frowned at Shi Yu: \"Shi Yu, why is your mouth red?\"","Shi Yu absently touched his lips, then glanced at Qiao Chuchu.","She stood behind the elders, her smile perfectly polite, but when their eyes met, she tilted her head slightly, raising a brow as if daring him to answer.","Shi Yu: \"...\"","He licked his lips, then turned to his grandparents with an innocent look: \"My mouth itched, so I scratched it.\"","\"Oh, you.\" Yun Sui chuckled, then smiled apologetically at Qiao Chuchu: \"We’ll be troubling you from now on, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head: \"Not at all. It’s my honor to help you both.\"","Shi Yu, watching her act, wheeled behind her and poked her palm with a finger.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She shot him a sidelong glare.","Shi Yu smirked back, utterly unrepentant.","Yun Sui beamed with genuine joy: \"Look how happy Shi Yu is! It’s rare to see him so lively.\"","Rolling his wheelchair beside her, Shi Yu grinned: \"Because I’m already looking forward to living with Miss Qiao!\"","His eyes shone with excitement: \"I can’t wait to discover more sides of her!\""]},{"number":261,"title":"Chapter 261: With Shi Yu at home now, arguments are bound to happen.","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu detected the underlying meaning in Shi Yu's words and turned her head away, ignoring him, only to meet Ji Yanchuan's gaze instead.","Ji Yanchuan stood at the corner, his face twisted into a snarl as he glared at her.","His hair was disheveled, covering his eyes, and the corner of his mouth bore a bruise from a recent blow, making him look utterly disheveled.","Qiao Chuchu arched an eyebrow.","What?","Looking for a fight?","Ji Yanchuan’s expression remained unresponsive, but a palpable murderous intent surged from his eyes.","Shen Zhuoyan emerged like a ghost from behind him, stepping squarely in front of him. \"What are you staring at?\"","Ji Yanchuan shuddered, his chest heaving even more violently at the sight of Shen Zhuoyan, as if suppressing rage but not daring to voice it.","In the end, he shot them a look that promised retribution before turning and fleeing.","Shen Zhuoyan scoffed. \"Pathetic.\"","His gaze then shifted back to Qiao Chuchu, his eyes tinged with a sour resentment, and he silently moved behind her, glaring at Shi Yu with a furrowed brow.","At seven o'clock that evening.","The long dining table of the Pei Family was fully occupied.","Pei Yuan sat at the head of the table, his expression dark.","Opposite him—the other head seat—was Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu scanned the crowded table.","The last time it had been this full was when Pei’s mother was still alive, hosting gatherings for her business associates, filling the house with laughter and wine.","Her gaze drifted left, toward the Pei Family’s side.","At the head was Pei Yuan’s eldest brother, followed by Pei Che, whose face was shadowed with displeasure.","Pei Youchuan lounged with his arm draped over the back of his chair, irritation written all over his face.","Pei Fengnong sat with his hands clasped on the table, his expression grave.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci mirrored each other, legs crossed in an arrogant sprawl.","Pei Buxian cradled a dog in his arms, his expression sinister.","She then looked to the right.","Seated beside Pei Yuan was the eldest of the Wei Sheng Family, Weisheng Wenzhan.","He sat with his legs crossed, his face impassive as he coldly observed her side of the table.","Weisheng Lin propped his chin on his hand, lazily watching her, though a simmering anger lurked in his eyes.","Weisheng Biehe idly thumbed his prayer beads, his dark gaze fixed on someone near her.","Weisheng Huailing made no effort to hide his displeasure, arms crossed as he stared pointedly at the person beside Qiao Chuchu.","Shen Zhuoyan stood at Qiao Chuchu’s side, his peripheral gaze flickering toward her companion.","An unspoken tension hung heavy over the dining room.","And at the center of it all was Shi Yu.","Seated in a wheelchair beside Qiao Chuchu, he wore an innocent smile, as if oblivious to the hostility directed at him, and nodded amiably at everyone.","Qiao Chuchu felt as though she were encased in a glass bubble—the animosity in their eyes bypassed her entirely, converging solely on Shi Yu.","**[I get it,]** she thought, leaning back in her chair, her gaze shifting left and right. **[My brothers are unhappy about a stranger suddenly appearing in the house—that’s normal. But why are the Wei Sheng Family members also upset?]**","**[Do they dislike Shi Yu that much?]**","**[And why is Weisheng Huailing even here? Shouldn’t he have gone home after being discharged from the hospital?]**","The table fell silent as everyone averted their eyes, lost in their own thoughts.","Weisheng Huailing shot his family a resentful look.","Of course, he hadn’t planned on coming to Qiao Chuchu’s home.","But after being discharged, he’d heard from the butler that Qiao Chuchu had fallen ill with a fever—while his dear brothers had taken up residence in her house during her weakest moment!","They’d gotten close to her when she was most vulnerable!!!","He’d been completely unaware of Qiao Chuchu’s fever!","His brothers had personally cared for her in her home, and he’d been none the wiser!","He’d been stuck in the hospital like an idiot, recovering from his injuries!","He’d missed days of opportunities to earn her favor!","It infuriated him!","Suppressing his anger, Huailing turned an ingratiating gaze toward Qiao Chuchu. **\"I heard you were sick, so I came to check on you. Are you feeling better now?\"**","He glanced at the Wei Sheng Family members, subtly gesturing to his lips.","**\"You’re... not still upset about this, are you?\"**","The others’ expressions darkened instantly!","Qiao Chuchu shook her head dismissively, signing in response: **\"I’m not angry anymore.\"**","Huailing’s smile widened, but his eyes cut like daggers toward Shi Yu. **\"And who is this brother?\"**"]},{"number":262,"title":"Chapter 262: Qiao Chuchu: Chirping Away, Annoyed by Their Scheming","paragraphs":["Shi Yu raised an eyebrow.","\"Brother?\"","He signed: *\"We seem about the same age. Why are you calling me 'brother'?\"*","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","*He knows sign language?*","Qiao Chuchu was equally surprised. \"You know sign language too?\"","Shi Yu nodded at her. \"I taught myself at home. When I had nothing else to do, I dabbled in all sorts of things.\"","He smiled playfully at Huailing. *\"This little brother can read lips, right? You’re quite cute. Do you also call Chuchu 'sister'?\"*","Everyone: \"?\"","*Chuchu?*","Weisheng Huailing narrowed his eyes. *\"What if I do?\"*","Shi Yu turned to Qiao Chuchu. \"Then we share a little brother. How nice.\"","Huailing’s eyes widened in disbelief as he looked at Weisheng Biehe. *\"Did his mouth just say what I think it said?!\"*","Weisheng Biehe calmly twirled his prayer beads, exhaled deeply, and closed his eyes. \"Yes.\"","Huailing: \"???\"","Pei Yuan sneered. \"Serve the food.\"","The household staff brought out plates of French cuisine, placing them before each guest.","Pei Yuan fixed Shi Yu with a piercing stare. \"Tonight’s dinner is French. I hope it suits your taste, Mr. Shi Yu.\"","Shi Yu picked up his knife and fork. \"It’s fine, though I don’t have much strength in my hands. My cutting might be clumsy—please excuse me.\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at him from the corner of her eye.","Shi Yu’s pale fingers trembled slightly as they gripped the utensils, his grip weak.","She sighed, taking his plate and utensils from him. \"We’re all friends here. No need for formal table manners. Let me cut it for you.\"","Shi Yu looked surprised, then smiled sheepishly. \"Sorry for the trouble.\"","Suddenly, a hand snatched the plate from Qiao Chuchu’s grasp!","She turned in surprise.","Pei Buxian set the plate in front of himself and began aggressively slicing the food, as if venting frustration.","*\"How could we trouble our little sister with this? We’ve never let her do housework since she was a child! Let her older brother handle it!\"*","He slammed the plate back in front of Shi Yu.","*\"Eat!\"*","Shi Yu looked down at the mangled food, which resembled a car crash.","He silently met Pei Buxian’s glare.","With a polite smile, he said, \"Thank you.\"","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned at the mess. \"This looks awful. Like something dismembered.\"","*[Doesn’t this make our table manners look terrible?]*","Pei Buxian froze, flustered as he glanced at her.","She picked up her knife and fork, neatly cut her own portion, and swapped plates with Shi Yu. \"Eat mine. I haven’t touched it yet.\"","The others watched the exchange with displeasure, their expressions tightening.","Shi Yu was touched. \"It’s fine. This has... character.\"","She ignored him and forced the exchange.","The \"car crash\" was replaced by a perfectly arranged plate.","Shi Yu’s eyes sparkled. \"Thank you.\"","He picked up his fork—","Only for another hand to snatch his plate away!","Shi Yu: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing opened his mouth wide, tilted his head back, and shoveled the entire portion into his mouth in one go!","Shi Yu: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","Huailing then cut his own appetizer neatly and pushed it toward Shi Yu.","*\"Untouched fork, knife, and plate.\"*","He smirked. *\"Eat up, brother.\"*","Shi Yu: \"...\"","Suppressing his irritation, he picked up his fork and shot Huailing a resentful look.","Weisheng Huailing grinned smugly, signing to Qiao Chuchu: *\"Sister’s cutting tastes the best!\"*","Pei Youchuan chuckled. \"Mr. Shi, if you can’t even hold a fork steady, you must not have any muscle, huh?\"","Shi Yu’s eyelid twitched, a flicker of annoyance crossing his face. \"True, I’m frail now. But I have the height for it. Once I recover, I’m sure I’ll develop a good physique.\"","Pei Youchuan sighed dramatically. \"Ah~ but that’ll take ages~ Girls these days love abs. Our Chuchu especially appreciates a fine body.\"","Qiao Chuchu shot him a look. \"What does my preference for abs have to do with you?\"","Pei Youchuan hissed through his teeth, lifting the hem of his shirt. *\"So hot~ Aren’t you all warm too~?\"*","Casually, he revealed his sculpted eight-pack.","Shi Yu: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Weisheng Lin smirked from across the table. \"What’s so special about that? Everyone here has abs.\"","Weisheng Biehe glanced at Shi Yu, amused. \"Except Mr. Shi Yu, of course.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan sipped his champagne. \"Now, now. Mr. Shi plays the guqin.\"","Pei Fengnong scoffed. \"I can play piano. We all learned instruments growing up.\"","Pei Mu said mockingly, \"He plays the *guqin*. Can you?\"","Pei Ci eyed Shi Yu. \"Mr. Shi is certainly unique—different hobbies, different talents. But what’s the point? It’s not like he makes a living from it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","*What is this?*","*Are they all ganging up on him?*","*Why?*","She opened her mouth to defend him, but Shi Yu spoke first.","\"If we all learned the same things, where’s the individuality?\"","The others glared at him.","He dabbed his lips with a napkin and smiled gracefully. \"All of you play piano. But I’m different—I play piano *and* guqin. That means if Miss Qiao ever wants to hear traditional Chinese music, I can perform for her.\"","He turned to Qiao Chuchu warmly. \"Miss Qiao, if there’s anything you’d like to hear, just ask. Even if I don’t know it, I’ll learn.\"","Pei Che sliced his food coldly. \"If Chuchu wants to listen to music, I can take her to a concert. No need to trouble yourself, Mr. Shi.\"","Shi Yu chuckled. \"A song played for a crowd isn’t the same as one played for a single person. The emotional weight is different.\"","*\"Take hands, for example. They’re always visible, always there—but not for anyone to hold. Their place belongs to one person. Only one can interlace fingers with mine.\"*","His gaze lingered on Qiao Chuchu. *\"A concert’s music is for many. But my guqin is only for Miss Qiao. That uniqueness—that’s what carries meaning.\"*","Suddenly, Shen Zhuoyan yanked him out of his seat!","Shi Yu: \"?!\"","Shen Zhuoyan shoved him squarely between Weisheng Lin and Weisheng Biehe, glaring. *\"Sit here. Since you love talking so much, the center suits you.\"*","The others raised their brows, silently praising Shen Zhuoyan.","*Well played.*","Pei Yuan wiped his mouth, pleased. \"Mr. Shi, stay there. We’re all brothers here—easier to look after you.\"","Trapped between Weisheng Lin and Weisheng Biehe, Shi Yu’s expression darkened.","Qiao Chuchu lost her appetite and stood.","Shen Zhuoyan noticed immediately. \"Miss Qiao—where are you going?\"","The table fell silent as everyone turned to her, concerned. \"What’s wrong? Not eating? Feeling unwell again?\"","The overlapping voices of so many men made her head throb.","\"I’m going out for some air.\"","The sound of a chair scraping against the floor echoed as someone spoke up: \"Should I go with you?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s expression darkened, and she turned to glare at them. \"No!\"","They stood by the table, taken aback by her sudden outburst, staring at her in surprise.","Shen Zhuoyan stepped forward. \"Miss?\"","\"You’re not coming with me either,\" Qiao Chuchu commanded. \"Stay right here at home!\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","With an irritated glance at them, Qiao Chuchu turned and walked away without another word.","[So clingy, always bickering and scheming against each other—what’s even the point?]","[So damn annoying!!]"]},{"number":263,"title":"Chapter 263: Going to Play with Sister Yucan","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu went straight to the underground garage, picked a random sports car, and drove away from home.","The roar of the engine echoed from outside.","Everyone hurried to the window, watching Qiao Chuchu speed off in the sports car, their brows furrowed as they turned in unison to glare at Shi Yu.","Shi Yu had already shed his meek expression, sneering arrogantly at them. \"Jealousy and petty squabbles—that’s all you narrow-minded fools are good for.\"","The group: \"......\"","Qiao Chuchu irritably grabbed her phone and drove to Lin Qing’s house, intending to call her out for some fun.","Coincidentally, Lin Qing stepped out of her home, dressed to the nines.","Ahead of Qiao Chuchu, a handsome guy hopped out of another sports car, clutching a bouquet as he eagerly ran up to Lin Qing.","Lin Qing accepted the flowers with an air of haughtiness and planted a kiss on the guy’s cheek.","The guy beamed, quickly opening the car door for her.","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","That guy looked like the recently skyrocketed male actor.","She put her phone away, her mood lifting instantly.","After breaking free from her fate as the villainess, Lin Qing’s life was finally on the right track.","Good. This was the life Lin Qing deserved.","Qiao Chuchu dialed Yu Can’s number instead.","Half an hour later, she arrived at one of Yu Can’s other residences and rang the doorbell.","A strikingly handsome man with long hair answered the door.","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in surprise—had she gotten the wrong house? \"Excuse me, does Weisheng Yucan live here?\"","The man nodded and stepped aside to let her in.","Inside the living room, several good-looking guys were lounging around, watching a movie. They glanced back at her and nodded in greeting.","Qiao Chuchu hesitated at the doorway.","Yu Can’s voice drifted down from upstairs. \"Chuchu, I’m up here!\"","She looked up, quickly responding before hurrying upstairs.","Weisheng Yucan leaned against the railing in loungewear, waiting for her. \"Bad mood?\"","Qiao Chuchu fiddled with the strap of her crossbody bag and nodded earnestly. \"Yeah, I’m really frustrated.\"","She glanced warily at the guys downstairs. \"Are those men your...?\"","Yu Can smirked. \"Yep, exactly what you’re thinking.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in awe, giving her a thumbs-up. \"Yu Can, you’re amazing!\"","But then she frowned. \"Don’t you find it noisy?\"","[Even when my friends gather at my place, it feels too chaotic.]","Yu Can’s smile deepened, amused. \"The people around me are well-behaved. I hold their financial lifelines—they wouldn’t dare step out of line.\"","She led Qiao Chuchu into her room, adding pointedly, \"But some people... are aggressive, domineering, and possessive in their professional lives. When they finally bloom late in love, all that pent-up energy has nowhere to go. And when there’s more competition than opportunity, of course they’ll fight.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned, sensing something familiar. \"Are you talking about the people around me?\"","Yu Can turned to her with a teasing smile. \"No, just speaking in general.\"","She handed Qiao Chuchu a tablet. \"You said you were feeling restless, so I had someone compile a list of events you could attend. I can also arrange for some handsome male models to keep you company.\"","Her tone lifted playfully. \"But I’m guessing~ you’re not in the mood for men right now~\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t deny it, flipping through the list. \"You actually prepared activities for me? You’re the best, Yu Can!\"","[I just wanted to vent and talk to a friend—preferably not a guy. Who knew Yu Can would be this thoughtful?]","Yu Can chuckled. \"Blowing off steam is good. You’ve been under too much pressure.\"","She picked up her phone and walked to the window, making a call.","\"Yeah, she’s here with me.\"","She stole a glance at Qiao Chuchu. \"Don’t come. Give her some space. Go do your own thing.\"","\"Huh? Push too hard, and you’ll just get hated.\"","Whatever the response was, she scoffed. \"Fine, come if you want. But when she snaps at you, don’t ask me to smooth things over. There are plenty of men out there.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes locked onto an entry for a legal racing event. \"Can I join this race?!\"","Yu Can hung up and grinned. \"Of course, sweetheart. I’ll make the arrangements. But the lineup’s already set—you’ll only get to do a friendly match.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded eagerly. \"That’s fine! A friendly match is perfect!\"","Yu Can patted her cheek. \"I’ll get it sorted for you.\"","---","Xia Xuechun stood blankly by the racetrack.","After clearing her name, she’d learned that Long Yuntian had been hospitalized—for days, thanks to Qiao Chuchu’s provocation.","She wanted to visit him, but Long Yuntian’s wife refused.","Long Yunxiao, meanwhile, was embroiled in scandal because of her. His wife, paralyzed and comatose, had her family accusing him of attempted murder after discovering his ties to Xia Xuechun. The police were involved.","He was in no position to help.","Long Yuntian was her only hope now.","But she couldn’t even get into the hospital.","Her last resort was Long Jun, Long Yuntian’s son.","Long Jun assumed she was his father’s mistress. He kept her around but tormented her, promising she could see Long Yuntian if she endured three days with him.","If she could just meet Long Yuntian, she could finally plot her revenge against Qiao Chuchu!","Xia Xuechun’s shoulder was suddenly bumped.","Long Jun glared at her. \"Stop spacing out. The race is about to start. If you jinx me, you’re dead.\"","His female companion smirked at her.","Xia Xuechun lowered her head meekly. \"Sorry.\"","Long Jun grabbed her chin, studying her face. \"You’re actually pretty.\"","Xia Xuechun’s eyes filled with dread as she stared at him silently.","Long Jun wasn’t attractive—small nose, thin lips, pockmarked skin—and his sleazy grin made it worse. \"Wear black stockings next time, yeah?\"","Xia Xuechun’s pupils shrank in horror.","Long Jun sneered, stepping back and beckoning her like a dog. \"C’mere, girl! Here, girl!~\"","His friends joined in, clicking their tongues. \"Here, girl! Here!\"","Humiliated, Xia Xuechun’s eyes reddened as she forced herself to move forward, her legs heavy as lead.","A hand suddenly clamped onto her shoulder.","\"Xia Xuechun, you were so proud and aloof when you slapped me and smashed cake in my face. What happened to that?\"","She froze, turning to meet Qiao Chuchu’s icy glare.","Qiao Chuchu, her red hair tied high, stood beside her with a scowl. \"You’re letting trash like this humiliate you without fighting back?\"","Xia Xuechun’s eyes widened in shock.","Qiao Chuchu?!","Of all people to witness her lowest moment—it had to be her?!","Long Jun's eyes lit up when he saw Qiao Chuchu. \"Xia Xuechun, you never told me you had such a radiant friend?\"","He leered at Qiao Chuchu's legs. \"Hey gorgeous, who are you?\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked. \"I'm the spicy great-grandma who clawed her way out of your family grave to haunt you.\"","Long Jun: \"???\""]},{"number":264,"title":"Chapter 264: How could I possibly have this ability","paragraphs":["Long Jun stared at Qiao Chuchu’s innocent-looking face and rubbed his ear in disbelief. \"What did you just say???\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped coldly, \"Can’t you understand? I said I’m your *spicy* great-grandma!\"","Long Jun’s temper flared instantly, and he raised his hand to strike her!","She swiftly kicked him square in the stomach!!","Caught off guard, Long Jun crumpled to the ground in pain, writhing. \"Oww!\"","His female companion shrieked, \"Ah! Long Jun, are you okay?!\"","The other delinquent young masters gaped at Qiao Chuchu in shock. \"Who the hell are you? How dare you lay a hand on him! Do you even know who Long Jun is?!\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked. \"No, but I’m sure my status is higher than his. I’m Qiao Chu—if you’ve got a problem, come find me in the glass office. I’ll be waiting.\"","She dragged Xia Xuechun away.","Long Jun clutched his stomach, gritting his teeth as he repeated her name. \"Qiao Chu?\"","His rage boiled over. \"That’s the Qiao Chu who’s been messing with my dad?!\"","Qiao Chuchu pulled Xia Xuechun into a secluded spot, shoving her against a wall. \"Xia Xuechun, are you blind? They were treating you like dirt! Since when did you become such a pushover? You used to be so tough with *me*!\"","Truthfully, she hadn’t gone there to help Xia Xuechun.","From a distance, she’d seen a girl being humiliated like a dog, and without thinking, she’d stormed over.","Only up close did she realize it was Xia Xuechun.","As much as she despised her, she despised men degrading women even more. She couldn’t stand seeing it.","\"You hooking up with old men is one thing—at least they actually cherish and respect you,\" Qiao Chuchu hissed. \"But that punk was walking you like a damn dog! Why didn’t you slap him? Have you lost your spine?!\"","Xia Xuechun kept her eyes down, face burning red. \"Why did you help me? You hate me.\"","Qiao Chuchu scoffed. \"I stepped in because I can’t stand people being degraded. You just happened to be the one suffering it.\"","Tears welled in Xia Xuechun’s eyes, as if she was holding back something. \"At the charity auction, I had all the online hype and marketing ready. After you ruined me, why didn’t you take my place as an influencer?\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"Not everyone craves the spotlight. I got what I wanted—why would I bother being an influencer?\"","\"But that exposure could’ve made you *famous*!\" Xia Xuechun suddenly looked up, resentment flashing. \"You didn’t take it, so why stop *me*? You clipped my wings and now you mock me for not flying! If it weren’t for you, I’d be on TV, raking in cash by now!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s expression darkened. She yanked Xia Xuechun to the wall. \"*You* tried to kill me first. Everything you got was *deserved*!\"","Xia Xuechun shuddered, pressing herself against the wall, arms wrapped tightly around herself.","Qiao Chuchu caged her in, glaring. \"You failed to kill me, nearly got my brother killed, and the same day, you went to Qi Xiaojia’s house—setting her up to be assaulted on camera! You even locked the only door she could’ve escaped through!\"","Xia Xuechun’s face paled. She covered her ears. \"I’m not listening!\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed her wrists, pinning them above her head. \"*Un*-listen, then!\"","Xia Xuechun blinked. \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu tightened her grip, making Xia Xuechun wince and sob harder. \"You’re hurting me! This is abuse!\"","\"Does it hurt?\" Qiao Chuchu squeezed harder, like she was handling a feeble puppy. Beneath her calm tone simmered lethal fury. \"Did you think about *our* pain when you tried to kill me? When you set up your *friend*? When Long Yunxiao’s wife ended up paralyzed because of you?\"","\"I didn’t paralyze his wife!\" Xia Xuechun flared up, rising on her toes to match Qiao Chuchu’s glare. \"She did that to *herself*!\"","Qiao Chuchu gaped. \"You didn’t *directly* kill her, but she died because of *you*! How is that not your fault?!\"","Xia Xuechun screamed, \"She was *jealous*! She had a rich husband, a perfect son—she should’ve looked the other way! Instead, she fixated on *me*! Her suffering was her own choice! Otherwise, why is *she* the one in a wheelchair and not *me*?!\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, stunned by her warped logic.","Xia Xuechun... was a textbook *enabler*.","But just as quickly, Xia Xuechun deflated, shrinking back into Qiao Chuchu’s hold, crying like she was the victim. \"Qi Xiaojia always looked down on the 10k-a-month job I gave her. She wanted *your* 50k position—but she wasn’t qualified! She betrayed me for *money*!\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed incredulously. \"*You* can chase money, but others can’t? Qi Xiaojia left because you’re two-faced. Are you *that* dense?\"","\"That’s a *lie*!\" Xia Xuechun shot back. \"People lie all the time! Qi Xiaojia was just pretending to be righteous! Can’t you see that?!\"","She strained closer. \"The only reason you can judge me from your high horse is because men spoil you. Without them, you’re *nothing*!\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked. \"Do you see any men backing me *now*?\"","Xia Xuechun faltered.","Qiao Chuchu effortlessly twisted her wrist. \"You always credit men for my success—like that makes you feel better.\"","She tilted her head. \"But haven’t you noticed? Even one-on-one, you’re *still* no match for me.\"","Xia Xuechun stared, realization dawning.","Qiao Chuchu sneered. \"You can’t fight me, can’t out-earn me. The money I make from comics has *zero* to do with men, yet you keep insisting I rely on them.\"","She released Xia Xuechun’s wrist, pulling a utility knife from her bag and pressing it into Xia Xuechun’s hand. \"Here’s your chance. Kill me.\"","Xia Xuechun hesitated for half a second—then lunged!","Qiao Chuchu caught her wrist, twisting it until the blade pointed at Xia Xuechun’s own eye!","The reversal was instant.","Xia Xuechun went deathly pale, breath hitching.","Qiao Chuchu raised a brow, amused. \"Know why I always beat you?\"","Xia Xuechun trembled.","Qiao Chuchu tightened her grip, mocking, \"*Because men help me.*\"","Xia Xuechun: \"???\"","Qiao Chuchu swiftly took the knife back, tucking it away. \"These *imaginary* men give me superpowers. Otherwise, how could little ol’ me ever defeat you~? I’m just *so* helpless~\""]},{"number":265,"title":"Chapter 265: It's Getting Hot, Time for the Long Family to Go Bankrupt","paragraphs":["Xia Xuechun leaned against the wall, still shaken by the utility knife from earlier, clutching her chest as she trembled in fear. \"Stop being so sarcastic with me. I know I can’t beat you. You just want to humiliate me!\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered, \"If I’m humiliating you, then what was that man doing earlier? Protecting you?\"","Xia Xuechun answered without hesitation, \"Long Jun was raised as a spoiled young master. It’s normal for him to have some flaws in character. He just doesn’t know how to love someone properly. Once he understands who I really am, I’m sure I can move him!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Girl, you need to chill!\"","She clutched her stomach in disgust. \"Thank god I didn’t eat dinner, or I’d be vomiting right now. You’re seriously delusional!\"","Xia Xuechun pouted. \"At least I’m better than you!\"","Qiao Chuchu scoffed. \"Oh yeah, you’re so much better! That man dared to humiliate you in front of everyone—what do you think he’ll do to you in private? If you don’t respect yourself, keep licking his boots then!\"","Long Jun suddenly appeared behind her like a ghost. \"Are you talking about me?\"","Qiao Chuchu spun around, alert.","Xia Xuechun’s expression changed. She wiped her tears and hurried to Long Jun’s side, whispering sweetly, \"Long Jun.\"","Long Jun glanced at her.","The dim lighting cast a faint yellow glow over his uneven, pockmarked face.","His small eyes raked over Xia Xuechun’s face as he spoke in an ambiguous tone. \"Did she bully you?\"","Xia Xuechun sniffled and nodded tearfully. \"Mhm.\"","Long Jun chuckled and patted her head. \"How pitiful.\"","Xia Xuechun looked up at him, flattered but timid.","Suddenly, Long Jun yanked her hair!","Xia Xuechun shrieked in pain. \"Ah—!\"","Long Jun leaned down, his face twisted with malice. \"Are you stupid? She was helping you, and you still cling to me. Can’t you tell who’s good for you?\"","He kicked her to the ground!","Xia Xuechun fell hard, face-first into the dirt.","Qiao Chuchu frowned, watching Long Jun.","Long Jun stuffed his hands in his pockets, smirking like a smug playboy. \"Qiao Chu, let me tell you—Xia Xuechun is just a pathetic fool. No matter how much you help her, she won’t appreciate it. I treat her like a dog, and she still comes crawling to me. She’s nothing but trash.\"","Xia Xuechun pushed herself up, glaring at Long Jun with enough hatred to flay him alive—yet she held back, swallowing her rage.","Long Jun, oblivious to her expression, stepped on her back for fun.","Weisheng Yucan, who had been looking for Qiao Chuchu, stood nearby and witnessed everything.","Her brow furrowed in disapproval as she stared at Long Jun.","Long Jun ground his shoe into Xia Xuechun’s back, then smirked at Qiao Chuchu. \"Miss Qiao, let’s exchange contacts. I’ve never been interested in women before, but meeting you made my heart skip a beat.\"","A female companion behind him paled. \"What about me?\"","Long Jun’s smile vanished as he shot her a cold look. \"Who the hell are you?\"","The girl staggered back, stunned, but bit back whatever she wanted to say.","With one woman under his foot and another at his side, Long Jun’s arrogance swelled. He tilted his chin up at Qiao Chuchu.","\"See this, Qiao Chu? This is how I treat other women. But for you, I’ll be gentle. If you want, you can be my girlfriend right now. I’ll take care of you forever.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s expression darkened. She reached into her bag and stepped forward. \"You know what?\"","Long Jun grinned. \"What?\"","Qiao Chuchu deadpanned, \"Your eyes are so small, it looks like someone pinched them out with their fingernails.\"","She whipped out pepper spray and blasted it into his eyes!","Long Jun howled, doubling over in pain. \"AHHH—!!\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed his hair, spraying his face again before kicking him to the ground!","Long Jun landed face-first in the dirt.","She planted her foot on his back. \"You disrespectful little brat. How dare you strut around in front of your Spicy Grandma?!\"","Long Jun struggled to pry his eyes open, barely managing a slit. \"You—you bitch!!\"","She smirked. \"My face? You don’t even have one.\"","Long Jun forced his eyes open, vision clearing just enough to see Qiao Chuchu’s blatant disdain. \"You talk big about others? What are you, then? Nothing but trash.\"","Long Jun’s face twisted with humiliation, his breath heaving like an angry bull. \"You—you—!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t wait for him to finish. She stepped over him and turned the corner—only to run straight into Weisheng Yucan.","Surprised, she blinked. \"Yucan-jie?\"","Yucan threw her arms around her in an excited hug.","\"My Chuchu is so amazing!!\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback. \"Why are you so happy?\"","Yucan cupped her face, admiring her. \"Of course I’m happy! You’re beautiful and fierce—no wonder everyone loves you!\"","She then looped an arm through Qiao Chuchu’s. \"But Xia Xuechun was just trampled by that guy, and he was clearly trying to impress you. Didn’t you feel satisfied seeing her get what she deserved?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head. \"If it were Qi Xiaojia—a victim—getting revenge on Xia Xuechun, I’d feel satisfied. But Long Jun’s behavior just disgusts me.\"","\"He thinks humiliating women will win my favor, as if that proves I’m ‘special’ to him. But in his eyes, I’m no different from the women he steps on. Both Xia Xuechun and I are just playthings to him. I refuse to let him look down on me.\"","She glanced back at Long Jun, who was stumbling out of the alley. \"I’ll make sure he knows—messing with me is like kicking a live wire.\"","Yucan raised an eyebrow, studying her sharp, unyielding gaze.","Just then, Long Jun stormed toward them, murder in his eyes.","Qiao Chuchu immediately pulled Yucan behind her.","Yucan quietly shifted to the side, watching the confrontation unfold.","Qiao Chuchu’s expression was unwavering, her resolve unshaken even as Long Jun’s twisted face loomed dangerously close.","Long Jun’s eyes bulged with rage. \"I have a racing competition coming up, and now my eyes are ruined because of you! I was supposed to take third place! If I can’t compete, my team’s investment goes to waste! You owe me compensation!!\"","A man who looked like the team manager hurried over, stern. \"Long Jun, why aren’t you preparing for the race? What’s going on here?!\"","\"I can’t race anymore!\" Long Jun pointed at his swollen eyes. \"Qiao Chu sprayed pepper spray in my face! If I get on the track like this, I won’t just lose—I could die!\"","The manager took one look and immediately caught the pungent scent of pepper spray. He turned to Qiao Chuchu, shocked. \"You did this?\"","Qiao Chuchu straightened her back and faced the manager squarely: \"He trampled over other girls and harassed me, so I sprayed him. What's the problem?\"","The manager was shocked and scolded Long Jun: \"Are you trying to get yourself killed?! How could you do something like this?!\"","Long Jun guiltily averted his gaze and fell silent.","The manager turned to Qiao Chuchu with an awkward expression. \"I'm sorry, miss, but this match is about to start. Even though it's not an official competition, I entered it to boost my team's reputation. My other top players are abroad competing right now, and Long Jun is currently the best member I have left. Now that you’ve done this to him, he can’t play. How am I supposed to cover this loss?\"","Long Jun snarled from the side, \"Make her pay! That fucking bitch!\"","Weisheng Yucan slapped him across the face. \"Say one more word, and I’ll bankrupt your family!\""]},{"number":266,"title":"Chapter 266: With Me Here, Who Dares to Add WeChat","paragraphs":["Long Jun staggered back in shock, clutching his face, his pupils shrinking as he recognized Weisheng Yucan. \"CEO Weisheng?!\"","Weisheng Yucan pulled out a disinfectant wipe to clean her hands, her voice low and threatening. \"Your family is already on the decline. If you dare act out again, I’ll make sure you never see the light of day.\"","Long Jun took a cautious step back, swallowing his resentment and not daring to show it.","The team manager, belatedly realizing who she was, stammered, \"CEO Weisheng?\"","She was a powerhouse—many teams dreamed of securing her investment!","Weisheng Yucan shot him a cold glare. \"If your player’s lack of integrity ruins your competition, that’s your problem. Don’t drag my girl into it.\"","The manager choked back his words, too intimidated to argue. \"My apologies. I’ll figure something out.\"","Qiao Chuchu stopped him. \"Wait, if I win first place, is there a prize? What do I get?\"","The manager explained, \"First place gets 500,000 yuan and a trophy. Since this isn’t a professional international event—just a small livestreamed competition—our team will also give bonuses: 100,000 for third place, 200,000 for second, and 300,000 for first.\"","He added, \"Of course, we’d be happy just to place third. It’s more about the reputation since all the top-tier players are competing abroad. We know our limits.\"","He shot Long Jun a disappointed look. \"Pity our only capable player screwed things up.\"","Qiao Chuchu shrugged. \"Then let me do it.\"","Weisheng Yucan looked at her in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu bargained with the manager. \"If I win, I keep the trophy and the prize money. You can take the credit.\"","Long Jun sneered, his tone mocking. \"You? Seriously? You’ll just embarrass our team!\"","Xia Xuechun scoffed from the sidelines. \"Qiao Chuchu, stop bragging. Driving a car doesn’t mean you can race.\"","The manager hesitated, glancing at Qiao Chuchu.","She lazily tucked her hands into her pockets, utterly confident. \"You don’t have to pick me. I’m just looking for some fun.\"","The manager blinked. \"Fun? Do you even know this is a competition?\"","\"Of course.\" She tilted her head with a smirk. \"But games are meant to be won.\"","She just wanted the added thrill of taking home the trophy and prize money—extra perks to make victory sweeter.","The manager faltered, looking uncertainly at Weisheng Yucan.","Weisheng Yucan stared at Qiao Chuchu, intrigued, her red lips curving into a slow, fascinated smile.","---","Pei Buxian curled up on the couch, hugging his soft, sweet-smelling dog, his gaze repeatedly drifting to the window.","Qiao Chuchu still wasn’t back.","He felt lightheaded, his body weak, exhaustion tugging at him.","But he forced himself to stay awake, setting the dog down with a sigh. \"Someone call Qiao Chuchu and ask when she’s coming home.\"","Pei Fengnong, standing by the window, pinched the bridge of his nose. \"Why don’t you do it yourself?\"","His head throbbed, his body ached, and even breathing felt scorching.","But he wouldn’t rest until Qiao Chuchu returned.","Pei Buxian slumped against the couch, suppressing his discomfort. \"I’m already too clingy. Last time it was me. It can’t always be me.\"","He turned to Pei Youchuan. \"You do it. You’re the fool—she won’t get mad at you.\"","Pei Youchuan weakly hugged a pillow. \"And when she does, you’ll blame me, right?\"","Pei Buxian didn’t deny it. \"Right.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","The others remained silent, each lost in their own thoughts.","Shi Yu was the most displeased. \"Just got here and already left alone. How tragic.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci glared. \"One more word and we’ll sew your mouth shut, you conniving jerk! This is all your fault!\"","Shi Yu shrugged. \"Not me. You all share the blame—except for me.\"","The doorbell rang.","A housekeeper hurried to answer it. \"Coming!\"","The men instantly straightened, eyes bright with hope as they turned toward the entrance.","Lou Tingsi strode in cheerfully, two gift boxes in hand. \"Brothers, long time no see! Did you miss me?\"","Their expressions, initially eager, darkened the moment they saw him. They turned away coldly.","Undeterred, Lou Tingsi chuckled. \"Where’s Chuchu? I brought her gifts. Has her fever gone down?\"","Then he noticed Shi Yu in the wheelchair. His smile froze, his gaze sharpening. \"And who’s this new hero?\"","Shi Yu extended a hand with a fake smile. \"Hello, I’m Shi Yu. Qiao Chuchu’s new housemate.\"","Lou Tingsi’s grin didn’t reach his eyes. \"New housemate?\"","He turned to the Weisheng brothers in disbelief. \"You’re all living together now?!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan, flushed, forced himself to focus on his laptop.","Weisheng Lin lay half-dead on the couch, asleep.","Weisheng Biehe slumped over the table, listless.","Huai Ling, red as a boiled lobster, sat silently, clearly unwell.","Lou Tingsi took in the scene, then suddenly laughed, shaking Shi Yu’s hand. \"Nice to meet you. I’m Lou Tingsi—also a new housemate.\"","He glanced at the Pei brothers. \"Why do you all look so awful? Red faces, red eyes—did you catch Chuchu’s fever?\"","The room fell silent as everyone looked up at him.","...He might be right.","Huai Ling, slow to process, suddenly perked up, clapping his hands to get their attention.","He signed excitedly: *That means I’m the only one who got sick from kissing Qiao Chuchu!*","Lou Tingsi’s face darkened. \"What did you say?!\"","Shi Yu nearly stood from his wheelchair. \"You kissed her?!\"","The others, despite their exhaustion, shot Huai Ling murderous glares.","Weisheng Biehe groaned. \"Huai Ling, must you stir the pot? She almost cut ties with you! Have some shame!\"","Pei Buxian snapped, \"Shut up!!\"","Huai Ling smirked. *I didn’t say anything. I’m mute.*","Lou Tingsi’s expression twisted. \"I was only gone for a business trip!\"","Shi Yu murmured, \"So that’s an option too?\"","Little Xie rushed in, phone in hand. \"Gentlemen! Qiao Chuchu is competing in a race! Want to watch?\"","They perked up like wilted flowers suddenly hit by sunlight, weakly asking, \"What race?\"","Little Xie connected his phone to the TV. \"I just saw it online—she’s about to start!\"","(Actually, one of Qiao Chuchu’s fans had posted about it on her app.)","They immediately turned to the screen.","Qiao Chuchu’s delicate face appeared, her hair tucked under a racing helmet as she stood beside another young racer, both in full gear.","On camera, her features were even more striking—petite, refined, effortlessly photogenic.","The host held up the microphone and asked, \"This is a friendly racing competition where, according to the rules, the passenger seat must be occupied by someone with absolutely no racing experience. We’ll be recording the passenger’s reactions throughout the race. Miss Qiao, as the only female contestant here, do you have anything to say?\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled politely. \"I hope to achieve a good result, and also hope I don’t make my passenger throw up.\"","The host then turned the microphone toward the young man. \"And what about the passenger? Any thoughts?\"","The boy’s eyes sparkled as he stole a shy, admiring glance at Qiao Chuchu. \"I think I’m really lucky.\"","\"Why’s that?\"","He pressed his lips together, his gaze lingering on Qiao Chuchu’s profile. \"Because this girl seems both sweet and cool, and she’s really beautiful. I hope I can get her WeChat after this~\"","As soon as he finished speaking, he covered his face in embarrassment and laughed.","The atmosphere in the living room instantly turned deathly silent.","Everyone’s eyes were locked onto the bashful young man, their stares so intense they could’ve burned holes through him.","Pei Youchuan stood up, radiating murderous intent as he strode toward the door. \"Let me see who dares to ask for her WeChat with me around!!!\"","The others wordlessly followed him out.","Shi Yu gave his bodyguard a meaningful look.","The bodyguard wheeled him away.","Only Little Xie remained in the living room.","Little Xie: \"...\"","Oh no.","She’d messed up."]},{"number":267,"title":"Chapter 267: Miss Eighth, Please Claim the Crown","paragraphs":["Entertainment racing livestreams have always been a highly popular program, with the main draw being a professional racer in the driver's seat and a complete amateur in the passenger seat.","The amateur wears a specially designed helmet that reveals their face, making it easy for viewers to screenshot and create memes. Every episode provides excellent material for hilarious edits.","The show usually has a large audience, but today it exploded in popularity!","Because Qiao Chuchu, who went viral a few days ago, turned out to be one of the racers!","Bullet comments flooded the screen:","\"Miss Eight is making a comeback?!\"","\"Ahhhh! My girl is back! She looks so cool!!\"","\"Wait, isn’t Miss Eight supposed to be an artist? Since when can she race? How is she this skilled?\"","\"Why can’t she be? She literally carried her family members on her back before. So what if the young lady has multiple talents?\"","\"The blogger I followed stopped updating. My girl is harder to catch than a wild boar in the mountains! I thought I’d never see her daily life again!\"","\"Right? That blogger claimed Qiao Chuchu wasn’t Miss Eight, but after Qiao went viral, they stopped posting. Sounds like a guilty conscience to me.\"","\"Whatever, I’m just happy to see Miss Eight again!!\"","\"T_T My girl looks so beautiful this time—not the snarling version for once!\"","Xia Xuechun sat in the audience, opening the livestream on her phone, only to find the comments overflowing with excitement and praise for Qiao Chuchu!","She had expected at least some criticism, but every single message was hyping her up!","She was on the verge of tears.","These people could have been her fans. They could have adored her instead.","But now, they were all fawning over Qiao Chuchu!","Xia Xuechun pinched the spot between her nose and upper lip, trying not to pass out from frustration.","Someone tapped her from behind.","She turned, eyes widening in delight. \"Second Brother Long, you’re out?\"","Long Yunxiao shushed her, pulling his baseball cap low as he glanced around. \"My name’s been cleared for now. I came to see you. Follow me.\"","He led Xia Xuechun to an empty area near the spectator stands.","Her nose stung as she threw herself into his arms, clinging tightly to his waist. \"You’re finally here. Long Jun keeps humiliating me, and I couldn’t even see any of you. Qiao Chuchu bullies me too—I can’t even fight back!\"","Long Yunxiao stroked her head sympathetically. \"Did Qiao Chuchu insult you again? On my way here, I heard she’s one of today’s racers.\"","Xia Xuechun nodded. \"She replaced Long Jun because she sprayed chili water in his eyes, so he couldn’t compete.\"","She pouted. \"Not only that, she held a craft knife to my eye and almost blinded me! And now she’s bragging about winning first place!\"","\"What?! Qiao Chuchu almost gouged your eye out?!\" Long Yunxiao’s expression darkened. \"Just wait.\"","Xia Xuechun blinked. \"What are you going to do?\"","His entire body radiated suppressed fury. \"I’ll spend some money to make sure she suffers on the track.\"","Overjoyed, Xia Xuechun leaped onto his back. \"Long-ge, you’re the best! I knew you’d take care of me!\"","Qiao Chuchu stood by her car, waiting as the other racers were interviewed one by one.","She noticed Xia Xuechun being affectionate with a man.","The man wore a baseball cap, hiding his face, dressed in slightly outdated clothes—yet he patiently carried Xia Xuechun piggyback as they chatted.","They looked like a couple.","...Who was he?","Definitely not Long Yuntian—his beer belly was way too big.","Could it be Long Yunxiao?","She stared straight at them. Suddenly, the man glanced in her direction.","Their eyes met for just a second before he looked away.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She wasn’t sure what was going on, but she’d better stay alert.","Fifteen minutes later, the race was about to begin.","Qiao Chuchu put on her helmet and got into the car.","The racers on either side called out to her, \"Hey!\"","She turned to them.","The two men leaned against their cars, smirking. \"Little girl, you better be careful. We don’t go easy on ladies.\"","They had just struck a deal with Long Yunxiao.","If they made sure Qiao Chuchu suffered on the track—whether by keeping her out of the top three or forcing her to crash—they’d get a million yuan.","As teammates, they always secured first and second place. This was a sure thing.","Bullying a girl? Piece of cake.","They sneered, \"Don’t cry when you lose, sweetheart.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Where did these nobodies come from, picking a fight with her? This setup felt so forced.","Was this scripted?","She scoffed and shot back, \"Relax, boys. I don’t go easy on anyone either. Just don’t start whining and cursing when you lose—spare your ancestors the shame.\"","The two men froze, exchanging baffled looks.","\"Hahahaha that’s my Miss Eight for you!!\"","\"‘Spare your ancestors the shame’—LMAO!\"","\"Is Qiao Chuchu serious right now? Does she not know Brother Wang and Brother Hao are pro racers?\"","\"Yeah, sure, they didn’t rank high in official tournaments, but on this track? They’ve dominated first and second place forever. They know every inch of this game.\"","\"Brother Wang, teach this brat a lesson! Shut her up!\"","\"Chuchu, fight for our noble family’s honor! You’re the only daughter we have!\"","\"Miss, you’re not just racing for first place—you’re racing for our dynasty’s pride!\"","\"Miss, I give you three minutes to win and humiliate these clowns!\"","Qiao Chuchu fastened her seatbelt and waited for the race to start.","The moment the signal sounded, she slammed the accelerator and shot forward!","Weisheng Yucan sat excitedly in the VIP section, watching the race broadcast.","Pei Fengnong rushed in, panting heavily. \"Has the race started?\"","Weisheng Yucan turned in shock.","A whole group of men had flooded in—all familiar faces.","Weisheng Wenzhan slumped onto the couch beside her, rubbing his temples as he caught his breath. \"Where’s Qiao Chuchu?\"","Yucan sighed. \"Why are all of you here? Didn’t I say being clingy is annoying?\"","Right now, she was definitely annoyed.","Weisheng Wenzhan shot her a stern look. \"Answer the question.\"","Rolling her eyes, she pointed at the screen. \"The red-and-white car.\"","They all focused on the broadcast.","The red-and-white car was already far ahead, clearly gunning for first place!","Pei Fengnong’s eyes lit up as he watched Qiao Chuchu’s smooth, controlled drifts. A faint smile tugged at his lips. \"She’s still so good at driving...\"","Long Jun stood dumbfounded in the spectator area, jaw slack as he stared at the screen.","Qiao Chuchu was driving his car—but with even more ferocity than he ever could.","She was an absolute beast on the track!","She actually knows how to race cars!!"]},{"number":268,"title":"Chapter 268: Helping Xia Xue is Worse Than Helping a Dog—She Bites Too Much","paragraphs":["The team manager beside them was also stunned.","He had chosen Qiao Chuchu purely to curry favor with Weisheng Yucan—he never actually expected this young girl to place well.","He thought her claim of being a skilled racer was just empty boasting.","But it wasn’t!","She genuinely had the skills!!","In fact, her abilities seemed even better than the rest of his team’s drivers!","Long Yunxiao watched as she surged ahead, leaving the other cars behind with a persistent one-car gap, his brow furrowed in frustration.","Xia Xuechun clenched her fists anxiously beside him. \"Catch up to her! She’s just a girl! Can’t two guys outdrive her?!\"","She picked up her phone to check the live comments.","The screen was flooded with question marks!","\"????\"","\"Wait, she actually knows how to drive?!\"","\"She overtook the usual champions on this track?!\"","\"Ahhhhh, Eighth Miss is so cool!!! Even cooler than when she was carrying her brother!!\"","\"Eighth Miss, I’m yours!!\"","\"Even though the blogger stopped updating daily posts and we can’t see Eighth Miss’s daily life, she’s got her own power-fantasy script!\"","The camera suddenly cut to the driver’s seat!","The man in Qiao Chuchu’s passenger seat was screaming like a horror movie victim.","\"HOLY SHIIIIIT!!!\"","In stark contrast, Qiao Chuchu calmly gripped the steering wheel, shifted gears, and even spared him a glance.","The delicate-looking young man beside her had his face twisted in terror, death-gripping the seatbelt as he shrieked, \"Slow down! Slow down! Too fast, too fast, AHHHH!!\"","Pei Buxian scoffed in amusement. \"This coward still dared to ask for Qiao Chuchu’s WeChat?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci sneered. \"What a joke. This guy’s got nothing on her.\"","Weisheng Yucan slowly processed the situation. \"Wait, did you all come here just because that guy asked for Qiao Chuchu’s WeChat?\"","No one answered her.","She smacked her forehead in disbelief. \"Are you serious? You can’t possibly be this insecure?!\"","Still, no one paid her any attention.","They were all too busy staring intently at the screen, brows furrowed.","The trembling young man in the passenger seat turned to Qiao Chuchu. \"Can we hold hands? I’m so scared!\"","Pei Youchuan’s face darkened as he shouted at the TV, \"Hold your grandpa’s leg! If you’re this much of a coward, why the hell did you get in the passenger seat?!\"","Weisheng Huailing glanced at Weisheng Biehe. \"What did he say?\"","Weisheng Biehe, gripping his prayer beads, smirked coldly. \"He wants to hold Qiao Chuchu’s hand.\"","Weisheng Huailing’s expression instantly darkened.","Shen Zhuoyan stared at the screen in awe. \"I had no idea she could race like this. She’s incredible.\"","Shi Yu nodded, equally stunned. \"Me neither, but I’m not surprised. She’s always been the type who seems easy to control but is actually stubborn at heart. It makes sense she’d be into something this intense.\"","Shen Zhuoyan nodded in agreement before realizing what he’d done.","The two exchanged a glance.","Then, with mutual irritation, they looked away.","Qiao Chuchu ignored the young man’s wails, focusing solely on the race.","Suddenly, her ears rang, drowning out the engine’s roar.","Her vision flickered—","The long-absent premonition flashed before her eyes!","Her car was sandwiched between two vehicles. After swerving to avoid them, it flipped over.","The boy beside her, for some reason, wasn’t wearing his seatbelt. His neck snapped on impact, killing him instantly.","The internet exploded with hate directed at her.","She was cyberbullied, her family’s stocks plummeted, and her brothers’ companies received wreaths in the mail.","The boy’s family attacked her physically.","Xia Xuechun and Long Yunxiao stood at the edge of the crowd, smirking. \"Qiao Chuchu, how does it feel to be humiliated?\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality, her blood pressure skyrocketing.","[Xia Xuechun and Long Yunxiao are trying to screw me over again! And after I helped her earlier—helping her was worse than helping a dog!!!]","Those who heard her thoughts stiffened.","Xia Xuechun was making a move now?!","Qiao Chuchu’s expression hardened.","[Long Yunxiao and Xia Xuechun must have bribed the racers on either side of me. They’ll try to box me in and make me flip. I’ll survive, but this kid next to me dies!]","She glanced at the still-screaming boy, oblivious to his impending fate, and broke out in a cold sweat.","[This is terrifying. I live, but someone else dies because of me—and after that, my life becomes hell.]","[But his seatbelt is a five-point harness. How could he not be wearing it? That makes no sense.]","[Is the plot intervening again? Since it can’t kill me, it’s going after people around me?!]","[Whatever the case, I can’t let them trap me!]","She checked the rearview mirror.","The two cars behind her were closing in fast!","[At this rate, they’ll catch up.]","[I have to shave off more time in the next turn—make it impossible for them to reach me.]","[But that leaves no room for error.]","[Dammit!]","Pei Fengnong immediately pulled out his phone and dialed.","Pei Yuan looked at him worriedly. \"What’s your plan?\"","Pei Fengnong’s face was flushed with fever, but his eyes burned with fury. \"If they can cheat and bribe people to hurt Qiao Chuchu, so can I. If we’re playing dirty, I’ll play dirtier.\"","He glared at the cars in fourth and fifth place. \"I’m buying those two drivers. They’ll block the ones chasing her.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Pei Fengnong’s vision blurred. His body screamed for rest, but he clenched his trembling fists, his voice hoarse with rage. \"No one touches her!!\"","Long Yunxiao, sweating over the live feed, called his hired staff. \"Tell those two drivers to hurry up and overtake her! Do they still want their money or not?!\"","The staff relayed the message through the drivers’ earpieces. \"Move faster. The client’s unhappy. Your cars are way better than hers—finish this quickly!\"","Without hesitation, the two drivers accelerated recklessly toward Qiao Chuchu!","Qiao Chuchu noticed them gaining and sped up as well.","The boy beside her was now shrieking hoarsely. \"MOM!! I’M GONNA DIE, MOM!! I REGRET THIS SO MUCH, MOM!! I NEVER SHOULD’VE COME, MOM!!\"","She glanced at the rearview mirror again.","The two cars were almost on her—","But the turn was coming up.","Taking it at this speed was suicide.","As she hesitated, two other cars suddenly overtook third and second place, maintaining an unnervingly close distance.","The second-place driver couldn’t react in time and crashed into the newcomer.","The third-place driver swerved violently—his car flipped.","Three cars were instantly out of the race.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","She steadied herself, downshifted, and drifted through the turn safely—but her mind was reeling.","[What the hell just happened? Did those two cars just... intentionally block the ones chasing me?]"]},{"number":269,"title":"Chapter 269: Chu Chu, Don't Be Angry","paragraphs":["Long Yunxiao was stunned by the sight and abruptly stood up from his chair!","Xia Xuechun was utterly disappointed: \"Are those two idiots sick?! They had so many chances to overtake before and failed, and now when they finally could, they crash into each other?!\"","The team manager was overjoyed: \"Qiao Chuchu is definitely winning now!\"","Long Jun cursed under his breath: \"Damn, she’s actually going to take first place.\"","Fierce applause erupted from the transparent glass room!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci cheered excitedly: \"Fourth Brother’s connections are solid! He handled it so quickly—Chuchu’s safe now!\"","Pei Che let out a long sigh, his nose beaded with sweat as he trembled and covered his eyes: \"Thank goodness.\"","Pei Yuan nodded wearily: \"Yeah, thank goodness.\"","Pei Youchuan threw an arm around Pei Fengnong, forcing himself to praise him: \"Who would’ve thought, Old Fourth? You’re usually so proper, but when it’s time to strike back, you don’t hold back!\"","Pei Fengnong didn’t respond, his gaze fixed on the three smoking cars on the screen, his expression ruthless: \"I’m not some saint. I don’t fight or compete usually because I never cared enough. But when someone I care about is involved—\"","He swayed as he stood up: \"There’s still Long Yunxiao to deal with. He messed with Qiao Chuchu. We can’t let him get away with—\"","His vision darkened, and he collapsed back onto the couch, weakly finishing: \"—this arrogance...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan picked up the phone, forcing himself to stay alert: \"I’ll handle him.\"","Weisheng Yucan glanced left and right, noticing an odd flush on all the men’s faces.","Especially Weisheng Wenzhan, who was usually pale as a ghost—now his cheeks were tinged with two bright spots of red.","The faint color extended over his nose bridge, like the trendy sunburn makeup from a while back.","This rosy hue starkly contrasted with his impeccably pressed, wrinkle-free suit.","Weisheng Yucan slowly realized something was wrong.","This glass room had been empty except for her earlier.","Ever since they barged in, she’d heard their heavy, uneven breathing.","She hadn’t paid it much mind, assuming they were just seething with jealousy.","But now...","A creeping dread shot up her spine, and she bolted to her feet: \"Are you all running fevers?!\"","Weisheng Lin gave her a puzzled look: \"So what if we are?\"","Weisheng Biehe adjusted his prayer beads weakly: \"Sis, we all caught it from Qiao Chuchu. But don’t worry, we’re fine. No need to fuss over us.\"","Weisheng Yucan gasped, covering her mouth and nose: \"Who’s fussing over you?! I don’t want to catch whatever you have!!\"","The men: \"?\"","She grabbed her bag and fled: \"I’ve had enough of you love-struck idiots! Running around with fevers like this!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan, still on the phone, snapped: \"I told you I’m not love-struck!!\"","The shout left him dizzy. He clutched his head, forcing himself to speak into the phone: \"It’s me. Come handle someone for me.\"","With her pursuers out of the race, Qiao Chuchu sped unimpeded down the track, crossing the finish line with ease!","She’d won!","Parking her car at the inspection area, she stepped out to a roaring crowd in the spectator stands!","Removing her helmet, she waved joyfully: \"Thank you!!\"","The applause was deafening!","\"Hell yeah, Qiao Chuchu!\"","\"This girl actually won?! Her turns were so sharp—so damn cool!\"","Long Yunxiao watched Qiao Chuchu’s triumphant glow, fury making his head spin.","Useless trash!","Life was already going badly—he just wanted to vent, and yet Qiao Chuchu slipped through again!","Xia Xuechun was crushed. She checked her phone, skimming through the live comments:","「Eighth Miss won, ahhhh!」","「LMAO, how did those two crash right at the start? Weren’t they bragging about making Qiao Chuchu cry?」","「Ugh! If those two cars hadn’t gotten in the way, who knows who would’ve won!」","「Stop whining. Racing’s unpredictable—Qiao Chuchu won fair and square! Stay mad!~」","Qiao Chuchu stepped down from the podium, glancing at the crash site.","The cars were built for collisions, so the drivers were unharmed.","But the two who’d been blocked were livid, lunging at the other pair: \"Did you two crash into us on purpose?!\"","Staff rushed to intervene: \"No fighting!\"","Behind the staff, the other two scoffed: \"Who crashed on purpose? We’re racing—are we not allowed to overtake?\"","Brother Wang and Brother Hao clenched their fists, turning to Qiao Chuchu: \"We could’ve beaten you!\"","They stared at her like she was a million dollars slipping through their fingers, eyes red: \"Rematch us!\"","Qiao Chuchu wasn’t surprised: \"Classic fragile masculinity. I knew you’d blame the ancestors when you lost!\"","\"You—\"","Before they could finish, staff dragged them away.","Qiao Chuchu scanned the crowd for Xia Xuechun, spotting her with the guy in the baseball cap.","She started toward them.","But a group of stern-faced men in suits intercepted, tapping the cap-wearer on the shoulder.","Confused, he followed them.","Xia Xuechun shot Qiao Chuchu a wary look before scrambling after them: \"Wait for me!\"","Qiao Chuchu tried to follow but was stopped by staff: \"Please wait for the award ceremony.\"","She could only watch as the two disappeared.","Though... was it her imagination?","Did one of the suited men just punch the guy in the cap?","Xia Xuechun clearly panicked, backing away—only to be yanked along forcibly.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Hah.","From now on, no matter how badly things went for Xia Xuechun, she wouldn’t lift a finger to help.","Pei Fengnong leaned against the glass, watching Qiao Chuchu ascend the podium and accept her trophy with a smile.","He grinned in relief: \"She... must be so happy right now.\"","The other men, barely holding themselves up, pressed against the glass to watch her receive the award.","True enough.","On the screen, her eyes curved into crescents as she laughed.","So beautiful when she smiled.","Qiao Chuchu happily carried her trophy back to the VIP lounge.","On the way, she ran into Weisheng Yucan waiting in the lobby.","She blinked: \"Sis Yucan? Why are you waiting here?\"","Weisheng Yucan sighed: \"First, congrats on the trophy. Second, my lounge’s been hijacked—your brothers and my idiot siblings are all in there.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? I told them not to follow me! Why are they here again?\"","Weisheng Yucan shrugged: \"Go ask them yourself.\"","Frowning, Qiao Chuchu shoved the trophy into Yucan’s hands and stormed upstairs, flinging the door open!","The moment she entered, all eyes turned to her.","Shi Yu, closest to her, brightened: \"Chuchu, congrats on winning!\"","She ignored him, scanning the room.","Even Lou Tingsi had shown up.","The men, seated or standing, all smiled warmly at her.","Her stomach churned at the crowd: \"Why are you all here again?\"","[Why are you all so clingy?!]","【They used to be such independent, self-sufficient adults, all cold and aloof, the kind of awe-inspiring big shots you’d read about in novels. So why are they always hovering around me now?】","【Last time with the horseback riding, and now this!】","【I just want some peace and quiet!】","Their expressions faltered, brows furrowing with hurt. \"Do you really dislike seeing us that much?\"","Pei Fengnong leaned weakly against the glass, his voice barely above a whisper. \"I... I was just worried about you, Chuchu. I didn’t mean any harm.\"","His vision darkened, eyelids growing heavy as he slumped forward. \"Sorry... I’ll leave. Don’t be angry...\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, then stepped closer to him. \"Why is your face so red?\"","Pei Fengnong didn’t answer, just gazed at her weakly.","She pressed a hand to his forehead and gasped. \"You’re burning up!\"","He swayed unsteadily. \"It’s just a fever... I’ll be fine...\"","\"Fine?! How is this fine?!\"","Suddenly suspicious, she turned to the others. \"You all look off too.\"","Panicked, she reached for Pei Yuan, touching his forehead.","Scalding.","Then Pei Che’s.","Just as hot!","Her voice cracked. \"Don’t tell me all of you are sick?!\"","Seeing her distress, the corners of their mouths twitched upward almost imperceptibly. In eerie unison, they murmured, \"We’re not sure.\"","Their eyes gleamed with expectation as they leaned in. \"Maybe... you should check for yourself?\""]},{"number":270,"title":"Chapter 270: Desire to Have One's Temperature Taken","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu didn’t hesitate and rolled up her sleeves, ready to check each of them one by one.","Her posture looked like she was about to skin a pig.","\"Who’s feeling unwell?\"","They all looked at her expectantly without saying a word.","Pei Youchuan eagerly raised his hand: \"Chuchu, I’m the third one—check me first!\"","She quickly walked over and pressed her hand against his forehead.","It was burning hot.","She couldn’t help but scold him: \"See? I told you all to stay away from me, but you didn’t listen, and now you’ve caught it too!\"","[This flu is so contagious. Once you get it, it’s easy to develop a fever, and inflammation in the lungs is common. It’s terrible for your health!]","She was exasperated.","[When I had a fever, you didn’t even let me drink hot water, and you don’t take care of yourselves when you’re sick either! And yet you still went out showing off!]","Hearing her tone, for some reason, they all felt warm inside.","Pei Youchuan felt her soft hand on his forehead, and it was surprisingly soothing.","Unable to resist, he placed his hands on Chuchu’s waist and pulled her closer. \"I saw you on the livestream.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze.","Pei Youchuan’s large hands enveloped her slender waist, making it feel like he had full control. His smile grew even more dazed: \"I saw some guy trying to get your WeChat. I was just worried you’d get scammed.\"","The others immediately glared at Qiao Chuchu, displeased.","She swatted his hand away: \"Did I say I was going to add him? That guy was wailing in my passenger seat the whole time—my ears are still ringing! Do you really think he’s my type?\"","[And after he got out of the car, he threw up everywhere, completely wasted. Asking for my WeChat? He probably didn’t even know where home was!]","Pei Youchuan wrapped his arm around her waist again, pulling her even closer, his voice tender: \"I was just worried. You’ve never been in a relationship before—what if you suddenly turn into a hopeless romantic?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened instantly: \"Looking for a beating, huh? Do I seem like the type to be love-struck?\"","She smacked his hand away again: \"And why are your hands so restless even with a fever?! Stop touching me!!\"","Pei Youchuan withdrew his hand but rubbed his palm, grinning foolishly: \"I—I’m delirious from the fever, hehe.\"","The others: \"...\"","Delirious?","He seemed perfectly lucid to them!","Qiao Chuchu didn’t say anything else and moved on to check the next person.","Weisheng Biehe lounged lazily on the sofa, closing his eyes when she touched him.","He looked like a lazy cat, obedient and languid as he rested.","Weisheng Yucan, wearing a borrowed mask from the staff, watched as Qiao Chuchu went from person to person, checking each forehead before moving to the next.","She couldn’t help but laugh, pulling out her phone to record: \"Lin Qing, look—all these guys have fevers, and Qiao Chuchu is checking each one, hahahaha!\"","Lin Qing replied quickly: \"? That sounds like heaven?\"","She even sent a sticker.","After checking all the high fevers, Qiao Chuchu approached Lou Tingsi: \"You don’t have a fever, right?\"","[He wasn’t around when I had mine.]","Lou Tingsi’s eyes crinkled with amusement as he leaned down like a fox waiting to be petted: \"I’m not sure. I feel a bit of a headache coming on.\"","She quickly pressed her hand to his forehead and sighed in relief: \"No fever.\"","But then she frowned: \"If you’ve been around them, could you pass it to Lou Yuejue?\"","Lou Tingsi blinked: \"Don’t worry about my son. He’s boarding at school and only comes home on weekends. He won’t catch it from us yet.\"","Qiao Chuchu relaxed and turned to Shen Zhuoyan.","Shen Zhuoyan stood behind her like an evergreen tree, gazing at her steadily.","She smiled: \"You look perfectly healthy.\"","Shen Zhuoyan froze, glancing around.","Everyone else had already had their foreheads checked.","He pursed his lips, hesitant: \"I’m not sure.\"","The moment he spoke, Qiao Chuchu’s warm little hand was already on his forehead: \"Alright, let me check.\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s face flushed instantly, his eyes darting nervously as he stared at her.","After a moment, Qiao Chuchu smiled reassuringly: \"You’re fine.\"","His heart skipped a beat, and he nodded obediently: \"Mm!\"","She then looked at Shi Yu: \"Shi Yu, you’re definitely not sick, right?\"","The others immediately glared at Shi Yu in warning.","Shi Yu sat in his wheelchair, his gaze sweeping over each of them before he smirked: \"Don’t worry, I’m fine. I just didn’t expect that despite all of you having abs, you’d still get sick like normal people. Thought there’d be some exceptions~\"","The others’ expressions darkened instantly, glaring at him.","Shi Yu grinned mischievously: \"I won’t trouble Chuchu. I’m perfectly healthy.\"","Pei Buxian muttered: \"You’re not healthy. You’re half-dead.\"","Shi Yu: \"?\"","The others burst into laughter, covering their mouths.","Qiao Chuchu frowned: \"Tch, why do you always start bickering when you’re together?\"","[I left earlier because of their arguing, and now it’s happening again!]","[This gives me a headache.]","Their expressions shifted, and they quickly masked their hostility: \"What? We’re not fighting.\"","Shi Yu coughed lightly and tugged at Qiao Chuchu’s sleeve: \"It’s fine, Chuchu. I don’t mind. I’m new here—it’s natural they’re not used to me yet.\"","Weisheng Lin, despite his headache, forced a weak smile: \"Shi Yu, don’t say that. Who doesn’t like you? We’re all friends here.\"","Weisheng Huailing signed with a fake smile: *Big brother is suffering, little brother is suffering too. Don’t worry, we suffer together—through thick and thin.*","Pei Mu and Pei Ci nodded vigorously: \"Yeah, yeah! Bros for life!\"","Lou Tingsi’s smile deepened as he stood beside Qiao Chuchu, enjoying the show: \"Don’t be mad, Chuchu. They’re actually pretty fun together. My childhood wasn’t this entertaining—being with them feels like making up for lost time.\"","Shen Zhuoyan side-eyed him: \"Childhood?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? That just made the mood even heavier. Now I just feel bad for you.\"","Lou Tingsi chuckled: \"No need for pity. I’m very happy now—and very lucky.\"","Weisheng Lin’s instincts flared: \"Lou Tingsi, stay on track. Why are you suddenly bringing up childhood trauma?\"","Weisheng Yucan, who had been watching from the sidelines, couldn’t stop grinning.","This was sweeter than her own love life!","She was practically beaming!","She stepped forward, still smiling: \"Let’s not waste time. Since everyone’s sick, you should all go home and rest.\"","Then she turned to Qiao Chuchu: \"I have an idea—why not find a big room and put them all together? That way, it’s easier to monitor their symptoms. What do you think?\"","Qiao Chuchu was horrified: \"Yucan-jie, my house doesn’t even have enough beds! The hospital is a much better idea.\"","Weisheng Yucan pouted unhappily, \"You don’t have to send someone to the hospital just because of a fever. It’s not that serious.\"","She seemed to be expecting something as she leaned closer to Qiao Chuchu and said, \"Just go along with my plan, okay? After all, I’ve got money—and there’s nothing money can’t fix!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s lips twitched. \"...Fine.\"","An hour later.","Qiao Chuchu stood in her home entertainment room, utterly stunned by the sight of eleven beds crammed inside."]},{"number":271,"title":"Chapter 271: Like a Silent Hunt","paragraphs":["Seven members of the Pei Family and four from the Wei Sheng Family, all running fevers, had changed into loungewear and were lying in bed with their eyes closed, resting.","The family doctor stood frozen beside Qiao Chuchu, staring at her in shock.","Qiao Chuchu stood dumbfounded next to Weisheng Yucan, her gaze fixed on her.","The three of them formed a perfect straight line.","Weisheng Yucan, wearing a mask, planted her hands on her hips and declared triumphantly, \"See? This is what I achieved with my emergency renovation budget! I turned your entertainment room into a massive sickbay. This space can serve even more purposes later—trust me, I’m an expert in this field!~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","What field, exactly?","Doctor Zhao gaped at Qiao Chuchu in horror. \"Miss Qiao, you said people in your household were sick, but you didn’t specify it was eleven people! I didn’t bring enough fever medicine for eleven!\"","Qiao Chuchu pinched the bridge of her nose, exasperated. \"Sorry, I was so busy earlier I forgot to mention the number.\"","Doctor Zhao sighed, waving a hand in resignation. \"It’s fine, I suppose. I just came from a tycoon’s place—his wife had a high fever, and he confiscated all my medicine, threatening to bury me with her if I couldn’t cure her. Now you’re handing me eleven patients at once. If they don’t recover, will I have to be buried with them too?\"","Weisheng Yucan answered without missing a beat. \"Nope. If a bunch of men die, they die. We’ll just replace them. No need for you to join them.\"","Doctor Zhao nodded, visibly relieved. \"That’s a relief. Otherwise, one body wouldn’t be enough to divide among all of them.\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"Not if we cremate you. Then everyone can take a handful of ashes.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","What kind of demonic conversation is this?!","She turned to Doctor Zhao. \"Just hook them up to IV drips, then you can leave. I’ll handle changing the bags and removing the needles. We can’t just let them keep burning up like this.\"","Doctor Zhao nodded. \"Alright. I’ll go restock—that tycoon took all my medicine.\"","Weisheng Yucan shot him a suspicious glance. \"The tycoon who robbed you—is he the one whose wife keeps running away pregnant?\"","Doctor Zhao sighed dramatically. \"The very same.\"","Weisheng Yucan rolled her eyes and strode out with her phone. \"What a lunatic. I’ll call him and make him share some of the meds.\"","Doctor Zhao hurried after her, alarmed. \"But he said if his wife has a fever, he’ll declare war on the entire world!\"","Without looking back, Weisheng Yucan scoffed, \"I’m not the 'entire world.' Let’s see him try picking a fight with me!\"","Instantly, Doctor Zhao’s gloomy expression brightened, his handsome features lighting up as he trotted after her like an eager puppy. \"You’re so cool! What kind of boss are you?\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"CEO Wei!\"","Doctor Zhao beamed, skipping to her side. \"Got it, CEO Wei!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Why does this seem... kind of sweet?","Little Xie rushed in, panting, clutching a handful of thermometers. \"Miss, I brought the eleven digital thermometers you asked for!\"","Qiao Chuchu took them. \"You can go, Little Xie. This room is full of sick people—you might catch something.\"","Little Xie shook her head firmly. \"Let me help you, Miss. You can’t handle all of them alone. I don’t want you exhausting yourself.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave her a calm look.","Little Xie immediately shut the door behind her!","Now, only Qiao Chuchu and the eleven feverish patients remained.","She had sent everyone else out to avoid contagion.","Approaching Pei Yuan’s bed, she placed a thermometer on him.","He stirred, groggy from the fever, blinking blearily at her.","She adjusted his arm to secure the thermometer properly.","His heart skipped—his body felt like it was floating in warm water. He wanted to speak but lacked the strength.","Qiao Chuchu pressed a cooling patch to his forehead.","Pei Yuan could barely keep his eyes open, his fingers weakly curling around the hem of her shirt.","Unaware, she drew the curtains and moved to Pei Che’s bedside.","Pei Che slept fitfully, but the moment she approached, his eyes fluttered open, his breath scorching. \"Chuchu...\"","She leaned down, gently touching his forehead.","The coolness soothed him, and he nuzzled into her palm before closing his eyes again.","She placed the thermometer, then peeled open another cooling patch and stuck it on his forehead.","Pei Che sighed in relief, his fever-bright eyes meeting hers gratefully. \"You’re working hard.\"","She shook her head. \"Don’t be so formal. You took care of me when I was sick, didn’t you?\"","After adjusting the curtains, she set a thermometer on Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan kicked off his blanket, restless from the heat. \"I’m burning up, Chuchu.\"","She stuck a cooling patch on his forehead. \"There, that should help.\"","He sighed, relieved, his fingers clutching her sleeve. \"Will you stay with me?\"","She tucked his hand back under the blanket. \"I’ll be in this room, but I still have others to check. One at a time.\"","Pei Youchuan’s lips pressed into a disappointed line. \"Fine.\"","Next was Pei Fengnong—cooling patch and thermometer in one swift motion.","Pei Fengnong murmured weakly, \"Don’t overexert yourself. I’ll be fine on my own.\"","She chuckled. \"No way. When I was sick, all of you looked after me. I’m not running away now.\"","Pei Fengnong paused, his voice frail. \"But there were many of us taking care of you. Now it’s just you handling all of us.\"","\"You realize that now?\" She shot him a mock glare. \"I told you all to leave, but you insisted on crowding my room. And now look—everyone’s sick.\"","She tucked his blanket in, grinning. \"But it’s fine. We share the joys and hardships together, right?~\"","Pei Fengnong stared, a flicker of awe in his dulled eyes, before nodding silently.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci lay sprawled across two merged beds, groaning dramatically. \"Chuchuuu~ Our dear Chuchuuu~ Come hereee~\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed, closing the curtains. \"Coming.\"","They stretched their arms out, pouting. \"We ache all over. Can we have a hug to make it better?\"","She pointed at Pei Youchuan. \"No hugs, but I can offer Pei Youchuan’s slipper. Want that?\"","Pei Youchuan, feverish and confused, turned his head. \"?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci flopped back in despair, kicking their legs weakly. \"You don’t care about your gege at all!\"","She rolled her eyes, adjusting their blankets, then gathered her hair into a loose bun.","Both men watched intently.","Her slender fingers swept her hair up, revealing the delicate curve of her neck, a few crimson strands escaping to frame her face.","Their mouths fell open slightly, eyes glued to her nape as they swallowed hard.","\"Thirsty?\"","Qiao Chuchu, now done with her hair, noticed their Adam’s apples bobbing. She grabbed a straw cup from the nightstand and held it to their lips.","They propped themselves up, sipping slowly, their eyes never leaving her.","After a few gulps, they murmured shyly, \"We’re good.\"","She handed them thermometers. \"Hold these. I’ll collect them in five minutes.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci blushed as red as boiled shrimp, reaching out to take the thermometer and tucking it under their arms. When their eyes met, each saw an indescribable tenderness lingering in the other's gaze."]},{"number":272,"title":"Chapter 272: Lou Tingsi: I've brought you a gift, can you come and take a look","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu drew the curtains shut and walked to Pei Buxian's bedside.","Pei Buxian was curled into a ball, clutching a West Highland Terrier in one arm, fast asleep.","The position made it difficult to place a thermometer, so she simply picked up a digital one and scanned his forehead.","38.7°C.","She sighed and pressed a cooling patch onto his forehead.","But Pei Buxian suddenly caught the hem of her clothes, murmuring deliriously, \"Chuchu, don't go...\"","Qiao Chuchu chuckled softly, gently placing his hand back down.","Pei Buxian was always like this when he had a fever—talking nonsense.","But he was also the most well-behaved when sick, doing nothing but sleeping.","She closed the curtains and moved to Weisheng Wenzhan.","Weisheng Wenzhan's brows were tightly furrowed, his lips slightly parted as he panted in discomfort.","Something felt off. Worried about a possible lung infection, she lightly touched his forehead.","Wenzhan jolted awake. \"Who's there?!\"","\"It's me,\" Qiao Chuchu reassured him. \"Don't be afraid.\"","She couldn’t help but add in her mind: [This big son of mine is quite alert, huh?]","Weisheng Wenzhan’s mind was foggy, but the phrase \"big son\" struck him as oddly familiar.","Only one thought remained clear in his haze:","Not an enemy.","It’s Qiao Chuchu.","His eyes rolled back, and he was out again.","Qiao Chuchu stood there, hesitating. She couldn’t bring herself to place a thermometer under his arm.","Weisheng Wenzhan looked too much like the male lead from her comic.","Even the way he lay weak with fever was identical.","She just couldn’t get past it!","After a moment’s deliberation, she scanned his forehead with the digital thermometer.","38.8°C.","Her brows knitted as she pressed a cooling patch onto his forehead before moving to Weisheng Biehe.","Weisheng Biehe was parched. \"So thirsty...\"","She quickly grabbed the straw cup from the bedside table. \"Here.\"","Biehe opened his phoenix-like eyes, the blurry figure before him gradually coming into focus.","Qiao Chuchu leaned down, her gaze full of concern.","Caught off guard, he stared at her in stunned silence as he drank.","Qiao Chuchu supported his head. \"Had enough?\"","He nodded dumbly.","She settled him back down, applied a cooling patch, and handed him a thermometer. \"Hold this. I’ll check it later.\"","Biehe took it gratefully. \"Thank you. You’ve worked hard.\"","Next, she approached Weisheng Lin.","Weisheng Lin lay with his eyes closed, though not deeply asleep.","His bones ached as if he’d been beaten.","Suddenly, something cool touched his forehead—a cooling patch.","Lin forced his eyes open to see Qiao Chuchu placing a thermometer beside him.","His face flushed red, his entire body stiffening like a wooden board as he watched her adjust his blanket.","Unaware he was awake, she naturally tucked him in, drew the curtains, and left.","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","Dazed, he held the thermometer, touching the cooling patch on his face, savoring the moment in disbelief.","Qiao Chuchu then went to Huai Ling.","Huai Ling lay with his eyes shut, breathing shallowly.","The moment she approached, he suddenly lunged, pressing a dagger to her throat!","She startled. \"Huai Ling?!\"","Recognizing her, his guarded expression melted. The hand at her neck slid around to embrace her instead, nuzzling against her like a leopard turned kitten, purring contentedly.","Qiao Chuchu’s expression darkened as she shoved him back onto the bed. \"Looking for trouble? What did I tell you last time?!\"","Huai Ling pouted, shamelessly pleading. \"Sis, I’m sorry! Don’t be mad!\"","His face feigned fear, but his eyes sparkled with mischief, as if he’d gotten away with something sweet.","She thrust the thermometer at him. \"Do it yourself!\"","Huai Ling took it with exaggerated pitifulness, obediently tucking it under his arm while gazing up at her like a wounded puppy.","Qiao Chuchu slapped the cooling patch onto his forehead with a \"Smack!\"","His head jerked back, but his lips curled into a delighted grin. Kneeling on the bed, he signed: \"Sis is rough with me, but she really cares.\"","She rolled her eyes. \"Stop daydreaming. I’m just taking responsibility since I got you sick.\"","Huai Ling’s eyes lit up. \"Then does Sis remember how you infected me?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","An unwanted memory resurfaced.","She pinched his cheek hard.","[This Weisheng Huai Ling just loves running his mouth, huh?! I was gonna let it slide since he’s sick!]","Hearing his name, Huai Ling only grew more excited, signing eagerly: \"Sis, I’m sorry! I won’t bring it up again!~\"","His eyes twinkled, unfazed by the pain, his apology anything but sincere.","He flopped back down, miming sleep. \"I’ll sleep now!\"","With exaggerated obedience: \"I’ll be good!~\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed, pulling the blanket over him before returning to the sofa across the room.","Half an hour later, Doctor Zhao returned with IV drips.","The treatment would take about two hours, so Yu Can didn’t linger, leaving only a cryptic smile behind.","Qiao Chuchu turned off the main lights, leaving only the soft glow of the desk lamp near the sofa as she kept watch.","Sometime later, they began to stir, faintly hearing the scratch of a pen on paper.","The suffocating heat in their bodies had eased, their headaches dulled.","The room was bathed in gentle lamplight.","Propping themselves up, they looked toward the source.","Under the warm, golden light, Qiao Chuchu curled on the sofa, her long hair cascading loosely as she sketched on her tablet with a stylus.","A soft pink cardigan draped over her slender frame, paired with comfortable beige wide-leg pants. The light caught her auburn curls, setting each strand aglow.","The quiet scratching was the sound of the stylus gliding over the tablet’s textured screen.","The scene was so serene, so separate from their world, it felt like a living painting.","She was breathtaking.","They stared, mesmerized.","Exhausted, Qiao Chuchu leaned her head against the sofa’s edge, tilting it back with a sigh.","The light haloed her face, wrapping her in a golden haze—ethereal and untouchable.","Inspiration eluded her. Her fingers absently twirled the slender stylus, flipping it in deft tricks.","Their eyes followed the pen, throats bobbing, breaths growing unsteady.","Someone let out an involuntary sound: \"Mmm...\"","Their faces paled. In unison, they flopped back onto their beds!","Qiao Chuchu glanced over.","In the light, she looked like a wary deer, ears pricked for the source. \"Is someone awake?\"","Silence.","From the darkness, they lay perfectly still, hearts hammering, gripping their blankets as if their lives depended on it.","She rose from the sofa, tiptoeing toward them.","Starting with Pei Yuan, she checked his forehead.","The fever had broken.","Pei Yuan gazed at her in pleasant surprise.","She moved to Pei Che next, pressing her palm to his brow.","Pei Che’s eyes darkened, drinking her in with hunger.","One by one, she checked them all.","The fevers were gone.","Relieved, she turned away.","They all stared at her eagerly.","Yet she didn’t spare them a glance.","Lou Tingsi gently knocked on the door and pushed it open. \"Are you asleep, Qiao Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly hushed him. \"They’re all sleeping. What’s wrong?\"","Lou Tingsi, taken aback by her gentleness, paused for a moment before his eyes softened with affection. \"I brought you a gift. I wanted you to see it. Would you come to my room?\"","The others: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu brightened. \"A gift?\"","She skipped happily toward Lou Tingsi. \"Okay, let’s go.\"","The others: \"???\""]},{"number":273,"title":"Chapter 273: Lou Tingsi: Feeling It, Feeling It","paragraphs":["Lou Tingsi smiled with amusement in his eyes as he pushed the door open, letting Qiao Chuchu step out of the room.","The moment she walked out, everyone on the bed sat up.","Lou Tingsi wore a triumphant smirk, pretending not to notice their reactions, and followed Qiao Chuchu into his guest room.","With a soft click,","Lou Tingsi locked the door behind them.","The Pei Family’s guest room was spacious, but Lou Tingsi didn’t turn on the main light.","Instead, he switched on the softest glow, casting an ambiguous, intimate atmosphere over the room.","Qiao Chuchu reached for the light switch. \"Why not turn on the lights? It’s too dark in here.\"","Her fingertips barely grazed the switch before Lou Tingsi’s warm hand covered hers.","He looked down at her with a playful smile. \"I’m about to sleep. Bright light keeps me awake, so let’s leave it like this.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up with anticipation. \"Did you buy me a gift outside? What is it?\"","[Lou Tingsi actually brought me a gift? How unexpected!]","[I love unwrapping presents!]","[I’ll bring him something back when I travel abroad too!]","Lou Tingsi retrieved a box. \"A few days ago, while I was abroad for business, I passed by a mall and saw a pair of high heels. I thought you might like them.\"","He handed her the branded shoebox. \"Open it and see?\"","Qiao Chuchu tore into it eagerly, her eyes widening in delight. \"Oh, it’s this one!\"","Inside was a pair of nude-colored high heels with red soles—","A timeless classic.","Lou Tingsi studied her expression carefully, searching for a reaction. \"Do you like them?\"","\"I love them!\"","She bent down to try them on. \"Let me put them on—\"","Before she could, Lou Tingsi’s hands slid around her waist, effortlessly lifting her onto the table!","Qiao Chuchu blinked in surprise. \"...?\"","Lou Tingsi knelt smoothly, taking her ankle in his hand as if it were the most natural thing, and slipped the high heels onto her feet.","\"Perfect fit.\"","He glanced up at her with a wink. \"Seems I guessed your size right~\"","In the dimly lit room, the glossy leather of Qiao Chuchu’s heels reflected the faint light.","Lou Tingsi cradled the slender heel in his broad palm, his long fingers toying with it absentmindedly.","His gaze was tender yet lingering. \"Do you like them?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s smile faltered slightly.","The awkwardness outweighed the excitement now, but she nodded politely. \"Yes, thank you.\"","[He just picked me up like it was nothing, and putting the shoes on me so casually—this is so awkward.]","Lou Tingsi ignored her discomfort and handed her another box. \"Open this one too?\"","Qiao Chuchu unwrapped the exquisitely packaged box, her breath catching.","Inside was a tiara.","It glittered magnificently in the box, clearly priceless, adorned with a single ruby.","She was stunned. \"Are these real diamonds?\"","Lou Tingsi took the box back, raising an eyebrow. \"Do you really think I’d give you fake ones?\"","He leaned closer, his voice coaxing like a fox’s. \"If you had a tiara, would you want to be a princess... or a queen?\"","Qiao Chuchu pressed her back against the wall, trapped in the narrow space between him and the furniture. She tilted her head away slightly. \"Definitely a queen.\"","Lou Tingsi’s smile deepened. He stepped back, then bowed slightly as he offered her the box. \"Then, Your Majesty, may I crown you?\"","Qiao Chuchu burst into laughter. \"You’re such a performer.\"","She carefully placed the tiara on her head, looking at him expectantly. \"Well? How do I look? Too dramatic?\"","Her eyes sparkled brighter than the diamonds.","Lou Tingsi tilted his head, his gaze fixed entirely on her. \"Miss Qiao, diamonds suit you best.\"","Qiao Chuchu beamed. \"You really know how to sweet-talk!\"","She hopped off the table and rushed to the mirror to admire herself. \"It is beautiful. You have great taste!\"","She turned back to Lou Tingsi cheerfully. \"Next time I travel, I’ll bring you a gift too, don’t worry!\"","Lou Tingsi smirked, understanding her meaning—","She didn’t want to feel indebted.","He said, \"How about you do me a favor instead?\"","Distracted by her reflection, Qiao Chuchu perked up. \"What favor?\"","\"Lou Yuejue has a family homework assignment. He needs help completing a painting.\"","Lou Tingsi pulled out a tablet. \"But I can’t draw. Could you do it for me?\"","She reached for the tablet, but Lou Tingsi suddenly raised it above her head.","Qiao Chuchu scowled, standing on her tiptoes to grab it. \"Hey! Give it to me!\"","He didn’t answer, just watched as she bounced like a little rabbit, her tiara glinting, her heels clicking against the floor with every hop.","The sharp clack of her shoes against the ground sent a thrill through him.","A part of him knew teasing her like this was wrong.","But he couldn’t help licking his lips as he wrapped an arm around her waist. \"Still so tiny even in heels. Adorable.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","She immediately swung a fist at his stomach!","Lou Tingsi reflexively bent forward to shield himself, and she snatched the tablet from his grip, smirking. \"Sorry, my height might be genetic, but my brains aren’t.\"","Lou Tingsi’s eyes lit up with delight. \"Well, well, well.\"","He sat beside her. \"Since Miss Qiao is so clever, you’ll definitely meet my request.\"","He pointed at the sketch on the tablet. \"I want to paint this for my son myself, but I don’t know how. What should I do?\"","Qiao Chuchu shrugged. \"Easy. I’ll draw it, and you can lie and say it’s yours.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"...?\"","He smiled patiently. \"No. My son only has one father, and only one childhood. I want to paint this for him myself.\"","Qiao Chuchu winced. \"Then just paint it! So what if it’s ugly?\"","\"Ugly would embarrass my son.\" Lou Tingsi crossed his legs, lifting his chin arrogantly. \"I can’t let him think his father is nothing but a pretty face.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Is he just a pretty face? Isn’t he also terrifying?]","But she understood. \"Fine. I’ll teach you, and you paint. Deal?\"","\"Deal!\" Lou Tingsi grabbed the stylus. \"The assignment is to paint our family. My son already started—he just needs me to finish by drawing him.\"","The sketch showed a luxurious living room with three figures on a sofa.","The middle figure was a girl—only a rough outline with long hair, no details.","To her left was Lou Tingsi in a suit, drawn in a childlike style but bearing a clear resemblance to the real man.","The right side was empty—presumably where Lou Yuejue would be.","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"Is the girl in the middle Lou Yuejue’s mother?\"","Lou Tingsi’s lips curled meaningfully. \"No, it’s an older sister he likes. Don’t worry about her—he’ll finish her later. Just teach me how to draw Yuejue.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, taking the stylus. \"First, do this... then this... and finally this. Got it?\"","With just a few casual strokes, the basic pose of the figure took shape.","Lou Tingsi: \"? Who could possibly learn this?\"","He tried sketching it himself, but the lines came out crooked and messy. Displeased, he muttered, \"...This looks awful. The assignment is due tomorrow, and there’s no way I can learn this in time now.\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed. \"Fine, then hold the pen.\"","Lou Tingsi nodded and gripped the pen.","Qiao Chuchu stepped behind him, wrapping her hand around his as he held the pen. \"Watch how I draw. Feel the movement of my hand.\"","Lou Tingsi shuddered. \"Feel your hand?\"","He watched as her small, warm hand enveloped his—her palm barely able to cover his fingers—yet she persisted, guiding him through the strokes. \"This still counts as your own drawing, right?\"","Lou Tingsi didn’t answer.","Because he was too absorbed in memorizing the sensation of her touch."]},{"number":274,"title":"Chapter 274: Because I Like It So Much, I Want Even More","paragraphs":["Lou Tingsi’s mind wandered as he stole a glance at her profile.","She was so close to him.","Close enough to catch the fragrance of her hair and see the thick, curled lashes framing her eyes.","His gaze drifted downward, lingering on the delicate slope of her nose before settling on her lips.","Qiao Chuchu paused her brush, lost in thought as she nibbled her lower lip.","His eyes darkened, and he swallowed unconsciously.","Qiao Chuchu pondered for a moment, shifting her stance absentmindedly.","The sharp click of her high heels against the floor made his breath hitch, his gaze growing more intense.","Unaware, Qiao Chuchu continued sketching and remarked, \"You're a good father—better than many I've seen.\"","He stared at her parted lips. \"Isn’t it common sense to treat someone you love well?\"","Her brush stilled, and she glanced at him. \"Not everyone has that common sense.\"","Lou Tingsi chuckled. \"You’re right.\"","He looked at her hand holding his. \"Growing up, I thought relationships were about mutual torment, judging by how my parents treated each other. But when it’s my turn, it feels different.\"","Qiao Chuchu perked up, ears practically twitching with curiosity. \"How so?\"","Lou Tingsi tilted his head up at her, speaking deliberately. \"I dream about her. When I see something nice, I want to buy it for her. I could never hurt her—not even a little. How could I, when I truly care for her?\"","His Adam’s apple bobbed as her scent intoxicated him. He leaned in closer. \"I can’t help but spoil her, smile at her without thinking. And because I adore her so much, I crave her touch—even just her fingertips brushing mine. A little is enough to linger in my mind.\"","His gaze grew hazy as he inched toward her lips. \"Just a little is enough to savor—\"","BANG BANG BANG!!","The violent knocking jolted Lou Tingsi back to reality!","Qiao Chuchu’s gossip-fueled excitement was cut short as she walked to the door. \"Huh? When was this locked?\"","She muttered as she opened it, only to be met with Pei Che’s murderous glare.","And he wasn’t alone—everyone who had been feverish was there.","Before she could speak, Pei Che gripped the back of her head. \"What were you two doing?\"","His grip was rough as he scrutinized her lips and neck. \"You didn’t do anything, did you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked, baffled. \"We were just drawing. Lou Tingsi gave me a pair of high heels and a tiara.\"","She carefully removed the tiara. \"Why are you all awake?\"","The others glared at the tiara with dark expressions.","Pei Che exhaled in relief when he found no signs of intimacy, though his anger simmered. \"We woke up and you were gone, so we came looking.\"","Truthfully, they’d waited too long for her return and panicked.","His gaze shifted to Lou Tingsi.","Lou Tingsi lounged on the sofa, legs crossed, radiating irritation at the interruption as he stared back at Pei Che.","Pei Che narrowed his eyes. \"Qiao Chuchu, go to bed.\"","She hesitated. \"But the drawing isn’t finished.\"","Pei Che’s sharpened gaze bore into her. \"Go. To. Sleep.\"","She stiffened, sensing his anger, and looked to Pei Yuan. \"Big brother?\"","Pei Yuan patted her head, his smile not reaching his eyes. \"Get some rest. You’ve worked hard.\"","Reluctantly, she glanced at Lou Tingsi one last time before leaving.","Pei Che turned his icy stare on Lou Tingsi. \"You’ve got nerve, sneaking in while we were sick.\"","Lou Tingsi smirked lazily. \"You’ve all had your alone time with her. Why act so threatened? I’ve been nothing but gracious.\"","He twirled a pencil in his right hand, propping his chin on his left. \"Funny how you’re all hypocrites. Why waste energy ganging up on me when you could be making actual moves?\"","Their expressions darkened.","Pei Fengnong stepped forward. \"If you’re so ‘gracious,’ does that mean you’d accept anything?\"","Lou Tingsi nodded. \"Of course.\"","Pei Fengnong pointed out the window. \"Pei Mu, Pei Ci—throw him off the balcony.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","---","The next morning, Qiao Chuchu received mixed news from Doctor Zhao.","Good news: the eleven feverish patients stayed fever-free until 8 a.m.","Bad news: by 10 a.m., their fevers returned—and one more person had joined the sick.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Don’t tell me it’s Lou Tingsi.\"","Doctor Zhao nodded gravely. \"It is. Apparently, he spent three hours on the balcony last night and caught the flu. Not surprising, given how contagious it is.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"But why was he on the balcony?\"","The doctor shrugged. \"That’s beyond my expertise.\"","She strode into the \"ward,\" now with an extra bed.","Lou Tingsi slept fitfully, cheeks flushed, brows furrowed in discomfort.","Twelve men now lay weak and feverish.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Doctor Zhao advised, \"Their relapse has left them weaker. Expect less energy today, and keep them hydrated.\"","She nodded, instructing Little Xie, \"Prepare twelve thermoses of hot water and plain congee for breakfast. Add plenty of side dishes—nothing too strong.\"","When she had a fever, bland food was all she could stomach.","Another housekeeper approached. \"Miss Qiao, you have a guest.\"","The twelve patients weakly pried their eyes open. \"Who...?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? You’re sick but still nosy?\"","The housekeeper stifled a laugh. \"It’s Mr. Lin Shen.\"","She sighed. \"I’ll greet him.\"","Hopefully, he wouldn’t catch the plague too.","Lin Shen waited anxiously at the door until it opened.","His face lit up. \"Chuchu?\"","Had she come just for him?","Qiao Chuchu stood in soft ivory loungewear, offering an apologetic smile.","Lin Shen’s heart skipped despite her odd expression. \"Long time no see.\"","He lifted an elegant shopping bag. \"I brought you a gift.\"","She blinked in surprise.","[He got me something too?]","[I’ll need to make a thank-you list.]","Lin Shen: \"?\"","\"Too\"?","Who else gave her gifts?","She motioned him inside, handing him a sealed mask. \"Come in, but wear this. Half my household is sick.\"","Lin Shen put it on. \"Your brothers?\"","\"Not just them,\" she sighed.","[There are twelve patients in here now.]","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Twelve?!","He put on his mask and asked urgently, \"Can I go take a look?\""]},{"number":275,"title":"Chapter 275: Crazy with Jealousy","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu hesitated for a moment, then nodded and led him to the entertainment room on the second floor.","The moment the door was pushed open, Lin Shen caught a faint whiff of disinfectant.","He peeked inside and was stunned by the sight before him, his eyes widening in shock.","The spacious room was filled with luxurious movable hospital beds.","Each bed held a person.","He slowly stepped forward, seeing Pei Yuan and the others lying there feverish and unconscious, and asked in disbelief, \"Did you infect all of them?\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed helplessly. \"Yes.\"","Lin Shen was too stunned to speak. \"What did they even do to get infected this badly?\"","\"Not much, really. They just talked to me under the same roof.\" Qiao Chuchu frowned worriedly. \"If I’d known I couldn’t drive them away, I wouldn’t have let them breathe.\"","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Little Xie came to find Qiao Chuchu. \"Miss, breakfast is ready. Please come take a look.\"","Qiao Chuchu adjusted her coat and followed Little Xie out.","Lin Shen’s brow furrowed as he glanced back at the sick men one last time before quickly catching up to Qiao Chuchu.","The kitchen was lined with small bowls of porridge and plates of side dishes.","Little Xie held a tablet, taking notes. \"Mr. Pei the Second doesn’t eat cilantro, and Mr. Pei the Seventh can’t handle spicy food. But the gentlemen from the Wei Sheng Family didn’t specify their dietary restrictions.\"","Qiao Chuchu scanned the dishes. \"It’s fine. Just prepare extra portions—some spicy, some mild. But don’t make too much, or it’ll go to waste.\"","\"Yes, Miss.\"","Lin Shen stood at the kitchen doorway, watching Qiao Chuchu give instructions like the lady of the house. \"They probably won’t have much appetite with their fevers, so just wait outside wearing masks. If anyone rings, go in. If someone’s appetite improves, you can add more then.\"","Lin Shen stared at her back, his lips pressed into a bitter line. \"You’re so considerate, Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to him. \"What?\"","He stood dejectedly in the doorway, like a discarded failure, forcing a weak smile. \"Nothing.\"","Seeing her care for them so attentively reminded him of the past, when Qiao Chuchu had been with him.","She had always been popular.","In his art studio, her beauty and poise had drawn in wealthy young men who couldn’t even hold a brush properly.","Maybe Qiao Chuchu wasn’t well-liked in her own social circle.","But among strangers, it was hard not to be drawn to her talent, looks, and sincerity.","Back then, suitors showered her with flowers and gifts, but she always refused. \"I’m sorry, I can’t accept this.\"","She never left any room for hope, cutting off every confession cleanly.","Gradually, people realized she was unshakable, and the crowd around her thinned.","He had watched it all unfold, and with every rejection, his own courage to confess dwindled.","But to give her flowers, he bought bouquets for everyone in the studio—just so he could give her one with a plausible excuse.","A friend hinted, \"Haven’t you noticed? Qiao Chu seems to like you! She painted the flowers you gave her!\"","Only then did he realize: out of all her suitors, she had only ever accepted his gifts.","Lin Shen’s frown deepened, his face paling as a cruel thought surfaced.","He had once been Qiao Chuchu’s only exception.","But not anymore.","And never again.","Qiao Chuchu instructed the maids, \"Take these trays to their rooms.\"","The maids nodded and carried the trays away.","Qiao Chuchu turned to leave as well.","Lin Shen stood behind her, and the moment the others were gone, he suddenly grabbed her hand.","\"Can you not go take care of them?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him in surprise.","Lin Shen kept his head down, gripping her hand tightly. \"I can hire professional nurses for them, the best ones. But please... don’t go yourself. Okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled. \"Are you worried I’ll get infected?\"","Lin Shen: \"No.\"","Meeting her confused gaze, he said earnestly, \"I can’t stand seeing you care for other men.\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, then yanked her hand away. \"What kind of reason is that?!\"","She glared. \"I’m taking care of them because they helped me! It has nothing to do with their gender! If it were Sister Lin Qing, I’d be even more attentive!\"","Lin Shen knew she was right—but he couldn’t help it!","Surrounded by so many outstanding suitors, he felt dull and insignificant in comparison.","He reached for her again, his fingers encircling her slender wrist with room to spare.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t struggle, just stared at him coldly.","Lin Shen couldn’t meet her eyes. \"Your hand is so small.\"","He squeezed gently, his voice breaking. \"I can hold you so easily... but I still feel like I can’t keep you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Do you know why you can’t hold onto me?\"","Lin Shen looked at her with tear-filled eyes.","Her expression was icy. \"Because I don’t belong to you. You’ve crossed a line, Senior.\"","Lin Shen’s breath hitched, the color draining from his face.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t pull away immediately, laying out the truth like unraveling a thread. \"Senior, to be honest, I did like you once. But that was in the past. When you chose to leave for abroad without a word, our connection was already severed.\"","Her voice was calm. \"You saw me clinging to my brother and thought I was disgusting. You couldn’t accept it, so you left. To this day, I still think you made the right choice. Even if we had gotten together, it wouldn’t have ended well.\"","[Because back then, my role was to torment my brother. My feelings were worthless—just part of the plot. After finishing that storyline, I was meant to die. There was never going to be a happy ending for us.]","Lin Shen’s pupils constricted as he listened, stunned.","Qiao Chuchu pulled her hand free. \"Don’t worry. Even though you’re still hung up on the past, time will fade those feelings. Emotions aren’t set in stone. You’re a rational person—surely you understand?\"","Lin Shen let out a hollow laugh, tears glistening. \"Then if you had a husband, and he fell for someone else, would you try to make him love you again?\"","Qiao Chuchu answered without hesitation. \"Of course not. I have my own life to live. Besides, if his heart belongs to someone else, how could he control that?\"","Lin Shen: \"Then how can I control mine?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lin Shen’s voice trembled with tears. \"Do you think I can just turn off my feelings?!\"","His tears spilled over. \"You call me rational, but look at us now—who’s the rational one here?! It’s you!\"","Qiao Chuchu was speechless for a moment before closing her eyes. \"I just don’t want you stuck in the past. It’s over. It’s not worth clinging to.\"","\"But I love you!!\"","Lin Shen completely lost his composure: \"Even if you make love sound so vile and worthless, I still love you!!!\"","She had once adored him so sincerely—he could always sense her special affection for him.","But now, there was none of it left.","With so many people surrounding her, he was terrified—terrified she might fall for someone else!","Out in the world, he was someone others admired, but among Qiao Chuchu's suitors, he was insignificant, like a bland cup of lukewarm water.","Even his own sister thought they were mismatched!","Yet he was the one Qiao Chuchu had liked first!","He was the one with the best chance!","Seeing that he wouldn’t listen to reason, Qiao Chuchu’s gaze turned icy in an instant: \"Then let’s not see each other anymore. Delete me as a friend too, and don’t come to my place from now on.\"","Lin Shen was stunned: \"What???\""]},{"number":276,"title":"Chapter 276: Foreshadowing Hints Again","paragraphs":["Shen Zhuoyan listened to the argument inside, his expression grave as he walked to the door and aimed his phone at the entrance.","Lin Shen’s tense voice rang out: \"Why?\"","His tone was like a needle piercing through the silence: \"Why did you cut me off?!\"","The men in the large ward, half-dazed, listened to Shen Zhuoyan’s live broadcast.","Qiao Chuchu’s calm voice sounded unhurried: \"You must get confessed to often, Senior.\"","Lin Shen: \"...Yeah.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"How do you feel when someone you don’t have feelings for confesses to you?\"","Lin Shen understood her implication, his presence weakening: \"...Nothing.\"","Qiao Chuchu said evenly: \"Right now, hearing you say these things to me, I feel nothing.\"","Those who heard these words all stiffened, their hearts as if crushed by something, an inexplicable ache spreading through their chests.","It was as if she wasn’t just speaking to Lin Shen alone.","But to everyone who had ever entertained such thoughts.","None of them took joy in Lin Shen’s rejection. Instead, their brows furrowed as they listened intently.","Qiao Chuchu advised Lin Shen: \"Since you can’t detach from these feelings, cutting your losses now is the best option. If you don’t see me for a while, your emotions will fade. I can’t give you anything, and this is the best outcome for you too.\"","\"No, it’s not!\" Lin Shen grabbed her shoulders. \"I won’t leave!\"","If he left now, he’d lose any chance for good!","His fingers tightened unconsciously around her shoulders as he stammered, \"I was just jealous. I’ve never been able to move on from our past, but that’s not a crime worthy of cutting ties, is it? Isn’t this just crueler to me?\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed. \"...Just walk away like you did before. Is that so hard for you?\"","Lin Shen: \"Yes!\"","He pulled her into his arms, rubbing her arms helplessly as if coaxing her. \"I won’t cut ties, and I won’t leave. Walking away back then was already a huge mistake—I can’t make it again, Chuchu!\"","Back then, he’d thought Qiao Chuchu liked him while still clinging to his family.","He was a traditional man—he couldn’t accept that.","But now he knew her struggles. He’d been wrong, so wrong. He never should have left!","He’d rather stay trapped in this vicious cycle than keep suppressing the feelings he’d held back for three years!","His arms tightened around her as he whispered fearfully, \"You’re too ruthless. How can you just cut things off like this?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Alright.\"","She pushed him away, wiping his tears in passing. \"Stop crying, Senior.\"","Lin Shen felt the warmth of her palm, and being comforted like this only made him sob harder.","His face buried in her hand, his fingers dug into her wrist as he muffled his low, choked cries.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Is he going to cry until he hyperventilates like Huai Ling did?]","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing cried too?","The men listening to the recording all turned in unison toward the peacefully sleeping Huai Ling.","He cried until he hyperventilated?","Qiao Chuchu spoke patiently to Lin Shen: \"Don’t cry. I was too harsh earlier.\"","Lin Shen didn’t answer, only hugged her tightly again.","His tall frame enveloped her from above, as if he wanted to meld her into his very bones. \"You’re not wrong. I’m the one who messed up.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned her head away, uncomfortable in his embrace. \"I hope you can move on soon. I think I’ve made myself clear.\"","\"I know. I understand what you mean.\" Lin Shen buried his face in the crook of her neck. \"I won’t trouble you anymore.\"","He wiped his tears roughly, his voice thick. \"Go rest. I’ll take care of the others.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? You?\"","Lin Shen nodded. \"Yeah, me.\"","Still wiping his tears, he walked away, muttering to himself, \"This is probably the only way I won’t get jealous.\"","Lin Shen pushed open the kitchen door and locked eyes with Shen Zhuoyan.","Shen Zhuoyan leaned against the wall, looking awkward.","Lin Shen’s eyes were red, but he didn’t hide it. \"You heard everything?\"","Shen Zhuoyan nodded.","Lin Shen didn’t elaborate, brushing past him with his head down.","Shen Zhuoyan hesitated, then followed. \"Actually, I think you’re brave.\"","Lin Shen looked at him in surprise.","Shen Zhuoyan wasn’t mocking him—his tone was sincere. \"You did what I didn’t dare to. I couldn’t have said it outright like you did.\"","Lin Shen wasn’t surprised. Instead, he smiled bitterly. \"I guess that’s something.\"","\"Yeah. And I’m not the only one.\" Shen Zhuoyan held up his phone, showing the call screen.","He was on the line with Pei Yuan.","He admitted frankly: \"Everything you two just said, they all heard it. Pei Yuan was worried you might do something, so he sent me to eavesdrop and relay the conversation.\"","Lin Shen: \"...\"","Lin Shen suddenly felt like he couldn’t breathe. \"So everyone heard me get rejected? In all my pathetic glory?\"","Shen Zhuoyan nodded. \"Yep.\"","Lin Shen laughed at himself. \"Aren’t you going to mock me?\"","\"Nothing to mock.\" Shen Zhuoyan’s expression was blank as he explained honestly, \"The outcome would’ve been the same no matter who went.\"","Lin Shen scoffed. \"So I’m the guinea pig for all of you?\"","Shen Zhuoyan didn’t answer, just patted his shoulder sympathetically.","Qiao Chuchu stepped out of the kitchen just in time to see Shen Zhuoyan guiding a dejected Lin Shen upstairs, the two looking oddly chummy.","?","Since when did Shen Zhuoyan comfort people?","She took a step forward—then a sharp pain lanced through her skull!","Like a steel needle driving straight through her temple!","She doubled over, bracing herself against the wall, forcing her eyes open against the dizzying vision—","A funeral.","She stood before a gravestone, but no matter how hard she squinted, she couldn’t make out the name.","All sound was muffled, as if her head was trapped underwater.","Someone spoke beside her, but the words were indistinct, buzzing in her ears.","Pei Che stepped in front of her and pulled her into an embrace. \"Chuchu, this isn’t your fault.\"","She didn’t answer. Guilt crashed over her like a tidal wave, dragging her into suffocating despair.","How could it not be her fault?","She’d foreseen everything—yet she still failed to save him!","And this was the first time she’d lost someone close to her despite knowing the future in advance!","Qiao Chuchu jolted back to awareness!","She didn’t know when she’d collapsed to the floor, her heart still aching from the funeral in her vision.","She’d felt the grief of her future self.","Shi Yu wheeled out of his room and paled at the sight of her on the ground. \"Chuchu?!\"","He rushed to her side. \"What’s wrong? Are you hurt?!\"","Qiao Chuchu slowly came to her senses, pushing herself up with an eerily calm expression. \"I’m fine.\"","Shen Zhuoyan hurried down the stairs and immediately supported her when he saw her pallor. \"What happened?!\"","She waved him off, her heart pounding wildly. \"It’s nothing.\"","But her mind was in turmoil.","【How could I, with the ability to foresee the future, still fail to protect someone dear to me? How did I let this happen? What went wrong?! Why did I make such a mistake even with the power of foresight?!】"]},{"number":277,"title":"Chapter 277: Someone Will Die, But She Doesn't Know Who","paragraphs":["Shen Zhuoyan and Shi Yu exchanged a glance before Shen urgently asked, \"What happened?\"","She anxiously bit her lower lip but still denied it. \"It's nothing.\"","With a troubled expression, she walked to the elevator, letting Shi Yu enter first in his wheelchair, followed closely by Shen Zhuoyan.","The three of them headed toward the large ward on the second floor.","As she walked, Qiao Chuchu pondered: This is strange. This time, the death wasn’t shown to me in detail—just the outcome, like with the shooting incident. It only gave me the result but didn’t tell me who died.","The people eating in the ward looked up at the sound of the door opening.","Qiao Chuchu pushed the door open and scanned the room.","They were all resting in their beds, casting weak glances her way.","She frowned, deep in thought: The only one I can be sure isn’t dead is Pei Che, because at that person’s funeral, Pei Che comforted me.","But things are unpredictable. If I get too complacent about Pei Che, what if he’s the one who dies? How can I control that?","Pei Che: \"...\"","A thought struck Qiao Chuchu: I don’t even know who to protect. There are so many of them, and once their fevers break, they’ll go back to work. If I want to keep them safe, the only way is to keep them all together.","Maybe I should lock them all up? Put them in cages and release them only after I survive till the end.","The others: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing excitedly licked his lips!","Qiao Chuchu sat on the sofa, still frowning in contemplation: But if I lock them up, our relationships will definitely suffer. They’ll think I’m a freak. How could they understand my good intentions? It’ll hurt our bond, and they might never want to see me again.","I’m a vain person. If I help someone, I want the reputation, the money, the praise, and the friendships—I can’t afford to waste my efforts. So locking them up isn’t the best plan.","Besides, what if they all die in a fire while locked up together?","The others: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu continued seriously: Now even Sister Yu Can and Sister Lin Qing are at risk. No matter who dies, I’ll be heartbroken. I can’t let any of them take that risk.","Suddenly, Little Xie knocked on the door.","Qiao Chuchu turned to her.","Little Xie entered nervously. \"Miss, I have an emergency at home. I need to ask for leave.\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow. \"What kind of emergency?\"","Little Xie hesitated, glancing at the Pei brothers. \"My mom hit a luxury car. I need to go help her handle it. Is that okay?\"","\"A luxury car?\" Qiao Chuchu was surprised. \"Alright, take our family’s grocery shopping car. I’ll approve it.\"","Little Xie sighed in relief. \"Thank you, Miss!\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded but then frowned in worry.","Could Little Xie be the one who dies?","Watching Little Xie leave, she decided to follow. \"I’ll go with Little Xie.\"","Shen Zhuoyan stood up. \"Then I’ll come with you.\"","\"No, you stay here,\" she warned with a sharp look. \"Keep an eye on the patients. I’ll handle this.\"","The prophecy didn’t say I’d die, so I should be fine going out. But Shen Zhuoyan is still at risk.","Shen Zhuoyan was uneasy. \"But what if something happens to you?\"","\"Nothing will happen,\" Qiao Chuchu said firmly. \"I’ll drive fast and be back within an hour.\"","Shen Zhuoyan could only watch her leave, his anxiety growing.","Pei Yuan, also concerned, hoarsely ordered, \"Shen Zhuoyan, follow her secretly.\"","With permission granted, Shen Zhuoyan immediately headed out.","Shi Yu spoke up. \"Mr. Pei, if Shen Zhuoyan dies, will Qiao Chuchu blame you?\"","Pei Yuan froze.","Shen Zhuoyan also stopped and looked at Shi Yu.","Shi Yu folded his hands on his lap, amused. \"Qiao Chuchu’s thoughts were clear—she attended a funeral, meaning she didn’t die. Someone else did. If Shen Zhuoyan goes out now and dies, will Qiao Chuchu resent the person who sent him?\"","Pei Yuan was stunned. \"...You can hear her thoughts too?\"","Shi Yu smirked. \"I’m more advanced than you. Not only can I hear thoughts, but I’m also a self-aware former male lead. Based on my understanding of the script, Qiao Chuchu will be fine this time, but Shen Zhuoyan will definitely be in danger if he leaves.\"","He then looked at Shen Zhuoyan with amusement. \"So, do you still want to cause trouble for your beloved Miss?\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","---","Qiao Chuchu drove, tailing Little Xie to the accident site.","From a distance, she saw an ordinary-looking elderly woman apologizing to a man in a suit—likely the driver—who seemed to be complaining.","The woman hunched slightly, as if in pain, not daring to breathe too loudly.","Little Xie rushed out of the car to her mother’s side. \"Mom, are you okay?\"","The woman shook her head. \"I’m fine, but I scratched their car.\"","Little Xie sighed in relief. \"As long as you’re unhurt, I’ll handle it.\"","She turned to the driver. \"Please send it for repairs. I’ll cover the costs.\"","But then a man stepped out of the car. \"If it’s you, I won’t ask for compensation.\"","Qiao Chuchu parked and stood by the roadside, wearing a mask and cap, watching the man’s back.","Little Xie was also surprised. \"You are...?\"","The man, dressed in a leather jacket with his hands in his pockets, looked aloof. \"You’re Xie Lele, the deputy housekeeper at Qiao Chuchu’s place, right?\"","Little Xie blinked. \"Yes.\"","\"I’m Ji Yanchuan.\" He handed her a business card. \"I came here specifically to find you.\"","He hadn’t expected his car to get scratched upon arrival—and by Xie Lele’s mother, no less.","What a fortunate coincidence.","He cut straight to the point. \"I won’t make you pay. Instead, be my spy in the Pei household, Xie Lele.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Little Xie looked at him incredulously. \"Why would I spy for you?\"","Ji Yanchuan smirked, confident. \"I want to know everything about your Miss. If you agree to be my informant, not only will I waive the damages, but I’ll also pay you extra. How does that sound?\"","He held up five fingers. \"You earn 50,000 a month? I’ll double it. Keep spying until your Miss agrees to marry me.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes narrowed suspiciously at Little Xie.","Little Xie, with her plain but earnest deer-like features, stared at him in disbelief before repeating, \"You want me to spy... until Miss agrees to marry you?\"","Ji Yanchuan nodded. \"Exactly. 50,000 every month.\"","Suddenly, Little Xie lunged at him to punch him!","Ji Yanchuan, anticipating this, quickly stepped back!","His bodyguards immediately restrained her!","Little Xie thrashed angrily in the bodyguard's arms, pointing at Ji Yanchuan and shouting, \"You scum! A man like you isn’t worthy of marrying our young lady! She’s beautiful, wealthy—she’d have to be blind to marry someone like you! Give up now!!\"","Ji Yanchuan’s face darkened, and he raised his hand to slap Little Xie!","Qiao Chuchu grabbed his wrist in a vice-like grip!","Ji Yanchuan, failing to recognize her behind her mask and cap, struggled furiously. \"Let go! This is none of your business—stay out of it!!\"","Qiao Chuchu tightened her grip, her expression cold. \"Master Ji, throwing a tantrum and ganging up on someone defenseless? How shameful.\"","Ji Yanchuan froze, stunned.","That voice... why did it sound so familiar?"]},{"number":278,"title":"Chapter 278: The Cliché Amnesia Trope is Here, How Will You Handle This Wave","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu removed her mask and raised an eyebrow at him. \"Besides, how is this none of my business? Didn’t you say you wanted to marry me?\"","Little Xie, who had been jumping around ready to fight, gasped in delight. \"Miss?!\"","Ji Yanchuan’s eyes widened. \"Qiao Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook off his hand and turned her gaze to Ji Yanchuan’s bodyguards.","The two bodyguards were sharp. The moment they saw her, they immediately released Little Xie and retreated behind Ji Yanchuan.","Little Xie rushed to her side. \"Miss, why are you here?\"","Qiao Chuchu answered smoothly, \"I was worried the car owner might give you trouble, so I came to back you up. Also, I was afraid you couldn’t afford the damages.\"","She then gave Ji Yanchuan a meaningful look. \"But I didn’t expect to witness the precious moment of Mr. Ji trying to bribe my deputy butler.\"","Little Xie also shot Ji Yanchuan a resentful glare. \"He clearly looks down on you. You’re rich, gorgeous, and have so many admirers—why should you settle for someone like him?\"","Flattered, Qiao Chuchu patted her shoulder. \"Take your mother to the hospital. I’ll handle things here.\"","Little Xie hesitated. \"But this man—\"","Qiao Chuchu cut her off. \"Leave him to me. I’ve already covered the damages, so don’t worry.\"","After a moment of hesitation, Little Xie nodded and helped her mother leave.","Qiao Chuchu turned back to Ji Yanchuan, her gaze as sharp as a blade.","Ji Yanchuan averted his eyes guiltily.","Thanks to the earlier commotion, the already noisy market was now packed with onlookers.","Many were even recording videos.","She put her mask back on, not wanting to be recognized. \"Get in my car. We’ll talk there.\"","Ji Yanchuan frowned and retorted, \"Why don’t you get in my car?\"","Qiao Chuchu turned and walked away. \"Then get lost.\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"...\"","He didn’t leave.","Grumbling, he followed Qiao Chuchu to a white G-Class, shooting his bodyguards a look to have them follow in their own car.","Qiao Chuchu started the engine and drove toward the city center. \"How much for the damages? Name your price, and I’ll transfer it directly.\"","Ji Yanchuan buckled his seatbelt. \"Do you like G-Classes?\"","She kept her tone businesslike. \"I’ll pay for the paint job. Let’s stick to the matter at hand.\"","Ji Yanchuan stared ahead. \"Would you like a pure pink G-Class? I can give you one.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She finally looked at him properly. \"I don’t want anything from you.\"","Ji Yanchuan finally matched her energy. \"You might change your mind. A pure pink G-Class might make your eyes pop.\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes. \"My fourth brother already gave me a pure pink G-Class for my twentieth birthday. Anything else you want to ask?\"","Ji Yanchuan pressed on, deadpan. \"What about a pure purple one? Or pure blue? Rainbow? Mermaid pearl?\"","He glanced at her red hair. \"Or pure red?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","This guy’s insane.","A heavy silence filled the car.","Ji Yanchuan, unfazed, turned on her car stereo. \"Let’s see what you usually listen to.\"","Soft music filled the air. He leaned back in the passenger seat, pleasantly surprised. \"I like this song too.\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored him.","He continued, undeterred. \"Did you know I’m a great singer? Lin Qing used to beg me to sing for her on her birthdays. People called me the ‘Singing Prince.’ Want me to sing for you?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Ji Yanchuan checked the time. \"It’s almost noon. I’m getting hungry, and it’s sweet of you to come find me now. How about we grab lunch?\"","He pulled out his phone to make a reservation. \"How about barbecue? I know a great place with fresh meat.\"","Qiao Chuchu tightened her grip on the steering wheel, barely containing her anger. \"Do you not understand human language? I let you in my car to talk business, not to eat.\"","Ji Yanchuan lowered his eyes, a flicker of sadness passing through them.","The bruises from Shen Zhuoyan’s punches still lingered on his face. \"You only have a problem with me, don’t you?\"","Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath, pulled over, and parked.","\"Why do you hate me so much?\" Ji Yanchuan remained lost in his own thoughts. \"Is it because I’m not a virgin?\"","Qiao Chuchu slammed on the brakes, staring at him like he was insane. \"Are you out of your mind?!\"","Ji Yanchuan didn’t look at her, instead casually smoothing his hair.","His bangs fell back into place as he lazily continued, his tone stubborn. \"I just don’t get it. You’re nice to everyone else—why not me? So I looked into all the men you’re close to and found a pattern. They’re all virgins. No dating history, no hotel records with women.\"","\"But I’m not.\"","His gaze turned icy. \"That’s why you hate me, isn’t it?\"","Qiao Chuchu gritted her teeth. \"You rammed into me during the race, sent people to humiliate me, turned my bodyguards against me, and just now tried to bribe my deputy butler. Out of all that, which part has anything to do with your sex life?!\"","Ji Yanchuan only grew more aggrieved. \"But I said I wanted to make it up to you! Why won’t you give me a chance? You won’t even talk to me—I had to plant spies! I had no other choice!!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s vision blurred with rage. She unbuckled his seatbelt and kicked him out of the car before speeding off.","Ji Yanchuan scrambled to his feet and chased after her. \"Qiao Chuchu!\"","A car behind him screeched to a halt!","Ji Yanchuan froze—but before he could react, he was sent flying by the impact!","Qiao Chuchu heard the crash but didn’t check the rearview mirror, driving straight back to the Pei residence.","Shen Zhuoyan, who had been waiting by the window, exhaled in relief. \"She’s back!\"","The others looked outside and relaxed at the sight of her car.","But at that moment, Qiao Chuchu’s phone rang.","An unknown number.","She hung up.","They called again.","She hung up again.","They called back immediately.","Finally, she answered. \"Hello?\"","Ye Huining’s tearful voice came through. \"Do you know my son was in a car accident?! Because he was chasing your car!\"","Qiao Chuchu took a moment to process this before replying flatly, \"He’s an adult. He’s responsible for his own actions. I didn’t tell him to chase me.\"","\"But he lost his memory! He can’t remember anything now!!\" Ye Huining sobbed. \"What are we supposed to do?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Memory loss?\"","Now that she thought about it, there was a memory loss arc in the novel.","Though she had memorized the entire story, she’d skipped over this part—because she hated amnesia tropes. Most of them involved the male lead falling for another woman while the female lead desperately chased after him, heartbroken.","The only thing she remembered was that after the male lead lost his memory, the female lead hit her head and also lost her memory.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Wait.","If the male lead loses his memory and the female lead follows...","Doesn’t that mean she’s about to lose her memory too?!"]},{"number":279,"title":"Chapter 279: Why is there such a big difference when both have amnesia","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu hung up on Ye Huining and hurriedly got out of the car.","Ye Huining stared at her phone in disbelief. \"She dared to hang up on me?!\"","She immediately called back.","But the call wouldn’t go through.","Qiao Chuchu had already blocked her!","Ye Huining was shocked. \"She even blocked me?!\"","She snatched her bodyguard’s phone and called Qiao Chuchu again.","Qiao Chuchu glanced at the caller ID and answered irritably. \"What do you want?\"","Ye Huining was fuming. \"I should be asking you that! How dare you hang up on me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled. \"Why wouldn’t I hang up? It’s my phone, my rules.\"","Ye Huining: \"? You caused my son to get into a car accident. I came to you for an explanation, and hanging up is your way of avoiding responsibility?!\"","Qiao Chuchu walked into the underground garage, picking up a lightweight safety helmet. \"I dropped your son off in a parking spot. Him chasing after the car was his own choice. Did I hit him and make him lose his memory?\"","Ye Huining: \"...No.\"","\"Then why are you coming to me for an explanation?\" Qiao Chuchu put on the helmet, ensuring she wouldn’t suffer any external impacts. \"Go after the person who actually hit your son!\"","Ye Huining’s hands trembled with anger. \"But no matter what, I’m still your elder! Don’t you even have the basic courtesy to respect your elders? Where are your manners?\"","Qiao Chuchu scoffed. \"Is your life so mediocre that the only way you can demand respect is by pulling rank as an elder?\"","Ye Huining: \"? What?\"","Qiao Chuchu coldly replied, \"You didn’t even bother using basic polite language when speaking to me. If you don’t treat yourself like a person, don’t expect me to treat you like one.\"","Ye Huining raised her voice in outrage. \"My son got hit by a car because he was chasing after you! Why should I be polite to you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Then why are you calling me instead of the traffic police?\"","Ye Huining: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu deadpanned, \"Anything else?\"","Ye Huining was left speechless and promptly hung up.","Qiao Chuchu blocked the number and headed upstairs, still wearing the helmet.","Just then, Shen Zhuoyan happily came to greet her. \"You’re back! You—\"","His gaze landed on the white helmet, and his expression stiffened. \"Why are you wearing a helmet indoors?\"","Qiao Chuchu replied sternly, \"None of your business. I have my own life routine.\"","[Mainly to prevent myself from suddenly bumping my head and losing my memory. Since Ji Yanchuan already lost his, if this script is making me the heroine, I’ll be next. So I’ll be wearing this helmet every day to prevent amnesia!]","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu returned to her room and opened her laptop to work on a PowerPoint.","[Write down my bank card number, password, locations of my valuables, my manga publishing site password, and include step-by-step instructions!]","[My manga is very important. Luckily, I don’t have any ongoing serials right now.]","[And also...]","She compiled photos of everyone around her, adding brief explanations, and saved them to her phone.","But that wasn’t enough.","She wrote her phone password on her arm in small print: [This is the phone password. If you lose your memory, open WPS and read everything! If you’ve lost your memory, open this—I’ve already backed it all up!]","But...","Was it possible that her amnesia would lead to someone around her dying?","After preparing for the worst, Qiao Chuchu asked Shen Zhuoyan, \"Did Shi Yu go to work?\"","Shen Zhuoyan shook his head. \"He’s working from home.\"","Qiao Chuchu rushed to Shi Yu’s room and knocked. \"Shi Yu, are you there?\"","Shi Yu had been in a video conference but immediately perked up at her voice. \"Come in, Miss Qiao.\"","The executives in the meeting: \"?\"","Their half-dead young master suddenly revived, and there was even a \"Miss Qiao\" involved?","How bizarre!","They all glanced at Grandpa Shi.","Grandpa Shi’s face lit up with delight, his lips curling into an uncontrollable smile.","His grandson living with Qiao Chuchu was clearly the best decision!","Shi Yu exited the meeting and eagerly looked toward the door.","A round safety helmet peeked in.","Shi Yu: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu stepped inside, shutting Shen Zhuoyan out. \"I’ll go in alone.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...Understood.\"","Shi Yu’s confusion instantly turned smug as he smirked at Shen Zhuoyan.","Shen Zhuoyan glowered and closed the door.","Shi Yu then turned to Qiao Chuchu with a gentle smile. \"Wearing a helmet to see me—are you taking me for a motorcycle ride? I’d love that.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? No, Ji Yanchuan suddenly triggered an amnesia plotline.\"","Shi Yu immediately understood. \"Ah~ So you’re wearing a helmet to protect yourself in case you lose your memory too.\"","\"You’re my strategist!\" She rushed to him. \"I didn’t read the amnesia part carefully. As a former male lead who’s self-aware, you must know what happens, right?\"","\"Of course.\"","Shi Yu took a sip of warm water and calmly explained, \"After the male lead loses his memory, he falls for the third female lead. The heroine and the third female lead fight over him. Then, the male lead gets into another car accident, regains his memory, dumps the third female lead, and falls back in love with the heroine. Unfortunately, the heroine hits her head and loses her memory too.\"","\"And then what happens to the heroine?\" she pressed eagerly.","Shi Yu’s expression darkened. \"The heroine gets trafficked abroad and nearly gets assaulted by an ugly man.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She frowned. \"How is that the plot? Shouldn’t the male rivals and the male lead fight over her? There were seven male rivals in the original story! Did none of them show up?!\"","Shi Yu sighed regretfully. \"Not a single one. Of course, the villain didn’t succeed because the male lead arrived just in time to save her.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s blood pressure skyrocketed. She ripped off the helmet and hurled it to the ground. \"Who the hell wants his rescue?! This plot is just pure garbage!\"","Shi Yu flinched at her outburst!","Realizing she’d scared him, Qiao Chuchu turned and stormed out without another word.","Shi Yu: \"?\"","He wheeled after her. \"Where are you going?\"","She didn’t answer, marching straight to the gym and kicking the punching bag with full force!","Her inner rage had been unleashed!!","Shen Zhuoyan and Shi Yu, who had followed her, were stunned.","Qiao Chuchu unleashed a flurry of punches and kicks at the bag. \"F you, you bleeping bleep bleep bleep bleep!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","Shi Yu: \"?\"","Why was she censoring herself while cursing?","Qiao Chuchu’s head buzzed with fury as she ranted, \"The male lead loses his memory and gets paired with another girl, forcing the heroine to fight for him. Then the heroine loses her memory and gets kidnapped—is this fair to her?! Am I not even human?!\"","Pei Buxian and the others, still nursing their injuries, followed the noise to the gym. The moment they peeked in, they were met with Qiao Chuchu’s ear-splitting scream!","Pei Buxian hesitated. \"Did Qiao Chuchu turn into a zombie after going out?!\"","Shi Yu sighed: \"No, it's Ji Yanchuan following the plot. He's lost his memory now. After Ji Yanchuan loses his memory, Qiao Chuchu will lose hers too, and she's furious.\"","Weisheng Lin frowned in confusion: \"Is she angry because she’s also going to lose her memory?\"","Shi Yu summarized succinctly: \"In the original storyline, Ji Yanchuan ends up with Xia Xuechun. After he loses his memory, the script pairs him with a third female lead. Ji Yanchuan falls for her, and she competes with Xia Xuechun for his affection.\"","\"Once Ji Yanchuan regains his memory, Xia Xuechun will suffer a series of misfortunes—she’ll lose her memory, be sent abroad, nearly get assaulted, and then be rescued by Ji Yanchuan.\"","Lou Tingsi was baffled: \"Shouldn’t there be a man competing with Ji Yanchuan for Xia Xuechun instead? This doesn’t seem fair at all.\"","Shi Yu sighed again: \"That’s exactly why Qiao Chuchu is angry. She thinks it’s unfair.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan asked quietly: \"When will she lose her memory? What causes it? And how does she recover?\"","Shi Yu lowered his voice: \"The moment Qiao Chuchu takes a hard hit to the head—that’s when she’ll lose her memory.\"","Pei Youchuan confidently crossed his arms: \"Then it’s impossible. As long as we take turns watching over her, she won’t lose her memory.\"","Qiao Chuchu kicked a sandbag with a flourish and spun around!","The sandbag swung back hard, slamming into her back!","Caught off guard, she face-planted, her head smacking loudly against a dumbbell with a BANG!","Her eyes rolled back, and she passed out.","Shi Yu: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\""]},{"number":280,"title":"Chapter 280: Amnesia Amnesia","paragraphs":["Lin Shen stared blankly at Qiao Chuchu: \"...Is she starting to lose her memory already?\"","They exchanged glances and immediately rushed toward Qiao Chuchu!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci were the first to reach her, flipping her over.","Blood trickled down her smooth forehead, dripping onto the floor.","Their faces paled as they tried to lift Qiao Chuchu—","But failed!","Damn it!","The fever had drained their strength!","Shen Zhuoyan pushed them aside: \"Let me!\"","He scooped Qiao Chuchu into his arms and dashed outside!","Lin Shen ran alongside him, gripping Qiao Chuchu’s hand anxiously: \"Chuchu, you can’t afford to get hurt!\"","The others, still weak from fever, stumbled after them.","Shi Yu’s wheelchair screeched as it turned, practically sparking: \"Wait for me—cough cough! Wait up!\"","He glared at the bodyguard pushing his chair: \"Faster!\"","The bodyguard dutifully replied: \"Don’t worry, young master! I used to run a driving school! My skills are top-notch!\"","As they rounded a corner, the bodyguard executed a dramatic drift—","And Shi Yu went flying!","Bodyguard: \"Ah! Young master!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan turned in shock just as Shi Yu soared toward him!","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","A human projectile?!","He was knocked flat!","Qiao Chuchu went flying again!","The group stretched out their arms: \"Whoa whoa whoa!\"","Lin Shen caught her smoothly and triumphantly lifted her high: \"I got her! I’ve got her!\"","Shen Zhuoyan and Shi Yu lay sprawled on the ground, looking up in relief.","The others burst into applause: \"Thank goodness!\"","Pei Youchuan gasped for breath: \"T-that was... too close.\"","Weisheng Huailing, equally exhausted, clapped weakly.","Lin Shen hugged Qiao Chuchu tightly, tears in his eyes: \"I finally caught her!\"","At the entrance, Lin Qing and Weisheng Yucan watched the chaos unfold.","Weisheng Yucan turned the steering wheel: \"Let’s just go. This world isn’t for us.\"","Lin Qing nodded, stunned: \"Agreed.\"","Meanwhile, in the hospital...","Ji Yanchuan sat dazedly on his hospital bed, muttering: \"Who am I? Where am I? Why do I feel like I’m missing someone?\"","Ye Huining wiped her tears: \"Son, your name is Ji Yanchuan. I’ve told you eight hundred times—you’re Ji Yanchuan.\"","Ji Yanchuan blinked at her: \"I’m Ji Yanchuan?\"","Ye Huining nodded frantically.","Ji Yanchuan mumbled: \"Right... I’m Ji Yanchuan. I’m... Wait, who am I? Where am I? Why do I feel like I’m missing someone?\"","Ye Huining burst into fresh tears, turning to the doctor: \"What’s going on?! You said he lost his memory, but he’s like a broken record! He keeps repeating the same thing!\"","The doctor frowned gravely: \"It’s not a broken record. It’s network lag.\"","Ye Huining: \"?\"","The doctor corrected himself: \"No, not lag—it’s trauma. He should be transferred to the psychiatric department.\"","Ye Huining gasped: \"Psychiatric?!\"","She grabbed the doctor’s collar: \"My son is a CEO! He can’t go to the psychiatric ward! Fix him!\"","The doctor deadpanned: \"I can’t. I’m a surgeon.\"","Ye Huining shook him: \"Then transfer him to psychiatry right now!\"","The doctor: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan staggered out of bed and wandered into the hallway.","Ye Huining was still berating the doctor: \"Do something!\"","The doctor sighed: \"...Please don’t be unreasonable, ma’am.\"","Ji Yanchuan clutched his wound, swaying unsteadily, when he spotted a group of men frantically escorting a girl toward the emergency room.","Compelled by an inexplicable pull, he followed.","Qiao Chuchu was placed on a bed by Lin Shen.","Pei Che exchanged quick words with a doctor before they wheeled her away for a CT scan.","Ji Yanchuan lingered at the door, studying the men.","For some reason...","He didn’t like them.","But the girl—she felt familiar, like a forgotten tether.","Soon, she was wheeled back and settled into a VIP room.","The men huddled in the hallway, listening intently to the doctor, though many leaned weakly against the wall, barely staying upright.","Seizing the moment, Ji Yanchuan slipped into the room and crouched beside the girl’s bed.","Her wound had been treated, and she slept peacefully.","He rested his chin on the mattress, mesmerized, and poked her cheek.","So soft.","He poked again. And again.","Qiao Chuchu stirred, frowning, and slowly opened her eyes—locking gazes with Ji Yanchuan.","Ji Yanchuan froze, struck by her beauty: \"Wow... you’re really pretty.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt dizzy and confused: \"Who are you? Who am I? Where is this?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","She lost her memory too?","A spark of inspiration hit him. Smoothly, he leaned in: \"You don’t remember me?\"","He rested his chin on the bed, eyes gleaming: \"I’m your boyfriend!\"","\"Boyfriend?\" Qiao Chuchu tilted her head. \"Then why do I feel like vomiting when I see your face? And why do I want to slap you?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Glancing at the door, he grabbed her hand: \"Actually, we’re star-crossed lovers. Your family disapproves, but if you come with me now, I’ll make you happy.\"","Qiao Chuchu yanked her hand back: \"If my family hates you, you’re probably the problem.\"","She yelled: \"HEY, FAMILY! THIS GUY SAYS HE’LL MAKE ME HAPPY! HELP!\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?!\"","A chorus of handsome faces popped into the room, glaring at him: \"Ji Yanchuan?!\"","Ji Yanchuan gaped at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu pointed at him: \"Is he really my boyfriend?\"","Pei Buxian exploded: \"BOYFRIEND?! AS IF!\"","He lunged, throwing a feeble punch: \"You persistent leech!\"","Ji Yanchuan shielded his face: \"Don’t hit me! I’m amnesiac! My brain’s not working!\"","Pei Buxian, despite his fever, kept swinging: \"You think mine is?!\"","The others closed in.","Qiao Chuchu stood by the bed, satisfied.","Yeah.","This felt right.","But... who was she?","Why did so many people care about her?","She slipped out of the room, leaning against the wall in thought.","...Was she some kind of badass?"]},{"number":281,"title":"Chapter 281: Ying Chen Assassinated, Amnesiac Qiao Chuchu Steps Up","paragraphs":["A group of medical staff rushed past her with a blood-dripping hospital bed: \"Make way!!\"","A hand with strange tattoos dangled from the bed, fingertips still dripping blood.","She found the tattoo eerily familiar.","As if she had seen it on someone before.","A blood-soaked bodyguard hurriedly followed the bed, his face paling when he spotted Qiao Chuchu. He lunged toward her—","\"Miss Qiao! Our boss has been stabbed!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at him blankly. \"What?\"","The bodyguard’s hands trembled as he urgently explained, \"Boss Ying Chen told me that if he was ever in mortal danger, I should come to you. I never expected you’d be right here! He’s fighting for his life now—what should we do?!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s expression shifted. \"Why ask me? Am I that important?\"","The bodyguard nodded without hesitation. \"Of course! You’re Miss Qiao! Don’t you know your own significance?!\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","She pinched her chin thoughtfully.","So... she was a big shot, huh?","The kind who dealt with gang fights.","The bodyguard anxiously continued, \"Boss was on his way to see you when his car was ambushed. During the fight, one of our own bodyguards suddenly stabbed him from behind and fled in the chaos!\"","He then added, \"Oh, by the way, I’m Yise. I’ve been with the boss since childhood. You can trust me completely. The boss made me swear that if anything happened, I had to come to you to keep things under control!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up!","They wanted her to take charge?!","This confirmed it—she was definitely a boss!","Her gaze turned shrewd as she studied Yise.","If she was a boss, she had to act the part. Even if she had amnesia, she couldn’t let it show.","Lowering her voice, she commanded, \"In that case, take me to Ying Chen.\"","Yise nodded. \"Yes!\"","Qiao Chuchu followed him to the operating room.","Other bodyguards sat slumped outside, exhausted.","Still dazed, they jolted to their feet upon seeing her and bowed in unison. \"Miss Qiao!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","They respected her this much?!","A thrill shot straight to the top of her head—this was exhilarating!","Meanwhile, Shen Zhuoyan, having just dealt with Ji Yanchuan, finally found Qiao Chuchu.","Spotting her back, he sighed in relief and signaled to the others. \"She’s here.\"","They hurried over, about to speak—","Qiao Chuchu coolly cut in, \"Have you found the traitor who stabbed Ying Chen?\"","The bodyguards exchanged guilty glances and shook their heads. \"Not yet.\"","\"Then go find him!\" she ordered. \"Bring him to me at once!\"","The bodyguards straightened. \"Yes, ma’am!\"","They scrambled off.","Qiao Chuchu leisurely settled into a chair, her gaze landing on Shen Zhuoyan and the others. Her face brightened. \"Oh, you’re here?\"","They: \"?\"","She tilted her head with a radiant smile. \"You handled that nuisance earlier, right? All good?\"","They exchanged odd looks. \"Yeah, it’s done.\"","Ji Yanchuan had fled in tears after just a few hits.","\"Good.\" Her eyes swept over each of them.","[I didn’t get a good look before, but my subordinates are all so good-looking. Was I a looks-obsessed boss?]","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","Pei Che: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Subordinates?!","Huai Ling sat beside Qiao Chuchu and signed, \"Sister, do you remember who you are?\"","Qiao Chuchu startled. \"Sister?\"","She was even more surprised.","[I can understand sign language?!]","[Is this guy my little brother?]","She signed back, \"Are we related? Are you my actual brother?\"","Huai Ling’s lips twitched. \"...No, I just call you ‘sister’ because you’re a year older.\"","Qiao Chuchu scrutinized him.","[What a shame. This kid’s gorgeous. If he were my brother, I’d probably be stunning too.]","[Wait, what do I even look like?]","Huai Ling: \"?!\"","She called him gorgeous?!","He grabbed her wrist. \"Sister, do you think I—\"","Pei Buxian shoved him to the ground!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","Pei Buxian slid into the seat beside her, flashing a sweet smile.","Her eyes sparkled with admiration.","[Wow, he’s so pretty. I like him already.]","Pei Buxian: \"!!!\"","He clasped her hand, intertwining their fingers. \"Chuchu, I’m Buxian. Do you remember me?\"","Leaning in, he whispered like a devil, \"I’m the most important person to you~\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci hoisted Pei Buxian up and plopped him aside.","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","They flanked Qiao Chuchu, linking arms with her. \"Chuchu~\"","They blinked eagerly, awaiting her first impression.","She glanced between them. \"You two look identical.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci nodded vigorously. \"Yep! We’re twins!~\"","Their synchronized voices amused her, and she giggled. \"You’re both so handsome! Like paintings!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci froze, melting on the spot. \"You’re even prettier! And so sweet—you’re the best in the world!~\"","Pei Mu kept nodding. \"Yeah, who else has a boss this adorable even with amnesia? Ours!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened. \"Adorable?\"","[I’m a boss, not a baby!]","Pei Mu and Pei Ci instantly backtracked. \"No no, you’re the boss!\"","They nuzzled her shoulders, gazing up adoringly. \"You’re the greatest boss ever!~\"","The others watched, swallowing hard.","So talking to her revealed her first impressions?","They inched forward, eager to test their luck.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly stood, scolding the twins. \"Know your place! I’m the boss—show some respect!\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","She dusted off her sleeves in disgust. \"I don’t have time for this. I’ve got a traitor to catch. Scram!\"","The others chimed in, \"We can help you find the traitor!\"","She arched a brow. \"You’d help?\"","Lou Tingsi, despite his feverish flush, bent forward pleadingly. \"Of course. Don’t you remember? This is what we’re for!~\"","He grinned. \"Use us however you need, Boss~\"","Qiao Chuchu suddenly pressed a hand to his forehead.","\"You’re burning up.\"","Lou Tingsi stiffened, startled.","She checked Pei Mu and Pei Ci next. \"You’re all feverish. You look terrible.\"","They shrank back, touched by her concern.","Qiao Chuchu sat back, chin high. \"I’m not the kind of boss who works my men to death. Get out of here! Don’t come back until you’re healed!\""]},{"number":282,"title":"Chapter 282: Qiao Chuchu: I Don't Want to See You Cry","paragraphs":["Lou Tingsi stared blankly at Qiao Chuchu: \"Are you... worried about me?\"","The others shot him a disdainful look: \"Don’t flatter yourself.\"","Weisheng Biehe pinched the bridge of his nose, muttering darkly: \"Overthinking it. She’s concerned about all of us.\"","Weisheng Lin glanced at Qiao Chuchu and chimed in: \"Yeah, our boss is super considerate!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan stood opposite Qiao Chuchu, watching her proud expression, the corner of his lips twitching upward.","Qiao Chuchu shrugged it off: \"What’s so considerate about that? It’s normal not to come to work when you’re sick, right?\"","Then she frowned, puzzled.","[Was I really that terrible before? The kind of ruthless boss who forces people to work even when they’re burning up with fever?]","She tried to recall, but a sharp headache and nausea hit her instantly.","[I can’t remember. It just makes my head throb and my stomach churn.]","Shen Zhuoyan rushed to her side in an instant: \"Are you feeling unwell?!\"","She nodded, but the discomfort faded as quickly as it came. She turned her gaze to him.","Shen Zhuoyan’s worry was written all over his face as he studied her expression.","She stared back, dazed.","[So strange. There’s something indescribable about this guy.]","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","The others: \"???\"","Weisheng Huailing immediately thrust his hand between them, blocking their eye contact!","No staring!","Shen Zhuoyan smacked his hand away!","No interruptions!","Huailing: «! Sis, this jerk hit me!!»","Qiao Chuchu kept her eyes locked on Shen Zhuoyan.","Shen Zhuoyan’s ears burned crimson, his nerves stretched taut like a bowstring, fists clenched in tension.","Could it be that after losing her memory, Qiao Chuchu saw him in a new light?","She leaned in, bringing her lips close to his ear.","The others’ expressions darkened instantly!","Huailing swiftly drew a claw knife, ready to strike at any moment!","Shen Zhuoyan froze, ignoring the jealous glares, stiffly waiting for her to speak.","Her breath brushed against his ear.","He shivered as she whispered eagerly: \"You’re my right-hand man, aren’t you?\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu beamed at him.","[Just looking at this guy makes me feel like I can trust him completely. Sure, I trust everyone here, but he’s different—like I could turn my back to him without a second thought.]","Pei Buxian exhaled sharply: \"...I almost passed out from suspense!\"","Pei Fengnong relaxed.","Pei Che wiped the sweat from his palms, unable to hide his irritation: \"Big bro, I told you we shouldn’t have let this guy join us!\"","Pei Yuan scowled: \"You think I wanted to? He was Chuchu’s pick, not mine.\"","Pei Youchuan grumbled to his brothers: \"We should’ve just hired female bodyguards from the start. It was Weisheng Lin who insisted on keeping options open, regardless of gender!\"","He glared at Shen Zhuoyan’s back: \"And now look! The ‘options’ are way too open—in every possible direction!\"","Weisheng Lin scratched his head sheepishly: \"Okay, fine, I just wanted some drama. But you can’t deny Shen Zhuoyan’s loyalty.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan sneered: \"He’s loyal because he’s infatuated. The moment that fades, so will his loyalty.\"","Weisheng Biehe, eyes closed, calmly twirled his prayer beads: \"Betrayal equals death. No need for lengthy discussions.\"","Weisheng Huailing sheathed his knife but fixed Shen Zhuoyan with a venomous glare.","Shen Zhuoyan met his gaze coldly.","Huailing narrowed his eyes, then shoved Pei Mu aside and flopped onto Qiao Chuchu’s lap.","Everyone: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Huailing nuzzled against her like a contented cat, settling in for a nap.","Shen Zhuoyan reached to yank him away—but a glint of silver flashed as a gun barrel pressed against his forehead!","Shen Zhuoyan: \"!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","A gun?!","Weisheng Huailing lounged on her lap, lazily aiming the weapon before holstering it with a taunting grin: «Try it. I dare you.»","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...\"","Huailing smirked at the seething men: «The lap is mine. Go hang an IV drip or something.»","Everyone: \"???\"","He flipped them off, grinning shamelessly.","Qiao Chuchu smacked his hand away!","Huailing winced, rubbing his fingers: «Oww, sis! That hurt!»","She shoved him off her lap: \"Who said you could lie down here?!\"","Weisheng Huailing blinked, then signed pitifully: «But why not? Don’t you remember our tragic orphanage days? We promised to stay together forever, through thick and thin!»","Qiao Chuchu: \"? We grew up together?\"","The seven Pei brothers chorused: \"Don’t listen to his nonsense! The eight of us grew up relying on each other!\"","Pei Yuan stepped forward, gently patting her head: \"You’re my—\"","He caught himself and rephrased: \"You’re a girl our family took in. Your name is Qiao Chu, but we all call you Qiao Chuchu.\"","Kneeling before her, he asked hopefully: \"Does any of this feel familiar?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face fell: \"So... you’re not my underlings?\"","Pei Yuan: \"...I’m your honorary brother. Like a neighbor-turned-brother, got it?\"","He rested his hands on her knees, pleading: \"Don’t you feel anything at all when you look at me?\"","She studied him carefully: \"I do.\"","[It’s familiar. A sense of reliance, like I should obey whatever he says—like a mother figure.]","Hesitantly, she said: \"You feel like... a mom. Or a patriarch. Am I right?\"","Pei Yuan’s smile wavered, disappointment flickering in his eyes.","But only for a second.","He nodded gently: \"Yes. You used to jokingly call me ‘male mom.’\"","He clasped her hands: \"You're Miss Qiao, the one fostered by the Pei family, and the person we cherish most. Because of the age difference, 'brother and sister' became our natural relationship.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked lost: \"So you’re the eldest brother?\"","Pei Yuan’s throat tightened: \"Yes. I’m your big brother.\"","Pei Che noticed his trembling voice and bent down: \"Bro, why are you crying? The doctor said her memory loss is temporary. She’ll recover. Don’t stress.\"","Maybe it was the fever, but Pei Yuan’s composure cracked. Covering his eyes, he choked out: \"I just... she’s been through too much. One ordeal after another, always getting hurt. Even at her worst before, she never suffered like this.\"","Tears spilled over: \"I failed as her brother. I couldn’t protect her. This is all my fault!\"","Watching Pei Yuan’s anguish, Qiao Chuchu’s chest ached.","On instinct, she opened her arms and pulled the crumpled man into a hug.","Pei Yuan shuddered in her embrace.","Her expression remained blank as she patted his back gently. \"Don't cry,\" she murmured.","In a dazed voice, she added, \"I can't bear to see you cry.\""]},{"number":283,"title":"Chapter 283: Qiao Chuchu: What's My Relationship with Ying Chen","paragraphs":["Pei Yuan widened his eyes in shock, inhaling her scent as he pressed tightly against her, tears like transparent beads cascading down his face in large drops.","The others stood to the side, watching Qiao Chuchu expectantly.","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes were dull, lost in confusion.","[Out of these seven people, they’re all my brothers.]","[Then how many are actually under my command? I can’t quite figure it out.]","Pei Yuan: “?”","The others: “?”","Is that really the point here???","The operating room light turned off.","A doctor stepped out: “Is Ying Chen’s family here?”","Qiao Chuchu quickly stood up, glancing at Yise.","Yise shook his head: “The boss’s family isn’t here.”","She repeated: “Ying Chen’s family isn’t present. I’m his friend—you can speak to me.”","Another urgent, deep male voice cut in: “Ying Chen’s family is right here!”","Qiao Chuchu turned toward the sound.","A man strode in hurriedly, carrying a child, followed by a woman in high heels rushing behind him.","The man anxiously set the child down and approached the doctor: “How’s my brother?”","Qiao Chuchu looked at Yise: “He’s Ying Chen’s brother??”","Yise shook his head: “No, our boss’s brothers all live abroad. He’s an adopted son—a child taken in by our boss’s father. He’s always lived in China.”","“Recently, our boss wanted to expand his business here and asked him for help.”","Qiao Chuchu hummed thoughtfully, observing the man’s anxious expression.","He seemed genuinely worried about Ying Chen.","The doctor said, “Although the patient suffered multiple stab wounds, none of them hit vital organs, so his life isn’t in danger. All the wounds have been stitched up. He just needs time to recover and a blood transfusion.”","The man immediately clasped his hands together in gratitude: “Thank you, thank you so much.”","He glanced around, spotting Yise: “Yise! Thank goodness Ying Chen’s alright.”","Yise nodded obediently: “Yeah!”","The man continued, “By the way, since your boss was attacked, why didn’t you come to me?”","He stepped closer, smiling. “Your boss still has a deal pending. If you don’t tell me, who’s going to prepare things for him?”","Yise gave an awkward smile: “But our boss specifically told me that if anything unexpected happened, all his affairs in China should be entrusted to someone he trusts.”","The man’s smile stiffened in surprise: “Ying Chen grew up overseas. Who could he possibly trust here?”","Yise hesitated, glancing at Qiao Chuchu.","The man’s gaze followed, landing on her.","Qiao Chuchu met his eyes without flinching.","He looked her up and down, disdain leaking from his expression: “Don’t tell me it’s this... lovely young lady.”","Yise: “It is her.”","The man’s smile vanished completely as he muttered under his breath: “Just some woman?”","His voice was so low only Yise and Qiao Chuchu could hear.","Qiao Chuchu beamed brightly: “Yes, just some woman.”","The man froze, realizing she had heard—and even echoed—his words.","The men behind Qiao Chuchu sensed the tension and swiftly moved to her side, glaring at him.","All familiar faces!","The man’s expression shifted, and he quickly backtracked: “Miss, I didn’t mean anything by it. I just think this deal isn’t suitable for a woman to handle. A delicate lady like you should stay home where it’s safer. I’m only thinking of your well-being.”","Ying Chen was wheeled out of the operating room, spotting Qiao Chuchu by the door.","He relaxed, about to speak, when Qiao Chuchu cut in cheerfully:","“No worries, I don’t mind. Narrow-minded people never get far anyway. Even if you curse me to the heavens, I’m still the one taking over Ying Chen’s work, closing this deal, and pocketing the money. You? You’re nothing.”","The man: “?!”","Ying Chen: “!”","The men behind Qiao Chuchu raised their brows, impressed.","She held her head high.","[Sorry not sorry—even if I’ve lost my memories, my personality’s intact. If Ying Chen trusted me, I must’ve been a big shot on his level before!]","Ying Chen: “?”","Qiao Chuchu lost her memory?","And she’s even more arrogant now?","Qiao Chuchu turned to Yise: “What time’s the meeting today?”","Yise: “Seven tonight, at Juyunzhai.”","She nodded, then smiled sweetly at the man: “I’ll handle the meeting tonight. You can leave. Ying Chen’s in my hands now.”","The man scoffed in disbelief: “You think you can just take over? What if you’re the one who tried to kill him?!”","Qiao Chuchu’s gaze sharpened like a hawk’s: “Ying Chen’s been in close contact with you. If he was attacked today, how do we know you had nothing to do with it?”","Ying Chen’s expression darkened as he studied the man suspiciously.","The man burst into laughter: “Do you even know who I am?! I’m Ying Yao, the adopted son of the Ying family! Even if Ying Chen and I aren’t blood-related, we’re still brothers!”","He gave her another disdainful once-over: “And so what if Ying Chen trusts you? Maybe you’re the one who sent people to kill him!”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","[Wait, holy crap—did I actually send people to kill Ying Chen?!]","Everyone who heard her thoughts: “?”","Ying Chen weakly turned to Biehe beside him and whispered: “She lost her memory?”","Biehe nodded.","Ying Chen was stunned: “How?”","Biehe deadpanned: “She punched a sandbag, the sandbag punched back, she hit her head, and now she thinks she’s a badass and we’re all her underlings.”","Ying Chen: “......”","Meanwhile, Ying Yao, seeing Qiao Chuchu hesitate, pointed at her triumphantly: “Ha! I knew it! You’re the killer, and you’re still pretending?!”","Qiao Chuchu ignored him, turning to Ying Chen instead.","Ying Chen lay weakly on the gurney, dizzy and disoriented: “Qiao Chuchu...”","She suddenly grabbed his face!","Ying Chen: “?”","She inspected him left, right, up, down!","[Dark-skinned, green-eyed hottie with tattoos!]","[Confirmed—not my doing. He’s too good-looking to kill!]","Ying Chen: “???”","She leaned in close: “Let me be honest—I just lost my memory. I don’t know what’s going on between us, but since you trust me, we must’ve had something going on. Tell me what our relationship is so I can shut this guy up.”","Ying Chen stared at her, amused: “What’s our relationship?”","His eyes gleamed mischievously: “We’re lovers.”","Qiao Chuchu: “? No way. You’re not charming at all. Are you sure?”","Ying Chen: “? I’m not charming?!”","Trembling, he raised his blood transfusion hand like a vengeful spirit and grabbed her wrist: “I’ve got the face, the body, the perfect ass—hell, even my size is something I’m proud of! And you say I’m not charming?!”","He looked utterly wronged: “Do you realize I just survived a near-death experience? The first thing I hear when I wake up is you insulting me. Just kill me now!”","Qiao Chuchu furrowed her brows, watching as Ying Chen's face turned pale, looking utterly wronged. She muttered under her breath, \"Are you sure we're actually a couple?\"","\"I'm certain!!\" Ying Chen strained his voice, hoarse with emotion, his gaze fixed on her with stubborn intensity. \"You love me so much you can't live without me!!\""]},{"number":284,"title":"Chapter 284: Go ahead and deceive her, take advantage of her amnesia to trick her","paragraphs":["The others grew wary and approached Ying Chen's hospital bed: \"What are you two talking about?\"","Weisheng Lin pulled Ying Chen's hand away: \"I'm warning you, don't pollute her pure mind with dirty ideas. Right now, she's as clean as a blank sheet of paper!\"","Ying Chen shakily withdrew his hand, his breathing uneven: \"Anyway... you can't... say I'm not charming... I'm... I'm a patient now... don't upset me...\"","He raised his head resentfully, mustering all his strength to declare: \"Otherwise, I'll haunt you even after I die!!\"","Qiao Chuchu stood up to leave: \"Got it. I believe you.\"","[That makes sense. No wonder he trusts me so much—it must be because we're in a relationship. Everything falls into place now.]","The others: \"?\"","What kind of relationship?","Pei Youchuan covered his ears, utterly confused: \"Did my ears get burned deaf from this fever?\"","Weisheng Huailing walked up to Ying Chen and angrily signed: 「She’s lost her memory. What did you tell her?!」","Ying Chen hadn’t expected Qiao Chuchu to believe him so easily and smirked smugly: \"I told her we're in a relationship.\"","Weisheng Huailing expressionlessly pinched his IV tube.","Ying Chen: \"?! I didn’t think she’d believe it. You guys go explain it to her.\"","The group collectively darkened their expressions.","Ying Chen reluctantly buried himself under the blankets: \"Not even considering how I just survived an assassination attempt. Some brothers you are!\"","Huailing kicked the hospital bed, then walked up behind Qiao Chuchu and tapped her shoulder.","Qiao Chuchu turned to look at him.","He signed an explanation: 「Ying Chen lied to you. He’s not your boyfriend.」","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Then who is?\"","Weisheng Huailing signed with utmost sincerity: 「I am.」","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Biehe yanked him back and tossed him at Weisheng Lin: \"What nonsense are you spouting?! Second Brother, control him!\"","He calmly stood before Qiao Chuchu, cleared his throat, and said, \"Don’t believe either of them. They’re just messing with you.\"","Qiao Chuchu grew even more bewildered, her damp eyes staring at him innocently: \"If neither of them is, then who is?\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"...\"","He fell silent again.","Qiao Chuchu pressed anxiously: \"Tell me!\"","Biehe glanced behind him.","Weisheng Huailing was being scolded.","Ying Chen was also getting an earful.","A sly glint flashed in his amber eyes as he leaned down toward her: \"Actually, there are too many people pursuing you. They all like you, but the one who’s really with you is me.\"","He studied her face, his expression neutral, but his gaze sharp as a hook: \"We got together in secret. We’re the real deal.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"So you’re the side piece?\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at Ying Chen: \"He’s my official boyfriend, right?\"","Biehe tightened his grip on his prayer beads: \"He’s not your boyfriend!\"","Qiao Chuchu reasoned logically: \"Then why does he trust me so much and even hand his business over to me?\"","Biehe: \"...\"","How would he know what Ying Chen was thinking?","Maybe because Qiao Chuchu could predict things?","Seeing his silence, Qiao Chuchu assumed he was speechless and patted his shoulder righteously: \"Whatever happened between us in the past, meddling in someone else’s relationship is wrong. Maybe in the past, as a big shot, I wasn’t a good person. Maybe I wasn’t faithful in love. But now I’m different. I don’t have feelings for you. Let’s end this.\"","Weisheng Biehe tilted his head, fury rising in his chest, though his tone remained flat: \"Why? Why won’t you break up with Ying Chen, but you’ll break up with me? What’s so much better about him?\"","Beneath his calm facade raged a storm of anger.","Qiao Chuchu frowned: \"I’ll break up with Ying Chen too, but he’s injured right now. Someone has to hold the business together.\"","Weisheng Biehe retorted matter-of-factly: \"Then break up with him now, and I’ll be the official one.\"","Qiao Chuchu spread her hands in confusion: \"He’s hurt. I can’t just abandon him right now. That’s inhumane, isn’t it?\"","\"I can wait, but I won’t accept you choosing him over me! How long has he even known you?!\"","Biehe’s voice grew sharper: \"And do you even know who I am?! I, Weisheng Biehe, have never chased after a woman in my life! Since childhood, I’ve gotten everything I wanted—I’ve never stumbled! And yet, you treat me like this?!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s temper flared: \"I told you to leave!\"","Weisheng Biehe’s face darkened as he hissed back: \"I won’t! Why should I be the one to leave?! If anyone’s leaving, it’s Ying Chen!\"","Qiao Chuchu felt like she was dealing with a madman, her head spinning: \"Oh my god, I don’t think I’m the type to two-time! Why is this so hard to explain?!\"","Weisheng Biehe froze, realizing he’d been dragged into her logic.","He awkwardly glanced behind him, then pulled Qiao Chuchu aside to apologize: \"Sorry, I went too far just now.\"","He took her hand in his, kneading it gently, whispering like a guilty lover: \"I’m the fourth son of the Weisheng family. I’ve had everything handed to me since childhood. No one but my parents has ever dared to make me angry. You’re the first. I got emotional and raised my voice, but I just don’t like losing to another man. I wasn’t targeting you.\"","He pressed her against the wall, caressing her face: \"Don’t be mad at me, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu turned her face away in discomfort.","His eyes darkened as he gripped her chin, forcing her to look at him.","She had no choice but to meet his gaze.","Biehe’s amber eyes burned with jealousy as he warned softly: \"Don’t choose Ying Chen again. He and I grew up together—we’re best friends. I won’t let him surpass me in your heart. Remember that.\"","He dragged his thumb roughly over her lips, then, before the others noticed, walked away with light steps.","Qiao Chuchu leaned against the wall, her worldview shattered.","Oh my god...","Oh my god!","What kind of life had she been living?!","And these two were supposed to be best friends?!","Ying Yao approached her: \"Can we talk business now?\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at him blankly.","Ying Yao glanced at the men, puzzled: \"Something about the way you all interact feels... weird. It’s like they’re bickering.\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of it and took a deep breath: \"Ignore them. I’m the one discussing things with you.\"","Ying Yao smirked mockingly: \"Just so you know, I’m blunt. You’re a woman—you might not be able to handle tonight’s client. Let me take care of it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"No.\"","Ying Yao: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu scowled: \"I don’t like your tone. And no matter how ‘blunt’ you are, you can’t just open your mouth and spew nonsense. This is a hospital—maybe you should go see a specialist while you’re here.\"","She turned to leave.","Ying Yao grabbed her shoulder: \"Who do you think you’re talking to?!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s breath hitched—a sudden vision flashed before her eyes.","Ying Yao stood over her, his foot pressing her down.","He drove a knife into her throat: \"I told you to stay out of this!\"","She clutched the blade, trembling, and saw Shen Zhuoyan’s lifeless body beside her.","With a final surge of defiance, she took her last breath.","Qiao Chuchu's face paled in shock, rooted to the spot as if her feet had grown into the ground, unable to take a single step!","[Oh my god! I actually have the ability to foresee the future!!]","[This Ying Yao killed my trusted subordinate and even slit my throat! And he had the nerve to say I was meddling in his business!]","The men's argument came to an abrupt halt as they suddenly swarmed forward and dragged Ying Yao away!","Ying Yao: \"????\""]},{"number":285,"title":"Chapter 285: Can't Believe I'm This Kind of Person","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu watched as they took Ying Yao away and stepped forward in confusion.","Shen Zhuoyan stopped her: \"Don’t go, Miss.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"Why? Where are you taking him?\"","Shen Zhuoyan replied, \"He has his own place to go. You should rest—there’s no need for you to interfere.\"","After a moment of hesitation, Qiao Chuchu relented. \"Actually, I don’t remember anything. What was your name again?\"","Shen Zhuoyan sighed with a pang of sympathy. \"My name is Shen Zhuoyan—'Zhuo' as in 'deliberate,' 'Yan' as in 'words.'\"","She nodded in understanding and turned to Ying Chen. \"What kind of person was I before?\"","Shen Zhuoyan answered, \"Not much different from now, except you were closer to us in the past.\"","She paused, cautious. \"What kind of closeness?\"","Was it... romantic closeness?","Shen Zhuoyan frowned. \"Just the usual kind. I haven’t been by your side for long, so I’m not familiar with the details.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded and approached Ying Chen, signaling for Shen Zhuoyan to step back.","Shen Zhuoyan obeyed, retreating a few paces to observe their surroundings.","Taking a deep breath, she leaned down and asked Ying Chen, \"How are you feeling?\"","Ying Chen’s eyes burned with hostility, his heart half-frozen. \"The brother my family adopted just got exposed as the traitor who tried to kill me. How do you think I feel?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? How do you know Ying Yao was the traitor who tried to kill you?\"","Ying Chen: \"Because I heard you—\"","Noticing her puzzled expression, he caught himself before slipping up and quickly changed his tone. \"I figured it out. He was obviously guilty. Probably wanted to kill me and take over the power and money I inherited in China, right? Since my family doesn’t operate here, if I died, everything would naturally fall to him. My relatives would just take their dividends and not dig too deep.\"","He smirked. \"But exposing a traitor is a good thing. Thanks to you—before you lost your memory—I told you that if you helped me find the mole, I’d give you 300 million. Even though I got stabbed, the mastermind was still uncovered because of you. As promised, I’ll have the money transferred to you soon.\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head. \"I won’t take your money. Aren’t you my boyfriend?\"","Ying Chen: \"?\"","She still believed that?!","Amused, he studied her. \"Exactly because I’m your boyfriend, I have to give you this money. It proves your man keeps his word, doesn’t it?\"","Weisheng Biehe approached them just in time to hear this.","His eyes darkened as he silently circled behind Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"I don’t want it!\"","Ying Chen grabbed the hand she had braced on the bed, insisting, \"You have to take it. Otherwise, you’ll throw a fit when you regain your memory. Besides, it’s not like I can’t afford it.\"","She tried to pull her hand back. \"I already said I don’t—\"","Suddenly, another hand hooked around her other wrist from behind.","Qiao Chuchu stiffened, turning her head in shock to meet Weisheng Biehe’s amber eyes.","They were as clear as gemstones, filled with an emotion she couldn’t decipher. He smirked, toying with her right hand as if it were nothing.","Qiao Chuchu: \"!!!\"","His grip was rough, kneading her fingers forcefully.","Weisheng Biehe leaned over her shoulder, his tone casual, as if nothing unusual was happening. \"What are you two talking about?\"","He trapped her hand between them—hidden from Shen Zhuoyan behind her and Ying Chen in front.","Qiao Chuchu’s nerves were on edge as she stiffly turned back to Ying Chen.","Oblivious, Ying Chen grinned and clasped her wrist, mischief dancing in his eyes. \"I was just saying Chuchu helped me uncover the mole, so I have to thank her properly. Otherwise, she’ll throw a tantrum when her memory comes back.\"","He was inwardly delighted.","Weisheng Biehe had no idea Qiao Chuchu thought Ying Chen was her boyfriend! He probably assumed they were just chatting normally!","How thrilling!","\"Will you?\" Weisheng Biehe leaned closer, his serpent-like gaze locking onto her, sending chills down her spine.","\"Will you throw a tantrum with him, Miss Qiao?\"","His scorching fingers interlaced with hers, squeezing tight.","Her breath hitched—she couldn’t take it anymore. She yanked her hands free from both men. \"This is disgusting! Was I really this kind of person before?!\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Ying Chen: \"?\"","She spun around and bolted, shrieking, \"I can’t accept this! No matter what, I can’t accept it!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"? Chuchu?!\""]},{"number":286,"title":"Chapter 286: The Past of the Qiao Family","paragraphs":["Shen Zhuoyan caught up to Qiao Chuchu in just a few strides, pulling her forcefully into his arms. \"Why are you running?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt like a dog yanked back by a leash, stumbling into Shen Zhuoyan’s chest with the momentum!","She groaned in pain. \"Ugh!\"","Shen Zhuoyan frowned in concern, leaning down to examine her face. \"Did you hurt yourself?\"","She rubbed her nose, too pained to speak.","He gently moved her hand aside, carefully inspecting her reddened nose.","Qiao Chuchu glared at him, her nose still flushed.","The look sent a ripple through him, and a faint smile tugged at his otherwise stern expression. \"So delicate. Just a little bump and you turn red.\"","Covering her nose, she pushed him away in irritation. \"Your chest is too hard!\"","His smile deepened. \"Yes, yes, my fault.\"","He stepped closer again, cupping her face in his hands as he bent down. \"Let me see if you're injured.\"","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head back, watching as his face drew near.","Shen Zhuoyan was strikingly handsome, around her age, with sharp, refined features.","His body bore the strength of someone who trained regularly, yet his eyes held a youthful stubbornness and coolness—an intriguing contrast.","Sensing her intense gaze, he slowly met her eyes.","There was no trace of desire in her expression—just pure, unflinching scrutiny.","But he was affected, his Adam’s apple bobbing as he swallowed. \"Alright.\"","His fingers absentmindedly pinched the tip of her nose. \"You're fine.\"","Reluctantly, he pulled back, putting some distance between them. \"Why did you run?\"","Qiao Chuchu wrapped her arms around herself, uneasy. \"I hate who I used to be.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"? Why?\"","She grimaced in self-disgust. \"I was two-timing—with two brothers, no less. Ying Chen was my official boyfriend, and Weisheng Biehe was my side affair. I can’t believe I was that kind of person. I thought I was someone who lived freely.\"","She shook her head repeatedly. \"There was no joy in that tangled mess, just guilt and resentment.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"? Those two idiots are full of nonsense!\"","A woman’s voice suddenly cut in. \"Qiao Chu!!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to see an elderly woman storming toward her, followed by a maid.","Despite her white hair, the old woman moved with vigor, her hawk-like eyes locked onto Qiao Chuchu. Without a word, she raised her hand to strike—","Shen Zhuoyan intercepted her wrist. \"What do you think you're doing?!\"","The old woman didn’t back down, glaring defiantly. \"None of your business! This girl is my granddaughter!\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s expression darkened. \"I don’t care who you are. She’s my lady, and no one touches her.\"","The old woman sneered. \"And what will you do if I still hit her?\"","A dangerous glint flashed in Shen Zhuoyan’s eyes as he tightened his grip. \"You’d have to get past me first.\"","His strength was overwhelming; the old woman couldn’t break free. She staggered back, teeth bared at Qiao Chuchu. \"Fine! Very fine!\"","She jabbed a finger at Qiao Chuchu. \"You’ve got a bodyguard because you’re guilty! You killed my son!\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked, then laughed. \"Your son?\"","She gave the old woman a once-over. \"Your son must’ve been grown. How could I have killed him?\"","Old Lady Qiao’s face turned ashen. \"How dare you speak to me like that?! I’m your grandmother!!\"","A memory flashed in Qiao Chuchu’s mind.","The old woman standing before her mother’s grave, snarling, \"This wretched woman cursed my son to death. Dig up her ashes and pair them with some other dead man! I won’t let her rest with my son—she’d defile his grave!\"","Back then, Qiao Chuchu had been small. Hearing those words, she’d lunged and bitten the old woman’s hand.","The old woman had shoved her away and slapped her hard. \"You little bitch, daring to bite me! You’re just like your mother—no good! Just wait till I take you home. I’ll beat you every day!\"","She’d fallen to the ground, glaring up in hatred.","The old woman had smirked, grabbing her ear and twisting it viciously.","Her scream of pain had only made the old woman’s grin widen before she kicked her away. \"Listen here. Your mother cursed my son to death. Living under my roof, you’ll die too—but I’ll make sure it’s a miserable end!\"","A middle-aged man had then jabbed her forehead. \"Know who I am?! I’m your uncle, and this is your grandmother. We’re your family now, you little brat!\"","She’d spat blood in their faces. \"I’d rather rot in an orphanage than go with you! You’re all monsters!!\"","The man had roared and swung at her. \"You bitch!\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to the present.","Now she remembered everything.","A mocking smile curled her lips. \"Got any proof it was me?\"","She tilted her head, taunting. \"Maybe you’re the one who cursed your son to death. After all, you’re the expert on curses—you blamed my mom for my dad’s death, didn’t you?\"","The old woman shrieked, lunging at Qiao Chuchu like a wild animal, fingers clawing for her hair.","\"You dare say it was me?! It was your mother who ruined this family! She cursed my child to death!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan blocked her again.","Qiao Chuchu turned away, done with the drama.","Old Lady Qiao trembled with rage, leaning on her maid. \"I’ll kill her... I have to kill her!!\"","The maid patted her back helplessly. \"That girl is truly wicked, speaking to you like that. Don’t let anger ruin your health. And don’t talk about killing—you’re too old for such things.\"","Another voice chimed in smoothly. \"Age is just a number. There are always... other ways.\"","The old woman stiffened, turning toward the speaker.","Xia Xuechun stood beside Long Yunxiao, dressed in a white tweed suit, smiling warmly. \"Perhaps you could share the details of your son’s disappearance? I might have some leads.\"","Old Lady Qiao calmed slightly, eyeing Long Yunxiao in confusion. \"President Long?\"","Then she studied Xia Xuechun. \"And you are?\"","Xia Xuechun handed her a business card. \"I’m President Long’s personal secretary, Xia Xuechun.\"","She’d recently landed a new job—Long Yunxiao’s close aide.","After visiting Long Yuntian at the hospital, she’d spotted Qiao Chuchu and her grandmother nearby.","Noting the old woman’s suspicion, Xia Xuechun pressed, \"I might have information about your son’s death.\"","Old Lady Qiao snorted dismissively. \"Just a secretary? What weight do your words carry?\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?\""]},{"number":287,"title":"Chapter 287: Fengnong Pei Passes Away","paragraphs":["Long Yunxiao affectionately wrapped his arm around Xia Xuechun’s waist and said to Old Lady Qiao, \"Don’t worry, she’s my future wife. Xuechun and I are already in a relationship.\"","Old Lady Qiao was stunned. \"But President Long, isn’t your wife paralyzed from the waist down?\"","A blissful smile spread across Long Yunxiao’s face as he shared the happy news with ease. \"Given my status, I can’t possibly have a paralyzed woman as my wife.\"","He pulled Xia Xuechun closer. \"Besides, there was no love between me and my wife. Xuechun and I are the real deal, even if there’s a bit of an age gap.\"","Xia Xuechun looked up at Long Yunxiao, her eyes brimming with adoration.","On the night of Qiao Chuchu’s race, trouble came for the two of them.","The attackers were hostile, throwing punches and kicks, but Long Yunxiao shielded her the entire time, covering her with his body, protecting her at the risk of his own life.","It was in that moment she realized what kind of man was truly worth entrusting her life to.","So, after they escaped and made it to his home, they made their relationship official.","Old Mr. Long blessed their union.","Brother Long, with a bitter expression, wished them happiness.","Long Yunxiao’s paralyzed wife—apparently due to some nerve damage—could hear but couldn’t speak. When she heard about their impending marriage, she started wailing uncontrollably.","But her opinion didn’t matter anymore.","Because her own parents were happy for her.","Xia Xuechun linked arms with Long Yunxiao and said smoothly, \"We’re all friends here. Why don’t you tell us about your missing son? I might know something.\"","Old Lady Qiao could only hide the disdain in her eyes and wearily explained, \"My son disappeared on a luxury cruise. Qiao Chuchu was on that ship too. He’s still missing—no trace of him anywhere. I need to know if he was killed or just vanished.\"","Xia Xuechun’s eyes gleamed as she lied without flinching. \"Now that you mention it... could the shadow I saw on that cruise have been Qiao Chuchu and your son?\"","The old woman tensed, her eyes widening. \"You saw them?!\"","\"I happened to be there that night,\" Xia Xuechun said, feigning recollection. \"I saw a figure throwing something like a sack into the sea. I was alone and scared of getting involved, so I kept quiet. But thinking back...\"","A sly glint flashed in her eyes as she leaned in. \"That must have been your son.\"","The old lady’s face twisted in horror. \"I knew it! She killed my boy!\"","She frantically looked around for a weapon. \"I’ll kill her! I’ll find something to kill her with!!\"","Xia Xuechun laughed lightly at her frenzy. \"At your age, you’re no match for Qiao Chuchu. She knows martial arts—even I can’t beat her.\"","The old woman’s mind went blank with panic. \"Then what should I do?! I have no proof!\"","Xia Xuechun’s smile deepened. \"Can you drive?\"","Old Lady Qiao: \"Yes, why?\"","Xia Xuechun simply smiled in response.","Realization struck the old woman, and she stormed toward the parking lot!","Her maid chased after her in confusion. \"Madam, don’t be rash! This is just hearsay—you can’t believe it!\"","Long Yunxiao watched the old woman hurry off and turned to Xia Xuechun. \"Did you really see Qiao Chuchu do it?\"","\"Of course not. Back then, I couldn’t even afford a regular cruise, let alone a luxury one. I made it up.\"","Xia Xuechun smirked in satisfaction. \"But the truth doesn’t matter—only the outcome does. I’m happy now, and making sure Qiao Chuchu dies horribly is my last beautiful wish. I’ll see it through.\"","Long Yunxiao leaned down and kissed her cheek. \"You little devil~\"","Old Lady Qiao scrambled into her car, ordering the driver and maid to stay outside.","Her eyes burned red, her hands trembling on the wheel like a monster on the verge of transformation. Panting heavily, she grabbed her phone to make a call.","She would lure Qiao Chuchu out.","She would run her over—crush her beneath the wheels!","Her gaze darted around like a rat’s until she spotted Pei Fengnong stumbling out of the hospital, clutching his head.","Pei Fengnong, weak with fever, headed toward his car.","He had rushed Qiao Chuchu to the hospital earlier and left his phone behind. Now, he needed to retrieve it before his condition worsened.","The old woman’s eyes locked onto him.","That was Pei Fengnong.","One of Qiao Chuchu’s close ones.","Should she hit him?","Would it interfere with her plan to kill Qiao Chuchu?","After a brief hesitation, she tightened her grip on the wheel. \"If she killed my son, why shouldn’t I kill her family?! If I suffer, everyone suffers!!\"","She started the engine and aimed straight for Pei Fengnong!","Inside the hospital, Qiao Chuchu suddenly foresaw Pei Fengnong’s death—his skull crushed, a shattered phone in his hand.","She grabbed Shen Zhuoyan and ran. \"To the parking lot! One of my brothers is about to get hit!!\"","Without hesitation, Shen Zhuoyan sprinted after her.","Pei Fengnong retrieved his phone and turned back toward the hospital.","Behind him, an engine roared to life, accelerating violently!","He barely had time to react before the impact sent him flying!","Pain exploded in his head as he hit the ground.","Qiao Chuchu reached the parking lot just in time to see it. She rushed toward him without thinking.","Pei Fengnong saw her and shouted, \"Chuchu, stay back! It’s dangerous!!\"","But she kept running.","The car reversed, then surged forward—rolling straight over his skull!","Warm blood splattered across Qiao Chuchu’s face.","Shen Zhuoyan, inches from grabbing her, was drenched in crimson.","Old Lady Qiao, still in the driver’s seat, burst into maniacal laughter. \"HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!\"","She pointed at Qiao Chuchu, her voice wild with glee. \"Your face is covered in your brother’s blood! All his blood!!\"","Qiao Chuchu stood frozen, staring at Pei Fengnong’s crushed head.","She forgot to breathe as the vision from her premonition merged with reality.","It was the same scene.","Disbelief choked her. \"I... didn’t save him?\"","Her body trembled as she stared at his lifeless form. \"I didn’t save him?\"","\"I DIDN’T SAVE HIM?!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan yanked her into the narrow gap between two parked cars. \"Move!\"","Old Lady Qiao slammed the gas, crashing toward them. \"DIE! I said you’d suffer—and you WILL!!\"","The driver and maid, horrified by the corpse on the ground, shakily dialed the police."]},{"number":288,"title":"Chapter 288: The Prophesied Scene Truly Appeared Before My Eyes","paragraphs":["Shen Zhuoyan carried Qiao Chuchu on his back, dodging Old Lady Qiao’s car as it tried to run them over again and again.","She stared blankly at Pei Fengnong’s lifeless body, deaf to the sharp, blaring horns around her.","It was as if a fishbowl had been placed over her head.","She couldn’t hear clearly, but she could see everything with perfect clarity.","Pei Fengnong lay in a pool of blood, his body utterly still.","Pei Fengnong was dead.","He had died right before her eyes.","From the moment she confirmed his death, it felt like she was trapped in a dream, and everything around her was slipping away.","Old Lady Qiao was arrested.","Countless people around them were filming the scene.","Her brothers rushed to Pei Fengnong’s body in disbelief.","Weisheng Huailing grabbed her tightly, waving a hand in front of her face. \"Sister! Sister, what’s wrong with you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t respond.","In the blink of an eye, days later, she found herself standing before Pei Fengnong’s funeral.","Lin Qing crouched in front of her, tears in her eyes as she tried to comfort her. \"Chuchu, the dead cannot return to life. You did everything you could.\"","Dressed in black, Qiao Chuchu’s vacant gaze flickered slightly, finally focusing on Lin Qing’s face.","Seeing her like this, Lin Qing knew she still hadn’t recovered. Her nose stung, and she opened her mouth to speak—","But Pei Che, his face pale, stepped forward. \"Lin Qing, go over there. I’ll take care of her.\"","Lin Qing nodded, wiping her tears as she stood.","Pei Che knelt before Qiao Chuchu, resting his hands on her knees. \"Chuchu.\"","She didn’t react, only staring at his face in silence.","Pei Che’s complexion was ghostly, his eyes the only part of him that showed any color—red and swollen from crying.","He took her hands in his, gently kneading them. \"You did everything you could. Don’t blame yourself.\"","Four days had passed since Pei Fengnong’s death, and she had remained silent the entire time.","At first, they thought it was shock, compounded by her amnesia.","But she refused to eat or drink, sitting motionless for hours.","Old Lady Qiao’s arrest? No reaction.","Pei Fengnong’s burial? Nothing.","She was like a wooden doll—ignoring her phone, doing nothing, even letting Little Xie change her clothes for her.","He was terrified.","Terrified she had lost her mind, that she couldn’t bear it.","Pei Che pulled her into his arms, his voice trembling for the first time. \"This isn’t your fault, Chuchu. It really isn’t!\"","His words choked with emotion. \"Fengnong left a will. If he died unexpectedly, everything he owned would go to you. At the very least... he gave you everything.\"","Only then, nestled against him, did she show the faintest flicker of awareness.","It was as if... she had foreseen this moment before.","But she couldn’t remember.","As if... she had known someone would die.","Her eyes dimmed with sorrow.","[I knew someone would die, but I didn’t act in time. Instead, I gave the enemy an opening.]","[I can’t forgive myself.]","Pei Che’s heart ached as he watched her.","This was the first time in four days he had heard Qiao Chuchu’s inner voice.","Qiao Chuchu finally opened her mouth, her voice hoarse and broken. \"What did... the old woman say?\"","Pei Che held her tighter. \"She said Xia Xuechun told her you killed her son. She wanted revenge, and Xia Xuechun even suggested she use the car to run you over. In her rage, she did it. Her family wants us to sign a settlement agreement.\"","Hatred burned in Pei Che’s eyes, his jaw clenched tight. \"After it happened, Xia Xuechun and Long Yunxiao fled the country. We still haven’t found them...\"","Qiao Chuchu let out a cold laugh. \"Is that so? Then I’ll go find them myself.\"","Pei Che froze. \"What?\"","She pushed him away, her dull eyes suddenly alight with fire. \"I’ll restart the game.\"","Pei Che: \"...?\""]},{"number":289,"title":"Chapter 289: Don't Blame Me for Being Ruthless","paragraphs":["Pei Che grabbed Qiao Chuchu’s hand: \"Where are you going?!\"","As if sensing something, he stared intently into her eyes: \"You can’t just wander off!\"","Qiao Chuchu said nothing, slowly pulling her hand free, her gaze settling on his chest.","Pei Che was dressed in a black suit, a white flower pinned to his lapel.","A symbol of mourning in the family.","But... the family shouldn’t have had to hold a funeral.","Seeing her deathly pale expression, Pei Che cautiously stepped closer.","As if she were a startled bird, he slowly raised his hand and cradled the back of her head.","His palm was cold as he tentatively pulled her into his embrace: \"Chuchu, no matter what you’re thinking, no matter what you plan to do—don’t. The risk is too great!\"","She showed no emotion.","Or rather, she felt nothing at all.","Even as Pei Che’s voice trembled, his body shaking faintly,","she found it oddly fascinating how this man could appear so uncharacteristically vulnerable.","But she didn’t care.","Her mind was made up.","She wrapped her arms around Pei Che and said obediently, \"On my way here, I saw a street vendor selling stir-fried noodles. I want to eat something.\"","Pei Che looked at her in shock: \"You... want to eat?\"","His reddened eyes finally flickered with hope: \"I’ll have someone bring you noodles. Don’t eat street food—it’s not hygienic.\"","\"I want it now,\" she insisted, leaving no room for argument. \"And I want you to go buy it for me.\"","Pei Che frowned, trying to reason with her: \"Street food isn’t clean. I’ll have it delivered—it won’t take long.\"","\"I want the street vendor’s noodles,\" Qiao Chuchu stared at him unblinkingly. \"Are you going to get them for me or not?\"","Pei Che’s expression darkened. Seeing the cold determination in her eyes, he finally relented.","\"Fine. But you’re coming with me.\"","He couldn’t leave her alone—what if she did something reckless?","Qiao Chuchu agreed without hesitation: \"Fine.\"","She pointed in a deserted direction: \"That way.\"","Pei Che didn’t question it, taking her hand as they walked.","Qiao Chuchu followed closely behind, occasionally bending down to pick wildflowers and foxtails from the ground.","Watching her, Pei Che thought she seemed more alive now and finally exhaled in relief: \"Do you remember?\"","She looked up blankly.","Despite the dark circles under his eyes, Pei Che forced a smile: \"When Mom passed away, I held your hand just like this.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t answer, pressing a hand to her chest as if searching for a memory that wasn’t there.","But her heart remembered.","It ached faintly at his words.","Seeing her reaction, pain flashed in Pei Che’s eyes before he turned away and kept walking.","He changed the subject: \"I didn’t notice any vendors earlier. Would there really be one here?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t answer. Instead, she pulled her hand free: \"Second Brother.\"","Pei Che turned: \"Hmm?\"","A rock smashed into his skull!","Caught off guard, Pei Che staggered, vision swimming as he collapsed to the ground!","Warm blood trickled down his forehead.","Dazed, he looked up at Qiao Chuchu in disbelief.","She stood in the sunlight, clad in a black dress, her hair styled into a neat princess cut—dressed carefully by Little Xie.","But in her hand was the bloodstained rock.","The one she’d just used to strike him.","What was she doing?","Was she really going to start over?!","Pei Che tried to stand, but the world spun violently, sending him crashing back down!","He couldn’t get up!","Trembling, he dragged himself toward her.","Qiao Chuchu looked down, watching as Pei Che crawled across the dirt.","The usually proud and composed man was disheveled, his tailored suit scuffed, his dignity abandoned as he reached for her feet.","His shaking hand covered her Mary Jane shoe: \"Don’t...\"","Too weak to lift his head, he begged: \"I’m begging you... don’t hurt yourself... please...\"","Faded scars crisscrossed his pale wrist.","Above them, his fingers clutched desperately at her shoe.","Qiao Chuchu crouched, cupping his face: \"I didn’t want to hurt you. But this was the only way.\"","Pei Che struggled to meet her gaze, tears falling onto her palm.","Fear flickered in his usually cold, sharp eyes.","He knew she wouldn’t stay, but he still hoped she might: \"Chuchu, I’ve already lost my brother. I can’t lose you too!\"","Qiao Chuchu said nothing, loosening his tie.","Like a numb executioner, she stood, holding the fabric: \"This pain will pass, Brother. Endure it—for both of us.\"","\"What are you doing?! What are you—?!\"","Pei Che pushed himself up, only to collapse again as dizziness overwhelmed him.","Qiao Chuchu frowned, turning away: \"No one can stop me from getting what I want.\"","Pei Che watched helplessly as she walked off, his attempts to rise failing before darkness swallowed him.","Qiao Chuchu strode into the woods.","Her phone suddenly buzzed.","A message from an unknown number—a photo.","She tried to open it, but her phone rejected facial recognition, demanding a passcode instead.","But...","What was her password?","Standing under a tree, she suddenly remembered Little Xie’s words while dressing her earlier—","\"Miss, you have a note on your arm from before your amnesia! It has your phone password. Did you somehow know this would happen?\"","At the time, Little Xie had tried everything to lift her spirits.","But she hadn’t cared to listen.","Now, she rolled up her sleeve, revealing faint numbers scrawled in ballpoint.","Though faded from days of washing, the digits were still legible.","She unlocked her phone and opened the message.","A selfie.","Xia Xuechun sat on a boat, smiling sweetly at the camera, Long Yunxiao grinning behind her.","\"You must be devastated your fourth brother is dead! Serves you right!!\"","\"P.S. Don’t bother tracing this number or calling back—we bought it just to send this before tossing it into the sea!\"","\"Oh, and guess what? I’m happier than ever! Best part? I’m abroad now. No matter how desperate you are, you’ll never find me. But I’ll make sure to attend your funeral someday, because I’m working every day to make sure you and everyone you love suffers! [Heart][Heart][Heart]\"","The taunts didn’t faze her. She zoomed in, studying a landmark in the photo.","A lighthouse.","She screenshotted it and ran an image search.","Results pointed to Country D—a scenic but lawless region, infamous as the world’s most dangerous zone.","So that’s where they’d hidden.","Pathetic.","Was Xia Xuechun really happy?","Living in a place where violence could erupt at any moment, all just to stay out of her reach?"]},{"number":290,"title":"Chapter 290: Reopen","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu returned to her desktop and noticed a few large words written on the wallpaper:","\"Remember to check WPS!!\"","She opened the software and found a single file prominently labeled \"Must Read After Memory Loss.\"","She read it carefully from top to bottom.","Though the document was brief, it covered all the key points—summarizing her relationships and everything that had happened to her.","At the end, a section was highlighted in red:","\"I saw myself attending the funeral of someone close to me, but I’m not sure who. Please pay close attention to the people around me and make sure none of them die.\"","\"I hope that even after losing my memory, I’ll retain some instincts and remember certain details, so I don’t become a completely different person or undergo a drastic personality change.\"","\"Lastly, to my amnesiac self—if you do attend a loved one’s funeral, don’t panic. You still have three lives left. Just restart the game!\"","\"Oh, and try negotiating with the system to let you set a specific time. If it refuses, trade a task for it. It’ll agree.\"","Qiao Chuchu silently pocketed her phone, tightened her grip on the tie in her hand, and looked toward the tree branch.","Ten minutes later—","Pei Fengnong, suppressing his discomfort, retrieved his phone from the car.","He glanced at it casually, confirming no one had messaged him, and prepared to return to the hospital.","He needed to find Chuchu and then get some proper rest.","Suddenly, the sound of a car accelerating roared behind him!","Just as he turned to look, someone yanked him into the narrow gap between two parked cars!","Pei Fengnong staggered, his head throbbing, and looked up in shock: \"Chuchu?!\"","Qiao Chuchu held onto him tightly, her numb expression finally coming alive as she took in Pei Fengnong’s bewildered face.","[Not a crushed head or a face twisted beyond recognition!]","[He’s alive!]","[He’s alive!!]","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","Alive?","What does she mean?","Inside the car, Old Lady Qiao’s face twisted in fury as she slammed the accelerator, aiming straight for them: \"Where did Qiao Chuchu come from?! She wasn’t there a second ago!\"","Seeing the car charging toward them, Qiao Chuchu grabbed Pei Fengnong and ran!","Pei Fengnong stumbled, barely able to keep his balance, clutching his head: \"M-my head... it hurts!\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced back—Old Lady Qiao was already turning the car around, coming straight for them again!","She turned to Pei Fengnong, who was swaying unsteadily, and asked urgently: \"Are you running a fever?!\"","Pei Fengnong didn’t even have the strength to nod, pressing a hand to his forehead: \"Mm...\"","Her heart clenched. She looked toward the hospital’s back entrance.","The nearest route would take three or four minutes to reach on foot.","Pei Fengnong couldn’t run that far—he’d still get hit!","Even if they made it, his condition might worsen from the exertion.","Time was running out.","Old Lady Qiao was already circling around, closing in from another angle.","They were trapped between cars with no other cover in sight.","Without another thought, Qiao Chuchu—somehow summoning inhuman strength—hoisted Pei Fengnong onto her back and sprinted toward the hospital!","Pei Fengnong: \"?!\"","The car was gaining fast.","Old Lady Qiao rolled down her window, screaming: \"You killed my son! I’ll make you pay with your life!!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan emerged from the hospital and, seeing Qiao Chuchu with a car hot on her heels, immediately took Pei Fengnong from her and slung him over his shoulder!","Relieved of the weight, Qiao Chuchu grabbed Shen Zhuoyan’s hand: \"Get inside!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan dashed into the hospital with Pei Fengnong, about to relax—","A vision flashed before Qiao Chuchu’s eyes.","Shen Zhuoyan slowing down... the car plowing into them... both men crushed beneath the wheels.","In that split second, she yanked Shen Zhuoyan toward the wall!","Pei Fengnong tumbled from Shen Zhuoyan’s shoulder, barely catching himself before being shoved against the wall!","Qiao Chuchu threw her arms around their waists, burying her face between them: \"Don’t move!\"","The car smashed through the glass doors with a deafening crash!","Screams erupted as people scattered in panic.","Shards of glass flew in every direction.","Shen Zhuoyan and Pei Fengnong instinctively shielded her, their bodies forming a protective triangle around her.","Glass grazed their cheeks and ears, but they held firm, keeping her safe until the blare of sirens and the arrival of security signaled it was over.","When they finally loosened their grip, they turned—the car had stopped mere inches from them.","It had rammed through the hospital’s back entrance, reducing the glass doors to splinters.","The airbag had deployed, and Old Lady Qiao slumped motionless in the driver’s seat, likely knocked unconscious by the impact.","Shen Zhuoyan stared at the near-miss, shaken: \"If Qiao Chuchu hadn’t pushed us aside, we’d have been hit.\"","Pei Fengnong was even more horrified: \"...If she hadn’t pulled me away in the first place, I’d already be dead.\"","Lin Shen and others rushed over at the commotion, their faces pale: \"Chuchu!\"","Chaos engulfed the scene.","People frantically checked on their loved ones.","Several had been cut by flying glass.","Amid the turmoil, Lin Shen pulled Qiao Chuchu from the wreckage, scanning her for injuries: \"Are you hurt?! Are you okay?!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t answer, her gaze locked on Pei Fengnong.","He leaned weakly against the wall, blood streaking his face.","Both he and Shen Zhuoyan bore cuts on their cheeks and necks.","Only she remained unscathed.","She stared at Pei Fengnong, her voice barely above a whisper: \"Come here.\"","Pei Fengnong, surprised, stepped forward.","She rose onto her toes, cradling his face in her hands.","Her eyes traced the curve of his expressive gaze, the straight line of his nose, the fresh wound still bleeding on his cheek.","Pei Fengnong assumed she was worried about his injuries and reassured her: \"Don’t mind these. They’re just scratches. You saved my life—this is nothing.\"","Qiao Chuchu said nothing.","She grasped his wrist, feeling the steady pulse beneath her fingers—then tears spilled without warning onto his palm.","Pei Fengnong froze: \"Why are you crying?\"","The others turned, startled by her sudden tears.","Even Ying Chen, lying on a hospital bed, struggled to prop himself up to look at her.","She studied Pei Fengnong head to toe—then leaped into his arms!","Pei Fengnong staggered but caught her.","Her sobs broke free, all the pent-up anguish and dread pouring out: \"You’re alive!!\"","[The past four days felt like living in hell. Pei Fengnong died—right in front of me, just as I’d foreseen!]","Pei Fengnong stiffened, staring down at her in shock.","The others exchanged uneasy glances.","Qiao Chuchu clung to his neck, weeping uncontrollably.","[I watched his body slide into the crematorium, swept his ashes with my own hands—a living man reduced to dust and a will.]","\"If I hadn't been given this chance to be reborn, he would have been gone from this world forever!\"","\"Thankfully, I came back. I saved him!\"","\"Pei's Mother, I haven’t failed the kindness you once showed me. I saved Pei Fengnong, your son. I didn’t let him die—he’s alive and well!\"","Pei Fengnong listened in stunned silence, struggling to believe what he was hearing.","Had he really died in that accident just moments ago?!","Qiao Chuchu had actually been reborn.","But how had she returned?","The same question echoed in the minds of everyone present, their gazes fixed on Chuchu with growing tension."]},{"number":291,"title":"Chapter 291: The Truth About Qiao Chuchu's Rebirth","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu pushed Pei Fengnong away, her eyes brimming with tears as she looked at Pei Che.","Pei Che frowned deeply, his gaze filled with concern as he watched her.","She walked up to him and raised her hand, gently touching his forehead. \"Does it hurt here?\"","Pei Che froze, confused. \"No, it doesn’t.\"","Qiao Chuchu sniffled, guilt weighing heavily in her eyes as she stared at him.","[I’m sorry. To get away from Pei Che, I hit him with a rock to knock him out so he couldn’t stop me.]","Pei Che’s expression gradually shifted to shock.","Qiao Chuchu lowered her head in remorse, remembering Pei Che lying alone on the ground.","[Pei Fengnong’s funeral had left everyone exhausted. Pei Che had taken time out of his shift to stay with me.]","[Strangely, it was as if he knew what I was planning. He held onto me tightly, and no matter what I did, I couldn’t shake him off. So I secretly grabbed a rock and knocked him out.]","[He trusted me so much. Even in that last moment, he didn’t blame me for hurting him. Instead, he begged me—begged me not to do anything reckless.]","[And yet... I still left him there alone, took his tie, and used it to bring myself back.]","Pei Che’s pupils constricted violently!","The others around them tensed as if an alarm had gone off!","His tie?!","Did Qiao Chuchu use Pei Che’s tie to revive herself?!","Then that would mean—","Pei Che’s heart skipped several beats as the realization hit him. He lunged forward and pulled her into a tight embrace!","Qiao Chuchu staggered back, caught off guard!","Pei Fengnong wrapped his arms around her from behind!","She was sandwiched between them like the filling of a cookie!","Pei Fengnong buried his face in the crook of her neck, his voice thick with regret. \"I’m not worth it, Chuchu. I’m really not worth you risking yourself to save me like that!\"","She had even come back from death to save him!","Pei Che, standing in front of her, opened his mouth as if to speak, but the words lodged in his throat.","He couldn’t say them.","Instead, he restrained himself and asked softly, \"You must have been terrified just now, weren’t you?\"","What he really wanted to ask was: Were you in pain when you tried to bring yourself back?","Trapped between their feverish bodies, Qiao Chuchu felt the heat radiating from them.","Tears welled in her eyes, but she smiled. \"I wasn’t scared.\"","Pei Che and Pei Fengnong exchanged surprised glances. \"You weren’t?\"","\"No.\" A sense of relief spread through her chest, mingling with the grief of the past four days, finally spilling over.","She wanted to sob, but she held the tears back, keeping them trapped behind her lashes. \"I actually feel... happy.\"","The two men froze, their eyes reddening in unison.","Qiao Chuchu closed her eyes, biting her lip hard to suppress her sorrow.","[No one will ever understand how happy I am to see the people I watched die standing alive before me again.]","[I’ve forgotten most things, but the one memory that remains is my mother’s grave—those so-called relatives threatening to kill me while I stood there helpless. And then, Pei’s Mother and my brothers appeared to protect me.]","[When Pei’s Mother confronted those vile relatives, my brothers stood by my side and held my hands.]","[Pei’s Mother and my brothers were the first warmth I felt when I came into this world.]","[Even though most of my memories are gone now, one thing is clear in my heart.]","[Pei’s Mother, who loved and cherished me, passed away over a decade ago.]","[In this world... all I have left are my brothers.]","The Pei family’s hearts trembled, as if something had stirred the depths of their souls.","The feeling spread through their limbs, an overwhelming tide of emotion surging from their chests.","Their hearts ached. They stepped closer, wiping her tears and murmuring soothing words. \"Don’t cry. It’s okay, don’t cry anymore.\"","Their own chests tightened with pain.","They couldn’t even imagine the suffering hidden behind her simple words!","But their comfort only made Qiao Chuchu cry harder. \"Your hands are so hot! You need to get an IV right now! If you don’t, you’ll go from alive to dead in no time!\"","The Pei family blinked, then burst into laughter at her bluntness. \"You—!\"","Even the Weisheng family, who had been watching with heavy hearts, couldn’t help but chuckle.","Shen Zhuoyan stood silently to the side, wiping away his tears when no one was looking.","Lin Shen clenched his jaw, fighting back tears as he watched her.","Ying Chen, however, was already bawling. \"Uwaaah! No one told me getting hurt would make me cry so much! This is too touching, wuuuuh!\"","Qiao Chuchu pushed them away. \"Go get your IVs! If any of you die from this fever, I’ll beat you up!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan glanced at Old Lady Qiao, who was being restrained by the police. \"Her matter isn’t settled yet.\"","Qiao Chuchu wiped her tears, her gaze turning icy. \"I’ll handle her myself.\"","Shen Zhuoyan and Lin Shen stepped forward. \"We’re not sick. We’ll stay with you.\"","Pei Che was the first to regain his composure. \"Right. If this fever keeps up, it could lead to lung infections or even myocarditis. We need to go. The sooner we recover, the sooner we can help Chuchu.\"","Otherwise, knowing Qiao Chuchu, if any of them died, she’d just restart everything again.","He looked at her with longing. \"Chuchu, wait for me. I’ll come back as soon as my fever breaks.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, then turned to Pei Fengnong.","Pei Fengnong gazed at her reluctantly as the others pulled him away.","Suddenly, he remembered something and rushed back to her. \"The necklace you gave me when we were kids—I’m wearing it again!\"","Like a child showing off a treasure, he pulled out the gold chain. \"I’ll never take it off!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at the necklace blankly, no memory of it surfacing.","Pei Fengnong’s heart sank at her reaction.","His voice cracked with remorse. \"I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have ignored you all those years. I shouldn’t have resented you or put this necklace away. I shouldn’t have let you suffer. It’s all my fault.\"","Qiao Chuchu shifted awkwardly. \"I’m sorry, but... I don’t remember any of that. I don’t know what you’re talking about.\"","She knew her ability to revive came from instinct.","Her instincts remained, but her memories had faded.","Pei Fengnong’s face fell, his pain deepening. \"I see...\"","She smiled gently. \"When I remember, you can apologize to me then.\"","Pei Fengnong swallowed the lump in his throat, nodding repeatedly. \"Okay. Okay, okay!\"","He squeezed her hand, reluctant to let go. \"I’ll come find you as soon as I’m done with the IV.\"","He still needed to pick a gift—the best gift he could find—to make it up to her.","Pei Fengnong was dragged away like a child refusing to go to kindergarten, turning back every few steps to look at her.","And it wasn’t just him.","Even the Weisheng family kept glancing back, their eyes filled with heartache.","Huai Ling frowned. Sister, wait for us! We’ll be back soon!","Ying Chen, being wheeled away on a hospital bed by Weisheng Biehe, yelled, \"Come see me in my room when you’re done! There’s no way I can move right now!\"","Qiao Chuchu waved at them, nodding to each one in turn.","Once they had vanished from her sight, her expression darkened as she turned her gaze toward Old Lady Qiao, now restrained by the police. A murderous intent flared in her eyes as she uttered coldly, \"Time to get down to business.\""]},{"number":292,"title":"Chapter 292: Qiao Chuchu: You're Being Used","paragraphs":["Old Lady Qiao, her wrists shackled, was being escorted by the police in a daze.","Qiao Chuchu walked up to her.","The old woman slowly raised her eyes, and her sharp gaze instantly burned with murderous intent. She lunged at Qiao Chuchu with all her strength: \"I'll kill you!!\"","The police immediately pinned her to the ground: \"Calm down! Don't move!!\"","Old Lady Qiao's chin slammed hard against the polished floor, and she let out a pained scream!","She struggled violently but couldn't break free, her vision filled with a pair of white sneakers.","Gritting through the pain, she looked up at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu stood before her, her delicate face expressionless, a flicker of mockery flashing in her eyes before tears welled up: \"Grandma, why are you doing this to me?\"","The police were stunned: \"Grandma? She's your grandmother?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, her eyes brimming with tears: \"Yes, she is my grandmother.\"","\"I am NOT your grandmother!!\" Old Lady Qiao shouted hysterically. \"Don't you dare claim any relation to me! I never acknowledged your mother! She seduced my son and brought him misfortune, and now you’ve killed him!\"","She turned desperately to the police: \"You must arrest this wretch! She’s the one who murdered my son! Not long ago, my son went missing on a luxury cruise. A girl named Xia Xuechun told me she saw this vile creature stuff my son into a sack and throw him into the sea!\"","Old Lady Qiao pleaded: \"You have to arrest her! She must pay for killing my son!!\"","The police eyed Qiao Chuchu skeptically.","Still crying, Qiao Chuchu defended herself pitifully: \"What are you talking about, Grandma? Xia Xuechun wasn’t even on that ship!\"","She turned to the police: \"There should already be an investigation report on this. I never even interacted with her son, and Xia Xuechun wasn’t among the guests! This is pure slander!\"","The police frowned—they had indeed heard of the mysterious cruise disappearance.","The missing man had vanished without a trace, not appearing in any surveillance footage.","And there were no suspects.","The officer questioned Old Lady Qiao: \"Are you certain Xia Xuechun told you she personally witnessed your son being stuffed into a sack?\"","Old Lady Qiao nodded frantically: \"Yes!\"","The officer pressed further: \"Are you sure she was actually on the ship when it happened? Did she show you any proof?\"","The old woman faltered, hesitation creeping into her expression: \"She didn’t show me any evidence...\"","The officer found this absurd and raised his voice sharply: \"You believed her without proof?! And then you went and rammed your car into people?! Do you realize how many you’ve injured?!\"","Old Lady Qiao flinched at the officer’s outburst and burst into tears: \"She’s the Dragon Family’s new girlfriend! Would she lie?! Besides, I’m just a helpless old mother! At my age, I’ve suffered the loss of my son! I was desperate and grasping at straws!!\"","Qiao Chuchu sniffled, tears streaming down her face: \"But you were tricked, Grandma. Xia Xuechun hadn’t even met the Dragon Family back then. She wasn’t on that ship—she was working somewhere else at the time!\"","She bent down, feigning pity as she explained: \"She lied to you because she wanted to use you to kill me. She hates me, so she fed you lies. You sought revenge on the wrong person, and now you’ve landed yourself in trouble.\"","The color drained from Old Lady Qiao’s face: \"Impossible!\"","Qiao Chuchu wiped her tears away: \"With you gone, my uncle gone, my father gone... the vast Qiao family is left with only my aunt and my sister.\"","Though she was crying, her eyes were smiling.","Do you know what this means?","It means that the household registry the old woman had stubbornly refused to relinquish would now allow Qiao Chuchu to inherit everything from the Qiao family—once all its rightful leaders were dead."]},{"number":293,"title":"Chapter 293: Xia Xuechun, I've Come for You","paragraphs":["Of course, it wasn’t that Qiao Chuchu was particularly cruel—her relationship with her family was one of mutual restraint and harm.","After she was fostered by the Pei Family, Old Lady Qiao had already begun scheming to take her wealth.","Because Pei's Mother was willing to spend money on her, the dowry for her future marriage had been prepared from the day she entered the Pei Family.","If she died, her grandparents would be the first inheritors of her wealth, not Pei's Mother, who had invested so much in her.","After Pei's Mother bought her a mansion worth hundreds of millions, she had narrowly escaped kidnapping several times.","It was only after Pei's Mother set a trap to counter the Qiao Family that her life was spared.","Looking at Old Lady Qiao’s pitiful state, Qiao Chuchu couldn’t help but smirk. \"What could be happier than receiving a fortune in the prime of my youth? After all, I didn’t lose out.\"","Actually, if she calculated it, she had lost—not just a life, but also endured great suffering to be reborn.","But it didn’t matter. What mattered was that she hadn’t lost too badly, while Old Lady Qiao had suffered a complete defeat.","This was revenge for the time the old woman had tried to dig up her birth mother’s remains to arrange a ghost marriage.","Stimulated by Qiao Chuchu’s words, Old Lady Qiao seemed to foresee the Qiao Family’s downfall, her eyes bulging in fury. \"No! Impossible!\"","The old woman lunged at her, claws outstretched, but the police restrained her, leaving her to rage helplessly. \"As long as I’m alive, you won’t lay a finger on the Qiao Family’s wealth! You’ll get nothing!!\"","Her voice trembled as she broke down in despair at the thought of Qiao Chuchu inheriting her fortune. \"You can’t take my money! No matter what, you can’t take my money!!!\"","Then, her face turned ashen, and she curled up in pain. \"My heart—my heart hurts!\"","The officers paled, quickly supporting her toward the emergency room. \"At her age, a heart attack could be fatal—get her to treatment, now!\"","The other officers turned to Qiao Chuchu. \"Please come with us. We need a detailed statement.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded obediently. \"I’ll cooperate fully.\"","She then suggested, \"Bring Xia Xuechun in too. My grandmother may have done wrong, but Xia Xuechun was the one who incited her to crash the car.\"","Unfortunately, Xia Xuechun had disappeared.","Surveillance footage showed her fleeing immediately after Old Lady Qiao’s failed attempt, and she had since gone off the grid.","When Old Lady Qiao heard this, her already failing heart took another blow. Furious, she suffered a stroke and a heart attack, landing her in the ICU.","Seated in the car, Qiao Chuchu watched the scenery blur past.","She was now in District 14 of Country D, having brought her entire entourage to hunt down Xia Xuechun.","Yise, Ying Chen’s subordinate, turned from the passenger seat to address her. \"Miss, District 14 isn’t safe. Our boss has ordered us to oversee your movements for the next few days.\"","She nodded, eyeing the lavish storefronts outside. \"I thought District 14 would be too chaotic for such refined places.\"","Yise chuckled. \"Even the worst districts have wealthy areas. And no matter how rough it gets, it’s still a tourist hotspot—many people love visiting.\"","\"Have you checked hotel records? And chapels—places where people might hold weddings?\"","Yise sighed apologetically. \"We have, but there’s no trace. We don’t know where Xia Xuechun and that man are hiding. I’m sorry, Miss.\"","\"Don’t apologize.\" Qiao Chuchu kept her gaze outside. \"If someone doesn’t want to be found, how could you?\"","Suddenly, the passing scenery shifted into a vision.","Frowning, Qiao Chuchu focused.","In the vision, she violently swept everything off a table, jabbing a finger at the person across from her. \"Are you out of your mind?! I brought you here so you could avenge your daughter, not to let Long Yunxiao and Xia Xuechun escape!!\"","The elderly woman, chastised, wrung her hands in regret—yet her tone was defiant. \"I didn’t mean to let them go! Long Yunxiao begged me, saying he never meant to push my daughter down! He said the child couldn’t grow up without a father, promised me shares as compensation! He tricked me!\"","\"What matters more—shares or your own child?!\"","Qiao Chuchu stormed around the table. \"He’s the reason your daughter is paralyzed! And you actually believed he’d take responsibility?! He dangled shares in front of you, and you fell for it?! Has he given you anything yet?!\"","The old woman sobbed, pleading. \"I know I was wrong! I shouldn’t have trusted his sweet talk—please, get him back!\"","\"How?! You begged me to bring you here for revenge! I finally caught them, handed them to you to deal with however you saw fit—and you let them go! You even stalled me for two hours! They could be on a ship halfway across the world by now—do you understand that?!\"","The vision faded, reality snapping back.","\"Damn it...\"","Just watching it had pissed her off.","This time, she had brought along Mother Liu—Long Yunxiao’s mother-in-law, Liu Shi’s mother.","Mother Liu had heard about Qiao Chuchu’s vendetta against Xia Xuechun and begged to join the hunt.","She hadn’t wanted to bring her, but Mother Liu had wept so dramatically she nearly knelt.","So Qiao Chuchu had relented, arranging for her to confront Long Yunxiao alone in the vision.","And what happened? Mother Liu let him go!","She even stalled Qiao Chuchu in the basement for two hours.","In the vision, Qiao Chuchu had found the delay suspicious, but Mother Liu insisted she needed more time for \"private matters.\"","Only after two hours—when Long Yunxiao’s phone went dead, proving his promises empty—did Mother Liu confess the truth.","Xia Xuechun and Long Yunxiao, right within her grasp, had slipped away because of this idiot. How could she not be furious?!","But it was fine.","At least now she knew who the weak link was.","And she knew where she had caught Xia Xuechun.","Irritated, she cracked her neck. \"Head to the chapel near the lighthouse.\"","Since it wasn’t yet the day she’d received the incriminating photos in her past life, she hadn’t focused on the lighthouse, instead searching high-end hotels and chapels.","Turns out, the two had held their ceremony right by the lighthouse.","The car changed course. Stepping out, Qiao Chuchu adjusted her cap.","Huai Ling bounded over cheerfully, slinging an arm around her. \"Sis!\"","Lou Tingsi sidled up with a smirk, prying Huai Ling’s hand away. \"No touching.\"","Weisheng Lin circled around from behind, eyeing the unremarkable surroundings skeptically. \"Would those two really be here?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t answer. Finding a vantage point, she raised her binoculars toward the chapel.","Weisheng Huailing felt a sudden impulse and leaned down closer to her face, using the telescope as an excuse: \"Well, can you see it?\""]},{"number":294,"title":"Chapter 294: Appearing to Catch Someone, Actually Aiming for a Solo Date Opportunity","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu focused all her attention on the church, spotting a familiar figure.","Xia Xuechun, dressed in a snow-white gown, leaped into Long Yunxiao's arms.","A sun hat obscured her face.","Qiao Chuchu smirked and handed the binoculars to Huai Ling: \"Take a look.\"","Huai Ling glanced at her, his gaze tender, but instead of taking the binoculars, he clasped her hand, acting as a makeshift stand as he peered into the distance.","Lou Tingsi narrowed his eyes at the sight and positioned himself beside Qiao Chuchu, leaning down to her eye level. \"You saw her?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, pointing ahead. \"She's inside the church. Let's split into three teams and catch them both.\"","She readjusted the binoculars toward the church. \"There seem to be a lot of bodyguards around them. Have your men clear them out—quietly, so we don’t alert them.\"","Lou Tingsi leaned in, his cheek brushing against hers as if sharing the binoculars. \"Alright, let me see too.\"","Weisheng Huailing shot him a resentful glare from the side.","Lou Tingsi pretended not to notice, guiding Qiao Chuchu’s hand holding the binoculars as he scanned the area. \"There are indeed many bodyguards.\"","\"So what?\" Weisheng Lin shoved Huailing aside and stood beside Qiao Chuchu, smirking. \"We have plenty of our own.\"","Hearing this, Qiao Chuchu relaxed and looked at the three of them.","[I trust them to help me catch Xia Xuechun. Their skills are undeniable.]","The three men brightened with varying degrees of pride, lifting their chins.","After all, they were the ones Qiao Chuchu had specifically chosen to bring ahead.","She believed they had the most experience in this.","Ying Chen could have joined too, but he was still recovering from injuries and couldn’t move around.","The others were tied up with work and would arrive half a day later, already en route.","Shen Zhuoyan had wanted to come but was assigned by Qiao Chuchu to stay with her family.","This was the perfect opportunity for just the three of them!","No meddling brother, no Shen Zhuoyan in the way!","Only them!","Their gazes grew increasingly possessive as they stared at Qiao Chuchu.","Lou Tingsi brimmed with confidence. \"I’ll have my men capture them.\"","He signaled to Song Yu.","Song Yu stepped forward. \"Boss, I’m ready.\"","Weisheng Lin scoffed. \"My men aren’t slouches either.\"","He snapped his fingers.","Several foreigners approached. \"Boss.\"","Huailing smiled slyly, like a fox already certain of victory. \"Have you two forgotten who I am? I can handle this alone. Unlike you, who travel with an entourage like crabs with too many legs.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"Why the infighting? We’re all going—just with different roles.\"","Weisheng Lin slid an arm around her waist, his voice dropping to a low, suggestive murmur. \"Miss Qiao, if one of us catches them first... will there be a reward?\"","She swatted his hand away. \"What do you want?\"","His hand stung from the slap, but the tingling pain only deepened his amusement. He leaned closer, whispering, \"A day alone with me.\"","\"That’s it?\" Qiao Chuchu glanced back at the church, unimpressed. \"I thought you’d ask for something worthwhile, like money.\"","Weisheng Lin studied her long lashes. \"I don’t need money. I want to spend time with you somewhere beautiful.\"","\"Fine.\" She nodded. \"Deal.\"","His face lit up, and he rolled up his sleeves with a wicked grin. \"Then wait here while Uncle catches them for you—maybe even turns them into soup!\"","He strode off with his men.","Huailing sensed something amiss. \"Sister, what did my brother say to you?\"","Qiao Chuchu gestured. \"He said if he catches that cheating pair, he gets a day out with me.\"","Huailing’s eyes widened. He glared at Weisheng Lin’s retreating figure before urgently tapping Qiao Chuchu’s shoulder. \"Then if I catch them, I should get a reward too, right?!\"","She sighed. \"What do you want?\"","Huailing beamed. \"A vacation on our family’s private island!\"","She nodded impatiently. \"Fine, fine, whatever.\"","His grin turned devious as he sprinted off.","Lou Tingsi watched their energetic departure before leisurely remarking, \"Miss Qiao, whatever they negotiated, I want the same.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","He pinched her cheek, smiling as he turned away. \"Song Yu, let’s go.\"","She watched them split into three teams, waiting for the right moment to move.","Mother Liu approached, simmering with restless fury. \"Did you find Xia Xuechun? When do we confront them? I can’t wait to avenge my daughter.\"","Qiao Chuchu side-eyed her. \"Will you really take revenge? Or will you forgive Long Yunxiao the moment he begs, saying his child needs a father?\"","Mother Liu didn’t hesitate. \"How could I?! He pushed my daughter off a building alone and flaunted his mistress here! He must pay—I won’t let him leave alive!\"","Yet her eyes flickered nervously, as if checking whether Qiao Chuchu believed her.","Qiao Chuchu smirked coldly.","Liar.","If not for her foresight revealing this woman’s greed, she might have fallen for the act.","She turned away indifferently. \"You’ll only watch. I’ll handle Long Yunxiao. Tell me how you want him dealt with.\"","Mother Liu paled. \"I can do it myself! I just want him to return to my daughter and make things right. You deal with the mistress!\"","Qiao Chuchu peered through the binoculars. \"So when a cheating man and his mistress are involved, only the mistress deserves punishment? The man bears no blame?\"","Mother Liu shrugged. \"That’s how it’s always done. Life must go on.\"","Qiao Chuchu lowered the binoculars, staring at her. \"You think a man who crippled your daughter is worth keeping?\"","Mother Liu grimaced. \"What choice is there? Who’d marry her now? Besides, a guilty man is the best—he’ll treat her well out of remorse.\"","\"If he felt remorse, he wouldn’t have pushed her.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s voice turned icy. \"And this isn’t what you promised earlier. You said you wanted him dead. Now you’re after money? You lied from the start.\"","Mother Liu’s face twisted in panic. \"I’m not lying! I just have my own goals! Would you have brought me otherwise?!\"","A gun suddenly pressed against her chest.","Mother Liu froze, staring in horror at the weapon before meeting Qiao Chuchu’s cold gaze.","Qiao Chuchu's deep eyes were clouded with darkness, like the ominous calm before a storm.","She pressed the weapon firmly against her chest, her voice eerily steady: \"That despicable pair killed my brother. They will pay for what they did. You deceived me, and I could have pretended it never happened—so long as you kept lying to me, just as you promised in the beginning. But if you betray me now, you’ll join them hand in hand on their final journey.\"","Her gaze sharpened like a venomous blade: \"I won’t tolerate traitors around me. Not when they threaten every step of my plan. Do you understand?\""]},{"number":295,"title":"Chapter 295: What Happens Between Me and My Sister Is None of Your Damn Business","paragraphs":["She had suffered so much in her rebirth, and now she was here to take down Xia Xuechun and Long Yunxiao in one fell swoop!","How could she be held back by a mere traitor?!","Beside her, Yise watched Qiao Chuchu with admiration.","Miss Qiao might be short in stature, but her temper was fierce—no one dared to mess with her!","No wonder she was the only person the boss trusted. She had such an intimidating presence!","Mother Liu trembled at the sight of the gun, stammering, \"O-okay, okay, okay.\"","Her eyes reddened, on the verge of tears. \"I'll do whatever you told me before! I promise I’ll listen to you! I’m sorry, I was wrong, I shouldn’t have kept things from you!\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the vision Qiao Chuchu had foreseen turned gray before her eyes, fading away completely.","The future had been rewritten.","This two-faced snake wouldn’t dare make another move.","Qiao Chuchu holstered her weapon and gave Yise a look. \"Have four people keep an eye on her. Don’t let her interfere with my plans.\"","Then she strode toward the church. \"The rest of you, follow me.\"","—","For some reason, the tourists visiting the church had been gradually ushered out.","The small, simple chapel was now empty except for Xia Xuechun and Long Yunxiao.","Xia Xuechun stared at the crucifix at the center, entwining her fingers with Long Yunxiao’s. \"I really thought that old woman would run Qiao Chuchu over. What a disappointment.\"","\"She’ll die one day,\" Long Yunxiao reassured her. \"I’ve already set up a meticulous plan to deal with her entire family. Just wait and see.\"","Xia Xuechun’s face brightened, and she playfully rested her chin on his shoulder. \"Can we make sure Qiao Chuchu suffers before she dies?~\"","Long Yunxiao smiled. \"Of course.\"","Her heart warmed, and she nuzzled against him, her voice sweet. \"As long as I have you, Yunxiao. I’m so clumsy and useless without you. You have to protect me, take care of me, and never leave me, okay?\"","Long Yunxiao’s eyes curved tenderly. \"I won’t. No matter what happens, I’ll never abandon you.\"","Lou Tingsi sat behind them, lighting a cigarette. Listening to their sweet nothings, he narrowed his eyes like a fox basking in the sun. \"Such lovely words.\"","The two froze at the sound of Mandarin and turned to look at him.","Lou Tingsi smirked mockingly. \"I wonder how they’ll hold up when real danger comes knocking.\"","Long Yunxiao’s face paled, and he yanked Xia Xuechun up from the pew, staring at Lou Tingsi in shock. \"What are you doing here?!\"","\"Same as you,\" Lou Tingsi drawled, lazily draping his arm over the back of the chair. \"You’re hiding here for the woman you love, and I’m hunting here for the woman I love.\"","He tilted his head, smiling amiably. \"Care to guess who I’m hunting?\"","Long Yunxiao’s breath hitched—he grabbed Xia Xuechun’s hand and bolted!","Lou Tingsi vaulted over the pew and kicked him to the ground. \"Where do you think you’re going?!\"","Xia Xuechun shrieked, \"Yunxiao!\"","Song Yu appeared from behind and seized her!","\"Don’t touch me!\" she screamed.","Gritting his teeth against the pain, Long Yunxiao pulled a smoke grenade from his pocket and hurled it!","Thick smoke instantly engulfed the area!","Seizing the chaos, he dragged Xia Xuechun toward the church’s back door!","The back door led to a corridor, and beyond it was a flower greenhouse.","At the end of the hallway stood a silver-haired teenager engrossed in his phone.","The device blared English announcements—\"Triple kill,\" \"Quadra kill,\" \"Penta kill.\"","Leaning against the wall, he didn’t even glance up as they passed.","Xia Xuechun thought he looked familiar but didn’t dwell on it, too panicked to care.","Long Yunxiao calmly pulled her past the boy.","But as they walked by, Xia Xuechun accidentally met his gaze.","His striking peach-blossom eyes crinkled, his lips curling into a grotesque, terrifying grin.","Her pupils shrank. \"Weisheng—!\"","Huai Ling kicked her straight into the wall!","She howled in pain.","Long Yunxiao lunged for her, but Huai Ling whipped out a gun and shot him in the arm!","BANG!","Long Yunxiao collapsed, howling.","Unfazed, Huai Ling leaned back against the wall and resumed his game.","Then he noticed something—a smoke grenade rolling toward his feet.","His expression darkened. Just as he reached for Long Yunxiao, smoke swallowed his vision!","Weisheng Lin’s men stealthily hoisted Long Yunxiao onto their shoulders and made off with him!","They tried to grab Xia Xuechun too!","Weisheng Lin, hands in his pockets, smirked triumphantly, directing his men to haul the captives away—ready to claim credit in front of Qiao Chuchu.","Huai Ling burst through the smoke, grabbing Weisheng Lin’s collar. \"I caught them first!\"","Weisheng Lin shrugged. \"Says who? I’m the one who has them now.\"","Huai Ling fumed. \"You can’t steal my prey! I was going to impress my sister with this!\"","Lou Tingsi emerged, coughing and waving away the smoke. \"I had them first. Who knew he had another smoke grenade? Ridiculous.\"","Weisheng Lin scoffed. \"Too bad. They’re mine now. I’ll be the one taking Qiao Chuchu on a nice little vacation.\"","Huai Ling protested, \"No! I caught them! I should be the one going with her!\"","Lou Tingsi’s smile didn’t reach his eyes. \"Keep dreaming. The date’s mine.\"","Long Yunxiao, drenched in sweat and agony, found the whole thing absurd.","His arm was practically hanging off, and these men were fighting over who got to brag to Qiao Chuchu?!","Xia Xuechun, standing to the side, watched them bicker and sneered. \"You’re all doing this just to win Qiao Chuchu’s favor?\"","The three men turned to her, their expressions dripping with disdain.","Tears welled in her eyes. \"You’re fighting over her? What’s so special about her? Can’t she catch me herself? She’s useless!!\"","Huai Ling shoved her hard against the wall!","She gasped in pain as he typed on his phone, letting the robotic voice announce: \"What my sister and I do is none of your business!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?!\"","Weisheng Lin mocked, \"Know your place, prey. You’re just a bargaining chip.\"","Lou Tingsi smirked. \"Song Yu.\"","Song Yu strode forward and slapped Xia Xuechun across the face. \"One more word against Miss Qiao, and I’ll cut out your tongue.\"","Long Yunxiao winced. \"Don’t hit her!\"","Lou Tingsi punched him in response!","Doubled over in pain, Long Yunxiao groaned as Weisheng Lin delivered a kick for good measure. \"You shoved your own wife off a building. A few punches shouldn’t bother you.\"","Long Yunxiao’s face turned beet red. \"Of course it bothers me! You’re not the one getting beaten up!!\""]},{"number":296,"title":"Chapter 296: I caught it","paragraphs":["Huai Ling grabbed Long Yunxiao by the hair and slammed his head hard against the ground!","Long Yunxiao was dazed from the impact!","Weisheng Huailing curled his lips into a pleased smile: \"Yeah, it’s not me who’s in pain, so of course I’ll do whatever feels good.\"","Xia Xuechun couldn’t stand it anymore: \"Stop hitting him! Call Qiao Chuchu over—what kind of coward hides while others take the blame?!\"","Qiao Chuchu waved away the smoke, stepping onto Long Yunxiao’s back with a look of disdain.","\"Where did all this smoke come from? I’ve been looking for you forever.\"","She looked down at Xia Xuechun with a smirk: \"Xia Xuechun, it’s been so long. How’d you get so much shorter?\"","Xia Xuechun stared at her feet in horror: \"I’m not shorter—you’re standing on my husband!\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced down and realized she was stepping on a half-dead man’s back: \"Well, you should’ve said so earlier. I would’ve jumped a couple times if I’d known.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"???\"","Weisheng Lin answered a call, then hung up and announced: \"They just landed and are on their way, but the airport is far. It’ll take over an hour to get here.\"","\"Then we’ll settle this when they arrive.\" Qiao Chuchu glanced at Xia Xuechun. \"I’ll go reserve this church for the day.\"","Weisheng Lin volunteered eagerly: \"Let me handle it. I caught these guys first—might as well finish what I started.\"","He ordered his men to book the venue.","Weisheng Huailing: \"? Excuse me, I caught them first!\"","Lou Tingsi blocked them both with a mocking grin: \"I caught them first. I was the first one to talk to these two!\"","Weisheng Lin shoved his hands in his pockets, taunting Lou Tingsi: \"If you saw them first, why’d you let them get to the greenhouse? In the end, I’m the one who caught them.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"...\"","Weisheng Lin then turned to Huailing with a smirk: \"Little brother, I’m not stealing your credit. You were too busy gaming—when did you have time?\"","Weisheng Huailing’s face darkened. He turned his phone volume to max, blasting a looped recording—","\"I caught them! I caught them! I caught them! I caught them! I caught them! I caught them! I caught them!\"","Qiao Chuchu winced at the noise: \"Enough! What’s with the arguing?! Fine, all three of you caught them, happy?!\"","Their expressions shifted instantly, and they spoke in unison—","\"Then how do we split the reward?\"","\"Then how do we split the reward?\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned: \"How about I pay for a trip for the three of you? Maldives, private island, temple run—whatever, my treat!\"","The three men gaped.","Weisheng Lin and Lou Tingsi looked at her like she’d lost her mind: \"Who wants your money? We want a chance to travel with you alone! What’s the point of the three of us going together?!\"","Huailing pouted angrily: \"Big sister lied! Big sister is mean! I’m ignoring big sister now!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[The document clearly stated these men were independent and self-sufficient, with only Huailing being the delicate, teary type. Why are the other two so clingy? This doesn’t match the personalities I assigned before losing my memories.]","Weisheng Lin flushed: \"...\"","Lou Tingsi also looked embarrassed: \"...\"","Seeing Qiao Chuchu’s troubled expression, they sighed in disappointment.","Fine.","They didn’t want to pressure her, and they knew she wouldn’t agree to go alone with either of them.","They started: \"Then forget it—\"","Qiao Chuchu tucked her hair behind her ear and said seriously: \"After this is over, pick a day each. I’ll spend one day with each of you. Fair?\"","Xia Xuechun, listening nearby, gritted her teeth: \"You really are a flirtatious vixen!\"","Weisheng Lin and Lou Tingsi snapped at her in unison: \"None of your business! Shut it!!\"","Xia Xuechun flinched.","The two men immediately turned back to Qiao Chuchu, all smiles: \"Deal. We appreciate it, Miss Qiao. I’ll pick a date right away!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"...\""]},{"number":297,"title":"Chapter 297: Confrontation with Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["Xia Xuechun was locked in a windowless room, trembling with fear.","Long Yunxiao was hung on the wall, already beaten black and blue, gasping weakly with his mouth half-open: \"Please let us go... I can give you money... Just name your price.\"","Pei Yuan sat on the sofa, busy with work on his laptop, not even bothering to look up. \"Do we look like we need money?\"","\"I know you don’t, but who ever thinks they have enough?\" Long Yunxiao weakly negotiated. \"I just want you to spare us. Xuechun and I have already realized our mistakes. We won’t cause you any more trouble.\"","His gaze swept over everyone before settling on Qiao Chuchu. \"Please forgive us. We truly regret what we did.\"","The others in the room turned to Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Yucan chuckled. \"Chuchu, don’t believe this nonsense. It’s just a desperate plea for survival. The Long family’s petty cash isn’t worth taking, but if you want money, I’ll give it to you. The Weisheng family has more than enough.\"","Shi Yu, lounging lazily in his wheelchair, calmly added, \"The Shi family isn’t lacking in funds either.\"","\"As if the Pei family is strapped for cash,\" Pei Youchuan scoffed, taking a bite of an apple. \"Chuchu, don’t waste your breath on them. If given the chance, they’ll come back for revenge. We can’t let them go!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci nodded vigorously in agreement.","Qiao Chuchu remained silent, her eyes fixed on Xia Xuechun’s half-unzipped crossbody bag.","A necklace had slipped out.","She pulled it out—a grotesque glass pendant filled with what looked like red dye soaking some object inside.","It resembled one of those liquid motion trinkets.","Xia Xuechun paled at the sight, her body stiffening, her breathing turning ragged.","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"What is this? A necklace?\"","Lin Qing stepped closer. \"Not a necklace. More like a wish-granting charm. Some famous witches sell these—you put a photo inside and pray for your crush to fall for you.\"","She shuddered, unnerved. \"Of course, some people use them for curses too. Either way, it’s just superstitious nonsense.\"","Qiao Chuchu tilted the pendant, revealing the photo submerged in the red liquid.","It was her university ID photo.","Her smiling face, eerily preserved, seemed to float in what looked like blood.","She let out a disbelieving laugh. \"Wow, my photo is soaking in red liquid. How charming.\"","The others recoiled in shock.","What the—?!","Qiao Chuchu turned to Xia Xuechun, feigning delight. \"Did you go out of your way to curse me?\"","Xia Xuechun panted in fear, unable to speak.","Lin Qing stormed over, yanking Xia Xuechun’s hair and slapping her hard. \"Did you really think this curse would work?!\"","Xia Xuechun clutched her stinging cheek. \"That hurt! I wasn’t actually trying to curse her! It’s just for peace of mind!\"","Lin Qing kicked her. \"Then me beating you is also for peace of mind. Got a problem with that?!\"","Long Yunxiao groaned from the wall. \"D-don’t hit her... don’t hit her!\"","Lin Qing kicked him between the legs. \"Who asked you, trash?!\"","Long Yunxiao howled in pain. \"Ah—!\"","Lin Qing delivered a few more merciless kicks. \"Consider this karma for you two lovebirds!\"","She turned back to Xia Xuechun. \"You’re something else. When physical attacks didn’t work, you switched to magic?\"","Xia Xuechun pouted, silent and resentful.","Lin Qing’s patience snapped. \"Answer me!\"","She yanked Xia Xuechun’s ear like an impatient old man. \"Huh?! Huh?! Huh?!\"","Xia Xuechun winced, wrenching free. \"It’s just a placebo! It doesn’t actually work! Everyone knows superstitions are fake—are you all really this gullible?!\"","Tears welled in her eyes. \"If this thing worked, would Qiao Chuchu even be standing here unharmed? I cursed her to die horribly! Yet she’s perfectly fine! Why are you all overreacting?!\"","Lin Qing slapped her again. \"You wished for her to die horribly? Looks like you’re the one who’s gonna meet a bad end!\"","Xia Xuechun collapsed, humiliated, and tearfully glared at Qiao Chuchu. \"Are you really going to let your people treat me like this? Last time, when Long Jun harassed me, you even helped me!\"","Qiao Chuchu said nothing, tossing the cursed pendant at Xia Xuechun’s face. \"Don’t bring up last time—it just makes me angrier! Did you hire someone to crash into my car?!\"","The document listed several suspicious points she needed to confront Xia Xuechun about.","She had to get answers, even if she couldn’t remember everything!","Xia Xuechun panicked, denying it. \"No! Why would I do that? It wouldn’t benefit me at all!\"","Pei Youchuan sneered. \"Stop lying. We saw right through it. Pei Fengnong even bought off the two drivers behind you to save Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu gaped at Pei Youchuan. \"What?\"","[I don’t remember this, but I feel shocked.]","[Like... this is completely unexpected.]","Pei Fengnong smacked Pei Youchuan. \"What are you saying?!\"","Pei Youchuan covered his mouth. \"Oops, I spilled the beans!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong awkwardly explained, \"Chuchu, it’s not that I didn’t trust you. The situation was urgent, and I was afraid you’d get hurt, so I paid off those two.\"","He forced a smile. \"They were conspiring against you. I just made sure you got the victory you deserved...\"","His voice trailed off as he nervously watched her.","Was she angry?","She never liked it when they acted behind her back.","Qiao Chuchu’s emotions churned.","[I had no idea Fourth Brother helped me in secret... and never even mentioned it.]","Pei Fengnong was stunned.","She wasn’t mad at him?!","Qiao Chuchu carefully considered the situation.","[Right now, Xia Xuechun and Long Yunxiao are here. I don’t want them overhearing too much about my family. Let’s deal with them first.]","She gave Pei Fengnong a grateful look. \"We’ll talk about this later.\"","Pei Fengnong’s eyes lit up with hope as he nodded eagerly.","Xia Xuechun scoffed. \"So it wasn’t luck that saved you that day—it was your people.\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow. \"Is that a confession?\"","Xia Xuechun lifted her chin defiantly. \"Fine, I admit it. But what about you? After the race, didn’t you send people to beat us? Almost killed my Yunxiao!\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled. \"When did I do that?\"","Xia Xuechun stiffened. \"Don’t play dumb! You had us attacked!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan spoke up. \"That was me.\""]},{"number":298,"title":"Chapter 298: Adaptable and Resilient Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu looked at Wen Zhan in shock.","Wen Zhan sat on the sofa, his long legs bent lazily, his gaze filled with disdain as he regarded Xia Xuechun: \"I was the one who sent people to deal with you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned: \"How could you not tell me about beating up Xia Xuechun and Long Yunxiao?! At the very least, I should’ve been there to watch!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu then turned to Xia Xuechun: \"So what if my friends sent people to teach you a lesson?\"","\"So what?\" Xia Xuechun straightened up defiantly. \"Last time, you helped me, but this time, you let the people around you abuse me! And you still have the nerve to ask me 'so what'? Why can’t you just be kind all the way through?!\"","Qiao Chuchu pointed a gun at her forehead.","Xia Xuechun: \"!\"","Disgusted, Qiao Chuchu couldn’t bear to look at her any longer, grinding her teeth. \"Last time, when Long Jun insulted you, I helped you. And how did you repay me? You sent someone to crash into my car. Did my help mean anything to you, Xia Xuechun?\"","Xia Xuechun paled, trying to shrink away from the gun. \"That’s because your help was never what I actually needed! You can’t blame me for not appreciating it! I wanted an apple, but you gave me a pear—do you expect me to be grateful for that?!\"","The others stared at her in disbelief.","\"This is beyond shameless,\" Pei Buxian muttered, wide-eyed. \"Truly a masterclass in audacity.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci glanced at Lou Tingsi. \"I think her face is thick enough to make bulletproof vests.\"","Lou Tingsi pondered seriously. \"If we could actually make bulletproof vests out of her skin, I’d make a fortune.\"","Ignoring their mockery, Xia Xuechun snarled, \"No matter how much you ridicule me, I stand by this—I, Xia Xuechun, have never done anything wrong!\"","She glared at Qiao Chuchu. \"You’re the one who’s wrong! If you hadn’t kicked me out from the start, if you’d let me stay in your house as your cheap little maid, none of this would’ve happened! You should be the one reflecting!\"","Her face flushed with rage as she grew more agitated. \"You’re so rich—what’s the big deal about giving me a house? Or finding me a good job? Or introducing me to one of the many handsome men around you? But no, you looked down on me from the very beginning!!\"","Qiao Chuchu had heard enough. \"Shut up!\"","She fired a shot into Xia Xuechun’s shoulder!","Xia Xuechun collapsed with a scream, writhing in pain before finally letting out a bloodcurdling shriek: \"AHHHHH!!\"","She scrambled on the floor, howling. \"It hurts! It hurts so much! AHH!!\"","Long Yunxiao’s expression twisted in fury as he turned to Qiao Chuchu. \"I told you not to shoot! Why did you do it anyway?!\"","Qiao Chuchu met his gaze coldly. \"You’re tied to a wall. You have no leverage to negotiate with me. Your life is worthless—all I want is your suffering.\"","Seeing her indifference, fear crept into Long Yunxiao’s eyes.","She was serious.","She wasn’t planning to let either of them go!","Qiao Chuchu meant every word!","Panic set in. \"What will it take for you to let us go?! We can kneel and apologize! Or—or—\"","Desperate, he glanced at Xia Xuechun. \"I’ll leave Xia Xuechun with you!\"","Xia Xuechun’s face drained of color. \"What did you just say?!\"","Long Yunxiao grimaced. \"Xuechun, ever since I got involved with you, nothing but bad luck has followed me. I’ve spoiled you, but now Qiao Chuchu wants my life!\"","Qiao Chuchu wasn’t surprised. \"Oh? Infighting, is it?\"","Scum like this turning on each other was hardly unexpected.","But Xia Xuechun couldn’t accept it. Staggering to her feet, she lunged at Long Yunxiao. \"How dare you say that?! You’re old and ugly, and I never complained! The only things you had to offer were your money and your so-called love—and now you’re backing out?!\"","Long Yunxiao snapped, \"I only liked you because you were young and pretty! We were using each other! Yes, I loved you, but I can’t die for love! Do you know how valuable my life is?!\"","Xia Xuechun’s eyes flashed with murderous intent. \"My life is worth more than yours!!\"","She grabbed a fruit from the table and hurled it at him. \"You scum! You promised to protect me! Everything you said was a lie! A LIE!!!\"","Long Yunxiao, still bound to the wall, couldn’t fight back. Instead, he turned to Qiao Chuchu eagerly. \"See? She’s just a hysterical shrew now! I’m cutting ties with her—our relationship is over! Let me go, and I swear I won’t cause any trouble!!\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an amused brow. \"Why should I?\"","Trembling, Long Yunxiao begged, \"Because Xia Xuechun made me do everything! She’s the evil one! I only fell for her because she was young and beautiful, but now I’ve seen the light—I love my ex-wife!\"","Qiao Chuchu feigned sympathy. \"Oh? In that case, fine. I’ll let you go.\"","Long Yunxiao brightened. \"Really?!\"","She aimed the gun at his forehead. \"No. Just as fake as your love for your ex-wife.\"","Terror froze on his face as a bullet pierced his skull.","His expression remained locked in eternal fear.","Qiao Chuchu smirked in satisfaction. \"Finally, some peace.\"","Xia Xuechun collapsed to the floor, her face ashen. She scrambled to Qiao Chuchu’s feet. \"You actually killed him?!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked down at her. \"When did I ever joke?\"","Xia Xuechun’s breath hitched. Clutching Qiao Chuchu’s pants, she sobbed, \"Qiao Chuchu, I’ll apologize! I was wrong! I shouldn’t have fought you at every turn—I was just confused!\"","Her hands rubbed together frantically like flies. \"I was forced into this! I was a good girl once—you know that! I didn’t mean to lose your brother’s dog, or get tangled up with you, or try to kill you!\"","Qiao Chuchu watched her coldly.","Xia Xuechun’s once-pristine white dress was now stained with blood, her tear-streaked face a pitiful sight as she pleaded. \"I swear this is the last time I’ll ever hurt you! You can curse me with a necklace, do whatever you want—just spare me!\"","She cried like a spoiled child, as if her suffering justified everything. \"I’ve lost everything! Long Yunxiao is dead—I have no one left to love me!\"","Qiao Chuchu remained unmoved. \"What about your parents?\"","Xia Xuechun paused, then sneered. \"What parents? They’re poor, stupid, and stingy. I cut ties with them when I went abroad, but they still clung to me—just trying to leech off me!\"","She clung to Qiao Chuchu's leg, looking up at her with tear-filled eyes: \"Chuchu, I know you're soft-hearted, I know you value loyalty and sentiment. I also know you can't bear to see a girl suffer. Please, have mercy on me. I’m just someone who took a wrong turn—I won’t do it again. Give me a chance, and I’ll go back to being the Xia Xuechun I used to be. Okay?\"","She shook Qiao Chuchu’s leg desperately, pleading: \"Okay? Okay, okay, okay? Just forgive me, please?!\""]},{"number":299,"title":"Chapter 299: Bye Bye, Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["Everyone frowned in disgust.","Lin Qing said to Qiao Chuchu, \"Chuchu, don’t believe her! She’s lying!\"","Qiao Chuchu watched as Xia Xuechun cried pitifully, and she couldn’t help but feel a twinge of sympathy.","But—","She leaned down and whispered to Xia Xuechun, \"Lou Tingsi said that in the church, you and Long Yunxiao discussed hoping I’d be tortured to death. Did you want me to end up like Qi Xiaojia, humiliated by a group of men?\"","Xia Xuechun’s heart skipped a beat, and she quickly shook her head. \"N-No!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t believe her, tilting her head. \"No? Then why is it that every girl who opposes you ends up being raped to death?\"","Xia Xuechun blinked in confusion. \"What are you talking about?\"","\"It’s true. I’ve foreseen it.\" Qiao Chuchu lowered her voice, leaning closer to her ear. \"I have the ability to see the future, and I’m not afraid to tell you. Old Lady Qiao’s car crash—the one you instigated—succeeded. She killed my brother in that accident. And you, overjoyed, sent me a wedding photo message. That’s how I found you.\"","She pressed the gun against Xia Xuechun’s chest. \"I’ve been reborn once. This time, I came specifically for you. I know even if I forgive you, you’ll still come after me. I have to protect myself.\"","Xia Xuechun’s eyes widened in disbelief. \"What?!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t answer, smiling faintly. \"Goodbye, Xia Xuechun.\"","Xia Xuechun shuddered, staring at her, mouth opening as if to speak—but no words came out. Her head lolled to the side, lifeless.","Seeing her like this, Qiao Chuchu felt no joy. She tossed the gun aside and left the room without looking back.","At the same time, the system’s voice echoed in her mind: [Congratulations, Host! You’ve obtained the female lead’s complete fate! Your remaining rebirths are being adjusted...]","The number before her eyes changed from 3 to 2.","The system continued: [Host, seeing you come this far hasn’t been easy. We never expected you’d fully inherit the female lead’s fate! Congratulations!]","[Since this rebirth was time-specific, you still owe us mission progress. We’ll occasionally assign tasks. If you fail, you’ll return to the time before your designated rebirth—the day of Pei Fengnong’s funeral. All your efforts will be wasted. Please remember our agreement.]","---","Two hours later.","Qiao Chuchu boarded Ying Chen’s private jet.","There was a private bedroom onboard. The flight would take about five hours, but everyone insisted she rest, so she retreated to the room.","After a shower and changing into comfortable clothes, she lay down and fell asleep.","Pei Fengnong slipped in quietly, watching her sleep, his gaze darkening.","From his pocket, he pulled out an exquisite jewelry box. Inside was a dazzling pink diamond ring.","Everyone had talked about buying Qiao Chuchu a pink diamond ring.","His was the most expensive—custom-made, taking months to complete. It had finally arrived.","He sat on the bed, carefully sliding the ring onto Qiao Chuchu’s finger.","Once it was on, he admired it.","So beautiful.","Her hands were beautiful.","He gently held her hand, lost in thought—until he met Qiao Chuchu’s confused eyes.","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...What are you doing?\"","\"Giving you a ring.\" He lifted her hand, cheeks faintly pink. \"I wanted it to be a surprise.\"","Qiao Chuchu examined the ring under the light. \"It’s gorgeous. This must’ve been expensive?\"","\"Not at all,\" Pei Fengnong said without hesitation.","He looked at her earnestly. \"No amount is too much for you.\"","Because she had suffered so much.","He leaned down, cupping her face, studying her features with heartbreaking tenderness—as if seeing someone else through her.","\"I had a dream just now,\" he murmured. \"You hurt yourself to save me.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"Really?\"","[How could he have such a vivid dream? Could it be some inexplicable overlap of timelines?]","Pei Fengnong traced her cheek gently. \"You’ve endured so much.\"","She didn’t deny it.","[Of course it was hard. Back then, it wasn’t just pain—it was utter despair.]","[But it’s over now.]","Thinking of Xia Xuechun—who had schemed relentlessly for her life—now dead, she exhaled in relief.","[Thankfully, it’s all over.]","Suddenly, Pei Fengnong pulled her into a crushing embrace!","Caught off guard, she felt him hold her tighter, as if afraid she’d disappear. \"I’d die for you, Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","His voice trembled—was he crying? \"I’m not good with words, but I need you to know—I’d do anything for you. I know you don’t remember me, but I want you to understand now. Anything.\"","A warm tear fell onto her neck.","Pei Fengnong swallowed hard. \"I care about you. So much.\"","Her heart swelled, warmth spreading through her at his tears. \"I know.\"","[Even if I can’t recall the past, I sense who he is. I also know I ruined his future.]","[The records mentioned our history—how I caused his compound fracture, leaving him with chronic pain, ending his racing career.]","[If not for me, he’d still be the greatest racer.]","Guilt-ridden, she whispered, \"I’m sorry for ruining your future.\"","Pei Fengnong tightened his arms, shaking his head. \"It’s in the past. I don’t care anymore. There’s something more important now. But... do you dislike me?\"","He asked uncertainly, \"I’m not as smooth-talking as the others. Do you mind that?\"","\"Why would I?\" Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"What have you done to deserve dislike?\"","He grimaced, thinking of the crowd around her. \"You’re surrounded by charming people. I’m just... quiet. Maybe you’d prefer someone livelier.\"","A cold voice cut in: \"If you think you’re boring, take your hands off her. Don’t cling so shamelessly.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"?!\"","He jerked upright, glaring at Pei Che in the doorway. \"Since when do you barge in without knocking?!\"","Now Pei Che had seen him—vulnerable, clutching Qiao Chuchu like a lost child.","Pei Che leaned against the doorframe, smirking. \"Get out. I need to talk to Chuchu.\"","Pei Fengnong scowled. \"Why should I?\"","\"Because I’m your older brother.\" Without another word, Pei Che yanked him off the bed and shoved him out!"]},{"number":300,"title":"Chapter 300: A Brand New Future","paragraphs":["Pei Fengnong wanted to barge in indignantly but hesitated, then reluctantly walked away.","Qiao Chuchu sat up on the bed, puzzled. \"What's going on?\"","Pei Che was about to speak when light, hurried footsteps echoed from outside.","Someone was coming!","His expression darkened, and without a word, he scooped Qiao Chuchu off the bed and rushed her straight to the bathroom!","Huai Ling pushed the door open, his face still wearing a gentle smile.","Huh?","Where’s my sister?","He glanced around, his gaze landing on the closed bathroom door.","Understanding dawned on him, and he sat obediently on the bed to wait.","Pei Che quietly cracked the bathroom door open a sliver, saw Huai Ling’s back turned to him, and decisively locked the door. \"Such a clingy nuisance.\"","Qiao Chuchu stood awkwardly behind him. \"What’s happening?\"","The cramped bathroom was nearly filled by just the two of them.","And for some reason, she felt a creeping unease around Pei Che.","A chilling sense of familial dominance crawled up her spine, prickling the back of her neck.","It was as if... she’d always been afraid of this man.","Stiffly, she pushed Pei Che away. \"I should just go out.\"","Pei Che’s eyes darkened as he pressed her against the bathroom door. \"Leaving so soon?\"","A loud thud echoed.","Huai Ling, still facing away from the bathroom, remained oblivious.","Pei Che waited warily for a moment, confirming Huai Ling hadn’t reacted.","Amusement flickered in his deep-set eyes, and his lips curled. \"Hah, how could I forget? The fifth son of the Weisheng family is deaf. Even if we made a racket in here, even if he stood right outside, he wouldn’t hear a thing.\"","He leaned in, trapping her in the confined space. \"Are you feeling better now?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[If you want to ask how I’m feeling, just ask! Why do you have to get so close?!]","Her gaze drifted to his shirt, shifting focus. \"Huh? I remember you had a tie. Why aren’t you wearing it?\"","Pei Che’s expression instantly darkened.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Did I say something wrong?]","Noticing her unease, Pei Che softened his gaze, speaking meaningfully. \"From now on, I won’t wear a tie unless it’s a formal occasion.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Why?\"","Pei Che stared at her impassively. \"No reason.\"","She didn’t press further, though she found it oddly amusing.","[Did he, like Pei Fengnong, have some premonition and decide to stop wearing ties?]","Running out of things to say, she muttered, \"This place is way too cramped. Let’s talk outside.\"","As she turned, Pei Che suddenly wrapped an arm around her waist and shoved her back against the door!","Another loud thud as he pressed against her from behind, his tone displeased. \"I wasn’t done talking. Why are you in such a hurry to leave? Do you hate me?\"","His voice dropped to a whisper. \"Just me?\"","His warm breath brushed against her neck, intimate and invasive.","Qiao Chuchu shivered, instinctively shrinking away as she tried to push him off. \"I don’t hate you! I just don’t want to talk in here!\"","But Pei Che gripped her throat. \"Don’t move.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","His slender fingers rested against her pulse, feeling its faint rhythm. His eyes narrowed in satisfaction as he embraced her from behind. \"After we go back, let’s move.\"","She froze mid-struggle. \"Why?\"","\"We stayed in that old house because we couldn’t bear to leave Mom behind.\" Pei Che closed his eyes. \"But we can’t live in the past forever.\"","Resting his chin on her shoulder, he spoke calmly. \"I found an estate. I’ll buy it for you. We’ll live there together—start a whole new future. How does that sound?\""]}]);
